On the criminal side, the firm assists with bail hearings, common assault, criminal harassment, domestic assault and driving offences. Its family law work covers divorce, decision-making responsibility and parenting time, support, property division and agreements. Its materials discuss how orders barring communication affect parenting arrangements and equalization when a spouse has been charged. Clients are advised to take steps such as being open with their lawyer about assets and debts.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('bow-river-law-llp-calgary','Bow River Law LLP','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.8,213,51.04894,-114.073167,'{"name":"Bow River Law LLP","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.04894,"lng":-114.073167,"address":"540 5 Ave SW unit 1240, Calgary, AB T2P 0M2","phone":"+15873917601","rating":4.8,"count":213,"slug":"bow-river-law-llp-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Bow+River+Law+LLP+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=540+5+Ave+SW+unit+1240%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2P+0M2","website":"https://bowriveremploymentlaw.com","blurb":"Employment Law in Calgary. Rated 4.8 from 213 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/bow-river-law-llp-calgary.jpg","bioImage":"images/bio/bow-river-law-llp-calgary.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Joel Fairbrother","title":"Employment Lawyer & Partner"},{"name":"Amanda Jacinto","title":"Employment Lawyer"}],"areas":["Wrongful dismissal","Constructive dismissal","Severance","Discrimination","Harassment and bullying","Workplace investigations","Termination and dismissal","Labour and employment law"],"serving":["Calgary","Alberta"]}}','{"1":[["08:30","16:30"]],"2":[["08:30","16:30"]],"3":[["08:30","16:30"]],"4":[["08:30","16:30"]],"5":[["08:30","16:30"]]}','Bow River Law LLP is a Calgary boutique firm handling employment and labour law, including wrongful dismissal, severance and workplace discrimination.

Founders Joel Fairbrother and Sarah Coderre met at the University of Alberta in 2006 and started the firm near the beginning of 2021 after working as employment lawyers together. The team also includes Chris Jones, Michael Hernandez and Amanda Jacinto. Services include constructive dismissal, lay-off, just cause, workplace investigations, employment policies, and disputes over fiduciary duty and non-competition. Federally regulated workers in aviation, banking or telecommunications may be entitled to reinstatement, and the firm offers a glossary of Alberta employment law terms.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('parr-business-law-vancouver','Parr Business Law','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.9,205,49.2643703,-123.1156041,'{"name":"Parr Business Law","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Business Law"],"caseTypes":["business"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2643703,"lng":-123.1156041,"address":"525 W 8th Ave #800, Vancouver, BC V5Z 1C6","phone":"+16042838622","rating":4.9,"count":205,"slug":"parr-business-law-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Parr+Business+Law+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=525+W+8th+Ave+%23800%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V5Z+1C6","website":"https://www.parrbusinesslaw.com","blurb":"Business Law in Vancouver. Rated 4.9 from 205 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/parr-business-law-vancouver.webp","details":{"areas":["Business law","Wills and estates","Incorporations and reorganizations","Contract drafting and review","Buying and selling a business","Power of attorney","Probate administration","Estate planning","Estate freezes"]}}',NULL,'Parr Business Law is a Vancouver firm handling incorporations, contracts, business sales and purchases, wills and estate planning.

Services include incorporations and corporate reorganizations, contract drafting, and help with buying and selling a business or planning succession. The estate side covers wills, powers of attorney, healthcare representation agreements, corporate wills, alter ego and joint partner trusts, estate freezes, and probate administration with executor support. Estate planning and wills in Vancouver, including trusts, executors and the probate process in British Columbia, are covered in detail.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('a-dhillon-law-brampton','A. Dhillon Law','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,5,199,43.7578005,-79.6923212,'{"name":"A. Dhillon Law","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.7578005,"lng":-79.6923212,"address":"9300 Goreway Dr Unit#218, Brampton, ON L6P 4N1","phone":"+16479633612","rating":5,"count":199,"slug":"a-dhillon-law-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/A.+Dhillon+Law+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=9300+Goreway+Dr+Unit%23218%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6P+4N1","website":"https://adhillonlaw.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Brampton. Rated 5.0 from 199 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/a-dhillon-law-brampton.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Akash Dhillon"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","Impaired driving","Sexual assault"],"serving":["Toronto","Ontario"]}}',NULL,'A Dhillon Law is a Brampton criminal defence firm serving clients in Toronto, Mississauga and across Southern Ontario.

The firm is led by Akash Dhillon, who holds an Hons B.A. and J.D. It handles charges such as sexual assault and impaired driving, and its blog covers identity fraud in Milton, disobeying a court order in Orangeville and youth charges in Ontario. A criminal charge can affect liberty, immigration status, career and travel, and each case receives a defence strategy based on the evidence. Flexible payment plans are available.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('shaffie-law-toronto','Shaffie Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,203,43.6484203,-79.373554,'{"name":"Shaffie Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["criminal","litigation"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6484203,"lng":-79.373554,"address":"65 Front St E Ste 300, Toronto, ON M5E 1B5","phone":"+16475005186","rating":4.9,"count":203,"slug":"shaffie-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Shaffie+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=65+Front+St+E+Ste+300%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5E+1B5","website":"https://www.shaffielaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Civil Litigation in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 203 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/shaffie-law-toronto.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Shayan Shaffie","title":"Domestic Assault Lawyer"}],"areas":["Domestic assault","Sexual assault","Youth criminal justice","Bail hearings and reviews"],"serving":["Ontario","Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Shaffie Law is a Toronto criminal defence firm that focuses on domestic assault and sexual assault charges across Ontario.

