Family services include divorce, uncontested divorce, custody, child support, separation agreements and spousal support, while employment work includes wrongful termination. The firm also handles residential purchases, wills, powers of attorney and probate. Puneet Bhardwaj graduated from Bond University in Australia in 2018 and articled in Edmonton; the team also includes Jesse Khehra, Claire M. Spicer and Lauren Hidalgo. The firm serves communities around Edmonton and Leduc.','dynamic','live',NULL);
