The firm operates from more than 30 locations and charges flat-rate fees with no retainer taken up front. Closing documents can be signed by remote video from 7am to midnight, seven days a week, or through in-home mobile signing. It works with real estate agents, lenders, private lenders and title insurers, and offers services for first-time homebuyers and clients with special needs. Title transfers it handles include family gifts, adding a spouse and estate transfers.','dynamic','live',NULL);
