The firm was founded in April 2022 by Alexander Karapancev, and its lawyers include Mark O''Brien, Spase Gjorgjievski, Josh Lim, Sandy Assaad, Tharsan Logendran and Radhika Sharma. They have obtained acquittals, charge withdrawals and stays of proceedings for hundreds of clients in Toronto and the Greater Toronto Area. Case summaries describe domestic assault trials and cross-examination of complainants, and the firm serves Toronto, the GTA and Ontario.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('rupinder-singh-dhaliwal-professional-corporation-brampton','Rupinder Singh Dhaliwal Professional Corporation','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,5,101,43.7257017,-79.827913,'{"name":"Rupinder Singh Dhaliwal Professional Corporation","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":[],"caseTypes":[],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.7257017,"lng":-79.827913,"address":"52 Iceland Poppy Trail, Brampton, ON L7A 0M9","phone":"+16478941516","rating":5,"count":101,"slug":"rupinder-singh-dhaliwal-professional-corporation-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Rupinder+Singh+Dhaliwal+Professional+Corporation+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=52+Iceland+Poppy+Trail%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L7A+0M9","website":"https://www.dhaliwal.law","blurb":"Law firm in Brampton. Rated 5.0 from 101 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/rupinder-singh-dhaliwal-professional-corporation-brampton.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Rupinder Singh Dhaliwal","title":"Barrister & Solicitor"}],"serving":["Brampton"]}}',NULL,'Rupinder Singh Dhaliwal Professional Corporation is a Brampton practice offering real estate legal services and wills and affidavits.

Rupinder Singh Dhaliwal became a member of the Law Society of Upper Canada in July 2019 and holds a B.A. and an LL.B. He practises as a barrister and solicitor. The firm''s approach is timely representation and practical solutions, and it works virtually with quick responses. The Brampton office handles property matters and the document work that goes with wills and sworn affidavits.','dynamic','live',NULL);
