Its practice areas include animal attacks and dog bites, assaults and sexual assault, boat accidents, child injury, disability matters, motorcycle accidents, product liability, slip and fall accidents and train accidents. On dog bites, the firm addresses Ontario''s Dog Owners'' Liability Act and who is responsible when a dog injures someone. Its injury lawyers will travel to a client''s home, hospital or rehabilitation centre anywhere in eastern Ontario.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('christien-levien-j-d-brampton','Christien Levien J.D.','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,4.8,103,43.6630959,-79.7280183,'{"name":"Christien Levien J.D.","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6630959,"lng":-79.7280183,"address":"2 County Ct Blvd Suite, 210, Brampton, ON L6W 3W8","phone":"+14163883003","rating":4.8,"count":103,"slug":"christien-levien-j-d-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Christien+Levien+J.D.+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2+County+Ct+Blvd+Suite%2C+210%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6W+3W8","website":"https://www.levienlaw.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Brampton. Rated 4.8 from 103 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/christien-levien-j-d-brampton.png","details":{"areas":["Criminal defence"],"serving":["Brampton"]}}',NULL,'Christien Levien, practising as Levien Law in Brampton, runs a criminal defence and trial litigation office across from the courthouse.

The approach is integrity-based and client-focused, and the office sits opposite the William A Grenville Courthouse so it is easy to reach. Criminal defence work follows the stages of a case, starting with arrest, release at the scene by Form 9 or promise to appear, and the bail hearing that decides whether a person is held until trial. The firm assists people from the start to the end of their proceedings.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('stayshyn-law-offices-hamilton','Stayshyn Law Offices','Hamilton','ON','hamilton-niagara',0,4.8,102,43.2515675,-79.8436551,'{"name":"Stayshyn Law Offices","city":"Hamilton","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"hamilton-niagara","province":"ON","lat":43.2515675,"lng":-79.8436551,"address":"795 King St E, Hamilton, ON L8M 1A8","phone":"+19057770070","rating":4.8,"count":102,"slug":"stayshyn-law-offices-hamilton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Stayshyn+Law+Offices+Hamilton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=795+King+St+E%2C+Hamilton%2C+ON+L8M+1A8","website":"https://tslawoffice.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Hamilton. Rated 4.8 from 102 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/stayshyn-law-offices-hamilton.png","bioImage":"images/bio/stayshyn-law-offices-hamilton.webp","details":{"founded":2001,"lawyers":[{"name":"Ted Stayshyn"}],"areas":["Personal injury","Automobile accidents","Slips and falls","Short and long term disability claims"],"serving":["Hamilton","Haldimand","Southern Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Stayshyn Law Offices is a Hamilton personal injury firm serving Haldimand and Southern Ontario, including people denied insurance benefits.

Its work covers automobile accidents, slips and falls, trip and falls, premises liability, all-terrain vehicle accidents, boat accidents and motorcycle accidents. The firm also handles short and long term disability benefits and denials of critical illness and life insurance. It helps clients find treatment providers who can offer healthcare in their own language, and its team are litigators focused on personal injury.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('michael-a-wills-windsor','Michael A. Wills','Windsor','ON','southwestern',0,4.9,99,42.283328,-83.0211494,'{"name":"Michael A. Wills","city":"Windsor","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":42.283328,"lng":-83.0211494,"address":"2557 Dougall Ave Unit 6 Suite 214, Windsor, ON N8X 1T5","phone":"+12262591129","rating":4.9,"count":99,"slug":"michael-a-wills-windsor","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Michael+A.+Wills+Windsor+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2557+Dougall+Ave+Unit+6+Suite+214%2C+Windsor%2C+ON+N8X+1T5","website":"https://willslaw.ca","blurb":"Wills & Estates in Windsor. Rated 4.9 from 99 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/michael-a-wills-windsor.webp","details":{"areas":["Employment law","Labour law","Litigation","Human rights law","Wrongful dismissal","Employment contracts","Workplace investigations","ESA compliance","Collective bargaining"],"serving":["Windsor","Essex County"]}}',NULL,'Michael Wills is a Windsor lawyer advising employers and employees on employment law, labour law and litigation, with real estate work as well.

He has more than 25 years of experience serving Windsor and Essex County, and his practice was founded in 1997. Employment topics include wrongful dismissal, employment contracts, human rights advice, workplace investigations and Employment Standards Act compliance. Clients across Ontario can be served in employment, labour and real estate law, with plain-language advice and upfront discussion of process, timelines and cost.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('zoom-law-calgary','Zoom Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,5,97,51.0422931,-114.0670002,'{"name":"Zoom Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0422931,"lng":-114.0670002,"address":"211 11 Ave SW Ste 610, Calgary, AB T2R 0C6","phone":"+14032873134","rating":5,"count":97,"slug":"zoom-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Zoom+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=211+11+Ave+SW+Ste+610%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2R+0C6","website":"https://www.zoomlawyers.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Calgary. Rated 5.0 from 97 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/zoom-law-calgary.png","heroImage":"images/hero/zoom-law-calgary.webp","details":{"areas":["Injury law","Motor vehicle claims","Wrongful death","Motorcycle accidents","Slip and fall","Dog bite claims","Chronic injury claims"],"serving":["Calgary","Alberta"]}}',NULL,'Zoom Law is a Calgary firm practising only injury law, from car accidents and hit and runs to motorcycle, pedestrian and cycling crashes.

Its car accident work covers rear-end collisions, impaired or distracted driving, uninsured motorists and wrongful death. The firm works across Alberta and offers service in English, Arabic, Russian, Polish, Ukrainian, Tagalog, Urdu, Punjabi, Hindi and Kurdish. It also guides clients through chronic injury matters and recovery, with the Calgary office as its base.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('miller-boileau-family-law-group-edmonton','Miller Boileau Family Law Group','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.7,103,53.556588,-113.5408809,'{"name":"Miller Boileau Family Law Group","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.556588,"lng":-113.5408809,"address":"10981 127 St, Edmonton, AB T5M 0T1","phone":"+17804822888","rating":4.7,"count":103,"slug":"miller-boileau-family-law-group-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Miller+Boileau+Family+Law+Group+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10981+127+St%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5M+0T1","website":"https://www.millerboileau.com","blurb":"Family Law in Edmonton. Rated 4.7 from 103 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/miller-boileau-family-law-group-edmonton.png","bioImage":"images/bio/miller-boileau-family-law-group-edmonton.webp","details":{"areas":["Family law","Divorce & separation","Mediation","Collaboration","Property division","Parenting","Child & spousal support","Adult interdependent partners","Prenuptial & cohabitation agreements","Arbitration"],"serving":["Edmonton","Alberta"]}}',NULL,'Miller Boileau Family Law Group is an Edmonton firm that handles divorce, separation, property division, parenting, child support and spousal support.

Family law is the only area the firm practises. Its work also covers common law and adult interdependent partners, along with prenuptial and cohabitation agreements. Negotiation, mediation, collaboration, arbitration and litigation are all available as processes, and in mediation a neutral third party helps the parties reach their own agreement. Its lawyers have decades of experience, and each client is matched with the level of legal service the situation needs.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('op-lawyers-llp-calgary','OP Lawyers LLP','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,5,94,51.0480272,-114.0742889,'{"name":"OP Lawyers LLP","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0480272,"lng":-114.0742889,"address":"600 6 Ave SW #600, Calgary, AB T2P 0S5","phone":"+15878574684","rating":5,"count":94,"slug":"op-lawyers-llp-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/OP+Lawyers+LLP+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=600+6+Ave+SW+%23600%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2P+0S5","website":"https://www.oplawyers.ca","blurb":"Employment Law in Calgary. Rated 5.0 from 94 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/op-lawyers-llp-calgary.jpg","heroImage":"images/hero/op-lawyers-llp-calgary.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Amanda Ovaici"}],"areas":["Family law","Divorce law","Employment law","Civil law","Construction law","Protection orders","Estate planning","Wrongful dismissal","Civil litigation"],"serving":["Calgary","Alberta"]}}',NULL,'OP Lawyers LLP, also styled Ovaici Peydayesh LLP, is a Calgary firm covering family law, divorce, employment law and civil litigation.

Areas of law include Calgary family, divorce and employment matters, civil litigation, construction disputes and protection orders, and the firm also handles wills and estates and refugee law. It supports individuals, families and businesses across Calgary and Alberta, drawing on business experience and a collaborative approach that favours negotiation and efficient dispute resolution before litigation. Its blog covers Alberta topics such as parenting after separation, property division and child and spousal support.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('westcoast-wills-and-estates-vancouver','Westcoast Wills & Estates','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,5,91,49.263836,-123.136372,'{"name":"Westcoast Wills & Estates","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.263836,"lng":-123.136372,"address":"1401 W Broadway #601, Vancouver, BC V6H 1H6","phone":"+16042301068","rating":5,"count":91,"slug":"westcoast-wills-and-estates-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Westcoast+Wills+%26+Estates+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1401+W+Broadway+%23601%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6H+1H6","website":"https://westcoastwills.com","blurb":"Wills & Estates in Vancouver. Rated 5.0 from 91 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/westcoast-wills-and-estates-vancouver.png","details":{"languages":["English","Cantonese","Vietnamese","Mandarin","Punjabi"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Jessica Poon"},{"name":"Joanna Tu"}],"areas":["Probate law","Estate planning","Estate disputes","Corporate law","Tax law","Family law agreements","Wills","Powers of attorney"],"serving":["Vancouver","North Vancouver","Surrey","Burnaby","Richmond"]}}',NULL,'Westcoast Wills & Estates is a Vancouver firm of lawyers handling wills, trusts, probate, estate disputes and related corporate and family law.

The firm has offices in Vancouver, North Vancouver, Surrey, Burnaby and Richmond. Ninety-five percent of its clients are charged flat rates, and it donates 1 percent of its revenue to charity and tries to limit its environmental impact. Lawyers on the team include Jessica Poon, Aron Chitsaz, Katrina Law, Nick Russell, Harleen Sandhu and Joanna Tu. Representative work includes helping siblings settle a parent''s estate through a probate application, and its lawyers present publicly on estate topics.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ig-law-professional-corporation-london','IG Law Professional Corporation','London','ON','southwestern',0,4.9,91,42.9837221,-81.2437409,'{"name":"IG Law Professional Corporation","city":"London","featured":false,"tags":[],"caseTypes":[],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":42.9837221,"lng":-81.2437409,"address":"291 King St Unit-104, London, ON N6B 1R8","phone":"+12265264522","rating":4.9,"count":91,"slug":"ig-law-professional-corporation-london","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/IG+Law+Professional+Corporation+London+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=291+King+St+Unit-104%2C+London%2C+ON+N6B+1R8","website":"https://iglaw.ca","blurb":"Law firm in London. Rated 4.9 from 91 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ig-law-professional-corporation-london.png","details":{"areas":["Real estate law","Wills & estate","Notary public","Power of attorney","Commercial leases","Private mortgage financing","Collateral mortgage financing","Commercial loan transactions","Farm property"],"serving":["London"]}}',NULL,'IG Law Professional Corporation is a London, Ontario firm handling real estate, wills and estates, powers of attorney and notary work.

The firm acts on residential property, commercial property, farm property, vacant land, condo and cottage purchases and sales, and also handles commercial loan transactions of all types. Its work includes examining purchase and sale agreements and keeping clients informed through a transaction, and land transfers are among its filings. IG Law offers option-based strategies and friendly service that can be delivered from a client''s home or office.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('sg-injury-law-ottawa','SG Injury Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.8,92,45.3771635,-75.7055705,'{"name":"SG Injury Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["injury","employment"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3771635,"lng":-75.7055705,"address":"1101 Prince of Wales Dr #295, Ottawa, ON K2C 3W7","phone":"+16135182416","rating":4.8,"count":92,"slug":"sg-injury-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/SG+Injury+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1101+Prince+of+Wales+Dr+%23295%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K2C+3W7","website":"https://www.sginjurylaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury / Employment Law in Ottawa. Rated 4.8 from 92 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/sg-injury-law-ottawa.jpg","details":{"areas":["Personal injury","Long term disability denials","Insurance claims","Employment claims"],"serving":["Ottawa","Brockville","Kingston","Pembroke","Ontario"]}}','{"1":[["08:30","18:30"]],"2":[["08:30","18:30"]],"3":[["08:30","18:30"]],"4":[["08:30","18:30"]],"5":[["08:30","18:30"]]}','SG Injury Law is an Ottawa firm whose only practice areas are personal injury, long-term disability insurance and employment law.

The lawyers are former insurance defence lawyers. Their injury work covers car accidents, including no-fault accident benefits, and slip and fall cases, while the employment group handles wrongful dismissal, employment contracts, severance pay and termination package assessment. The firm acts in Ottawa and in Eastern Ontario communities such as Pembroke, Cornwall, Kingston, Brockville, Perth and Arnprior. It walks clients through the steps of an injury case, from a notice letter and examinations for discovery to mediation, pre-trial conference and trial.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('robb-macdonald-toronto','Robb MacDonald','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,87,43.6483555,-79.3959124,'{"name":"Robb MacDonald","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6483555,"lng":-79.3959124,"address":"130 Spadina Ave. #606, Toronto, ON M5V 2L4","phone":"+14163151505","rating":4.9,"count":87,"slug":"robb-macdonald-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Robb+MacDonald+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=130+Spadina+Ave.+%23606%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5V+2L4","website":"https://www.lawintoronto.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 87 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/robb-macdonald-toronto.webp","bioImage":"images/bio/robb-macdonald-toronto.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Robb MacDonald"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","Assault & violent offences","Conspiracy & organized crime","Impaired driving","Drug offences","Fraud & economic crimes","Sexual offences","Murder & manslaughter"],"serving":["Toronto","Scarborough"]}}',NULL,'Robb MacDonald is a Toronto criminal defence lawyer whose practice centres on jury trials for serious charges, from assault and impaired driving to murder.

He was admitted to the Ontario bar in 2007, holds a J.D. from Queen''s University, trained under Edward Greenspan and has two decades of defence work. Charges handled include assault and violent offences, conspiracy and organized crime, over 80, drug offences, fraud and economic crimes, sexual offences, and murder and manslaughter. The case R. v. Hoang features in his work, and other lawyers refer files to him. His assault work covers what the Crown must prove across the Greater Toronto Area.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('dietrich-law-office-kitchener','Dietrich Law Office','Kitchener','ON','waterloo-guelph',0,4.7,90,43.4488203,-80.4838247,'{"name":"Dietrich Law Office","city":"Kitchener","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"waterloo-guelph","province":"ON","lat":43.4488203,"lng":-80.4838247,"address":"141 Duke St E, Kitchener, ON N2H 1A6","phone":"+15197490770","rating":4.7,"count":90,"slug":"dietrich-law-office-kitchener","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Dietrich+Law+Office+Kitchener+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=141+Duke+St+E%2C+Kitchener%2C+ON+N2H+1A6","website":"https://www.dietrichlaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Kitchener. Rated 4.7 from 90 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/dietrich-law-office-kitchener.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"George Dietrich"},{"name":"Catharine Simons"},{"name":"Alexandra Victoros"},{"name":"Connor Shields"}],"areas":["Personal injury law","Disability law","Insurance law"],"serving":["Cambridge"]}}',NULL,'Dietrich Law Office is a Kitchener firm that represents injured people and those seeking disability benefits in Waterloo Region and nearby areas.

The lawyers serve Kitchener, Waterloo, Cambridge, the GTA, Brant and Oxford. The personal injury lawyers follow changes to motor vehicle accident legislation and the law of negligence, and the disability lawyers work with orthopaedic, psychological, chronic pain and fibromyalgia diagnoses. The firm pays attention to treatment and medication needs and to income replacement, and its practice is limited to personal injury and disability law.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('pollack-tsimerman-llp-north-york','Pollack Tsimerman LLP','North York','ON','toronto',0,5,408,43.7711721,-79.3226303,'{"name":"Pollack Tsimerman LLP","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["injury","litigation"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7711721,"lng":-79.3226303,"address":"2450 Victoria Park Ave, North York, ON M2J 4A2","phone":"+14164910111","rating":5,"count":408,"slug":"pollack-tsimerman-llp-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pollack+Tsimerman+LLP+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2450+Victoria+Park+Ave%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2J+4A2","website":"https://ptlawyers.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury / Civil Litigation in North York. Rated 5.0 from 408 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/pollack-tsimerman-llp-north-york.png","details":{"languages":["Hebrew","Russian"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Philip Pollack"},{"name":"Ziv Tsimerman"},{"name":"Lianne Sharvit"},{"name":"Michelle Farb"}],"areas":["Personal injury","Catastrophic injury","Long term disability","Motor vehicle accidents","Slip and fall","Product liability","Medical malpractice"],"serving":["Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Pollack Tsimerman LLP is a North York personal injury firm whose lawyers have worked on both the plaintiff and insurance sides of injury litigation.

The team includes Philip Pollack, Ziv Tsimerman, Lianne Sharvit, Michelle Farb, Julie Koritar, Laura Barbosa, Luca Drago and Ayla Koritar. Pollack, a graduate of Western University and Osgoode Hall Law School, formerly practised civil litigation at a large Toronto firm acting for national and international insurers. His injury work centres on motor vehicle and snowmobile accidents, slip and falls, long-term disability, product liability and sport and recreational litigation, and he appears before the Ontario Superior Court of Justice. The firm is prepared to take cases to trial.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('stepup-immigration-inc-edmonton','StepUp Immigration Inc.','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,5,402,53.4169202,-113.4791498,'{"name":"StepUp Immigration Inc.","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.4169202,"lng":-113.4791498,"address":"1803 91 St SW Unit 205, Edmonton, AB T6X 0W8","phone":"+17808858115","rating":5,"count":402,"slug":"stepup-immigration-inc-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/StepUp+Immigration+Inc.+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1803+91+St+SW+Unit+205%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T6X+0W8","website":"https://www.stepupimmigration.com","blurb":"Immigration in Edmonton. Rated 5.0 from 402 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/stepup-immigration-inc-edmonton.png","details":{"areas":["Express Entry","Provincial Nominee Program","Study permits","Work permits","Family sponsorship","Visitor visas","Super visa","Spousal immigration","Post landing services"],"serving":["Edmonton"]}}',NULL,'StepUp Immigration is an Edmonton firm of Registered Canadian Immigration Consultants assisting with visas, work permits and permanent residence.

The firm has served clients for over a decade and supports people who want to study, work or settle in Canada, from visa applications to permanent residency applications. It also offers post-landing guidance on banking, transport and renting or buying a home, along with application tracking. Topics it follows include new language test rules for permanent residence applications and open work permit changes for high-skilled workers as of January 2025.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('amer-ali-law-ottawa','Amer Ali Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,388,45.4915491,-75.4821114,'{"name":"Amer Ali Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4915491,"lng":-75.4821114,"address":"890 Taylor Creek Dr, Orléans, ON K4A 0Z9","phone":"+13436335997","rating":5,"count":388,"slug":"amer-ali-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Amer+Ali+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=890+Taylor+Creek+Dr%2C+Orl%C3%A9ans%2C+ON+K4A+0Z9","website":"https://www.ameralilaw.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 388 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/amer-ali-law-ottawa.png","details":{"areas":["Real estate law","Buying real estate","Selling real estate","Title transfers","Mortgage transactions"]}}',NULL,'Amer Ali Law is a virtual Ontario firm, with Ottawa, Orleans and Toronto listed, that handles real estate closings, incorporations and wills.

The firm''s model pairs technology with personal service, with documents signed electronically and remotely, or in person when arranged in advance. Its real estate work includes buying and selling, title transfers and survivorship applications, mortgage transactions, mortgage refinancing and debt consolidation, and examining the agreement of purchase and sale. It acts for homeowners, realtors, lenders and mortgage professionals on residential and commercial properties, and has completed thousands of real estate deals.','dynamic','live',NULL);
