Founded in 1984, the firm has worked for Ontario employees for over 40 years and has acted for more than 10,000 clients. Its subjects also include discrimination, harassment, denied disability benefits and forced resignation from toxic workplaces. Its lawyers have litigated precedent-setting cases, and the firm serves Toronto and North York, working for Ontario workers.','dynamic','live',NULL);
