The firm is led by founding partner Weston Powell and focuses exclusively on courtroom advocacy and dispute resolution rather than general practice. It handles commercial conflicts, real estate disputes and estate challenges, and appears in the Ontario Superior Court of Justice for clients across Southern Ontario. Its office is in Toronto, Richmond Hill is also among the places served, and the lawyers have over 40 years of combined trial experience.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('property-law-firm-cb-llp-calgary','Property Law Firm CB LLP','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,1250,51.1290181,-114.20437,'{"name":"Property Law Firm CB LLP","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.1290181,"lng":-114.20437,"address":"600 Crowfoot Crescent NW #240, Calgary, AB T3G 0B4","phone":"+14038008000","rating":4.9,"count":1250,"slug":"property-law-firm-cb-llp-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Property+Law+Firm+CB+LLP+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=600+Crowfoot+Crescent+NW+%23240%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T3G+0B4","website":"https://www.propertylaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 1250 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/property-law-firm-cb-llp-calgary.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Joseph Berljawsky"},{"name":"Nathaniel Brettle"},{"name":"Iryna Romanova"},{"name":"Mahdi Al-Toum"}],"areas":["Real estate legal services","Residential purchases & sales","Mortgage refinancing","Ownership transfers","Lending services","Refinancing & second mortgages","Mortgage registration & discharges"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Property Law Firm CB LLP is a Calgary real estate practice handling home purchases, sales, refinancing and ownership transfers.

The firm is a purpose-built real estate practice serving clients across Canada, with offices in Alberta and Ontario. It guides people from home purchases through to complex lending agreements, using remote closings and digital documentation to limit delays. Realtors, lenders and title companies are the professionals it works with, and its focus is heading off legal issues before a closing. Its mission is to change how real estate is transacted nationally.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('clark-and-clark-lawyers-calgary','Clark & Clark Lawyers','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,535,50.999298,-114.0661544,'{"name":"Clark & Clark Lawyers","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":50.999298,"lng":-114.0661544,"address":"6020 1a St SW Ste 8, Calgary, AB T2H 0G3","phone":"+14037771444","rating":4.9,"count":535,"slug":"clark-and-clark-lawyers-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Clark+%26+Clark+Lawyers+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=6020+1a+St+SW+Ste+8%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2H+0G3","website":"https://clarklegal.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 535 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/clark-and-clark-lawyers-calgary.png","details":{"founded":1995,"lawyers":[{"name":"Clint R. Clark"},{"name":"Maxwell LaBrech"},{"name":"Brian Twerdoff"},{"name":"Brandon Clark"}],"areas":["Residential & commercial real estate","Corporate & commercial law","Wills & estates","Enduring power of attorney"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}',NULL,'Clark & Clark Lawyers is a Calgary firm handling residential and commercial real estate, corporate and commercial law, and wills and estates.

The firm has served the Calgary community since 1995, and residential real estate is the core of its practice, whether the property is a condominium or a quarter section. Its real estate services include buying, selling and refinancing, preparing leases, and conveyancing for residential development projects, from subdividing a lot to a hundred-unit condominium. Corporate work covers incorporation, partnerships and joint ventures, and estate work covers wills, powers of attorney and personal directives. Clients anywhere in Alberta can sign remotely.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('summit-legal-group-calgary','Summit Legal Group','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,594,50.9874687,-114.028594,'{"name":"Summit Legal Group","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":50.9874687,"lng":-114.028594,"address":"30 Glendeer Cir SE #200, Calgary, AB T2H 2Z7","phone":"+15873560356","rating":4.9,"count":594,"slug":"summit-legal-group-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Summit+Legal+Group+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=30+Glendeer+Cir+SE+%23200%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2H+2Z7","website":"https://www.summitlegalgroup.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 594 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/summit-legal-group-calgary.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Sean V. Green"},{"name":"Natasha A. Nicholls"},{"name":"Mark K. Kiggundu"},{"name":"Gabrielle Maunier"},{"name":"Warren W.C. Woo"}],"areas":["Real estate","Wills & estate","Business law","Domestic contracts","Notary","Probate & estate administration","Executor advisor services"]}}',NULL,'Summit Legal Group is a boutique Calgary firm covering real estate, wills and estates, business law, domestic contracts and notary services.

On real estate, the firm acts for buyers and sellers of residential and commercial properties, preparing and registering the necessary documents. Its estate work includes wills and estate planning, probate, administration of estates and trusts, executor advisor services and dependent adult matters. Notary services include notarizing documents, administering oaths and affirmations and certifying true copies; a notary verifies identity and voluntary signing to deter fraud.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('shivji-law-calgary','Shivji Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,316,51.0004539,-114.0701217,'{"name":"Shivji Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0004539,"lng":-114.0701217,"address":"5940 Macleod Trl SW #601, Calgary, AB T2H 2G4","phone":"+14032535588","rating":4.9,"count":316,"slug":"shivji-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Shivji+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=5940+Macleod+Trl+SW+%23601%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2H+2G4","website":"https://shivjilaw.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 316 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/shivji-law-calgary.webp","details":{"areas":["Real estate law","Wills and estates","Employment law","Purchase of property","Purchase of new condominiums","Purchase of foreclosure property","House purchase from builder","Construction draw mortgages","Sale of property","Refinance of property"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}',NULL,'Shivji Law is a boutique Calgary firm focused on residential real estate, with wills and estates and employment law as additional services.

Its real estate work covers purchases, including new condominiums, foreclosure properties and houses bought from builders, as well as sales, refinancing and construction draw mortgages. The team includes Farouk Shivji, Madisyn Gilbert, Abi Poxon and Mizghan Darwishan. The office sits just outside the downtown core, with parking for clients and access from all quadrants of the city.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('passgo-real-estate-law-calgary','PassGo Real Estate Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,403,50.9085299,-114.063414,'{"name":"PassGo Real Estate Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":50.9085299,"lng":-114.063414,"address":"340 Midpark Way SE Ste 203, Calgary, AB T2X 1P1","phone":"+15875707427","rating":4.9,"count":403,"slug":"passgo-real-estate-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/PassGo+Real+Estate+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=340+Midpark+Way+SE+Ste+203%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2X+1P1","website":"https://passgo.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 403 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/passgo-real-estate-law-calgary.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Erin Crocker"}],"areas":["Real estate legal services","Residential real estate"],"serving":["Calgary","Alberta","British Columbia","Ontario"]}}',NULL,'PassGo Real Estate Law is a Calgary firm that closes home purchases, sales, mortgage refinances and title transfers through an online workspace or in person.

The firm acts on properties in Alberta and British Columbia. Clients upload documents, meet with a lawyer online or face to face, and then collect keys or receive funds. For title changes, it prepares the transfer, coordinates mortgage requirements and files with Alberta Land Titles. The team includes Erin Crocker, who has over ten years of practice, along with Shivam Parekh, Amy Kim, Cari Henschel, Denyse Giguere, Anthony Staddon, Emily Johnston and Kaiya Proulx.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('pringle-law-edmonton','Pringle Law','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.9,541,53.542498,-113.4908164,'{"name":"Pringle Law","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["criminal","litigation"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.542498,"lng":-113.4908164,"address":"10150 100 St NW #300, Edmonton, AB T5J 0N8","phone":"+17804248866","rating":4.9,"count":541,"slug":"pringle-law-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pringle+Law+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10150+100+St+NW+%23300%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5J+0N8","website":"https://www.pringlelaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Civil Litigation in Edmonton. Rated 4.9 from 541 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/pringle-law-edmonton.webp","bioImage":"images/bio/pringle-law-edmonton.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Dan Chivers"},{"name":"Michael D. Sparks"},{"name":"Daniel J. Song"},{"name":"Nicole J. Stewart"},{"name":"Evan McIntyre"},{"name":"Curtis Steeves"},{"name":"Laura Matalas"},{"name":"Stephen Brophy"},{"name":"Tania Shapka"},{"name":"Jackson Mirasty"},{"name":"Susannah Morrison"},{"name":"Ariel MacDonald"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","Sexual assault & sexual offences","Violence & offences of assault","Driving & impaired driving offences","Drug offences","Regulatory offences","Domestic violence offences","Weapons & firearms offences","Fraud, theft & commercial crime","Internet, computer & technology crimes"],"serving":["Edmonton","Western Canada","Alberta","Northwest Territories"]}}',NULL,'Pringle Law is an Edmonton criminal defence firm representing people charged with criminal and regulatory offences across Western Canada.

Criminal defence is the only area every one of the firm''s lawyers practises. Offences handled range from driving offences and domestic violence to sexual offences and weapons offences, at every stage from arrest and bail hearings to sentencing, trials and appeals. The firm also takes administrative offences, and its service area includes British Columbia and the Northwest Territories. The lawyers include Dan Chivers, Michael D. Sparks and the late Alexander Pringle, K.C. (1947-2015), and the firm offers an extradition guide and an articling student program.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('james-h-brown-and-associates-edmonton','James H. Brown & Associates','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.9,1701,53.542172,-113.4879108,'{"name":"James H. Brown & Associates","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["injury","litigation"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.542172,"lng":-113.4879108,"address":"10123 99 St NW, Edmonton, AB T5J 3H1","phone":"+17804280088","rating":4.9,"count":1701,"slug":"james-h-brown-and-associates-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/James+H.+Brown+%26+Associates+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10123+99+St+NW%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5J+3H1","website":"https://www.jameshbrown.com","blurb":"Personal Injury / Civil Litigation in Edmonton. Rated 4.9 from 1701 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/james-h-brown-and-associates-edmonton.webp","bioImage":"images/bio/james-h-brown-and-associates-edmonton.webp","details":{"founded":1993,"lawyers":[{"name":"James H. Brown"},{"name":"Trent Brown"}],"areas":["Personal injury","Car accidents","Motorcycle accidents","Heavy truck accidents","Wrongful death","Medical malpractice","Brain injury","Spinal cord injury","Whiplash","Burn injury"],"serving":["Edmonton","Alberta"]}}',NULL,'James H Brown & Associates is an Edmonton personal injury firm acting for Albertans hurt in car accidents and other serious accidents.

The firm was formed by James H. Brown, who at 19 suffered a broken neck in a head-on collision with a drunk driver, ending his professional hockey career. Injury types include spinal cord injury, traumatic brain injury, whiplash and wrongful death, and its lawyers have over 200 years of combined experience. The firm aims to help injured people recover compensation for medical expenses, lost wages and other damages, and it handles precedent-setting car accident cases.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('snowdrop-immigration-services-ltd-edmonton','Snowdrop Immigration Services Ltd','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.9,1231,53.4167306,-113.4782628,'{"name":"Snowdrop Immigration Services Ltd","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.4167306,"lng":-113.4782628,"address":"1803 91 St SW unit#105, Edmonton, AB T6X 0C8","phone":"+15874161702","rating":4.9,"count":1231,"slug":"snowdrop-immigration-services-ltd-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Snowdrop+Immigration+Services+Ltd+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1803+91+St+SW+unit%23105%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T6X+0C8","website":"https://snowdropimmigration.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Edmonton. Rated 4.9 from 1231 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/snowdrop-immigration-services-ltd-edmonton.png","details":{"areas":["Permanent residency","Study visa assistance","Work permit support","Visitor visa & super visa support","Express Entry","Provincial nominee programs"],"serving":["Edmonton"]}}',NULL,'Snowdrop Immigration Services Ltd is an Edmonton firm offering permanent residence, study permit, work permit and visitor visa services.

The firm is registered and regulated and works only on Canadian immigration. Its services include Express Entry, family sponsorship, provincial nominee applications, the Rural and Northern Immigration Pilot, the Atlantic Immigration Pilot, work permits and work permit extensions, as well as super visa support. The team studies each client''s background and eligibility before planning a pathway.','dynamic','live',NULL);
