Its lawyers have more than 35 combined years of litigation experience, much of it working for insurance companies before acting for injured people. They have conducted trials before juries and judges across Ontario and argued matters at the highest level of court in the province. Partners Matthew C. MacIsaac and Fraser R. Gow are joined by associates Alex Robart, Mark McDonald and Maximilian Jagoda, and the firm serves clients in Mississauga and the surrounding area.','dynamic','live',NULL);
