The firm''s main focus is real estate law, covering buying, selling and refinancing, and it also handles private mortgages, family law and litigation. Adam Seif is licensed in Canada and in the US, belongs to the Florida Bar and opened his own practice in 2011 after articling. The team includes lawyers, law clerks and legal assistants, a live person answers around the clock, and the multilingual team includes French.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('dimitri-trofimoff-lawyer-ottawa','Dimitri Trofimoff Lawyer','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.9,238,45.3009275,-75.8822862,'{"name":"Dimitri Trofimoff Lawyer","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3009275,"lng":-75.8822862,"address":"430 Hazeldean Rd Unit 6, Ottawa, ON K2L 1T9","phone":"+18885119118","rating":4.9,"count":238,"slug":"dimitri-trofimoff-lawyer-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Dimitri+Trofimoff+Lawyer+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=430+Hazeldean+Rd+Unit+6%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K2L+1T9","website":"https://gotlaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Ottawa. Rated 4.9 from 238 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/dimitri-trofimoff-lawyer-ottawa.png","details":{"languages":["Russian"],"areas":["Criminal law","Notary services","Family law"],"serving":["Ottawa","Renfrew","Lanark"]}}',NULL,'Dimitri Trofimoff Lawyer is an Ottawa practice handling family law and criminal defence, with offices serving Ottawa, Kanata and Perth.

On the criminal side, the practice represents clients from police interaction and bail hearings through negotiation with prosecutors, judicial pre-trial and trial in Ontario courts. Its family work covers anything from a simple divorce to a complicated separation. The office also provides certification of copies, witnessing of signatures, commissioning of oaths, and travel and invitation letters. It has three locations in the region and offers virtual meetings, and Dimitri Trofimoff was educated in Russia, England and Ontario.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lawyerg-calgary','LawyerG','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,234,51.0672085,-114.0684562,'{"name":"LawyerG","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0672085,"lng":-114.0684562,"address":"320 16 Ave NW Ste 105, Calgary, AB T2M 0H6","phone":"+14034545294","rating":4.9,"count":234,"slug":"lawyerg-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/LawyerG+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=320+16+Ave+NW+Ste+105%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2M+0H6","website":"https://www.lawyerg.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 234 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lawyerg-calgary.jpg","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Gurpreet Aulakh"}],"areas":["Real estate","Corporate and commercial","Civil litigation"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}',NULL,'LawyerG is a Calgary law office led by Gurpreet Aulakh, handling real estate, corporate and commercial law, wills and family matters.

The firm is full service, with a focus on real property and on corporate and commercial work. For home buyers and sellers it covers real property reports and land title transfers; for families it also prepares prenuptial and cohabitation contracts, and it offers notary services such as travel documents. Civil litigation and personal injury are also practice areas. Gurpreet Aulakh holds law and business degrees, a cyber crime investigation certification, and memberships in the Law Society of Alberta, Legal Aid Alberta and the Calgary Bar Association.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('alexander-hu-professional-corporation-toronto','Alexander Hu Professional Corporation','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,229,43.6556261,-79.3864674,'{"name":"Alexander Hu Professional Corporation","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6556261,"lng":-79.3864674,"address":"180 Dundas St W 25th Floor, Toronto, ON M5G 1Z8","phone":"+16473628618","rating":5,"count":229,"slug":"alexander-hu-professional-corporation-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Alexander+Hu+Professional+Corporation+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=180+Dundas+St+W+25th+Floor%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5G+1Z8","website":"https://www.alexhulaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 229 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/alexander-hu-professional-corporation-toronto.png","heroImage":"images/hero/alexander-hu-professional-corporation-toronto.webp","details":{"areas":["Real estate purchase","Real estate sale","Condo sale","Condo purchase","New construction home purchase","Residential real estate"],"serving":["Toronto","GTA","Peel Region","Durham Region","York Region","Halton Region"]}}',NULL,'Alexander Hu Professional Corporation is a Downtown Toronto law firm limited to real estate, handling home and condo purchases, sales and mortgages.

The firm''s work covers title examination, financing and closing coordination, including examination of condominium status certificates and collaboration with realtors and mortgage lenders. It serves Toronto, Peel, Durham, York and Halton regions, with local coverage of Central Toronto, Old York, East York, Etobicoke, North York and Scarborough. Topics include multiple offers, rezoning and development, property taxes, land transfer taxes and mixed-use or commercial properties.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('mandall-immigration-law-toronto','Mandall Immigration Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,229,43.6599948,-79.3851994,'{"name":"Mandall Immigration Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6599948,"lng":-79.3851994,"address":"763 Bay St. #3008, Toronto, ON M7A 1S5","phone":"+16479305067","rating":5,"count":229,"slug":"mandall-immigration-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mandall+Immigration+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=763+Bay+St.+%233008%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M7A+1S5","website":"https://mandallimmigrationlaw.com","blurb":"Immigration in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 229 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/mandall-immigration-law-toronto.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Austin Mandall Rooplall","title":"Founder"}],"areas":["Visitor visa","Study permits","Spousal sponsorships","Work permits","Express Entry","PR card renewals","Humanitarian applications","Inadmissibility","Federal Court matters","Immigration appeals"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Mandall Immigration Law is a Toronto firm handling visitor visas, study and work permits, spousal sponsorship, Express Entry and immigration appeals.

The firm is led by founder Austin Mandall Rooplall, who personally examines every file, and it has offices in Toronto and Ottawa. It was founded in 2024. Other services include PR card renewals, humanitarian applications, inadmissibility matters and LMIA-related work permits, and the difference between LMIA-based and exempt permits is part of its guidance. It serves clients across Canada and worldwide with a transparent, client-centred approach.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('dlegal-law-office-wills-calgary','DLegal Law Office: Wills','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,232,50.9019759,-114.0571543,'{"name":"DLegal Law Office: Wills","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Real Estate","Wills & Estates","Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["family","realestate","wills","employment"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":50.9019759,"lng":-114.0571543,"address":"40 Sunpark Plaza SE Ste 226, Calgary, AB T2X 3X7","phone":"+15878851783","rating":4.9,"count":232,"slug":"dlegal-law-office-wills-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/DLegal+Law+Office%3A+Wills+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=40+Sunpark+Plaza+SE+Ste+226%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2X+3X7","website":"https://dlegal.ca","blurb":"Family Law / Real Estate in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 232 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/dlegal-law-office-wills-calgary.png","bioImage":"images/bio/dlegal-law-office-wills-calgary.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Anna Dunaeva"},{"name":"Kenule Onu"}],"areas":["Immigration law","Business law","Corporate law","Litigation","Employment law","Notary services","Real estate","Family law","Wills and estate planning"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','DLegal Law Office: Wills is a Calgary practice handling wills and estate planning, family matters, real estate transactions and business law.

The firm offers everyday legal services for everyday needs, supporting Calgary families through each stage of life. It publishes its flat fees, because transparency and predictability matter to its clients. Lawyer and notary Anna Dunaeva leads the practice, which also carries resources on the roles of executors and estate trustees and on the Estate Administration Act in Alberta. The firm serves on community boards and teaches seminars around Calgary.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('hammerco-lawyers-llp-vancouver','Hammerco Lawyers LLP','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.7,241,49.2654367,-123.1097418,'{"name":"Hammerco Lawyers LLP","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2654367,"lng":-123.1097418,"address":"2233 Columbia St #400, Vancouver, BC V5Y 0M6","phone":"+16042698500","rating":4.7,"count":241,"slug":"hammerco-lawyers-llp-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Hammerco+Lawyers+LLP+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2233+Columbia+St+%23400%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V5Y+0M6","website":"https://hammerco.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Vancouver. Rated 4.7 from 241 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/hammerco-lawyers-llp-vancouver.png","bioImage":"images/bio/hammerco-lawyers-llp-vancouver.webp","details":{"languages":["Mandarin","Cantonese","Farsi","French","Spanish"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Morgyn Chandler"},{"name":"Douglas Chiu"},{"name":"Dale McGregor"},{"name":"Kevin McLaren"},{"name":"Krista Simon"},{"name":"Alexia Majidi"},{"name":"Sabrina Lombardi"},{"name":"Rosy Arora"},{"name":"Serena Cheong"},{"name":"Hailey Reid"},{"name":"Elisabeth Sadowski"},{"name":"Chanèle Rioux-McCormick"}],"areas":["Class action litigation"],"serving":["B.C.","Ontario","London"]}}',NULL,'Hammerco Lawyers LLP is a Vancouver firm handling class actions, commercial litigation, estate litigation, personal injury and medical negligence.

The firm has served individuals and businesses for over twenty-five years in British Columbia and now in Ontario, with offices on Vancouver Island, in Vancouver and in London, Ontario. It also acts in civil sexual assault cases and publishes a guide for survivors of sexual assault. Lawyers include Morgyn Chandler, Douglas Chiu, Dale McGregor, Kevin McLaren, Krista Simon, Alexia Majidi and Sabrina Lombardi, and service is available in Mandarin and Cantonese among other languages.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('bottos-law-group-edmonton','Bottos Law Group','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.9,223,53.543681,-113.499782,'{"name":"Bottos Law Group","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.543681,"lng":-113.499782,"address":"10226 104 Street NW 4th floor, Edmonton, AB T5J 1B8","phone":"+17804217001","rating":4.9,"count":223,"slug":"bottos-law-group-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Bottos+Law+Group+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10226+104+Street+NW+4th+floor%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5J+1B8","website":"https://bottoslaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Edmonton. Rated 4.9 from 223 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/bottos-law-group-edmonton.webp","heroImage":"images/hero/bottos-law-group-edmonton.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Dino Bottos"},{"name":"Austin Corbett"}],"areas":["Homicide","Impaired driving","Sexual assault","Assault and domestic violence","Drug charges","Firearms and weapons offences","Theft and fraud","Internet crimes","Youth criminal justice","Criminal appeals"],"serving":["Edmonton","Northern Alberta","Central Alberta","Southern Alberta"]}}','{"1":[["08:00","17:00"]],"2":[["08:00","17:00"]],"3":[["08:00","17:00"]],"4":[["08:00","17:00"]],"5":[["08:00","17:00"]]}','Bottos Law Group is an Edmonton criminal defence firm representing people accused of serious criminal and regulatory charges across Alberta.

The firm was founded in 2012, and its barristers have been involved in many high-profile criminal cases in Edmonton and elsewhere in the province. It acts for individuals accused of any crime, and no matter is considered too small or too serious. Its lawyers, including Will van Engen, offer straightforward and thorough legal advice. The firm also advertises articling positions for law students and publishes news items on its blog.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('addelman-baum-gilbert-llp-ottawa','Addelman Baum Gilbert LLP','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.8,226,45.4222969,-75.6953132,'{"name":"Addelman Baum Gilbert LLP","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4222969,"lng":-75.6953132,"address":"75 Albert St #207, Ottawa, ON K1P 5E7","phone":"+16132372673","rating":4.8,"count":226,"slug":"addelman-baum-gilbert-llp-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Addelman+Baum+Gilbert+LLP+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=75+Albert+St+%23207%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1P+5E7","website":"https://www.abgottawa.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Ottawa. Rated 4.8 from 226 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/addelman-baum-gilbert-llp-ottawa.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Richard Addelman"},{"name":"Douglas Baum"},{"name":"Jason Gilbert"},{"name":"Joseph Addelman"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","Child protection"],"serving":["Ottawa","Brockville","Cornwall","L’Orignal","Perth","Pembroke","Renfrew","Smith Falls"]}}',NULL,'Addelman Baum Gilbert LLP is an Ottawa firm handling criminal defence and child protection (C.A.S.) proceedings across Eastern Ontario.

The firm was formed in January 2010 by Richard Addelman, Douglas Baum, Jason Gilbert and Joseph Addelman. Based in Ottawa, it also serves Brockville, Cornwall, L''Orignal, Perth, Pembroke, Renfrew and Smiths Falls. It acts in criminal and regulatory offences as well as child protection cases, and does trial and appellate work on matters such as homicides. Richard Addelman graduated from the University of Ottawa Faculty of Law in 1969 and helped found the Defence Counsel Association of Ottawa in 1975.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('tim-louis-and-company-law-firm-vancouver','Tim Louis & Company Law Firm','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.9,218,49.2671893,-123.1629687,'{"name":"Tim Louis & Company Law Firm","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2671893,"lng":-123.1629687,"address":"2526 W 5th Ave, Vancouver, BC V6K 1T1","phone":"+16047327678","rating":4.9,"count":218,"slug":"tim-louis-and-company-law-firm-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Tim+Louis+%26+Company+Law+Firm+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2526+W+5th+Ave%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6K+1T1","website":"https://timlouislaw.com","blurb":"Personal Injury in Vancouver. Rated 4.9 from 218 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/tim-louis-and-company-law-firm-vancouver.png","bioImage":"images/bio/tim-louis-and-company-law-firm-vancouver.webp","details":{"languages":["English","Spanish"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Tim Louis"}],"areas":["Long-term disability claims","Employment law","Wills and estate planning","Estate litigation and will disputes","Probate administration","Personal injury law"],"serving":["Vancouver"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Tim Louis & Company Law Firm is a Vancouver practice handling long-term disability cases, wills and estates, personal injury and employment law.

The firm is led by Tim Louis, who graduated from UBC Law in 1983, articled with Harry Rankin in 1984 and then opened his own practice. He co-founded the BC Coalition of the Disabled, now Disability Alliance BC, and the Public Interest Advocacy Centre, and served on the Vancouver Park Board, City Council and Library Board. The firm assists clients across British Columbia with probate, estate disputes, wrongful dismissal and denied benefits, and offers service in English and Spanish.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('aviron-law-professional-corporation-brampton','Aviron Law Professional Corporation','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,5,211,43.6903483,-79.7316513,'{"name":"Aviron Law Professional Corporation","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6903483,"lng":-79.7316513,"address":"159 Rutherford Rd S 2nd Floor, Brampton, ON L6W 3N5","phone":"+19054971200","rating":5,"count":211,"slug":"aviron-law-professional-corporation-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Aviron+Law+Professional+Corporation+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=159+Rutherford+Rd+S+2nd+Floor%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6W+3N5","website":"https://www.avironlaw.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Brampton. Rated 5.0 from 211 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/aviron-law-professional-corporation-brampton.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Dilvir S. Tatter","title":"Principal Lawyer"}],"areas":["Real estate law","Wills and estate planning","Business law","Immigration law","Probate and estate administration","Powers of attorney","Commercial real estate","Residential real estate"],"serving":["Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Aviron Law Professional Corporation is a Brampton firm handling real estate, wills and estate planning, business law, immigration and civil litigation.

Its principal lawyer, Dilvir S. Tatter, holds LL.M. and LL.B. degrees, practises as barrister, solicitor and notary public, and began his career in litigation on contractual disputes. The real estate group acts on residential, commercial and condominium purchases and sales, mortgage refinancing, survivorship applications and title transfers. Its litigation practice covers civil disputes from a demand letter through negotiation, mediation and trial, including shareholder and partnership conflicts, failed closings and deposit disputes. Team member Avinash Kaur is also named.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('kh-dunkley-law-group-calgary','KH/Dunkley Law Group','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.7,224,51.0810737,-114.013771,'{"name":"KH/Dunkley Law Group","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0810737,"lng":-114.013771,"address":"1915 32 Ave NE, Calgary, AB T2E 6R6","phone":"+15873234155","rating":4.7,"count":224,"slug":"kh-dunkley-law-group-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/KH%2FDunkley+Law+Group+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1915+32+Ave+NE%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2E+6R6","website":"https://www.khlawgroup.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Calgary. Rated 4.7 from 224 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/kh-dunkley-law-group-calgary.png","details":{"founded":2010,"lawyers":[{"name":"Khalil Haji","title":"Lawyer"},{"name":"Stephanie Sue Wan Wong","title":"Lawyer"},{"name":"Fanny Tam","title":"Lawyer"},{"name":"Grace Fasehun","title":"Lawyer"},{"name":"Stephanie Ostrowski","title":"Lawyer"},{"name":"Bailey Kester","title":"Lawyer"},{"name":"Zackary Kirsch","title":"Lawyer"}],"areas":["Residential real estate","Commercial real estate","Corporate law","Wills and estates"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}',NULL,'KH | Dunkley Law Group is a Calgary firm handling residential and commercial real estate, wills and estates, and corporate law.

The firm was formed in 2012 through the merger of KH Law and Michael C. Dunkley Law Offices. It operates from three locations: a main office in northeast Calgary, a central office near Bonnybrook and Inglewood, and a south office near Shawnessy and Sundance. Clients always meet with a lawyer, flat-rate pricing is offered on nearly all services, and evening signing appointments are held. General services include notary public work, commissioning of oaths, powers of attorney, independent legal advice certificates and travel consent letters.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('cangaly-montreal','Cangaly','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,5,208,45.4960199,-73.5765625,'{"name":"Cangaly","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.4960199,"lng":-73.5765625,"address":"1440 Sainte-Catherine St. West Ste 404, Montreal, Quebec H3G 1R8","phone":"+15145839566","rating":5,"count":208,"slug":"cangaly-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Cangaly+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1440+Sainte-Catherine+St.+West+Ste+404%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H3G+1R8","website":"https://www.jialicanada.com","blurb":"Immigration in Montreal. Rated 5.0 from 208 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/cangaly-montreal.png"}',NULL,'Cangaly is a Montreal immigration consulting company assisting with Quebec PEQ, federal Express Entry, provincial nomination and study permit applications.

The company, which works in Chinese, is registered to handle entry and exit affairs, immigration and study abroad, employment placement, and education training. Its consultant holds a bachelor''s degree in applied linguistics and a master''s in information processing and analysis, previously worked at the China Scholarship Council, and can represent clients before immigration authorities, the border agency and the Immigration and Refugee Board on appeal. The company carries one million dollars of insurance each year and has teams in Canada and China.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('mcintosh-and-zayed-s-r-l-winnipeg','McIntosh & Zayed s.r.l.','Winnipeg','MB','mb-winnipeg',0,5,205,49.8791528,-97.1179486,'{"name":"McIntosh & Zayed s.r.l.","city":"Winnipeg","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"mb-winnipeg","province":"MB","lat":49.8791528,"lng":-97.1179486,"address":"221B Kitson St, Winnipeg, MB R2H 0Z4","phone":"+12046662503","rating":5,"count":205,"slug":"mcintosh-and-zayed-s-r-l-winnipeg","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/McIntosh+%26+Zayed+s.r.l.+Winnipeg+Manitoba","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=221B+Kitson+St%2C+Winnipeg%2C+MB+R2H+0Z4","website":"https://www.mcintoshzayed.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Winnipeg. Rated 5.0 from 205 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/mcintosh-and-zayed-s-r-l-winnipeg.png","heroImage":"images/hero/mcintosh-and-zayed-s-r-l-winnipeg.webp","details":{"languages":["English","French","Arabic","Spanish"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Stephen A. McIntosh"},{"name":"Philip A. Zayed"}],"areas":["Immigration services","Asylum hearings","Immigration appeals","Temporary resident visas and work permits","Business incorporation"],"serving":["Manitoba"]}}',NULL,'In Winnipeg, McIntosh & Zayed s.r.l., a local firm, handles immigration, real estate, business and wills and estates matters.

Its immigration work covers refugee matters, applications and appeals, and the real estate group acts on purchases, sales and developments, walking Manitoba buyers through the costs and paperwork. The business group deals with corporations, contracts and litigation, while the wills and estates group handles wills, powers of attorney and probate. The firm uses custom technology to help clients put their testamentary documents in order, and it also offers notary public appointments. It aims to bring clients peace of mind.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('maclean-law-vancouver','MacLean Law','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.6,222,49.2876342,-123.1175718,'{"name":"MacLean Law","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["family","wills"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2876342,"lng":-123.1175718,"address":"1021 W Hastings St #2900, Vancouver, BC V6E 0C3","phone":"+16046029000","rating":4.6,"count":222,"slug":"maclean-law-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/MacLean+Law+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1021+W+Hastings+St+%232900%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6E+0C3","website":"https://macleanfamilylaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law / Wills & Estates in Vancouver. Rated 4.6 from 222 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/maclean-law-vancouver.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Lorne MacLean"},{"name":"Fraser MacLean"}],"areas":["Family law","High net worth family law","Wealth protection agreements","Estate litigation","International child abduction","Prenuptial agreements","Family property and debt division","Wills variation","Cohabitation agreements","Parenting time and guardianship"],"serving":["West Vancouver","Vancouver"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','MacLean Law is a Vancouver family law firm handling parenting, guardianship, high net worth divorce and estate litigation matters.

The firm was founded in 1983 and has more than 43 years of practice. It has offices in Vancouver, West Vancouver, Victoria, Surrey, Kelowna and Calgary. Its areas include child parenting time, guardianship and fertility, adult guardianship, power of attorney abuse and undue influence, the division of family trusts and family businesses, and foreign child custody orders in British Columbia. Lorne MacLean, KC, Fraser MacLean, Sophie Bartholomew and Rana Yavari are co-authors of the Chambers and Partners Family Law Guide for Canada.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('cougle-co-real-estate-business-law-calgary','Cougle + Co. │ Real Estate + Business Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,204,51.0375842,-114.1181314,'{"name":"Cougle + Co. │ Real Estate + Business Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["realestate","business"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0375842,"lng":-114.1181314,"address":"2505 17 Ave SW Unit 220, Calgary, AB T3E 7V3","phone":"+14032499000","rating":4.9,"count":204,"slug":"cougle-co-real-estate-business-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Cougle+%2B+Co.+%E2%94%82+Real+Estate+%2B+Business+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2505+17+Ave+SW+Unit+220%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T3E+7V3","website":"https://www.cougle.co","blurb":"Real Estate / Business Law in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 204 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/cougle-co-real-estate-business-law-calgary.png","details":{"areas":["Real estate law","Business law"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}',NULL,'Cougle + Co., a Calgary firm, limits its practice to two areas, real estate conveyancing and business law.

The lawyers chose to know a lot about a few things rather than a little about many, and see the work as helping people reach their goals. Honesty, authenticity and integrity are the firm''s values, and the team is forward-thinking. The firm also makes a notable billing promise: if it fails to meet its service and value commitments, the client may adjust the bill to what the client believes is fair.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('de-krupe-law-north-york','De Krupe Law','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.9,200,43.7520036,-79.4653329,'{"name":"De Krupe Law","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7520036,"lng":-79.4653329,"address":"20 De Boers Dr Ste 300, North York, ON M3J 0H1","phone":"+14169019344","rating":4.9,"count":200,"slug":"de-krupe-law-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/De+Krupe+Law+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=20+De+Boers+Dr+Ste+300%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M3J+0H1","website":"https://dekrupelaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in North York. Rated 4.9 from 200 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/de-krupe-law-north-york.png","details":{"areas":["Real estate law","Family law","Wills and estates","Corporate law","Mortgage refinancing","Title transfers"],"serving":["Toronto","Newmarket","Barrie","Vaughan","York Region","Simcoe County"]}}',NULL,'De Krupe Law is a North York firm handling real estate closings, mortgage refinancing, wills and estates, corporate, family and litigation matters.

The firm has offices in Toronto, Newmarket, Vaughan and Barrie, and also serves Mississauga. It offers flat-rate pricing, after-hours and weekend appointments, and in-person meetings Monday to Saturday as well as online meetings. It has handled more than 1,000 cases and 3,000 transactions, and clients work directly with their assigned lawyer. The team includes Stan Aranush de Krupe, Eva Aranush de Krupe, Anthony Galasso and Julieta Daniel.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ronalee-carey-law-ottawa','Ronalee Carey Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.8,203,45.428703,-75.614663,'{"name":"Ronalee Carey Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.428703,"lng":-75.614663,"address":"TCC Canada - The Blair Centre, 1900 City Park Dr 3rd Floor, Suite 382, Ottawa, ON K1J 1A3","phone":"+16136991765","rating":4.8,"count":203,"slug":"ronalee-carey-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Ronalee+Carey+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=TCC+Canada+-+The+Blair+Centre%2C+1900+City+Park+Dr+3rd+Floor%2C+Suite+382%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1J+1A3","website":"https://ronaleecareylaw.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Ottawa. Rated 4.8 from 203 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ronalee-carey-law-ottawa.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Ronalee Carey"}],"areas":["Visitor, study and work permits","Express Entry","Provincial Nominee Program","Family sponsorship","Humanitarian and compassionate applications","Refugee protection","PR card applications and renewals","Citizenship"],"serving":["Gloucester"]}}',NULL,'Ronalee Carey Law is an Ottawa immigration law practice handling visas, permanent residence, refugee cases and citizenship.

Ronalee Carey has practised law in Ontario since 1998 and has worked only in immigration since 2008. The small team handles visitor visas, study permits, post-graduate and open work permits, and family sponsorship, but does not assist with employer-specific work permits or LMIA applications, and does not serve clients in French. Ronalee belongs to the Canadian Bar Association''s immigration section, the Ontario Bar Association''s citizenship and immigration section, and two refugee lawyers'' associations. The office dogs are Milo and Indy.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('michael-dibua-law-prof-corp-brampton','Michael Dibua Law Prof Corp.','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,4.8,203,43.7029307,-79.7421041,'{"name":"Michael Dibua Law Prof Corp.","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.7029307,"lng":-79.7421041,"address":"338 Queen St E #207, Brampton, ON L6V 1C4","phone":"+19052163307","rating":4.8,"count":203,"slug":"michael-dibua-law-prof-corp-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Michael+Dibua+Law+Prof+Corp.+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=338+Queen+St+E+%23207%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6V+1C4","website":"https://michaeldibualaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Brampton. Rated 4.8 from 203 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/michael-dibua-law-prof-corp-brampton.png","heroImage":"images/hero/michael-dibua-law-prof-corp-brampton.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Michael Dibua"}],"areas":["Family law","Civil litigation"]}}',NULL,'Michael Dibua Law Prof Corp., based in Brampton, handles family law and civil litigation, including divorce, separation and support.

Michael Dibua obtained his law degree at Obafemi Awolowo University in Nigeria in 1997, was admitted to the Nigerian Bar in 1999 and completed a master''s degree in law at Cardiff University in 2004. Before opening the practice he worked as in-house counsel in banking, handling debt collection, litigation and risk matters. His family work covers family property, equalization of net family property, the matrimonial home, decision-making responsibility and parenting time. He is upfront with clients about their chances in order to manage expectations.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('kahlon-law-mississauga','Kahlon Law','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,185,43.6586469,-79.6528355,'{"name":"Kahlon Law","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6586469,"lng":-79.6528355,"address":"6200 Dixie Rd #223, Mississauga, ON L5T 2E1","phone":"+14165028555","rating":5,"count":185,"slug":"kahlon-law-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kahlon+Law+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=6200+Dixie+Rd+%23223%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5T+2E1","website":"https://kahlonlaw.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 185 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/kahlon-law-mississauga.webp","details":{"areas":["Criminal harassment","Criminal defence"],"serving":["Mississauga","Toronto","GTA"]}}',NULL,'Kahlon Law is a Mississauga criminal defence firm defending charges that include impaired operation and firearm possession.

The firm has defended more than 500 criminal cases and publishes summaries of selected matters, among them a week-long trial that ended in dismissal, a preliminary inquiry that dismissed firearm charges, and Charter applications on arrest and right to counsel. Founder Antar Kahlon holds a criminal justice degree from the University of Guelph and a law degree from Windsor, worked with Windsor''s Community Legal Aid, clerked at a Michigan district court and edited a legal journal at Windsor.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ryan-edmonds-workplace-counsel-toronto','Ryan Edmonds Workplace Counsel','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,184,43.6517237,-79.3809618,'{"name":"Ryan Edmonds Workplace Counsel","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6517237,"lng":-79.3809618,"address":"401 Bay St. Ste 1600, Toronto, ON M7A 0A6","phone":"+16473618228","rating":4.9,"count":184,"slug":"ryan-edmonds-workplace-counsel-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Ryan+Edmonds+Workplace+Counsel+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=401+Bay+St.+Ste+1600%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M7A+0A6","website":"https://rewc-law.com","blurb":"Employment Law in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 184 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ryan-edmonds-workplace-counsel-toronto.webp","heroImage":"images/hero/ryan-edmonds-workplace-counsel-toronto.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Ryan Edmonds"},{"name":"Christopher Gibson"},{"name":"Thulasi Kandiah"},{"name":"Barbara Lee"}],"areas":["Employment law","Workplace law","Employment contracts"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Ryan Edmonds Workplace Counsel is a Toronto employment law firm advising Ontario employees and employers on severance, contracts and workplace disputes.

Ryan Edmonds founded the firm to offer innovative legal solutions tailored to each client''s workplace, whether a small business, an employee in transition or a founder. For employees it handles severance package assessment and negotiation, wrongful dismissal, contract negotiation, workplace discrimination and disability accommodation. Its lawyers also act for management, which gives them insight into how employers think. Its values are honesty, transparency and quality, with some humour added.','dynamic','live',NULL);
