The firm amalgamated with Terry Sidhu Notarial Services Inc. and serves clients throughout the Fraser Valley. Its real estate group acts on home purchases and sales and changes of mortgage lender, and its subdivision work with municipalities covers rezoning, border realignments and splitting a property into several PIDs. Notarizations include affidavits for BC registries, international documents and real estate transfers; the signer must attend in person with government photo identification. The firm has more than fifteen years in subdivisions and over twenty years overall.','dynamic','live',NULL);
