The firm has nine offices across British Columbia and serves the Lower Mainland, including Abbotsford, Delta, Langley, New Westminster, Port Coquitlam, Richmond and Vancouver. Services are provided in English, French, Punjabi, Hindi, Mandarin, Cantonese, Sinhalese, Tamil and Spanish. Shawn Sidhu and Zachary Ng are on its team, and its work highlights medical malpractice, ICBC Enhanced Care matters and a communication-first way of working on every file.','dynamic','live',NULL);
