The firm acts on residential and commercial real estate transactions, development work such as zoning and planning, financing, leases and joint ventures, and disputes including mortgage enforcement. Its clients include brokers, developers, investors and private lenders. Gurpreet heads the litigation practice group, which covers complex litigation and arbitration. Sabio Law uses value-based pricing and favours resolution and restructuring over litigation where it can.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('md-law-group-edmonton','MD LAW GROUP','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.7,179,53.5422502,-113.4878713,'{"name":"MD LAW GROUP","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5422502,"lng":-113.4878713,"address":"10123 99 St NW #820, Edmonton, AB T5J 3H1","phone":"+15875201885","rating":4.7,"count":179,"slug":"md-law-group-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/MD+LAW+GROUP+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10123+99+St+NW+%23820%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5J+3H1","website":"https://www.mdlawgroup.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Edmonton. Rated 4.7 from 179 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/md-law-group-edmonton.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Dan Murphy","title":"Managing Partner"},{"name":"Bobbi Olsen"}],"areas":["Civil litigation","Criminal defence","Debt collection","Domestic violence","Employment law","Family law","Family law mediation","Immigration law","Power of attorney"],"serving":["Edmonton","Calgary","Alberta"]}}',NULL,'MD Law Group is an Edmonton firm handling criminal defence, family law, civil litigation, employment and personal injury matters across Alberta.

The firm has offices in Edmonton and Calgary, with Dan Murphy as managing partner. Its practice areas include civil litigation, criminal defence, debt collection and domestic violence. Its Calgary family law work covers divorce, child custody and support, spousal support, property division and cohabitation agreements. The firm also publishes articles on rights during a police encounter in Alberta, assault charges, what to expect at a criminal trial and recent legal reforms.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('avanessy-giordano-llp-north-york','Avanessy Giordano LLP','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.9,171,43.7640757,-79.487041,'{"name":"Avanessy Giordano LLP","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7640757,"lng":-79.487041,"address":"1275 Finch Ave W Ste 411, North York, ON M3J 0L5","phone":"+14165515492","rating":4.9,"count":171,"slug":"avanessy-giordano-llp-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Avanessy+Giordano+LLP+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1275+Finch+Ave+W+Ste+411%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M3J+0L5","website":"https://www.avagiolaw.com","blurb":"Personal Injury in North York. Rated 4.9 from 171 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/avanessy-giordano-llp-north-york.png","details":{"areas":["Personal injury","Car accident","Product liability","Medical malpractice","Wrongful death","Slip and fall","Medical negligence"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Avanessy Giordano LLP is a North York boutique personal injury firm representing injured people in Toronto and across Ontario.

The firm was founded in 2015 by Michael Giordano and Aline Avanessy, each with more than a decade of personal injury experience at large firms before they opened their own practice. They keep a conservative file load, give clients regular updates and maintain a network of medical and rehabilitation practitioners. The firm also handles medical malpractice, with medical professionals on staff to help identify negligence and support a case through litigation.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('b-kay-law-office-edmonton','B.Kay Law Office','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,5,167,53.4945366,-113.4172195,'{"name":"B.Kay Law Office","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.4945366,"lng":-113.4172195,"address":"5737 50 St NW, Edmonton, AB T6B 3W5","phone":"+17808004050","rating":5,"count":167,"slug":"b-kay-law-office-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/B.Kay+Law+Office+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=5737+50+St+NW%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T6B+3W5","website":"https://bkaylaw.com","blurb":"Immigration in Edmonton. Rated 5.0 from 167 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/b-kay-law-office-edmonton.webp","details":{"areas":["Immigration law","Personal injury","Real estate","Civil litigation","Corporate and commercial","Criminal defence","Wills and estates","Notary services"],"serving":["Edmonton"]}}',NULL,'B.Kay Law Office is an Edmonton practice handling immigration law, personal injury and notary services for individuals, families and businesses.

The firm was founded by Bikramjit Singh and serves Edmonton''s multicultural community, as well as clients across Canada, in English, Punjabi, Hindi and Urdu. Its immigration practice covers Canadian temporary residence programs and admissibility hearings and detention matters. Notary Public and Commissioner for Oaths services are offered in Edmonton and surrounding areas, including affidavits, and clients are told what to bring to an appointment.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('jahanshahi-business-law-firm-north-york','Jahanshahi Business Law Firm','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.9,169,43.7238486,-79.3373096,'{"name":"Jahanshahi Business Law Firm","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Business Law"],"caseTypes":["business"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7238486,"lng":-79.3373096,"address":"18 Wynford Dr Ste 516, North York, ON M3C 0K8","phone":"+14165511569","rating":4.9,"count":169,"slug":"jahanshahi-business-law-firm-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Jahanshahi+Business+Law+Firm+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=18+Wynford+Dr+Ste+516%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M3C+0K8","website":"https://www.jahanlaw.ca","blurb":"Business Law in North York. Rated 4.9 from 169 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/jahanshahi-business-law-firm-north-york.png","bioImage":"images/bio/jahanshahi-business-law-firm-north-york.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Shahriar Jahanshahi"}],"areas":["Business purchase and sale","Shareholder disputes","Business counsel","Corporate and commercial"]}}',NULL,'Jahanshahi Business Law Firm is a North York firm advising on business purchases and sales, shareholder disputes and ongoing corporate matters.

The firm supports startups, entrepreneurs, franchise operations and small or mid-sized businesses, and its work also touches real estate, estate planning and tax planning. It gives ongoing counsel on contracts, corporate matters and reorganizations, and acts for buyers and sellers from structuring and due diligence through closing. For shareholder disputes it addresses ownership, management, control and the breakdown of business relationships. It also offers general guidance on choosing a law firm, covering experience, fees and disbursements.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('siu-law-professional-corporation-richmond-hill','Siu Law Professional Corporation','Richmond Hill','ON','york-durham',0,5,161,43.8804034,-79.4399051,'{"name":"Siu Law Professional Corporation","city":"Richmond Hill","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["realestate","business"],"region":"york-durham","province":"ON","lat":43.8804034,"lng":-79.4399051,"address":"10376 Yonge St #305, Richmond Hill, ON L4C 3B8","phone":"+19057377999","rating":5,"count":161,"slug":"siu-law-professional-corporation-richmond-hill","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Siu+Law+Professional+Corporation+Richmond+Hill+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10376+Yonge+St+%23305%2C+Richmond+Hill%2C+ON+L4C+3B8","website":"https://siulaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Business Law in Richmond Hill. Rated 5.0 from 161 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/siu-law-professional-corporation-richmond-hill.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Andrea Siu"},{"name":"Jason Fu"}],"areas":["Real estate"],"serving":["Ontario","Alberta","Richmond Hill"]}}',NULL,'Siu Law Professional Corporation is a Richmond Hill real estate law firm handling purchases, sales, mortgages and refinancing.

The lawyer, Andrea, was admitted to the Ontario Bar in 2011 after graduating from Osgoode Hall Law School, and earlier spent seven years at a chartered bank. Her experience spans legal aid clinics, boutique and Bay Street firms in immigration, civil litigation, wills and estates, and real estate. Purchase services include agreements of purchase and sale, condominium status certificates, title searches and title insurance. The firm also closes new construction purchases in Alberta, and handles powers of attorney, corporate work and notarizing.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('taylor-law-calgary','Taylor Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,164,50.9893367,-114.0502489,'{"name":"Taylor Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":50.9893367,"lng":-114.0502489,"address":"550 71 Ave SE, Calgary, AB T2H 0S6","phone":"+14032594151","rating":4.9,"count":164,"slug":"taylor-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Taylor+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=550+71+Ave+SE%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2H+0S6","website":"https://www.tomtaylorlaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 164 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/taylor-law-calgary.jpg","details":{"areas":["Real estate","Corporate and business law","Estate planning"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}','{"1":[["08:00","16:30"]],"2":[["08:00","16:30"]],"3":[["08:00","16:30"]],"4":[["08:00","16:30"]],"5":[["08:00","16:30"]]}','Taylor Law is a Calgary boutique firm handling real estate and estate planning for vendors, purchasers, mortgagors and mortgagees.

The firm has served Calgarians for more than thirty-four years and provides tailored legal services with personal attention for every client. Its estate planning work covers wills, enduring powers of attorney, personal directives, trusts and the appointment of trustees. On the real estate side, it advises on purchase agreements, listing agreements, leases and mortgages. Its practice is organized under real estate law and wills and estate planning, with the office located on 71 Avenue SE.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('susan-karpa-calgary','Susan Karpa','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,163,51.0433704,-114.0737209,'{"name":"Susan Karpa","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["criminal","litigation"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0433704,"lng":-114.0737209,"address":"535 10 Ave SW Ste 201, Calgary, AB T2R 0A8","phone":"+15878887149","rating":4.9,"count":163,"slug":"susan-karpa-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Susan+Karpa+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=535+10+Ave+SW+Ste+201%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2R+0A8","website":"https://www.susankarpa.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Civil Litigation in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 163 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/susan-karpa-calgary.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Susan Karpa"}],"areas":["Domestic assault","Assaults and threats","Sexual assault","Child pornography and luring","Drug offences","Firearms and weapons offences","Theft and fraud","Murder and manslaughter","Driving offences","Release and bail"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}','{"1":[["07:00","11:30"]],"2":[["07:00","11:30"]],"3":[["07:00","11:30"]],"4":[["07:00","11:30"]],"5":[["07:00","11:30"]],"6":[["07:00","11:30"]],"7":[["07:00","11:30"]]}','Susan Karpa is a Calgary criminal defence lawyer handling assault, sexual offence, drug and firearms charges for clients across Alberta.

She has twenty-five years of experience in criminal law and has defended more than 2,000 people. Practice areas include assaults, threats and harassment, domestic assault, sexual assault and sexual offences, child pornography and luring offences, drug offences, and firearms and weapons offences. Each area has an explanation of the charge in plain terms, and a section of case decisions is included. She serves communities including Calgary, Airdrie and Cochrane.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lawyer-up-canada-richmond-hill','Lawyer UP Canada','Richmond Hill','ON','york-durham',0,4.8,166,43.8412817,-79.3990206,'{"name":"Lawyer UP Canada","city":"Richmond Hill","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"york-durham","province":"ON","lat":43.8412817,"lng":-79.3990206,"address":"330 Hwy 7 Unit 305-C, Richmond Hill, ON L4B 3P8","phone":"+19057456180","rating":4.8,"count":166,"slug":"lawyer-up-canada-richmond-hill","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lawyer+UP+Canada+Richmond+Hill+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=330+Hwy+7+Unit+305-C%2C+Richmond+Hill%2C+ON+L4B+3P8","website":"https://www.lawyerupcanada.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Richmond Hill. Rated 4.8 from 166 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lawyer-up-canada-richmond-hill.png","details":{"areas":["Criminal defense","Drug trafficking","Failure to stop","Harassment and utter threats","Professional discipline","Employment law","Sexual offences","Dangerous driving","Break and enter","Fraud"],"serving":["Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Lawyer UP Canada is a Richmond Hill criminal defence firm representing people charged with offences such as fraud, theft and assault in Ontario.

The firm provides full criminal defence services to people charged with criminal offences who also face related legal consequences. The charges it covers in plain language include fraud, theft, assault, robbery, mischief, failure to remain at the scene of an accident, and harassment and uttering threats. The office is located on Highway 7 in Richmond Hill.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('joseph-a-nagy-injury-law-edmonton','Joseph A. Nagy Injury Law','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.8,165,53.5408201,-113.4481947,'{"name":"Joseph A. Nagy Injury Law","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["injury","litigation"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5408201,"lng":-113.4481947,"address":"7815 101 Ave NW, Edmonton, AB T6A 0K1","phone":"+17807604878","rating":4.8,"count":165,"slug":"joseph-a-nagy-injury-law-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Joseph+A.+Nagy+Injury+Law+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=7815+101+Ave+NW%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T6A+0K1","website":"https://josephanagy.com","blurb":"Personal Injury / Civil Litigation in Edmonton. Rated 4.8 from 165 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/joseph-a-nagy-injury-law-edmonton.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Joseph A. Nagy"}],"areas":["Traumatic brain injury","Spinal cord injury","Orthopedic injury","Chronic pain injury","Psychological injury","TMJ injuries","Wrongful death","Motor vehicle accident"],"serving":["Edmonton","Central and northern Alberta"]}}',NULL,'Joseph A Nagy Injury Law is an Edmonton firm handling motor vehicle accident and personal injury cases in central and northern Alberta. It covers car, truck, motorcycle and bicycle collisions.

Each of its injury lawyers has more than 20 years of experience, and a senior lawyer keeps a file from the first meeting through resolution rather than passing it to a junior. The team includes Joseph A. Nagy and Howard Poon. Fees are contingency based, and clients owe no legal fees until a case is resolved. The firm also addresses Alberta''s switch to no-fault auto insurance, branded Care-First and set for January 1, 2027; it has opposed no-fault coverage and supports FAIR Alberta.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('dale-streiman-law-brampton','Dale Streiman Law','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,4.7,167,43.697506,-79.775025,'{"name":"Dale Streiman Law","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.697506,"lng":-79.775025,"address":"480 Main St N, Brampton, ON L6V 3E3","phone":"+19054557300","rating":4.7,"count":167,"slug":"dale-streiman-law-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Dale+Streiman+Law+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=480+Main+St+N%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6V+3E3","website":"https://www.dalestreimanlaw.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Brampton. Rated 4.7 from 167 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/dale-streiman-law-brampton.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Elliott Dale"},{"name":"Fred Streiman"},{"name":"Shana Dale"},{"name":"Amanda Dale"},{"name":"Ingrid Saffrey"},{"name":"Deandra M. Moore"},{"name":"David Citron"},{"name":"Victoria Delicata"}],"areas":["Family law","Real estate law","Business law","Wills and estates"]}}',NULL,'Dale Streiman Law is a full-service Brampton firm handling family law, real estate, business law, and wills and estates for individuals and companies.

The practice operates as Dale Streiman Law LLP, or DS Law. Its lawyers draw on years of experience in the GTA, and the team of nine lawyers is supported by law clerks. Appointments are also offered in Toronto, Vaughan, Milton, Oakville, Burlington and Hamilton. The firm''s motto is No Nonsense Law, and its guiding test is what a lawyer would tell a sister or brother to do. Elliott Dale and Fred Streiman are among the lawyers, and the firm keeps an eye on costs as well as outcomes.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('erikson-law-firm-ottawa','Erikson Law Firm','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,155,45.331122,-75.703749,'{"name":"Erikson Law Firm","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.331122,"lng":-75.703749,"address":"18 Deakin St Unit 105, Nepean, ON K2E 8B7","phone":"+16136925885","rating":5,"count":155,"slug":"erikson-law-firm-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Erikson+Law+Firm+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=18+Deakin+St+Unit+105%2C+Nepean%2C+ON+K2E+8B7","website":"https://eriksonlaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 155 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/erikson-law-firm-ottawa.png","details":{"languages":["English","French"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Valentin Erikson"}],"areas":["Real estate law","Wills and estates","Tax law","Business law","LGBTQ law"]}}',NULL,'Erikson Law Firm in Ottawa handles real estate, tax and family law matters, with flat-fee billing for most of its legal services.

Valentin Erikson owns the firm. He studied at Carleton University and the University of Ottawa, clerked at the Tax Court of Canada and was admitted to the Ontario bar in 2009. The practice serves clients in Ottawa and across Ontario from an office in Nepean, and also covers estate planning and same-sex legal issues. Notary services include administering oaths, certifying true copies, consent letters for children travelling abroad, passport declarations, and authenticating documents in English, French, Russian, Estonian and Lithuanian.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('west-legal-calgary','West Legal','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.7,163,50.9638818,-114.0734118,'{"name":"West Legal","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":50.9638818,"lng":-114.0734118,"address":"10201 Southport Rd SW #1200, Calgary, AB T2W 4X9","phone":"+14037230175","rating":4.7,"count":163,"slug":"west-legal-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/West+Legal+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10201+Southport+Rd+SW+%231200%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2W+4X9","website":"https://www.west-legal.ca","blurb":"Wills & Estates in Calgary. Rated 4.7 from 163 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/west-legal-calgary.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Tom Harrison","title":"Senior Legal Counsel"},{"name":"Zakiyya Karbani"}],"areas":["Estate planning","Probate and estate administration","Real estate","Family law","Employment law"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}','{"1":[["08:30","16:30"]],"2":[["08:30","16:30"]],"3":[["08:30","16:30"]],"4":[["08:30","16:30"]],"5":[["08:30","16:30"]]}','West Legal is a Calgary team of lawyers handling wills and estates, probate, family, employment and residential real estate matters.

The firm takes a People First approach and serves Calgary, Okotoks and Airdrie. David West practises in real estate, wills and probate, Kim Nutz in employment law for both employees and employers, Machelle Luiters in family law and Kelsey Morrison in wills and estate planning. Adrienne O''Reilly handles corporate, securities, mergers and acquisitions and commercial work. West Legal offers flat-rate fees wherever possible, including for wills, enduring powers of attorney, personal directives, probate and residential real estate transactions.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('edmonton-criminal-lawyer-ziv-edmonton','Edmonton Criminal Lawyer Ziv','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.8,151,53.5424186,-113.4909475,'{"name":"Edmonton Criminal Lawyer Ziv","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["criminal","litigation"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5424186,"lng":-113.4909475,"address":"10150 100 St NW Unit 700, Edmonton, AB T5J 0P6","phone":"+17806287728","rating":4.8,"count":151,"slug":"edmonton-criminal-lawyer-ziv-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Edmonton+Criminal+Lawyer+Ziv+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10150+100+St+NW+Unit+700%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5J+0P6","website":"https://edmontoncriminallawyerziv.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Civil Litigation in Edmonton. Rated 4.8 from 151 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/edmonton-criminal-lawyer-ziv-edmonton.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Rory Ziv"},{"name":"Sharline Lipkewich"}],"areas":["Financial crimes","Assault","Drug offence","Possession and trafficking","Theft","Serious offences","Driving offences","Sexual offences","Murder","Impaired driving"],"serving":["Edmonton","St. Albert","Sherwood Park","Leduc"]}}',NULL,'Edmonton Criminal Lawyer Ziv is the Ziv Law Group, a criminal defence practice handling assault, drug, theft, fraud and impaired driving charges in Edmonton.

Rory Ziv has practised criminal defence since his admission to the Alberta Bar in 2005 and founded the firm in Edmonton in 2011. His practice includes homicide, sexual assault, impaired driving, major fraud and drug offences. The work is organized into financial offences, assault, possession and trafficking, theft, serious offences and driving offences, and the firm serves Edmonton along with Fort Saskatchewan, Leduc, Sherwood Park, Spruce Grove, St. Albert and Drayton Valley.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('silver-immigration-montreal','Silver Immigration','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.9,145,45.4977899,-73.5673787,'{"name":"Silver Immigration","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.4977899,"lng":-73.5673787,"address":"1010 Rue De la Gauchetière O bureau 200, Montreal, Quebec H3B 2N2","phone":"+18887994769","rating":4.9,"count":145,"slug":"silver-immigration-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Silver+Immigration+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1010+Rue+De+la+Gaucheti%C3%A8re+O+bureau+200%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H3B+2N2","website":"https://silverimmigration.com","blurb":"Immigration in Montreal. Rated 4.9 from 145 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/silver-immigration-montreal.png","details":{"founded":2019,"lawyers":[{"name":"Matthew Silver","title":"Founder & President"}],"areas":["U.S. immigration","E-2 investor visa","EB-5 investor green card","TN visa","H-1B visa","O-1 visa","L-1 visa","US entry waiver","F-1 student visa"],"serving":["Montreal"]}}',NULL,'Silver Immigration is a Montreal firm advising Canadians on US immigration, including work visas, green cards, student visas and entry waivers.

Matthew Silver, a Montreal-based US immigration attorney, founded the firm, which has served Canadians since 2019 and serves both Montreal and Ottawa. Its services cover E-2 and E-1 treaty visas, EB-5 investor green cards, employment-based permanent residence, TN and L-1 work visas, O-1 visas, B-1/B-2 visitor travel, F-1 student visas, OPT after graduation, and Form I-192 waivers for people with a criminal record or DUI. The office is on rue de la Gauchetière Ouest.','dynamic','live',NULL);
