The firm has offices in 15 locations across Canada. Its practice areas also include civil litigation, such as contract disputes, debt collection, property disputes and tort claims, along with immigration law, business law, real estate law, and wills and estate planning. Its class action litigation has secured financial compensation for thousands of Canadians, and it has a team of corporate lawyers for business clients.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('mawazini-visa-and-immigration-services-ottawa','Mawazini Visa & immigration Services','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.9,143,45.2748905,-75.7057172,'{"name":"Mawazini Visa & immigration Services","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.2748905,"lng":-75.7057172,"address":"11 Grandlea Terrace, Nepean, ON K2G 6X6","phone":"+16139790979","rating":4.9,"count":143,"slug":"mawazini-visa-and-immigration-services-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mawazini+Visa+%26+immigration+Services+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=11+Grandlea+Terrace%2C+Nepean%2C+ON+K2G+6X6","website":"https://www.mawazini.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Ottawa. Rated 4.9 from 143 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/mawazini-visa-and-immigration-services-ottawa.webp","details":{"areas":["Refugee protection","Family reunification","Refusal appeals","Study and work"]}}',NULL,'Mawazini Visa and Immigration Services is an Ottawa consultancy assisting with refugee protection, family sponsorship, study and work permits and appeals.

It is an immigration consulting firm led by Abdullah Mawazini, a licensed consultant accredited by the Canadian College of Immigration and Citizenship Consultants, with over 22 years of experience and hundreds of completed cases. Services include refugee applications and hearings, appeals of refused applications, sponsorship of spouses, parents and children, passport services, permanent residence, PR cards, visit applications, academic accreditation reports, and RCMP fingerprints and biometrics. The address is in Nepean.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('laws-and-beyond-calgary','Laws & Beyond','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.8,143,51.048038,-114.0759336,'{"name":"Laws & Beyond","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Civil Litigation","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["family","litigation","wills"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.048038,"lng":-114.0759336,"address":"634 6 Ave SW Ste 320, Calgary, AB T2P 2Y5","phone":"+14033005297","rating":4.8,"count":143,"slug":"laws-and-beyond-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Laws+%26+Beyond+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=634+6+Ave+SW+Ste+320%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2P+2Y5","website":"https://lawsnbeyond.com","blurb":"Family Law / Civil Litigation in Calgary. Rated 4.8 from 143 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/laws-and-beyond-calgary.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Megha Sharma","title":"Founder"},{"name":"Simone Conrad","title":"Barrister & Solicitor"}],"areas":["Family law","Civil litigation","Wills and estate law","Real estate law","Notarization and commission","Employment law","Immigration law","Debtor-creditor law","Criminal law"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Laws & Beyond is a Calgary firm handling family law, civil litigation, wills and estates, real estate and employment matters.

Family matters include separation, divorce, emergency protection orders, spousal and child support, parenting arrangements, marital agreements and family violence, and Alberta now frames custody as decision-making responsibility and parenting time. The firm uses negotiation, mediation and other alternative dispute resolution where feasible but is prepared to go to court when required. It also offers notarization and commissioning services, and its approach is tailored to each client''s goals and circumstances.','dynamic','live',NULL);
