Further areas include corporate services, intellectual property, civil disputes and criminal defence, and the firm serves Surrey, White Rock, Delta, Langley, Cloverdale and Metro Vancouver. The office sits minutes from the Peace Arch border crossing, stays open until 7 PM on weekdays, and offers appointments in English, Hindi, Urdu, Punjabi and ASL. A second office in Kelowna operates by appointment, and the firm notes a successful PRRA decision for a client facing removal.','dynamic','live',NULL);
