The firm uses technology and cloud services to keep files moving and clients informed. It handles separation agreements, adoption, domestic violence and parenting issues through negotiation, settlement agreements and litigation, for families in Ottawa and Eastern Ontario. The team includes Ronan Blake, Gisele Alexander, Maria Ilie-Draga, Michael Randazzo and Jeremiah Kalyniak, and the office is on Churchill Avenue North.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('kn-law-toronto','KN LAW','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,135,43.8087363,-79.2430885,'{"name":"KN LAW","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.8087363,"lng":-79.2430885,"address":"2225 Markham Rd Ste 303, Scarborough, ON M1B 2W4","phone":"+16473501250","rating":4.9,"count":135,"slug":"kn-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/KN+LAW+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2225+Markham+Rd+Ste+303%2C+Scarborough%2C+ON+M1B+2W4","website":"https://www.knlegalservices.com","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 135 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/kn-law-toronto.png","details":{"areas":["Property purchases","Property sales","Mortgage refinances","Title transfers","Survivorship applications","Private mortgages"],"serving":["Ontario"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","18:00"]],"2":[["09:00","18:00"]],"3":[["09:00","18:00"]],"4":[["09:00","18:00"]],"5":[["09:00","18:00"]]}','KN LAW is a Toronto-area virtual law practice closing Ontario real estate deals, including purchases, sales, refinances and title transfers.

KN LAW Professional Corporation was built as a fully virtual practice, with signing done from home, so it can serve clients from Thunder Bay to Windsor and Ottawa to Niagara Falls. Its services also include survivorship applications after a joint tenant dies, private mortgage transactions for borrowers and lenders, and reverse mortgage registrations for homeowners aged 55 and over. The firm limits its work to Ontario real estate law, and clients receive a breakdown of fees and disbursements before signing.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('hsp-law-north-york','HSP Law','North York','ON','toronto',0,5,130,43.7260134,-79.3492236,'{"name":"HSP Law","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7260134,"lng":-79.3492236,"address":"1131A Leslie St Ste 201, North York, ON M3C 3L8","phone":"+16478833533","rating":5,"count":130,"slug":"hsp-law-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/HSP+Law+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1131A+Leslie+St+Ste+201%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M3C+3L8","website":"https://www.hsplaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in North York. Rated 5.0 from 130 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/hsp-law-north-york.png","details":{"founded":1981,"areas":["Personal injury","Long term disability","Car accidents","Slip and fall","Dog bite","ATV and snowmobile accidents","Bicycle accident"],"serving":["Toronto","Brampton","Burlington","Halton","Markham","Milton","Mississauga","Oakville"]}}','{"1":[["08:00","17:00"]],"2":[["08:00","17:00"]],"3":[["08:00","17:00"]],"4":[["08:00","17:00"]],"5":[["08:00","17:00"]]}','HSP Law is a North York personal injury firm handling car accidents, slip and falls, dog bites and long-term disability matters.

The firm has acted for injured people for over 40 years and has offices in Whitby, Oshawa, Toronto, Niagara Falls and Calgary. Its work also covers ATV and snowmobile accidents and cases involving the death of a loved one through negligence. The team includes Harlan A. Pottins. Clients pay no upfront legal fees or costs, with payment due only on a successful outcome.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('gerami-law-pc-ottawa','Gerami Law PC','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.6,140,45.4211161,-75.697111,'{"name":"Gerami Law PC","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4211161,"lng":-75.697111,"address":"130 Albert St #2010, Ottawa, ON K1P 1B1","phone":"+16137010532","rating":4.6,"count":140,"slug":"gerami-law-pc-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Gerami+Law+PC+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=130+Albert+St+%232010%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1P+1B1","website":"https://www.geramilaw.com","blurb":"Immigration in Ottawa. Rated 4.6 from 140 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/gerami-law-pc-ottawa.png","details":{"founded":2011,"languages":["English","Farsi"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Arghavan Gerami","title":"Founder and Senior Counsel"}],"areas":["Immigration law","Refugee law","Citizenship law","Family class sponsorship","Humanitarian and compassionate residency","Study permits","Super visas","Visitor visas","Pre-removal risk assessment","Admissibility hearing"],"serving":["Ottawa","Toronto","Vancouver"]}}',NULL,'Gerami Law PC is an Ottawa immigration firm handling refugee protection, family sponsorship, study and visitor permits and citizenship applications.

Operating since 2011, the firm has its headquarters in Ottawa and remote offices in Toronto and Vancouver. Founder Arghavan Gerami has practised in Ontario for over 15 years, and the team also includes Elham Tarahimofrad, Ana Paula Aguilar Gomez and Nathan Knoble Kenna. Its refugee work covers application forms, narratives, hearing preparation and submissions before the Board, while an urgent practice group deals with removals, admissibility hearings and pre-removal risk assessments.','dynamic','live',NULL);
