The firm has its head office in Montreal and additional offices in the Middle East and the Gulf. Clients come from dozens of countries, among them China, Iran, Lebanon, France, Mexico, India, Nigeria, Brazil and the Philippines. The lawyers serve clients in English, French, Mandarin, Spanish, Arabic, Portuguese, Romanian, Italian and Hebrew, and assist applicants with temporary or permanent visa applications and with challenging decisions by immigration authorities.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ld-law-llp-toronto','LD Law LLP','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.8,131,43.6559562,-79.4533078,'{"name":"LD Law LLP","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6559562,"lng":-79.4533078,"address":"1551 Bloor St W, Toronto, ON M6P 1A5","phone":"+14167479900","rating":4.8,"count":131,"slug":"ld-law-llp-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/LD+Law+LLP+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1551+Bloor+St+W%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M6P+1A5","website":"https://www.ldlaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Toronto. Rated 4.8 from 131 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ld-law-llp-toronto.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Daniel La Gamba"},{"name":"Michael Almeida"}],"areas":["Real estate law","Wills and estate planning","Family law","Business law","Commercial real estate","Commercial leasing","Franchise legal representation","Trademarks and copyright","Municipal and land use planning","Shareholder and partnership agreements"],"serving":["Toronto","Ontario"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','LD Law LLP is a Toronto firm handling real estate closings, mortgage refinances, title issues and title insurance across Ontario.

The firm acts for buyers, sellers and owners of residential and commercial property, and also takes on real estate litigation. Further practice areas include wills and estate planning, family law and business law, along with employment, corporate and commercial matters. David Baptista dos Reis and Daniel La Gamba are the lawyers named, and real estate services are also offered in Brantford.','dynamic','live',NULL);
