The firm, Bernard Lau and Co. Law Office, also handles defamation and notarization work and serves Richmond and Metro Vancouver. Its team is fluent in English, Mandarin and Cantonese, and a network of legal professionals overseas supports out-of-town signings in China, Hong Kong and the wider Asia-Pacific region. It works with the major chartered banks on mortgages and helps with closing disputes such as home deficiencies, oil tank discoveries and collapsing deals.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('merovitz-potechin-llp-ottawa','Merovitz Potechin LLP','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.7,133,45.3816716,-75.7452423,'{"name":"Merovitz Potechin LLP","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3816716,"lng":-75.7452423,"address":"1565 Carling Ave #300, Ottawa, ON K1Z 8P9","phone":"+16135637544","rating":4.7,"count":133,"slug":"merovitz-potechin-llp-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Merovitz+Potechin+LLP+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1565+Carling+Ave+%23300%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1Z+8P9","website":"https://www.merovitzpotechin.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Ottawa. Rated 4.7 from 133 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/merovitz-potechin-llp-ottawa.png","details":{"founded":1976,"languages":["English","Hebrew"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Yasmin M. Vinograd"}],"areas":["Real estate transactions","Business disputes","Insolvency and collection","Litigation","Corporate and business","Will preparation","Estate litigation"],"serving":["Ottawa"]}}',NULL,'Merovitz Potechin LLP is an Ottawa firm serving personal and business clients in litigation, business law, real estate, and wills and estates.

Chuck Merovitz started the firm in April 1976 and Bram Potechin joined as a partner in 1978. The firm marks its 50th anniversary in 2026 and had grown to 19 lawyers and over 40 support staff by 2025. Robert De Toni, Timothy Grieve, Eli Udell, Yasmin Vinograd and Mitchell Besner were later additions, and the firm supports community causes such as CHEO and the Ottawa Regional Cancer Foundation.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('droit-ouimet-mcpherson-law-ottawa','Droit Ouimet-McPherson Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,125,45.4426077,-75.6409421,'{"name":"Droit Ouimet-McPherson Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4426077,"lng":-75.6409421,"address":"608 Cummings Ave., Ottawa, ON K1K 2K6","phone":"+13438888913","rating":5,"count":125,"slug":"droit-ouimet-mcpherson-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Droit+Ouimet-McPherson+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=608+Cummings+Ave.%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1K+2K6","website":"https://ottawa.law","blurb":"Real Estate in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 125 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/droit-ouimet-mcpherson-law-ottawa.png","details":{"founded":2020,"lawyers":[{"name":"Marc Ouimet-McPherson"}],"areas":["Real estate","Commercial real estate","Business law","Estate planning","Estates"],"serving":["Ontario","Ottawa","Rockland","Hawkesbury"]}}',NULL,'Droit Ouimet-McPherson Law is an Ottawa boutique firm offering real estate, business law, estate planning and estate administration in English and French.

Its owner, Marc, was raised in Ottawa, holds an LL.B. from the University of Ottawa''s French common law program and founded the firm in 2020 after practising in Orléans and Rockland. The firm limits itself to no more than 25 transactions a month, uses secure online forms alongside virtual and in-person meetings, and prepares documents for probate applications. It also offers executor services at 4.0 percent of the estate value, subject to a minimum.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('travers-law-guelph','Travers Law','Guelph','ON','waterloo-guelph',0,4.7,132,43.5405966,-80.2431314,'{"name":"Travers Law","city":"Guelph","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills","business"],"region":"waterloo-guelph","province":"ON","lat":43.5405966,"lng":-80.2431314,"address":"100 Gordon St, Guelph, ON N1H 4H6","phone":"+18777442281","rating":4.7,"count":132,"slug":"travers-law-guelph","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Travers+Law+Guelph+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=100+Gordon+St%2C+Guelph%2C+ON+N1H+4H6","website":"https://www.traverslaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Guelph. Rated 4.7 from 132 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/travers-law-guelph.webp","details":{"areas":["Real estate","Wills and estates","Business law","Family law"],"serving":["Kitchener-Waterloo","Cambridge","Guelph","Milton"]}}',NULL,'Travers Law is a Guelph firm with a high-volume real estate, wills and estates, and business law practice across four Ontario offices.

The offices are in Kitchener-Waterloo, Cambridge, Guelph and Milton. Don Travers, admitted to the bar in 1974, founded the firm in 1981 under the name Paquette Travers and served on Kitchener council and Waterloo Regional Council. The firm has worked in real estate law for over 40 years, offers evening appointments, remote and virtual meetings and fixed fees, and serves Waterloo, Kitchener, Cambridge, Fergus, Elora, Puslinch and Wellington County. Bryan Mayes and Robert A. Sheldon are also with the firm, and family law is a secondary area.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('capelle-kane-immigration-lawyers-ottawa','Capelle Kane Immigration Lawyers','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,123,45.3900137,-75.7533169,'{"name":"Capelle Kane Immigration Lawyers","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3900137,"lng":-75.7533169,"address":"360 Ravenhill Ave E, Ottawa, ON K2A 1S5","phone":"+16132307070","rating":5,"count":123,"slug":"capelle-kane-immigration-lawyers-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Capelle+Kane+Immigration+Lawyers+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=360+Ravenhill+Ave+E%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K2A+1S5","website":"https://www.capellekane.com","blurb":"Immigration in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 123 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/capelle-kane-immigration-lawyers-ottawa.png","details":{"founded":1994,"lawyers":[{"name":"Betsy Kane"}],"areas":["Corporate immigration","Citizenship and immigration","Visitor visas","Study permits","Work permits","Express Entry","Family class sponsorship","Spousal sponsorship"]}}',NULL,'Capelle Kane Immigration Lawyers is an Ottawa firm advising on Canadian citizenship and immigration, with corporate immigration work for employers.

The firm has given legal advice on these laws since 1994, and two of its lawyers hold Law Society of Ontario certification in citizenship and immigration law, which is unique among Ottawa firms. Its work covers bringing international talent to Canada for Canadian and multinational companies, reuniting families, and reducing delays in visa processing. Betsy Kane, a founding partner, began her career with Citizenship and Immigration Canada at national headquarters in Ottawa.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('s-zalman-haouzi-avocat-montreal','S. Zalman Haouzi Avocat','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.9,125,45.5061509,-73.5559527,'{"name":"S. Zalman Haouzi Avocat","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.5061509,"lng":-73.5559527,"address":"510 Boul. Saint-Laurent #400, Montreal, Quebec H2Y 2Y9","phone":"+15145624236","rating":4.9,"count":125,"slug":"s-zalman-haouzi-avocat-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/S.+Zalman+Haouzi+Avocat+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=510+Boul.+Saint-Laurent+%23400%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H2Y+2Y9","website":"https://www.solutionlegale.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Montreal. Rated 4.9 from 125 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/s-zalman-haouzi-avocat-montreal.png","heroImage":"images/hero/s-zalman-haouzi-avocat-montreal.webp","details":{"founded":2011,"lawyers":[{"name":"S. Zalman Haouzi"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","DUI","Traffic ticket","Sexual assault","Domestic violence","Fraud","Drug trafficking"],"serving":["Montreal","Longueuil","Laval","Valleyfield","St. Jerome"]}}',NULL,'Zalman Haouzi Avocat is a Montreal boutique handling criminal defence for clients in Longueuil, Laval, Valleyfield and surrounding areas.

Founded in 2011, the practice treats a criminal charge as a problem to be solved and works with first-time offenders to avoid a criminal record. It assists from the first interaction with police through to resolution of the file, and prefers negotiated outcomes over trial where possible. Zalman Haouzi, who has practised in Montreal for more than a decade, is the lawyer behind the firm, and the work centres on minimizing the consequences of an accusation.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('hughes-law-corporation-vancouver','Hughes Law Corporation','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.8,127,49.2636797,-123.1212853,'{"name":"Hughes Law Corporation","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2636797,"lng":-123.1212853,"address":"777 W Broadway Ste 208, Vancouver, BC V5Z 4J7","phone":"+16046021828","rating":4.8,"count":127,"slug":"hughes-law-corporation-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Hughes+Law+Corporation+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=777+W+Broadway+Ste+208%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V5Z+4J7","website":"https://www.hughesco.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Vancouver. Rated 4.8 from 127 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/hughes-law-corporation-vancouver.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Cedric Hughes","title":"Principal Lawyer"}],"areas":["Commercial and residential conveyancing","Landlord and tenant disputes","Mortgage refinancing","Wills and estates","Business acquisitions and sales"],"serving":["Lower Mainland"]}}',NULL,'Hughes Law Corporation is a Vancouver firm handling real estate conveyancing, mortgage refinancing and landlord and tenant disputes.

The firm has been in business for close to 30 years, and its conveyancing covers residential and commercial property. Its other areas include wills and estates and business acquisitions and sales. Principal lawyer Cedric Hughes is a University of British Columbia graduate and a member of the Law Society of British Columbia. Many clients live outside Vancouver, and meeting offices around the Lower Mainland, including North Vancouver and Surrey/Delta, allow the lawyers to come to the client.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('watchmaker-law-car-accident-and-personal-injury-lawyers-edmonton','Watchmaker Law Car Accident and Personal Injury Lawyers','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,5,121,53.5439131,-113.5118675,'{"name":"Watchmaker Law Car Accident and Personal Injury Lawyers","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["injury","litigation"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5439131,"lng":-113.5118675,"address":"10235 111 St NW Unit 6, Edmonton, AB T5K 2V5","phone":"+15878502899","rating":5,"count":121,"slug":"watchmaker-law-car-accident-and-personal-injury-lawyers-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Watchmaker+Law+Car+Accident+and+Personal+Injury+Lawyers+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10235+111+St+NW+Unit+6%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5K+2V5","website":"https://watchmakerlaw.com","blurb":"Personal Injury / Civil Litigation in Edmonton. Rated 5.0 from 121 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/watchmaker-law-car-accident-and-personal-injury-lawyers-edmonton.png","bioImage":"images/bio/watchmaker-law-car-accident-and-personal-injury-lawyers-edmonton.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"David Sowemimo"}],"areas":["Accident law","Personal injury law","Human rights law","Employment law","Civil litigation","Whiplash injuries","Traumatic brain injuries","Spinal cord injury","Burn injury","Soft tissue injuries"],"serving":["Edmonton","Alberta"]}}','{"1":[["00:00","23:59"]],"2":[["00:00","23:59"]],"3":[["00:00","23:59"]],"4":[["00:00","23:59"]],"5":[["00:00","23:59"]],"6":[["00:00","23:59"]],"7":[["00:00","23:59"]]}','Watchmaker Law is an Edmonton firm handling car accident, personal injury and civil litigation matters for clients across Alberta.

Founder David Sowemimo represents plaintiffs in serious and catastrophic injury cases, from paraplegic and quadriplegic injuries to multi-fatality collisions, and draws on alternative dispute resolution experience. Associates Wura Oshodi and Erin Castro are also with the firm, and services are available in English and Yoruba. Its injury practice covers psychological injuries, fractures, traumatic brain injuries, whiplash, burns and chronic pain. The firm works on a contingency fee basis and offers flexible meeting options for clients whose injuries make travel difficult.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('shore-and-johnston-barristers-at-law-ottawa','Shore & Johnston, Barristers-at-Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,119,45.4208205,-75.6940175,'{"name":"Shore & Johnston, Barristers-at-Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Family Law"],"caseTypes":["criminal","family"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4208205,"lng":-75.6940175,"address":"141 Laurier Ave W Ste 600, Ottawa, ON K1P 5J3","phone":"+16132337747","rating":5,"count":119,"slug":"shore-and-johnston-barristers-at-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Shore+%26+Johnston%2C+Barristers-at-Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=141+Laurier+Ave+W+Ste+600%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1P+5J3","website":"https://www.sjhdlaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Family Law in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 119 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/shore-and-johnston-barristers-at-law-ottawa.png","details":{"areas":["Domestic assault and mischief","Criminal harassment","Sexual assault","Sexual offences involving minors","Pornography-based offences","Criminal defence"],"serving":["Ottawa"]}}',NULL,'Shore & Johnston, Barristers-at-Law is an Ottawa criminal defence firm handling bail, driving, drug, domestic, sexual and homicide charges.

The firm has helped clients through criminal charges in Ontario for fifty years under the Criminal Code and the Controlled Drugs and Substances Act, and has also acted in regulatory prosecutions ranging from the Ontario Highway Traffic Act to the Canadian Lobbying Act. Its lawyers appear at bail hearings, on guilty pleas and sentencing, in judge-alone and jury trials, and on appeal. Michael Johnston is among its lawyers, and the practice addresses Charter rights, including the presumption of innocence.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('oakley-family-law-calgary','Oakley Family Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.6,127,50.9499567,-113.9929243,'{"name":"Oakley Family Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":50.9499567,"lng":-113.9929243,"address":"3150 114 Ave SE, Calgary, AB T2Z 3V6","phone":"+15879431394","rating":4.6,"count":127,"slug":"oakley-family-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Oakley+Family+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=3150+114+Ave+SE%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2Z+3V6","website":"https://www.oakleyfamilylaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Calgary. Rated 4.6 from 127 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/oakley-family-law-calgary.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Melissa Oakley","title":"Founding Lawyer"}],"areas":["Family law","Divorce and separation","Financial disclosure","Property division","Child support","Mediation","Protection orders","Arbitration","Legal coaching"]}}',NULL,'Oakley Family Law is a Calgary firm that supports clients through divorce, starting a new family and estate planning.

The firm marks its 10th anniversary, and founding lawyer Melissa Oakley notes that the practice has worked with thousands of individuals through major life transitions over the decade. Its core values are honesty and transparency, collaboration, integrity, client service and respect for differences, and everyone is welcome. The firm identifies as a Calgary family lawyer and Calgary divorce lawyer, and the office is in southeast Calgary.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('smith-employment-law-toronto','Smith Employment Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,112,43.6481452,-79.3846606,'{"name":"Smith Employment Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6481452,"lng":-79.3846606,"address":"150 King St W Ste 257, Toronto, ON M5H 3B7","phone":"+14168060732","rating":5,"count":112,"slug":"smith-employment-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Smith+Employment+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=150+King+St+W+Ste+257%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5H+3B7","website":"https://smithemploymentlaw.ca","blurb":"Employment Law in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 112 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/smith-employment-law-toronto.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Waheeda Ekhlas Smith"}],"areas":["Wrongful dismissal","Severance packages","Constructive dismissal","Workplace harassment and bullying","Human rights and workplace discrimination","Disability leave of absence","Parental and maternity leave","Just cause dismissal","Employment contracts","Workplace investigations"],"serving":["Toronto","Mississauga","Oakville","Oshawa","Barrie","Vaughan","Halton Hills"]}}',NULL,'Smith Employment Law is a Toronto practice that acts for both employees and employers in employment law matters.

The firm is led by Waheeda Ekhlas Smith, who practises as WES Law Professional Corporation and worked as a legal assistant for many years, beginning at age 18, before becoming a lawyer. The practice handles severance negotiations and assessments of job offers and employment contracts, and seeks early resolution before matters reach court while staying ready to advance or defend a client''s position when necessary. Community involvement, education, representative work and speaking engagements are also part of Ms. Smith''s profile.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('gad-pariente-montreal','Gad Pariente','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.8,115,45.5048906,-73.5543837,'{"name":"Gad Pariente","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.5048906,"lng":-73.5543837,"address":"83 Rue St-Paul Ouest, Montréal, QC H2Y 3T3","phone":"+15149616222","rating":4.8,"count":115,"slug":"gad-pariente-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Gad+Pariente+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=83+Rue+St-Paul+Ouest%2C+Montr%C3%A9al%2C+QC+H2Y+3T3","website":"https://sponsorshipattorney.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Montreal. Rated 4.8 from 115 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/gad-pariente-montreal.png","details":{"languages":["English","French"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Gad Pariente"}],"areas":["Spousal sponsorship","Family sponsorship"]}}',NULL,'Gad Pariente is a Montreal immigration lawyer who handles spousal and common-law partner sponsorship applications for clients across Canada.

Licensed by the Barreau du Québec since 2006, he practises as a sole practitioner through Gad Pariente Avocat Inc. and spent years in public relations and communications before law. His work covers both inland and outland sponsorship files, with posted flat fees and a federal-only path. All client work is conducted remotely, with office visits by appointment for Montreal-area clients. Service is offered in English or French to clients in Quebec, Ontario, British Columbia, Alberta and the U.S.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('sean-fagan-criminal-defence-lawyer-calgary','Sean Fagan Criminal Defence Lawyer','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,5,109,51.0419516,-114.0660889,'{"name":"Sean Fagan Criminal Defence Lawyer","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0419516,"lng":-114.0660889,"address":"1117 1 St SW Ste 306, Calgary, AB T2R 0T9","phone":"+14038158099","rating":5,"count":109,"slug":"sean-fagan-criminal-defence-lawyer-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sean+Fagan+Criminal+Defence+Lawyer+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1117+1+St+SW+Ste+306%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2R+0T9","website":"https://seanfagan.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Calgary. Rated 5.0 from 109 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/sean-fagan-criminal-defence-lawyer-calgary.webp","bioImage":"images/bio/sean-fagan-criminal-defence-lawyer-calgary.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Sean Fagan"},{"name":"Devlin Gavigan","title":"Associate"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","Assault","Drug trafficking","Firearms offences","Murder"]}}','{"1":[["00:00","23:59"]],"2":[["00:00","23:59"]],"3":[["00:00","23:59"]],"4":[["00:00","23:59"]],"5":[["00:00","23:59"]],"6":[["00:00","23:59"]],"7":[["00:00","23:59"]]}','Sean Fagan Criminal Defence Lawyer is a Calgary practice defending assault, driving, drug, sexual, theft and fraud charges, and handling bail matters.

Sean Fagan grew up around his father''s Calgary criminal practice, focused on criminal defence in law school, took first place at the MacIntyre Cup and medalled at the Sopinka Cup national trial advocacy finals. He was lead counsel in a Supreme Court of Canada case that ended in acquittal and re-established the defence of extreme intoxication. The practice also covers breaches and failures to appear, and recent matters include charges withdrawn or stayed. The firm does not handle traffic tickets, and Devlin Gavigan also practises there.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('diamond-and-diamond-lawyers-edmonton','Diamond and Diamond Lawyers','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.7,114,53.4800498,-113.4806466,'{"name":"Diamond and Diamond Lawyers","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.4800498,"lng":-113.4806466,"address":"4246 97 St NW Unit 100, Edmonton, AB T6E 5Z9","phone":"+18005674878","rating":4.7,"count":114,"slug":"diamond-and-diamond-lawyers-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Diamond+and+Diamond+Lawyers+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4246+97+St+NW+Unit+100%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T6E+5Z9","website":"https://diamondlaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Edmonton. Rated 4.7 from 114 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/diamond-and-diamond-lawyers-edmonton.webp","details":{"areas":["Personal injury","Motor vehicle accidents","Misdiagnosis and diagnostic errors","Birth and obstetric injury","Treatment errors","Hospital and nursing negligence","Medication and prescription errors","Estate administration","Wills and estate planning"],"serving":["Edmonton","Toronto","Vancouver"]}}',NULL,'Diamond and Diamond Lawyers runs an Edmonton office for personal injury cases, from motor vehicle accidents to medical malpractice.

The firm has experience across the full range of personal injury matters, including other accidents, injuries, misdiagnosis and diagnostic errors, birth and obstetric injury, and treatment errors. It also helps families with estate administration, applications and litigation. The firm has offices in Ontario, including Toronto, Barrie, Kitchener, London, Ottawa, Sudbury, Timmins and Windsor, as well as in Alberta.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('rana-u-hameed-criminal-law-mississauga','Rana U. Hameed Criminal Law','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,103,43.6218707,-79.6677929,'{"name":"Rana U. Hameed Criminal Law","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6218707,"lng":-79.6677929,"address":"100 Matheson Blvd E #204, Mississauga, ON L4Z 2G7","phone":"+14164741577","rating":5,"count":103,"slug":"rana-u-hameed-criminal-law-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Rana+U.+Hameed+Criminal+Law+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=100+Matheson+Blvd+E+%23204%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L4Z+2G7","website":"https://umerhameed.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 103 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/rana-u-hameed-criminal-law-mississauga.webp","heroImage":"images/hero/rana-u-hameed-criminal-law-mississauga.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Rana Umer Hameed","title":"Barrister & Solicitor"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","Offences against the person","Sexual offences","Driving offences","Drug offences","Financial offences","Property offences","Weapons offences","Bail hearing"],"serving":["Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Criminal defence lawyer Umer Hameed leads Rana U Hameed Criminal Law in Mississauga, defending people charged with offences across Ontario.

The firm handles offences against the person, sexual and weapons offences, driving and drug offences, property and financial offences, and bail hearings at both the Ontario Court of Justice and the Superior Court of Justice. Umer Hameed holds BScN, LL.B. and LL.M. degrees, articled at a boutique Toronto defence firm and later worked as an associate at another Toronto criminal firm. His experience includes matters before the Ontario Court of Justice, the Superior Court of Justice and the Court of Appeal for Ontario, and flexible payment plans are available.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('tas-law-firm-mississauga','TAS Law Firm','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,101,43.5964037,-79.6369797,'{"name":"TAS Law Firm","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5964037,"lng":-79.6369797,"address":"2 Robert Speck Pkwy Ste 700, Mississauga, ON L4Z 1H8","phone":"+14168902147","rating":5,"count":101,"slug":"tas-law-firm-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/TAS+Law+Firm+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2+Robert+Speck+Pkwy+Ste+700%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L4Z+1H8","website":"https://www.taslawfirm.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 101 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/tas-law-firm-mississauga.webp","details":{"areas":["Uncontested divorce","Separation agreements","Court filing and process serving"],"serving":["GTA"]}}',NULL,'TAS Law Firm is a Mississauga family law practice offering uncontested divorce, separation agreements and child custody matters on flat fees.

The firm serves clients across the GTA and Ontario, including Milton and Brampton, and works with clients in person and online. Its simple divorce service is aimed at spouses who agree on the terms, requires no court appearances, and includes a mobile service in the GTA. Pricing is simple flat-rate without hidden fees, and the firm aims to keep clients informed about their rights and obligations during the divorce process.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('traffic-tickets-toronto-toronto','Traffic Tickets Toronto','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,103,43.6558552,-79.3817835,'{"name":"Traffic Tickets Toronto","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6558552,"lng":-79.3817835,"address":"Eaton Centre, Traffic Tickets Toronto 1, 2500 Dundas St W, Toronto, ON M5G 1Z3","phone":"+18887870260","rating":4.9,"count":103,"slug":"traffic-tickets-toronto-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Traffic+Tickets+Toronto+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Eaton+Centre%2C+Traffic+Tickets+Toronto+1%2C+2500+Dundas+St+W%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5G+1Z3","website":"https://www.justicejolt.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 103 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/traffic-tickets-toronto-toronto.webp","details":{"areas":["Speeding tickets","Stunt driving","Dangerous driving","Licence reinstatement","Traffic violations defence"],"serving":["Ontario","Manitoba"]}}',NULL,'Traffic Tickets Toronto defends drivers charged with speeding, stunt driving, careless driving and other traffic offences in Ontario and Manitoba.

The business traces to Shelina Lalji, who joined POINTTS in 2008, became its master franchisee in 2015 and later launched the JUSTICEJOLT Legal Defence for Drivers brand. The team has more than 17 years of experience and offers paralegal-led defence aimed at protecting licences, records and insurance costs. Services include demerit point matters, handheld device violations, dangerous driving and related criminal charges, appeals, licence reinstatement and CVOR defence for commercial operators.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('bernstein-law-group-personal-injury-lawyers-hamilton','Bernstein Law Group Personal Injury Lawyers','Hamilton','ON','hamilton-niagara',0,4.9,103,43.2490722,-79.8726256,'{"name":"Bernstein Law Group Personal Injury Lawyers","city":"Hamilton","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Civil Litigation","Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["injury","litigation","criminal"],"region":"hamilton-niagara","province":"ON","lat":43.2490722,"lng":-79.8726256,"address":"250 James St S, Hamilton, ON L8P 3B3","phone":"+19055461990","rating":4.9,"count":103,"slug":"bernstein-law-group-personal-injury-lawyers-hamilton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Bernstein+Law+Group+Personal+Injury+Lawyers+Hamilton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=250+James+St+S%2C+Hamilton%2C+ON+L8P+3B3","website":"https://bernsteinlawgroup.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury / Civil Litigation in Hamilton. Rated 4.9 from 103 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/bernstein-law-group-personal-injury-lawyers-hamilton.png","bioImage":"images/bio/bernstein-law-group-personal-injury-lawyers-hamilton.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Stephen Bernstein","title":"Founding lawyer"}],"areas":["Domestic violence","Drug offences","Youth offences","Bail hearings","Sexual assault","Weapons offences","Personal injury","Real estate law","Criminal law","Mental health and capacity law"],"serving":["Hamilton","Burlington","Ancaster","Oakville","Brantford","Cayuga","Stoney Creek","Milton"]}}',NULL,'Bernstein Law Group is a Hamilton firm handling criminal defence, personal injury and mental health law matters from an office near the courthouse.

Founding lawyer Stephen Bernstein has more than 30 years of trial experience, and Robert Bernstein is also a lawyer at the firm. The James Street office is close to the courthouse and the firm accepts Legal Aid. Its criminal work covers domestic violence, drug and youth offences and bail hearings, while its injury work covers motor vehicle accidents, wrongful death, slip and falls, spinal injuries and truck accidents. The firm represents clients throughout Hamilton and surrounding areas, including Burlington.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('derek-wilson-hamilton-personal-injury-and-disability-lawyer-hamilton','Derek Wilson Hamilton Personal Injury & Disability Lawyer','Hamilton','ON','hamilton-niagara',0,5,100,43.2526562,-79.8717783,'{"name":"Derek Wilson Hamilton Personal Injury & Disability Lawyer","city":"Hamilton","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"hamilton-niagara","province":"ON","lat":43.2526562,"lng":-79.8717783,"address":"19 Bold St #1, Hamilton, ON L8P 1T3","phone":"+19057690418","rating":5,"count":100,"slug":"derek-wilson-hamilton-personal-injury-and-disability-lawyer-hamilton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Derek+Wilson+Hamilton+Personal+Injury+%26+Disability+Lawyer+Hamilton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=19+Bold+St+%231%2C+Hamilton%2C+ON+L8P+1T3","website":"https://www.derekwilsonlaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Hamilton. Rated 5.0 from 100 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/derek-wilson-hamilton-personal-injury-and-disability-lawyer-hamilton.png","bioImage":"images/bio/derek-wilson-hamilton-personal-injury-and-disability-lawyer-hamilton.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Derek Wilson"}],"areas":["Car accidents","Disability benefits","Brain injury","Truck accidents","Slip and fall accidents","Pedestrian accidents","Motorcycle accidents","Spinal cord injuries","Bicycle accidents","Wrongful death"],"serving":["Hamilton"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Derek Wilson is a Hamilton lawyer who handles personal injury and long-term disability cases, including car, truck, motorcycle and pedestrian accidents.

He has practised personal injury and insurance litigation since 1995, handles every file himself and keeps a limited caseload. His education includes an LL.B. from the University of Alberta, an LL.M. in civil litigation from the London School of Economics and a Harvard mediation certificate from 2025, and he spent much of his career dealing with insurance companies from both sides. Service areas include traumatic brain injury, spinal injury and slip and fall cases for clients in Hamilton, Burlington, Niagara Falls, Brantford and Kitchener.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ellis-criminal-law-professional-corporation-london','Ellis Criminal Law Professional Corporation','London','ON','southwestern',0,4.9,102,42.9845311,-81.2548188,'{"name":"Ellis Criminal Law Professional Corporation","city":"London","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":42.9845311,"lng":-81.2548188,"address":"468 Ridout St N, London, ON N6A 2P7","phone":"+15199321133","rating":4.9,"count":102,"slug":"ellis-criminal-law-professional-corporation-london","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Ellis+Criminal+Law+Professional+Corporation+London+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=468+Ridout+St+N%2C+London%2C+ON+N6A+2P7","website":"https://elliscriminallaw.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in London. Rated 4.9 from 102 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ellis-criminal-law-professional-corporation-london.webp","details":{"areas":["Cyber crime","Preliminary hearings","First time offenders","Young offenders","Corporate offences","Property offences","Driving offences","Sexual offences"]}}',NULL,'Ellis Criminal Law Professional Corporation is a London, Ontario firm that limits its practice to criminal defence.

The firm has practised only criminal defence since 2006, after earlier work in civil litigation and education, and has appeared at all levels of court in Ontario. Laura Ellis, Ron Ellis and Stephen Troyer are the lawyers, with Kholood Ghenniwa as paralegal and office manager. Its services include cyber crime, preliminary hearings, trials, first-time offenders, young offenders, and corporate, property and driving offences. The team stresses Charter protections and is reachable around the clock, every day of the week.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('mm-family-and-divorce-lawyers-calgary','MM Family & Divorce Lawyers','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.8,104,51.0479691,-114.0757837,'{"name":"MM Family & Divorce Lawyers","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["family","wills"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0479691,"lng":-114.0757837,"address":"634 6 Ave SW #410, Calgary, AB T2P 2Y5","phone":"+14037189815","rating":4.8,"count":104,"slug":"mm-family-and-divorce-lawyers-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/MM+Family+%26+Divorce+Lawyers+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=634+6+Ave+SW+%23410%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2P+2Y5","website":"https://mmfamilyanddivorcelawyers.ca","blurb":"Family Law / Wills & Estates in Calgary. Rated 4.8 from 104 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/mm-family-and-divorce-lawyers-calgary.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Miguel Mejia"},{"name":"Dan Aburto"},{"name":"Zihao Guo"}],"areas":["Divorce law","Child support","Family law agreements","Property division","Mediation and arbitration","Parenting and child custody","Spousal and partner support"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','MM Family & Divorce Lawyers is a Calgary firm practising only family and divorce law, from parenting arrangements to property division.

Founded in 2011 and based in downtown Calgary, the firm''s services include divorce, child support and Section 7 expenses, family law agreements, spousal support, mediation and arbitration. Its lawyers are Miguel Mejia, Maryla (Mary) Ali, Dan Aburto and Zihao Guo, who appear in the Alberta Court of Justice and the Court of King''s Bench of Alberta. The team is trained in litigation and in alternative dispute resolution, including mediation, arbitration and parenting coordination.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ken-hoyt-law-ottawa','Ken Hoyt Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.8,103,45.4172939,-75.6879971,'{"name":"Ken Hoyt Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4172939,"lng":-75.6879971,"address":"157 Gilmour St, Ottawa, ON K2P 0N8","phone":"+16132312995","rating":4.8,"count":103,"slug":"ken-hoyt-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Ken+Hoyt+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=157+Gilmour+St%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K2P+0N8","website":"https://kenhoytlaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Ottawa. Rated 4.8 from 103 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ken-hoyt-law-ottawa.webp","details":{"areas":["Real estate matters","Wills, powers of attorney and estate planning","Estate administration","Business and corporate services","Notarial and commissioning services"]}}',NULL,'Ken Hoyt Law is an Ottawa firm handling residential real estate purchases and sales, wills, powers of attorney and estate matters.

The firm has served its real estate community for 30 years and approaches its work with professionalism and a touch of humour. Once a deal becomes unconditional, it meets the client for about 25 minutes to explain the closing process, work through the financial costs of the transaction and list what must be done beforehand. Further services include estate administration, business and corporate work, mortgage refinancing, and notarial and commissioning services.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('zomorodi-law-pc-richmond-hill','Zomorodi Law PC','Richmond Hill','ON','york-durham',0,4.7,105,43.8412674,-79.3989903,'{"name":"Zomorodi Law PC","city":"Richmond Hill","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["realestate","business"],"region":"york-durham","province":"ON","lat":43.8412674,"lng":-79.3989903,"address":"330 Hwy 7 Ste 309, Richmond Hill, ON L4B 3P8","phone":"+19055970529","rating":4.7,"count":105,"slug":"zomorodi-law-pc-richmond-hill","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Zomorodi+Law+PC+Richmond+Hill+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=330+Hwy+7+Ste+309%2C+Richmond+Hill%2C+ON+L4B+3P8","website":"https://www.zomorodilaw.com","blurb":"Real Estate / Business Law in Richmond Hill. Rated 4.7 from 105 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/zomorodi-law-pc-richmond-hill.png","details":{"languages":["English","Farsi","Greek","Japanese","Korean"],"areas":["Real estate transactions","Business law","Civil and commercial litigation","Wills and estates","Notary public services"],"serving":["Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Zomorodi Law PC is a Richmond Hill firm offering real estate transactions, business law, civil and commercial litigation, and wills and estates.

Its real estate practice covers purchase, sale and mortgage closings for urban and cottage properties, condominiums and vacant land, both residential and commercial. Business services include articles of incorporation, shareholder agreements and the sale or acquisition of franchised businesses, and notary public services are also offered. The firm serves newcomers, business owners, young entrepreneurs, other professionals, international investors and diverse communities, and its litigation experience lets it handle disputes that arise during a closing in house.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('dhiman-law-professional-corporation-ottawa','Dhiman Law Professional Corporation','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,96,45.228923,-75.6824287,'{"name":"Dhiman Law Professional Corporation","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.228923,"lng":-75.6824287,"address":"1096 Bridge St, Ottawa, ON K4M 0H8","phone":"+16136966777","rating":5,"count":96,"slug":"dhiman-law-professional-corporation-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Dhiman+Law+Professional+Corporation+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1096+Bridge+St%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K4M+0H8","website":"https://dhimanlaw.com","blurb":"Family Law in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 96 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/dhiman-law-professional-corporation-ottawa.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Inderjit Dhiman","title":"Founder"}],"areas":["Family law","Real estate law"],"serving":["Ottawa"]}}',NULL,'Dhiman Law Professional Corporation is an Ottawa general practice firm handling family law and real estate matters.

Founder and principal lawyer Inderjit Dhiman is qualified to practise in both India and Canada and is a member of the Law Society of Ontario. The firm serves Barrhaven, Kanata, Nepean, Manotick, Orleans, Greely, Osgoode and Riverside South, along with Brampton and Mississauga, offers virtual meetings, and speaks Punjabi and Hindi. Its family law practice concerns separation and the interests of families, and its real estate practice the careful handling of closings for buyers moving into a new home.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('porcelli-d-angela-llp-mississauga','Porcelli D''Angela LLP','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,96,43.6585907,-79.6036639,'{"name":"Porcelli D''Angela LLP","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["injury","litigation"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6585907,"lng":-79.6036639,"address":"2540 Matheson Blvd E, Mississauga, ON L4W 4Z2","phone":"+16474909444","rating":5,"count":96,"slug":"porcelli-d-angela-llp-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Porcelli+D%27Angela+LLP+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2540+Matheson+Blvd+E%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L4W+4Z2","website":"https://www.pdlaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury / Civil Litigation in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 96 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/porcelli-d-angela-llp-mississauga.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Vince Porcelli"},{"name":"Tullio A. D’Angela"}],"areas":["Motor vehicle accidents","Long term disability claims","Bicycle accidents"]}}',NULL,'Porcelli D''Angela LLP is a Mississauga personal injury firm handling motor vehicle accidents, bicycle accidents and long-term disability matters.

Vince Porcelli and Tullio A. D''Angela bring over 50 years of combined legal experience. Vince is a senior licensed paralegal in Ontario who has worked on motor vehicle accident benefit matters for over 25 years, and Tullio is the firm''s lawyer. The firm helps clients understand their rights and what to expect during a lawsuit, and no fees are owed unless money is recovered on an injury or disability matter.','dynamic','live',NULL);
