The firm, which also uses the name N&E Avocats, operates three offices in Quebec, in Gatineau, Trois-Rivières and Sherbrooke. Immigration work covers temporary and permanent residence, study and work permits, family sponsorship and asylum applications for individuals, families, students and professionals who want to settle in Canada or bring relatives. The firm represents clients before the competent courts and tailors its approach to each situation.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('manbir-sodhi-brampton','Manbir Sodhi','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,4.8,88,43.6852731,-79.7615335,'{"name":"Manbir Sodhi","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6852731,"lng":-79.7615335,"address":"9 George St N Unit 102, Brampton, ON L6V 1E9","phone":"+19054572546","rating":4.8,"count":88,"slug":"manbir-sodhi-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Manbir+Sodhi+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=9+George+St+N+Unit+102%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6V+1E9","website":"https://www.manbirsodhilaw.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Brampton. Rated 4.8 from 88 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/manbir-sodhi-brampton.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Manbir Singh Sodhi","title":"Criminal Defence Lawyer"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","Impaired driving offences"],"serving":["Brampton"]}}',NULL,'Manbir Sodhi is a Brampton criminal defence lawyer who represents people charged with offences, including impaired driving.

He practises exclusively in criminal law and offers representation at each stage, from a police request to turn oneself in through arrest, bail hearings, pre-trial and trial. Practice areas include domestic and sexual assault, weapons, drug and criminal driving offences, traffic and bylaw matters, search warrants, theft, fraud and shoplifting, youth criminal offences and professional disciplinary proceedings. The office is on George Street North in Brampton and the firm serves clients across the GTA and Ontario.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('harvey-katz-law-office-hamilton','Harvey Katz Law Office','Hamilton','ON','hamilton-niagara',0,4.6,91,43.2586526,-79.877649,'{"name":"Harvey Katz Law Office","city":"Hamilton","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"hamilton-niagara","province":"ON","lat":43.2586526,"lng":-79.877649,"address":"14 Hess St S, Hamilton, ON L8P 3M9","phone":"+19055231442","rating":4.6,"count":91,"slug":"harvey-katz-law-office-hamilton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Harvey+Katz+Law+Office+Hamilton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=14+Hess+St+S%2C+Hamilton%2C+ON+L8P+3M9","website":"https://www.harveykatzlaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Hamilton. Rated 4.6 from 91 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/harvey-katz-law-office-hamilton.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Harvey Katz","title":"Partner"},{"name":"Eli Jakubovic","title":"Partner"},{"name":"Michael Bishop"}],"areas":["Personal injury law","Real estate transactions","Wills and estate planning","Motor vehicle accidents","Slip-and-falls","Long-term disability claims"],"serving":["Hamilton"]}}',NULL,'Harvey Katz Law Office is a Hamilton firm handling personal injury, civil litigation, wills and estates, and real estate matters.

The firm has represented the Hamilton community for over 45 years and has a team of four lawyers: partners Harvey Katz and Eli Jakubovic, plus Michael Bishop and Bianca Zimperi. Harvey Katz was born and raised in the Hamilton area. Its personal injury work includes accident benefits and disability matters, civil litigation covers property disputes, contract disputes and debt collection, and estates work spans estate planning, probate administration, trusts and guardianships.','dynamic','live',NULL);
