Pav Lama earned a bachelor''s degree at York University and a law degree at the University of Birmingham in the UK, and was admitted to the Ontario bar in 2016. The firm also handles corporate law, commercial law, notary services, and wills and powers of attorney. It offers fixed fee closings, and the office is on Speers Road in Oakville.','dynamic','live',NULL);
