The firm has decades of exclusive focus on immigration and refugee law. Its work includes entry for tourists, business visitors and workers, rehabilitation applications and temporary resident permits for criminal inadmissibility, provincial nominee programs, business immigration, Express Entry, spousal and common-law sponsorship, and family class applications. The team can communicate in English, French, Mandarin, Punjabi, Hindi and Spanish, and the office is in Sun Life Place.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('alam-real-estate-law-mississauga','Alam Real Estate Law','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,82,43.6363554,-79.6225317,'{"name":"Alam Real Estate Law","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6363554,"lng":-79.6225317,"address":"5100 Dixie Rd, Mississauga, ON L4W 1C9","phone":"+16479785565","rating":5,"count":82,"slug":"alam-real-estate-law-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Alam+Real+Estate+Law+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=5100+Dixie+Rd%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L4W+1C9","website":"https://alamrealestatelaw.com","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 82 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/alam-real-estate-law-mississauga.jpg","details":{"languages":["English","Urdu","Hindi"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Jawaid Alam"}],"areas":["Real estate litigation","Construction litigation","Buying and selling transactions","Registering and removing liens","Commercial property development litigation","Mortgage refinance"],"serving":["Mississauga","GTA","Halton","Ontario"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Alam Real Estate Law is a Mississauga firm handling property purchases, sales, refinancing and real estate litigation in the GTA and Halton.

Principal lawyer Jawaid Alam has degrees in commerce, economics and finance, business management and law, holds Ontario accreditation of his law degree through the National Committee of Accreditation, and speaks English, Hindi and Urdu. The firm also handles construction litigation, registering and removing liens, commercial property development litigation, and examination of agreements of purchase and sale and mortgage agreements. It serves residential and commercial clients across Mississauga and the surrounding communities.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('jsb-calgary-employment-law-calgary','JSB Calgary Employment Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.6,89,51.0498788,-114.07204,'{"name":"JSB Calgary Employment Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0498788,"lng":-114.07204,"address":"500 4 Ave SW #2500, Calgary, AB T2P 2V6","phone":"+14036205400","rating":4.6,"count":89,"slug":"jsb-calgary-employment-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/JSB+Calgary+Employment+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=500+4+Ave+SW+%232500%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2P+2V6","website":"https://jsblaw.ca","blurb":"Employment Law in Calgary. Rated 4.6 from 89 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/jsb-calgary-employment-law-calgary.webp","details":{"areas":["Severance pay","Constructive dismissal","Wrongful termination","Workplace harassment","Employment agreements","Workplace investigations","Employment standards compliance","Human rights complaints"],"serving":["Calgary","Alberta"]}}',NULL,'JSB Calgary Employment Law is a Calgary firm handling terminations, severance packages and constructive dismissal for employees and executives.

The firm mainly acts for people whose employment has ended, whether with or without cause, and also works with employers on employment agreements, workplace investigations, workplace conflict and employment standards compliance. Its services extend to human rights complaints, discrimination and harassment, disability, maternity and other job-protected leaves, layoffs, independent contractor classification, and non-competition and non-solicitation covenants. Most of its files settle out of court, and its office is on 4 Avenue SW.','dynamic','live',NULL);
