The firm serves Kitchener, Waterloo, Cambridge, the Greater Toronto Area and surrounding regions. Khaled Wahab is the managing lawyer, with Nima Pannu as an associate and Richard David Christy as executive advisor. Real estate work covers buying, selling and refinancing with transparent pricing, while the family practice handles custody disputes, support calculations, asset distribution and divorce. Notary services and independent legal advice are also offered, and clients are served throughout the Waterloo Region.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('kalia-law-firm-brampton','Kalia Law Firm','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,4.7,81,43.750942,-79.7270575,'{"name":"Kalia Law Firm","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["family","realestate"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.750942,"lng":-79.7270575,"address":"2120 N Park Dr #213, Brampton, ON L6S 0C9","phone":"+19057900020","rating":4.7,"count":81,"slug":"kalia-law-firm-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kalia+Law+Firm+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2120+N+Park+Dr+%23213%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6S+0C9","website":"https://www.kalialaw.com","blurb":"Family Law / Real Estate in Brampton. Rated 4.7 from 81 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/kalia-law-firm-brampton.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Tulika Kalia","title":"Lawyer"}],"areas":["Family law","Real estate law","Wills and estate planning","Independent legal advice","Notary public services","Immigration"],"serving":["Brampton","Georgetown","Caledon","Guelph","Mississauga","Milton"]}}',NULL,'Kalia Law Firm is a Brampton practice offering family law, real estate, wills and estates, notary and independent legal advice services.

The firm serves Brampton and nearby communities including Mississauga, Guelph, Georgetown, Caledon and Milton. Tulika Kalia is licensed as a barrister and solicitor in Ontario and handles family and real estate matters, and her network of lawyers extends the firm''s reach to more than four jurisdictions worldwide. The notary practice covers statutory declarations, affidavits, invitation letters, powers of attorney, name change applications and certified true copies, and the firm also handles probate, travel documents and immigration services.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('tsf-law-mississauga','TSF Law','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,76,43.6288179,-79.6688955,'{"name":"TSF Law","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6288179,"lng":-79.6688955,"address":"259 Traders Blvd E Unit 10, Mississauga, ON L4Z 2E5","phone":"+13655178731","rating":5,"count":76,"slug":"tsf-law-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/TSF+Law+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=259+Traders+Blvd+E+Unit+10%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L4Z+2E5","website":"https://tsflaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 76 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/tsf-law-mississauga.png","bioImage":"images/bio/tsf-law-mississauga.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Terio Francis"},{"name":"Kristofer Angle"},{"name":"Andrea Seecharan","title":"Associate"}],"areas":["Long term disability claims","Personal injury","Motor vehicle accidents","Slip and fall claims","Dog bite incidents"],"serving":["Mississauga","Ontario"]}}',NULL,'TSF Law is a Mississauga personal injury firm acting for people with denied long term disability benefits and injuries from car accidents and falls.

The firm practises personal injury law exclusively and acts for clients from across Ontario. Partner Terio Francis grew up in Toronto, studied at Dalhousie''s Schulich School of Law, and has appeared before the Superior Court of Justice and the License Appeal Tribunal and arbitrated at the Financial Services Commission of Ontario. The team also includes associate KristoFer Angle, licensed paralegal Licia Lionessa, Andrea Seecharan and Andreea Savin, and the head office is on Traders Boulevard East.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('zamani-law-toronto','Zamani Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,77,43.6503164,-79.3842467,'{"name":"Zamani Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6503164,"lng":-79.3842467,"address":"121 Richmond St W Suite 1100, Toronto, ON M5H 2K1","phone":"+16475788054","rating":4.9,"count":77,"slug":"zamani-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Zamani+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=121+Richmond+St+W+Suite+1100%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5H+2K1","website":"https://zamani-law.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 77 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/zamani-law-toronto.png","details":{"areas":["Bail hearing","Domestic violence","Youth offences","Driving offences and DUI","Drug crimes","Assault and threats","Weapon charges","Theft and fraud","Sexual assault","Criminal harassment"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Zamani Law is a Toronto criminal defence firm that represents people facing criminal allegations across the Greater Toronto Area.

Practice areas include bail hearings and domestic violence charges, and the firm''s priority is protecting clients'' rights while seeking a reasonable resolution or withdrawal of charges. For family law, wills and estate planning and real estate, it has alliances with other practitioners to whom it directs clients, since family disputes are often linked to criminal proceedings. Founder Farid Zamani is a co-founder of Children without Borders, a non-profit that raises awareness of child labour and sponsors education for children in Afghan communities. The office is on Richmond Street West.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('badesha-law-criminal-lawyer-brampton-brampton','Badesha Law Criminal Lawyer Brampton','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,5,75,43.748244,-79.699368,'{"name":"Badesha Law Criminal Lawyer Brampton","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["criminal","litigation"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.748244,"lng":-79.699368,"address":"80 Maritime Ontario Blvd Ste 240, Brampton, ON L6S 0E7","phone":"+12894060110","rating":5,"count":75,"slug":"badesha-law-criminal-lawyer-brampton-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Badesha+Law+Criminal+Lawyer+Brampton+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=80+Maritime+Ontario+Blvd+Ste+240%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6S+0E7","website":"https://criminallawyerinbrampton.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Civil Litigation in Brampton. Rated 5.0 from 75 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/badesha-law-criminal-lawyer-brampton-brampton.png","details":{"areas":["Criminal defence","Domestic assault","Impaired driving and DUI","Drug offences","Weapons charges","Uttering threats","Bail matters"],"serving":["Brampton","GTA"]}}','{"1":[["00:00","23:59"]],"2":[["00:00","23:59"]],"3":[["00:00","23:59"]],"4":[["00:00","23:59"]],"5":[["00:00","23:59"]],"6":[["00:00","23:59"]],"7":[["00:00","23:59"]]}','Badesha Law is a Brampton criminal defence firm representing people charged with assault, DUI, theft, domestic violence and other offences.

The firm is led by founding lawyer Harprit Badesha and senior lawyer Kajol Panchol. It acts from the first police involvement through bail hearings and trial, across Brampton, Mississauga, Peel Region and the Greater Toronto Area. Other charges handled include sexual assault, dangerous driving, uttering threats, and theft under and over $5,000. Fees can be flat or flexible, and the firm is available around the clock.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('swift-law-calgary','Swift Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,75,51.0243501,-114.1112054,'{"name":"Swift Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0243501,"lng":-114.1112054,"address":"2130 33 Ave SW B, Calgary, AB T2T 1Z6","phone":"+14033654397","rating":4.9,"count":75,"slug":"swift-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Swift+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2130+33+Ave+SW+B%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2T+1Z6","website":"https://www.swiftllp.ca","blurb":"Wills & Estates in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 75 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/swift-law-calgary.webp","details":{"areas":["Residential real estate","Wills and estates","Mediation","Commissioner for oaths services"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}',NULL,'Swift Law is a Calgary real estate law practice, also called Swift LLP, handling residential purchases, sales and refinances.

The firm is a mobile practice based in Marda Loop, with flexible appointment options. Paul Kennett and Angela Mouton are named with the firm, which has more than 20 years of experience, and the practice also offers wills and estates, mediation, and notary and commissioner for oaths services alongside real estate. It prepares custom fee estimates, gives direct access to the lawyer, and sets out how the lawyer''s role differs from that of the realtor and mortgage broker in getting a deal to close.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('conron-law-professional-corporation-london','Conron Law Professional Corporation','London','ON','southwestern',0,5,73,42.985112,-81.2523468,'{"name":"Conron Law Professional Corporation","city":"London","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":42.985112,"lng":-81.2523468,"address":"Mezzanine Level, 140 Fullarton St #202, London, ON N6A 5P2","phone":"+15196731881","rating":5,"count":73,"slug":"conron-law-professional-corporation-london","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Conron+Law+Professional+Corporation+London+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Mezzanine+Level%2C+140+Fullarton+St+%23202%2C+London%2C+ON+N6A+5P2","website":"https://www.conronlaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in London. Rated 5.0 from 73 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/conron-law-professional-corporation-london.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Carolynn V. Conron"},{"name":"Katie Gosen"}],"areas":["Domestic and non-domestic assault","Aggravated assault","Sexual assault","Sexual interference","Impaired driving","Dangerous operation","Theft and property crimes","Drug possession","Drug trafficking","Sentencing"]}}',NULL,'Conron Law Professional Corporation is a London, Ontario criminal defence firm covering charges from assault to drug trafficking.

The firm handles all criminal charges, including domestic and non-domestic assault, aggravated and sexual assault, impaired driving, dangerous operation, theft and property crimes, drug possession and trafficking, firearm offences and breaches of court orders. Carolynn V. Conron, who holds an LL.M., heads the practice and has more than a decade in practice, with associate Katie Gosen and licensed paralegal Ashley Bates on the team. The office is on the mezzanine level at Fullarton Street.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('frenkel-tobin-llp-toronto','Frenkel Tobin LLP','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,73,43.6471843,-79.3923527,'{"name":"Frenkel Tobin LLP","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6471843,"lng":-79.3923527,"address":"317 Adelaide St W #1001, Toronto, ON M5V 1P9","phone":"+14163634273","rating":4.9,"count":73,"slug":"frenkel-tobin-llp-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Frenkel+Tobin+LLP+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=317+Adelaide+St+W+%231001%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5V+1P9","website":"https://frenkeltobin.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 73 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/frenkel-tobin-llp-toronto.png","details":{"areas":["Separation agreements","Child support","Spousal support","Property division","Prenups and marriage contracts","Divorce","Common-law spouses","Financial statements and disclosure"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Frenkel Tobin LLP is a downtown Toronto boutique firm focused exclusively on family and divorce law.

Its lawyers act for clients in Ontario, across Canada and internationally, including mothers, fathers, grandparents, seniors, LGBTQ clients, people with limited finances and those with high net worth. Areas include separation, parenting schedules and decision-making for children, child support and spousal support. David Frenkel has practised only family law since 2008, has published in the Canadian Family Law Quarterly, Law Times and the Globe and Mail, and has spoken at the Law Society of Ontario''s Family Law Summit; David Tobin and several other lawyers also practise with the firm.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('m-j-o-nions-vancouver','M.J. O''Nions','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.8,74,49.2803797,-123.1227709,'{"name":"M.J. O''Nions","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["family","wills"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2803797,"lng":-123.1227709,"address":"938 Howe St #311, Vancouver, BC V6Z 1N9","phone":"+16044497779","rating":4.8,"count":74,"slug":"m-j-o-nions-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/M.J.+O%27Nions+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=938+Howe+St+%23311%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6Z+1N9","website":"https://www.mjonions.com","blurb":"Family Law / Wills & Estates in Vancouver. Rated 4.8 from 74 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/m-j-o-nions-vancouver.jpg","details":{"areas":["Mediation","Family law agreements","Divorce","Business law","Wills and estates","Notary services","Estate litigation","Enduring power of attorney"],"serving":["Vancouver","British Columbia"]}}',NULL,'MJ O''Nions, now Stride Law, is a Vancouver firm practising family law, mediation, wills and estates and business law.

The firm operates as Stride Law, formerly M.J. O''Nions Lawyers & Mediators, a British Columbia practice whose areas include mediation, collaborative divorce, family law agreements, wills and estates, business law and notary services. On estates it handles litigation over unfair wills and the defence of estates against challenges, along with probate, letters of administration and flat-rate estate plans covering a will, power of attorney and advance health care directive. It does not charge for photocopying, faxing or secretarial time.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lazar-law-firm-london','Lazar Law Firm','London','ON','southwestern',0,4.6,77,42.9856912,-81.2487404,'{"name":"Lazar Law Firm","city":"London","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":42.9856912,"lng":-81.2487404,"address":"200 Queens Ave Ste 615, London, ON N6A 1J3","phone":"+15196019010","rating":4.6,"count":77,"slug":"lazar-law-firm-london","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lazar+Law+Firm+London+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=200+Queens+Ave+Ste+615%2C+London%2C+ON+N6A+1J3","website":"https://lazarlaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in London. Rated 4.6 from 77 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lazar-law-firm-london.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Bassam Lazar"}],"areas":["Real estate law","Business law","Paralegal and civil law services","Wills and estates","Family law","Landlord and tenant board matters"],"serving":["London","Windsor","Kitchener"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Lazar Law Firm is a London, Ontario firm covering real estate, business, wills and estates, family law and paralegal services.

Its real estate practice handles residential and commercial purchases and sales, mortgage refinances and private mortgages, with title searches and closing coordination. The business side covers asset and share transactions, business purchases and sales, commercial leasing, start-ups and incorporation. Wills services include single, multiple and mirror wills for couples, plus estate administration and applications for a Certificate of Appointment of Estate Trustee. Its paralegal and civil services extend to lower-value civil court matters, the Landlord and Tenant Board and Provincial Offences Court.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('slipacoff-immigration-law-ottawa','Slipacoff Immigration Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,70,45.3443125,-75.9246968,'{"name":"Slipacoff Immigration Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3443125,"lng":-75.9246968,"address":"1000 Innovation Dr Ste 500, Kanata, ON K2K 3E7","phone":"+16138638776","rating":5,"count":70,"slug":"slipacoff-immigration-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Slipacoff+Immigration+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1000+Innovation+Dr+Ste+500%2C+Kanata%2C+ON+K2K+3E7","website":"https://slipacofflaw.com","blurb":"Immigration in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 70 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/slipacoff-immigration-law-ottawa.png","details":{"areas":["Appealing refusals","Procedural fairness","Inadmissibility","Study permits","Express Entry","Spousal sponsorship","Citizenship applications","PR card renewals"]}}',NULL,'Slipacoff Immigration Law is an Ottawa-area practice handling immigration refusals, appeals, study permits, visitor visas and sponsorships.

Adam Slipacoff, a fourth-generation Canadian and Ottawa native, studied at Carleton University and Osgoode Hall Law School. The firm serves Toronto and Ottawa and represents clients challenging refusals through appeals and judicial applications to court, responds to procedural fairness letters and works on inadmissibility. Other services are Express Entry, spousal sponsorship, citizenship applications and PR card renewals. The office address is in Kanata, and the firm also provides guidance on settlement services for newcomers.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('dabros-law-ottawa','Dabros Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.9,71,45.428703,-75.6146629,'{"name":"Dabros Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.428703,"lng":-75.6146629,"address":"1900 City Park Dr suite 341, Ottawa, ON K1J 1A3","phone":"+16137149100","rating":4.9,"count":71,"slug":"dabros-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Dabros+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1900+City+Park+Dr+suite+341%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1J+1A3","website":"https://www.dabroslaw.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Ottawa. Rated 4.9 from 71 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/dabros-law-ottawa.png","bioImage":"images/bio/dabros-law-ottawa.webp","details":{"areas":["Wills and powers of attorney","Real estate","Personal injury","Probate law","Estate litigation and disputes","Estate planning"],"serving":["Ottawa","Nepean","Barrhaven","South Keys","Findlay Creek","Orleans","Greely","Manotick"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Dabros Law is a family-run Ottawa law office handling estates, wills and powers of attorney, residential real estate and personal injury.

The firm serves the greater Ottawa area, including Nepean, Barrhaven, South Keys, Findlay Creek, Orleans, Greely, Manotick and Stittsville. Founder Shane A. Dabros holds a degree from the University of Ottawa and a master''s in law from the University of Bristol, grew up in Orleans and names responsiveness as a pillar of his service. Slip and fall and car accident injuries fall under personal injury, and the firm also covers probate and estate administration as well as home purchases, sales and refinancing.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('boghossian-morais-llp-ottawa','Boghossian Morais LLP','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.9,71,45.4066621,-75.7210209,'{"name":"Boghossian Morais LLP","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4066621,"lng":-75.7210209,"address":"24 Bayswater Ave, Ottawa, ON K1Y 2E4","phone":"+18777010109","rating":4.9,"count":71,"slug":"boghossian-morais-llp-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Boghossian+Morais+LLP+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=24+Bayswater+Ave%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1Y+2E4","website":"https://bmlawyers.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Ottawa. Rated 4.9 from 71 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/boghossian-morais-llp-ottawa.png","details":{"languages":["English","French","Portuguese"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Tamar Boghossian","title":"Founding partner"}],"areas":["Immigration and refugee law","Express Entry","Family sponsorship","Business immigration","Work permits","Provincial nomination applications","Judicial review","Study permits"],"serving":["Ottawa"]}}',NULL,'Boghossian Morais LLP is an Ottawa firm whose two lawyers and support staff work exclusively in immigration and refugee law.

The firm offers services in English, French, Armenian and Brazilian Portuguese. Its work includes Express Entry applications under the Canadian Experience Class and Federal Skilled Worker and Trades programs, provincial nominee applications, visitor and study permits, business immigration, intra-company transfers, work permits, hiring temporary foreign workers and family sponsorship. A founding member of the Canadian Immigration Lawyers Association is on the team, and appointments by Skype are available for clients outside the National Capital Region.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('matthew-feehan-estate-lawyer-edmonton','Matthew Feehan Estate Lawyer','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.7,74,53.5423152,-113.5254749,'{"name":"Matthew Feehan Estate Lawyer","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5423152,"lng":-113.5254749,"address":"10160 118 St NW, Edmonton, AB T5K 1Y4","phone":"+17804246430","rating":4.7,"count":74,"slug":"matthew-feehan-estate-lawyer-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Matthew+Feehan+Estate+Lawyer+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10160+118+St+NW%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5K+1Y4","website":"https://matthewfeehan.ca","blurb":"Wills & Estates in Edmonton. Rated 4.7 from 74 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/matthew-feehan-estate-lawyer-edmonton.jpg","details":{"founded":1950,"lawyers":[{"name":"Matthew F. Feehan","title":"Lawyer"}],"areas":["Wills and estates","Probate applications","Grants of administration","Personal directive","Power of attorney","Real estate"],"serving":["Edmonton"]}}',NULL,'Matthew Feehan Estate Lawyer is an Edmonton practice dealing with wills, probate and estate administration.

F.M. (Ned) Feehan QC, Mark E. Feehan and Matthew F. Feehan are the lawyers, and the practice serves clients across Canada from offices in Alberta and British Columbia. Its guidance covers what probate is and when it is required, how applications and grants of administration work, why a person should have a will and what naming an executor involves.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('agp-llp-ottawa-criminal-lawyers-ottawa','AGP LLP Ottawa Criminal Lawyers','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.6,75,45.419433,-75.6904642,'{"name":"AGP LLP Ottawa Criminal Lawyers","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.419433,"lng":-75.6904642,"address":"116 Lisgar St Ste 200, Ottawa, ON K2P 0C2","phone":"+16132359779","rating":4.6,"count":75,"slug":"agp-llp-ottawa-criminal-lawyers-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/AGP+LLP+Ottawa+Criminal+Lawyers+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=116+Lisgar+St+Ste+200%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K2P+0C2","website":"https://www.agpllp.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Ottawa. Rated 4.6 from 75 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/agp-llp-ottawa-criminal-lawyers-ottawa.webp","heroImage":"images/hero/agp-llp-ottawa-criminal-lawyers-ottawa.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Howard Krongold"},{"name":"Michael Spratt"},{"name":"Keara Lundrigan"},{"name":"Josh Morency"},{"name":"Hanna Colbert"},{"name":"Kathleen Ferrell"}],"areas":["Appeals","Assault","Bail hearings","Domestic assaults","Drinking and driving","Drug offences","Homicide","Sexual assault","Supreme Court of Canada appeals","White collar crimes"],"serving":["Ottawa"]}}','{"1":[["08:30","17:00"]],"2":[["08:30","17:00"]],"3":[["08:30","17:00"]],"4":[["08:30","17:00"]],"5":[["08:30","17:00"]]}','AGP LLP is an Ottawa criminal defence firm of trial and appellate lawyers handling appeals, assault, drinking and driving, drug and homicide cases.

The firm was founded in Ottawa two decades ago and builds a custom-crafted defence for each client. Its practice areas include bail hearings, domestic assaults, sexual assault and white-collar matters, and it acts for executives, civil servants, doctors, pharmacists, high-tech workers, diplomats and organizations facing criminal or regulatory issues. Criminal appeals turn on finding legal errors, and the firm defends against Crown appeals from acquittal or sentence and takes referrals from other lawyers.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('gauthier-and-mines-criminal-lawyers-vancouver','Gauthier & Mines Criminal Lawyers','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.9,70,49.2876033,-123.1171306,'{"name":"Gauthier & Mines Criminal Lawyers","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2876033,"lng":-123.1171306,"address":"355 Burrard St #1550, Vancouver, BC V6C 2G8","phone":"+16046881460","rating":4.9,"count":70,"slug":"gauthier-and-mines-criminal-lawyers-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Gauthier+%26+Mines+Criminal+Lawyers+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=355+Burrard+St+%231550%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6C+2G8","website":"https://mineslaw.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Vancouver. Rated 4.9 from 70 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/gauthier-and-mines-criminal-lawyers-vancouver.png","bioImage":"images/bio/gauthier-and-mines-criminal-lawyers-vancouver.webp","details":{"founded":1993,"areas":["Assault charges","Driving charges","Drug charges","Sexual assault charges","Theft and fraud charges","Weapons charges"],"serving":["British Columbia","Vancouver"]}}',NULL,'Gauthier & Mines Criminal Lawyers is a Vancouver firm that has defended criminal charges across British Columbia since 1993.

Formerly Mines & Company, the firm includes Michael Mines, Ian Gauthier, Patrick Johnston, Courtney McLaughlin and Ishnoor Dhillon, whose practice is focused solely on criminal law, civil forfeiture and Motor Vehicle Act defence. Charges handled include assault, driving, drug, sexual assault, theft and fraud, weapons, murder and other serious offences, plus driving prohibitions and professional discipline. The firm appears in courts throughout Metro Vancouver and the rest of the province, has conducted cases in Alberta, Ontario, Quebec and the Yukon, and uses Alternative Measures programs that can end a prosecution without a criminal record.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('jeremie-john-martin-montreal','Jérémie John Martin','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.8,71,45.49602,-73.576563,'{"name":"Jérémie John Martin","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["litigation"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.49602,"lng":-73.576563,"address":"1440 Sainte-Catherine St. West #522, Montreal, Quebec H3G 1R8","phone":"+15148396014","rating":4.8,"count":71,"slug":"jeremie-john-martin-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/J%C3%A9r%C3%A9mie+John+Martin+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1440+Sainte-Catherine+St.+West+%23522%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H3G+1R8","website":"https://www.maitremartin.com","blurb":"Civil Litigation in Montreal. Rated 4.8 from 71 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/jeremie-john-martin-montreal.png","details":{"areas":["Droit familial","Droit civil"]}}',NULL,'Jérémie John Martin is a bilingual Montreal litigation lawyer who practises and pleads in both French and English.

Me Martin is originally from Quebec, now lives on the Island of Montreal and serves all judicial districts of Quebec. He favours a diplomatic approach aimed at settling files out of court, while remaining ready to plead. In 2006 he took the national inter-university debating championship Face à Face in Sherbrooke with colleague Yves Tanguay, and also earned the individual pleader''s bursary. His practice information covers his services, fees, the courthouses he serves, his partners and associates, and media appearances.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('hum-employment-law-firm-toronto','Hum Employment Law Firm','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.7,72,43.6486362,-79.3817439,'{"name":"Hum Employment Law Firm","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6486362,"lng":-79.3817439,"address":"First Canadian Place, 100 King St W Ste 5700, Toronto, ON M5H 1H1","phone":"+14162142329","rating":4.7,"count":72,"slug":"hum-employment-law-firm-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Hum+Employment+Law+Firm+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=First+Canadian+Place%2C+100+King+St+W+Ste+5700%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5H+1H1","website":"https://thehumlawfirm.ca","blurb":"Employment Law in Toronto. Rated 4.7 from 72 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/hum-employment-law-firm-toronto.webp","details":{"areas":["Employment law","Workplace investigations","Shareholder disputes","Business partnership disputes","Professional regulation"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Hum Employment Law Firm is a Toronto firm focused on workplace and employment law, human rights, investigations and mediation.

The firm practises in Ontario and Quebec, in English and French, for employers and employees and for plaintiffs and defendants. Its main office is in downtown Toronto, with additional offices in Markham, Mississauga, Richmond Hill and Scarborough and appointments also held in London, Ontario and Montreal. Services include workplace investigations, shareholder disputes, professional regulation matters and litigation, and employer guidance on contracts, policies, risk management and compliance. The firm publishes articles on topics such as constructive dismissal, medical leave and AI use in the workplace.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('z-legal-litigation-lawyer-toronto','Z Legal Litigation Lawyer','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,69,43.7000989,-79.3972723,'{"name":"Z Legal Litigation Lawyer","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Civil Litigation","Employment Law","Wills & Estates","Family Law"],"caseTypes":["litigation","employment","wills","family"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7000989,"lng":-79.3972723,"address":"1984 Yonge St, Toronto, ON M4S 1Z7","phone":"+18552337440","rating":4.9,"count":69,"slug":"z-legal-litigation-lawyer-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Z+Legal+Litigation+Lawyer+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1984+Yonge+St%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M4S+1Z7","website":"https://www.zlegal.ca","blurb":"Civil Litigation / Employment Law in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 69 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/z-legal-litigation-lawyer-toronto.png","details":{"areas":["Employment law","Commercial litigation","Estate disputes","Family law","Real estate litigation","Professional misconduct defense","Mediation"],"serving":["Toronto","Greater Toronto Area","Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Z Legal is a Toronto litigation firm handling estate, employment, commercial and family disputes and professional misconduct matters.

Founder Martin Zatovkanuk is a litigation lawyer with more than a decade of experience before all levels of Ontario courts. The firm represents clients from the outset of a matter to its end, whether it resolves by settlement, mediation, arbitration or trial. Its employment practice acts for employees and employers on wrongful dismissal, severance pay, constructive dismissal and workplace harassment across Toronto and the GTA, while the firm also covers real estate litigation and will challenges. Flat-rate and contingency fee options are available.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('muenz-criminal-law-calgary','Muenz Criminal Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,69,51.0480333,-114.0732375,'{"name":"Muenz Criminal Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0480333,"lng":-114.0732375,"address":"550 6 Ave SW #900, Calgary, AB T2P 0S2","phone":"+14035436666","rating":4.9,"count":69,"slug":"muenz-criminal-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Muenz+Criminal+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=550+6+Ave+SW+%23900%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2P+0S2","website":"https://www.rickmuenz.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 69 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/muenz-criminal-law-calgary.png","details":{"areas":["Sexual assault","Domestic assault","Drinking and driving","Drugs and trafficking","Theft and fraud","Assaults and threats","Youth crimes","Warrant checks","Bail hearings","Appeals"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}','{"1":[["08:30","21:00"]],"2":[["08:30","21:00"]],"3":[["08:30","21:00"]],"4":[["08:30","21:00"]],"5":[["08:30","21:00"]],"6":[["08:30","21:00"]],"7":[["08:30","21:00"]]}','Muenz Criminal Law is a Calgary criminal defence firm whose lead lawyer has practised exclusively in criminal law since 1992.

Rick Muenz leads the firm, and Alvin Luximon, Maria Muenz and Giuliana Di Lorenzo are also part of the team. He holds admissions in Alberta (1993) and British Columbia (2001), has worked on cases in five provinces and the Yukon, and teaches in the Advanced Criminal Law Course at the University of Calgary Faculty of Law. Charges handled include sexual assault, domestic assault, impaired driving, drug trafficking, theft and fraud, and youth offences. Staff can walk clients through the legal process in French, Spanish and Italian, and the firm works with The Pardon Group on record suspensions, U.S. entry waivers and digital fingerprinting.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('frouhar-law-ottawa','Frouhar Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.7,71,45.4179029,-75.6961238,'{"name":"Frouhar Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4179029,"lng":-75.6961238,"address":"190 O''Connor St Ste 700, Ottawa, ON K2P 1T6","phone":"+16132382000","rating":4.7,"count":71,"slug":"frouhar-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Frouhar+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=190+O%27Connor+St+Ste+700%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K2P+1T6","website":"https://www.frouharlaw.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Ottawa. Rated 4.7 from 71 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/frouhar-law-ottawa.png","details":{"languages":["English","French","Farsi"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Mash Frouhar"},{"name":"Connie D’Angelo"}],"areas":["Assault charges","DUI and impaired driving","Drug charges","Sexual assault","Homicide and murder","Manslaughter","Fraud and white collar crime","Firearms and weapons offences","Property crime and theft","Robbery and extortion"],"serving":["Ottawa","Brockville","Eastern Ontario"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Frouhar Law is an Ottawa criminal defence firm defending assault, impaired driving, drug, sexual assault, homicide and fraud charges.

The firm serves Ottawa, Brockville and Eastern Ontario and maintains an emergency line available around the clock. Mash Frouhar was admitted to the Ontario Bar in 2009, previously worked as an Assistant Crown Attorney and as a defence lawyer with Legal Aid Ontario, and offers services in English, French and Farsi. Connie D''Angelo was admitted in 1993 and has practised only criminal law, including representing police officers before the Special Investigations Unit and at Police Services Act hearings. Micaela Rodriguez is also on the team.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('wvgb-personal-injury-lawyers-ottawa','WVGB Personal Injury Lawyers','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.9,67,45.3634125,-75.7875245,'{"name":"WVGB Personal Injury Lawyers","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3634125,"lng":-75.7875245,"address":"2571 Carling Ave #200, Ottawa, ON K2B 7H7","phone":"+16135055025","rating":4.9,"count":67,"slug":"wvgb-personal-injury-lawyers-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/WVGB+Personal+Injury+Lawyers+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2571+Carling+Ave+%23200%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K2B+7H7","website":"https://www.wvglaw.com","blurb":"Personal Injury in Ottawa. Rated 4.9 from 67 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/wvgb-personal-injury-lawyers-ottawa.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Bianca Bielecki"},{"name":"Charles Genest"},{"name":"Justin A. Villeneuve"},{"name":"J.A. Michael Wolfe"},{"name":"William C. Wolfe"}],"areas":["Car accidents","Slip and falls","Brain injuries","Dog bites","Burn injuries","Truck accidents","Motorcycle accidents","Long-term disability claims","Medical malpractice","Wrongful death"],"serving":["Ottawa"]}}',NULL,'WVGB Personal Injury Lawyers is an Ottawa firm acting for people hurt in car crashes, falls, brain injuries and other accidents.

WVGB Law Group was established in 2021 through a partnership between Villeneuve Litigation P.C. and Wolfe Lawyers P.C., and serves English and French speaking communities in Ottawa and the Ottawa Valley. Clients work directly with a partner who oversees the case personally. Practice areas cover car accidents, slip and trip and falls, brain injuries, animal attacks and rideshare and taxi accidents, along with wills and estates, and the time limits that apply to injury cases are explained.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('hammer-injury-law-edmonton','Hammer Injury Law','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,5,65,53.5411321,-113.5135157,'{"name":"Hammer Injury Law","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5411321,"lng":-113.5135157,"address":"11150 Jasper Ave #355, Edmonton, AB T5K 0C7","phone":"+15874054092","rating":5,"count":65,"slug":"hammer-injury-law-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Hammer+Injury+Law+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=11150+Jasper+Ave+%23355%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5K+0C7","website":"https://www.hammerinjurylaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Edmonton. Rated 5.0 from 65 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/hammer-injury-law-edmonton.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Rick Mallett"}],"areas":["Motorcycle accidents","Spinal cord injury","Brain injury","Wrongful death","Class actions","Serious injury and fatality claims"],"serving":["Alberta","Northwest Territories","Yukon"]}}',NULL,'Hammer Injury Law is an Edmonton personal injury firm focused on motor vehicle accident injuries, serious injury and wrongful death.

Richard J. Mallett graduated from the University of Alberta in 1989, was admitted to the Alberta Bar in 1990 and spent his first ten years in insurance defence and corporate law before acting exclusively for injured people from 1999. He established the firm in 2023 and has appeared in Alberta courts, the Supreme Courts of the Northwest Territories and the Yukon, the CPP Appeal Tribunal and the WCB Appeals Commission. The firm serves Alberta, British Columbia, the Yukon and the Northwest Territories, and it also handles class actions.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lambert-law-victoria','Lambert Law','Victoria','BC','bc-victoria',0,4.6,70,48.4693634,-123.3623087,'{"name":"Lambert Law","city":"Victoria","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"bc-victoria","province":"BC","lat":48.4693634,"lng":-123.3623087,"address":"1095 McKenzie Ave, Victoria, BC V8P 2L5","phone":"+12505887679","rating":4.6,"count":70,"slug":"lambert-law-victoria","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lambert+Law+Victoria+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1095+McKenzie+Ave%2C+Victoria%2C+BC+V8P+2L5","website":"https://lambertlaw.com","blurb":"Personal Injury in Victoria. Rated 4.6 from 70 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lambert-law-victoria.png","details":{"areas":["Personal injury","Motor vehicle CRT claims","Medical malpractice","General litigation"],"serving":["Victoria"]}}',NULL,'Lambert Law is a Victoria firm handling personal injury, medical malpractice, motor vehicle tribunal matters and general litigation.

Rory Lambert and his legal team have represented members of the Victoria community for more than 30 years. On medical malpractice, the firm works with doctors, nurses and other medical professionals who assess a case before a decision to sue, and litigation against medical professionals can be costly and take several years. In British Columbia a general two-year limitation period applies, measured from the last date of the treatment alleged to be negligent.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('nanda-family-and-divorce-lawyers-mississauga','Nanda Family and Divorce Lawyers','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,64,43.5964038,-79.6369796,'{"name":"Nanda Family and Divorce Lawyers","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5964038,"lng":-79.6369796,"address":"2 Robert Speck Pkwy Suite 750, Mississauga, ON L4Z 1H8","phone":"+18666606640","rating":5,"count":64,"slug":"nanda-family-and-divorce-lawyers-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Nanda+Family+and+Divorce+Lawyers+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2+Robert+Speck+Pkwy+Suite+750%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L4Z+1H8","website":"https://familylawyersmississauga.com","blurb":"Family Law in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 64 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/nanda-family-and-divorce-lawyers-mississauga.png","heroImage":"images/hero/nanda-family-and-divorce-lawyers-mississauga.webp","details":{"founded":2003,"areas":["Family and divorce law","Child support and section 7 expenses","Property, asset division and equalization","Child arrangement orders","Special guardianship order","Corporate law"],"serving":["Mississauga"]}}',NULL,'Nanda Family and Divorce Lawyers is a Mississauga firm handling divorce, child custody, child support and financial issues after separation.

The family law team guides clients through the legal steps of ending a marriage, sets up child arrangement orders on where children live and how decisions about their upbringing are made, and addresses financial adjustments after separation. Its Mississauga family lawyers aim for fair resolutions and keep the well-being of children in focus. The office is on Robert Speck Parkway.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('dhasi-law-family-lawyer-brampton-brampton','Dhasi Law Family Lawyer Brampton','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,4.9,65,43.7999386,-79.7489725,'{"name":"Dhasi Law Family Lawyer Brampton","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.7999386,"lng":-79.7489725,"address":"6475 Mayfield Rd Unit 206, Brampton, ON L6P 4N2","phone":"+16475096952","rating":4.9,"count":65,"slug":"dhasi-law-family-lawyer-brampton-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Dhasi+Law+Family+Lawyer+Brampton+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=6475+Mayfield+Rd+Unit+206%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6P+4N2","website":"https://www.dhasilaw.com","blurb":"Family Law in Brampton. Rated 4.9 from 65 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/dhasi-law-family-lawyer-brampton-brampton.webp","details":{"areas":["Personal injury","Immigration law","Criminal law"],"serving":["Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Dhasi Law is a Brampton firm serving Ontario clients in personal injury, immigration, criminal law, civil litigation, estates and real estate.

Practice areas are personal injury, immigration, criminal law, civil litigation, notary public, wills, estates and trusts, real estate, corporate law and family law. For injuries caused by negligence, the firm pursues compensation for medical expenses and lost income. Immigration work covers applications, permits and sponsorships for individuals and families, and the criminal practice supports clients facing charges through the court process. The office is on Mayfield Road in Brampton.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lt-lawyers-llp-calgary','LT Lawyers LLP','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,5,63,51.0480395,-114.0754341,'{"name":"LT Lawyers LLP","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["injury","litigation"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0480395,"lng":-114.0754341,"address":"630 6 Ave SW #750, Calgary, AB T2P 0S8","phone":"+14034838888","rating":5,"count":63,"slug":"lt-lawyers-llp-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/LT+Lawyers+LLP+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=630+6+Ave+SW+%23750%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2P+0S8","website":"https://ltlawyers.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury / Civil Litigation in Calgary. Rated 5.0 from 63 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lt-lawyers-llp-calgary.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Ryan Lee"},{"name":"Peter Trieu"},{"name":"Daniel Gelb"},{"name":"Faye Gelb"},{"name":"Bridget Belsher"}],"areas":["Personal injury","Long-term disability"],"serving":["Alberta"]}}',NULL,'LT Lawyers LLP is a Calgary boutique firm representing injured people and those denied long-term disability benefits in Alberta and British Columbia.

Co-founders Ryan Lee and Peter Trieu lead the firm; Lee previously acted for insurance companies in personal injury cases and has appeared before the Alberta Court of King''s Bench and the Supreme Court of British Columbia. Two of its lawyers are former criminal prosecutors, and Daniel Gelb, Faye Gelb and Bridget Belsher are also on the team. Matters include car crashes, injuries caused by negligence and long-term disability denials and terminations, with strategies ranging from settlement to trial.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('nanuq-law-victoria','Nanuq Law','Victoria','BC','bc-victoria',0,5,62,48.463826,-123.4042573,'{"name":"Nanuq Law","city":"Victoria","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Wills & Estates","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["injury","wills","litigation"],"region":"bc-victoria","province":"BC","lat":48.463826,"lng":-123.4042573,"address":"359 Marigold Rd, Victoria, BC V8Z 4R1","phone":"+17784335297","rating":5,"count":62,"slug":"nanuq-law-victoria","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Nanuq+Law+Victoria+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=359+Marigold+Rd%2C+Victoria%2C+BC+V8Z+4R1","website":"https://www.nanuqlaw.com","blurb":"Personal Injury / Wills & Estates in Victoria. Rated 5.0 from 62 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/nanuq-law-victoria.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Marlisa H. Martin"}],"areas":["Motor vehicle accidents","Real estate law","Personal injury","Medical malpractice","Slip and fall injury","Wills and power of attorney","Injury at work","Pedestrian and bike injury","Estate litigation","Employment law"],"serving":["Victoria","British Columbia"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Nanuq Law is a Victoria boutique firm handling personal injury, employment law and estate litigation, with real estate and wills also offered.

The firm dates to 2011 and takes its name from Nanuq, the master of the polar bears, comparing the animal''s strength to its own approach. Marlisa H. Martin is one of its lawyers. Practice areas include motor vehicle accidents, slip and fall injuries, medical malpractice, injuries at work, pedestrian and bicycle injuries, estate litigation, real estate purchases and leases, and wills and power of attorney. Motor vehicle accident work is taken on a contingency fee basis.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('charney-legal-toronto','Charney Legal','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,63,43.6879948,-79.4124285,'{"name":"Charney Legal","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6879948,"lng":-79.4124285,"address":"383 Spadina Rd Suite 200, Toronto, ON M6C 1A7","phone":"+16475502918","rating":4.9,"count":63,"slug":"charney-legal-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Charney+Legal+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=383+Spadina+Rd+Suite+200%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M6C+1A7","website":"https://charneylegal.ca","blurb":"Wills & Estates in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 63 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/charney-legal-toronto.png","details":{"areas":["Real estate","Estate administration","Business law","Estate planning"],"serving":["GTA","Ontario"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Charney Legal is a Toronto remote law firm handling wills, estates, probate and real estate matters for clients across Ontario.

Charney Legal Professional Corporation works online and uses technology to serve Ontario and clients elsewhere, and it also offers online or in-person mediation for family and estate disputes. Its estate services include tailored estate plans and advice to trustees, executors and beneficiaries on administering an estate and obtaining Certificates of Appointment of Estate Trustee, with or without a will. Real estate work includes mortgage refinances. The office address is on Spadina Road in Toronto.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('mikhael-avocat-inc-montreal','Mikhael Avocat Inc.','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.9,63,45.503694,-73.5574091,'{"name":"Mikhael Avocat Inc.","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.503694,"lng":-73.5574091,"address":"204 R. Notre Dame O #300, Montreal, Quebec H2Y 1T3","phone":"+15144271414","rating":4.9,"count":63,"slug":"mikhael-avocat-inc-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mikhael+Avocat+Inc.+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=204+R.+Notre+Dame+O+%23300%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H2Y+1T3","website":"https://mikhaelavocat.com","blurb":"Family Law in Montreal. Rated 4.9 from 63 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/mikhael-avocat-inc-montreal.png","details":{"languages":["Arabic","Spanish","Turkish","Punjabi","Hindi"],"areas":["Immigration","Joint divorce","Family sponsorship","Temporary visa","Refugees and asylum seekers","Denials and appeals","Permanent immigration","Canadian citizenship"],"serving":["Montreal","Outaouais"]}}',NULL,'Mikhael Avocat is a Montreal law firm handling immigration and joint divorce matters, with offices in Montreal and Outaouais.

The firm was founded by Me Marianne Mikhael, who holds a Licentiate in Law from the University of Ottawa, has been a member of the Québec Bar since 2020 and belongs to the Québec Association of Immigration Lawyers and the Canadian Association of Refugee Lawyers. The firm helps individuals and families with Canadian immigration matters, handles joint divorces by encouraging open dialogue between spouses, and offers translation services to overcome language barriers. Business law and the Gatineau area are also part of its work.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('whitestone-law-ottawa','Whitestone Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,61,45.4276094,-75.6767084,'{"name":"Whitestone Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills","business"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4276094,"lng":-75.6767084,"address":"5 Ave Blackburn, Ottawa, ON K1N 8A2","phone":"+16136511865","rating":5,"count":61,"slug":"whitestone-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Whitestone+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=5+Ave+Blackburn%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1N+8A2","website":"https://whitestonelaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 61 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/whitestone-law-ottawa.png","details":{"areas":["Corporate and commercial law","Real estate transactions","Estate planning"],"serving":["Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Whitestone Law is an Ottawa firm providing corporate and commercial law, real estate transactions and estate planning for clients across Ontario.

The firm acts for businesses, individuals and families, and clients work directly with their lawyer for continuity and clear communication. Corporate work covers mergers and acquisitions, incorporations, restructuring, contract drafting and regulatory compliance, with ongoing advisory and general counsel services available. Real estate files include buying, selling and refinancing, and estate planning centres on wills and inheritance planning. Costs are explained before work starts, and every lawyer on the team is licensed in Ontario.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('malina-a-roshan-mississauga','Malina A. Roshan','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.9,62,43.6794609,-79.670997,'{"name":"Malina A. Roshan","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6794609,"lng":-79.670997,"address":"7895 Tranmere Dr Ste 21, Mississauga, ON L5S 1V9","phone":"+14168346428","rating":4.9,"count":62,"slug":"malina-a-roshan-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Malina+A.+Roshan+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=7895+Tranmere+Dr+Ste+21%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5S+1V9","website":"https://www.roshanlaw.com","blurb":"Family Law in Mississauga. Rated 4.9 from 62 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/malina-a-roshan-mississauga.webp","details":{"founded":2010,"lawyers":[{"name":"Malina A. Roshan"}],"areas":["Family law","Criminal law","Wills and notary","Marriage (pre-nuptial) agreements"],"serving":["Mississauga"]}}',NULL,'Malina Roshan runs Roshan Law, a Mississauga practice handling family and divorce law as well as criminal defence matters.

Malina Roshan founded the firm in 2010 and has more than 15 years as a family and criminal lawyer, regularly appearing in the Superior Court of Justice. The firm serves the Greater Toronto Area and communities including Brampton, Etobicoke, North York, Hamilton, Milton, Guelph, Kitchener, Waterloo, Vaughan, Newmarket, Oakville, Burlington, Oshawa and Orangeville. It offers clear pricing, regular updates on the file and a process that starts with booking a meeting.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('hergott-law-kelowna','Hergott Law','Kelowna','BC','bc-okanagan',0,4.8,63,49.8894754,-119.4933656,'{"name":"Hergott Law","city":"Kelowna","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"bc-okanagan","province":"BC","lat":49.8894754,"lng":-119.4933656,"address":"1385 Ellis St, Kelowna, BC V1Y 1Z9","phone":"+18554374688","rating":4.8,"count":63,"slug":"hergott-law-kelowna","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Hergott+Law+Kelowna+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1385+Ellis+St%2C+Kelowna%2C+BC+V1Y+1Z9","website":"https://www.hlaw.ca","blurb":"Wills & Estates in Kelowna. Rated 4.8 from 63 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/hergott-law-kelowna.webp","details":{"founded":2007,"lawyers":[{"name":"Paul Hergott"}],"areas":["Estate planning","Estate administration","Executor services"],"serving":["Kelowna","West Kelowna","Okanagan"]}}',NULL,'Hergott Law is a Kelowna boutique firm focused on estate planning and estate administration, including probate and executor support.

Paul Hergott leads the firm, which he and his wife Terri opened in 2007 to serve Kelowna and West Kelowna; Terri provides administrative support, making it a team of two. Paul moved from litigation and defending injured people''s rights to practising exclusively in estate administration. Services include obtaining probate or letters of administration, supporting executors, seeking compensation for executors'' work and will curing. The firm also advises on wills, powers of attorney and representation agreements, and has served the Okanagan since 1995.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('just-done-law-office-toronto','Just Done Law Office','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.8,62,43.659124,-79.383546,'{"name":"Just Done Law Office","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.659124,"lng":-79.383546,"address":"386 Yonge St #1006, Toronto, ON M5B 1N9","phone":"+16477812288","rating":4.8,"count":62,"slug":"just-done-law-office-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Just+Done+Law+Office+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=386+Yonge+St+%231006%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5B+1N9","website":"https://www.justdonelaw.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Toronto. Rated 4.8 from 62 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/just-done-law-office-toronto.png","details":{"languages":["Spanish","French","Mandarin","English"],"areas":["Buying a home","Selling a home","Title transfer","Mortgage refinance","Independent legal advice"]}}',NULL,'Just Done Law Office is a Toronto firm focused on real estate transactions including home purchases, sales, title transfers and mortgage refinances.

Principal lawyer Julian Prieto practises real estate transactions and real estate litigation, has overseen more than $300 million in transaction volume and holds a JD from McGill University. He has represented clients at the Superior Court of Ontario and administrative tribunals. The service can be completed remotely, and its steps include examining the agreement of purchase and sale and status certificates, checking title for liens and mortgages, advising on land transfer tax and arranging title insurance. Fixed prices are published for each service.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('jeffrey-r-horricks-law-corporation-vancouver','Jeffrey R. Horricks Law Corporation','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,5,59,49.2805947,-123.1174441,'{"name":"Jeffrey R. Horricks Law Corporation","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2805947,"lng":-123.1174441,"address":"777 Richards St Suite 602, Vancouver, BC V6B 0M6","phone":"+16043053152","rating":5,"count":59,"slug":"jeffrey-r-horricks-law-corporation-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Jeffrey+R.+Horricks+Law+Corporation+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=777+Richards+St+Suite+602%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6B+0M6","website":"https://horrickslaw.net","blurb":"Wills & Estates in Vancouver. Rated 5.0 from 59 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/jeffrey-r-horricks-law-corporation-vancouver.png","heroImage":"images/hero/jeffrey-r-horricks-law-corporation-vancouver.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Jeffrey Horricks"}],"areas":["Real estate law","General corporate law","Commercial lease drafting and negotiation","Real estate development and financing","Incorporation and corporate structuring","Mergers and acquisitions","Shareholder agreements and partnership contracts","Corporate reorganizations and asset transfers"],"serving":["Vancouver","British Columbia"]}}',NULL,'Jeffrey Horricks Law Corporation is a Vancouver practice handling real estate, corporate and estate law.

Jeffrey Horricks was born and raised in Vancouver, studied at the University of Victoria and earned his Juris Doctor from Bond University in Australia. After returning in 2012 he worked at a corporate and securities firm and then at a boutique criminal law practice, and he established Horricks Law in 2014. The firm serves individuals, families and businesses across Vancouver and the Lower Mainland, with real estate work covering strata properties, mortgages and financing, and development and investment deals. Clients speak directly with the lawyer, and flat-fee options are offered.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('bin-xia-zhang-montreal','Bin Xia Zhang','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,5,58,45.5027367,-73.5572834,'{"name":"Bin Xia Zhang","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.5027367,"lng":-73.5572834,"address":"465 Rue Saint-Jean bureau 603, Montreal, Quebec H2Y 2R6","phone":"+15146329386","rating":5,"count":58,"slug":"bin-xia-zhang-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Bin+Xia+Zhang+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=465+Rue+Saint-Jean+bureau+603%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H2Y+2R6","website":"https://www.quebecvisa.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Montreal. Rated 5.0 from 58 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/bin-xia-zhang-montreal.png","details":{"founded":2016,"languages":["French","English"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Bin Xia Zhang"}],"areas":["Temporary residence","Permanent residence","Canadian citizenship","Quebec acceptance certificate","Quebec selection certificate"]}}',NULL,'Bin Xia Zhang is a Montreal immigration lawyer who helps international students and temporary foreign workers seek permanent residence.

The practice has run since 2016 and works mainly on temporary residence, permanent residence and Canadian citizenship applications. Bin Xia Zhang immigrated to Canada from China at age 9, and later worked in a college''s international students department helping with temporary residence applications. The practice assesses eligibility, plans a route to permanent residence where a client is eligible, guides clients toward eligibility where not, and helps prepare and assemble applications. It works in English and French, and the office is on rue Saint-Jean.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('vml-family-law-llp-calgary','VML Family Law LLP','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.8,60,51.0309152,-114.0710267,'{"name":"VML Family Law LLP","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0309152,"lng":-114.0710267,"address":"2424 4 St SW #1030, Calgary, AB T2S 0L4","phone":"+15873581211","rating":4.8,"count":60,"slug":"vml-family-law-llp-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/VML+Family+Law+LLP+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2424+4+St+SW+%231030%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2S+0L4","website":"https://vmlfamilylaw.com","blurb":"Family Law in Calgary. Rated 4.8 from 60 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/vml-family-law-llp-calgary.webp"}',NULL,'VML Family Law LLP is a Calgary family law firm offering divorce, custody, child support, mediation, arbitration and litigation services.

The team includes mediators, arbitrators, parenting coordinators and litigators. Services also include asset and debt separation, adoption, child abduction law, prenuptial agreements, legal coaching and the preparation of agreements and legal documents. Emily Varga is a co-founding partner, and the team also includes Holly McCord Lonseth, Suman Parmar, Tanisha Smith, Anne Marie Harrison, Danijela Radinovic, Caleigh Hunt, Hannah Grant and Kamiko Bosch. The firm takes a compassionate approach to emotionally charged family matters and has an office on 4 Street SW.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('berard-avocats-montreal','Bérard Avocats','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.7,61,45.5302654,-73.6080076,'{"name":"Bérard Avocats","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Civil Litigation","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["realestate","litigation","business"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.5302654,"lng":-73.6080076,"address":"6413 Boul. Saint-Laurent, Montréal, QC H2S 3C3","phone":"+14383751132","rating":4.7,"count":61,"slug":"berard-avocats-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/B%C3%A9rard+Avocats+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=6413+Boul.+Saint-Laurent%2C+Montr%C3%A9al%2C+QC+H2S+3C3","website":"https://berardavocats.com","blurb":"Real Estate / Civil Litigation in Montreal. Rated 4.7 from 61 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/berard-avocats-montreal.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Me Julien Bérard"}],"areas":["Droit civil","Droit immobilier","Droit de la construction","Droit commercial","Litige civil et commercial"]}}',NULL,'Bérard Avocats is a Montreal firm handling civil, commercial, real estate and construction law disputes, established in the city in 2016.

Commercial disputes it handles include unpaid invoices and debts, missed deliveries by suppliers, difficulties with commercial leases and whether to incorporate, and early legal advice can reduce the impact of such problems on a business. Its practice areas are civil law, real estate law, construction law and commercial law, and it supports clients from diagnosis through to resolution of a file. The firm also maintains a YouTube channel, and Me Bérard is the lawyer named.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('j-kalirai-law-firm-mississauga','J. Kalirai Law Firm','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.8,59,43.5912644,-79.636863,'{"name":"J. Kalirai Law Firm","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5912644,"lng":-79.636863,"address":"90 Burnhamthorpe Rd W #1400, Mississauga, ON L5B 3C3","phone":"+14372481234","rating":4.8,"count":59,"slug":"j-kalirai-law-firm-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/J.+Kalirai+Law+Firm+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=90+Burnhamthorpe+Rd+W+%231400%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5B+3C3","website":"https://www.yourcriminallawyer.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Mississauga. Rated 4.8 from 59 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/j-kalirai-law-firm-mississauga.png","details":{"areas":["Assault and related charges","Drug offences","Driving related offences","Criminal harassment","Criminal negligence","Firearm and weapons offences","Robbery and theft offences","Sexual assault related offences","Utter threats","Traffic tickets"]}}',NULL,'Kalirai Law Firm is a Mississauga criminal defence firm covering drug, driving, assault and other offences, founded by lawyer Jeevan Kalirai.

The firm handles arson, assault and related charges, drug offences under the Controlled Drugs and Substances Act and the Cannabis Act, impaired and dangerous driving, driving while disqualified, criminal harassment and criminal negligence causing death. Jeevan Kalirai holds an LL.B. (Honours) and a B.A. in Biomedical Sciences (Honours). The firm works at every level of court and offers flat fee pricing and flexible payment plans. The office is on Burnhamthorpe Road West.','dynamic','live',NULL);
