Owner Jeremy Newton obtained his law degree in 2011, worked first as a generalist, and then spent more than ten years as a Federal Prosecutor on cases across Alberta, where he also trained police and correctional officers. He took a case to the Supreme Court of Canada, and his father was a criminal defence lawyer. Bulwark Law has offices in Calgary and Airdrie.','dynamic','live',NULL);
