The firm has more than 25 legal professionals and five offices across Simcoe County, in Barrie, Elmvale, Midland, Orillia and Penetanguishene, and it can also serve clients remotely. The Barrie office is at 190 Cundles Road East. The firm publishes articles on topics such as Ontario land transfer tax, failure to complete a real estate transaction and spousal sponsorship.','dynamic','live',NULL);
