The firm stresses timely communication, transparency and a client-responsive way of working, and it is a modern firm that makes use of technology. It regularly meets with clients over audio-visual platforms such as Zoom. The office is at 238 Elm Street, Unit 200, in Greater Sudbury, Ontario, and the firm serves individual and business clients with a general practice.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('de-bakker-law-thunder-bay','de Bakker Law','Thunder Bay','ON','northern',0,4.6,49,48.430023,-89.230954,'{"name":"de Bakker Law","city":"Thunder Bay","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"northern","province":"ON","lat":48.430023,"lng":-89.230954,"address":"217 Algoma St S, Thunder Bay, ON P7B 3C3","phone":"+18073452356","rating":4.6,"count":49,"slug":"de-bakker-law-thunder-bay","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/de+Bakker+Law+Thunder+Bay+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=217+Algoma+St+S%2C+Thunder+Bay%2C+ON+P7B+3C3","website":"https://www.debakkerlaw.ca","blurb":"Law firm in Thunder Bay. Rated 4.6 from 49 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/de-bakker-law-thunder-bay.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Jessica Macaulay"}],"areas":["Real estate","Wills and estates","Criminal law","Civil litigation","Corporate law","Medical malpractice","Immigration law"],"serving":["Thunder Bay","Kenora","Dryden","Ignace","Sioux Lookout","Atikokan","Nipigon","Fort Frances"]}}',NULL,'de Bakker Law is a Thunder Bay firm handling real estate, wills and estates, criminal, civil litigation, corporate and immigration matters.

The practice has represented Thunder Bay for over 40 years, and its services also include medical malpractice. Deborah de Bakker practises wills, estates and real estate alongside her son. She is a lifelong Thunder Bay resident with a B.A. from Queen''s University and an LL.B. from Osgoode Hall Law School, a member of the Law Society of Ontario and the Thunder Bay Law Association, and a past member of the federal Judicial Appointments Advisory Committee. The team also includes Vlad Popescu, Jennifer Hay, Jessica Macaulay and Carly Deboni.','dynamic','live',NULL);
