The team helps drivers keep their demerit points and their licence when a ticket is contested, including tickets issued in Montreal. The firm also runs an immigration practice that pairs Me Charlis Bakleh with regulated immigration consultant Joseph Zakhour for study permits, work visas, permanent residence and status regularization, in Quebec, Ontario or remotely. Real estate law is among its practice areas, and the firm works in French.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('fazio-law-sarnia','Fazio Law','Sarnia','ON','southwestern',0,4.8,44,42.9847142,-82.3999695,'{"name":"Fazio Law","city":"Sarnia","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":42.9847142,"lng":-82.3999695,"address":"568 Christina St N, Sarnia, ON N7T 7X6","phone":"+15193440777","rating":4.8,"count":44,"slug":"fazio-law-sarnia","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Fazio+Law+Sarnia+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=568+Christina+St+N%2C+Sarnia%2C+ON+N7T+7X6","website":"https://faziolaw.net","blurb":"Law firm in Sarnia. Rated 4.8 from 44 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/fazio-law-sarnia.jpg","details":{"founded":1988,"areas":["Real estate","Wills and powers of attorney","Estate planning and administration","Corporate and commercial law","Land development","Municipal law"],"serving":["Sarnia"]}}',NULL,'Fazio Law is a Sarnia firm that has handled real estate, business and estate matters since 1988 for individuals, families, charities and companies.

The practice serves Sarnia and the surrounding area, from small businesses to large corporations, and covers estate planning, real estate transactions and corporate law. Frank Fazio was admitted to the Ontario bar in 1988 and has more than 37 years in practice. He has served on boards in Sarnia-Lambton, including the YMCA, the Downtown Business Improvement Area, the Lung Association and the real estate section of the Lambton Law Association, and the aim is to explain legal dealings in everyday English.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('simeson-law-oshawa','Simeson Law','Oshawa','ON','york-durham',0,4.8,42,43.8998278,-78.8599287,'{"name":"Simeson Law","city":"Oshawa","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"york-durham","province":"ON","lat":43.8998278,"lng":-78.8599287,"address":"100 Bond St E, Oshawa, ON L1G 0B7","phone":"+19055795302","rating":4.8,"count":42,"slug":"simeson-law-oshawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Simeson+Law+Oshawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=100+Bond+St+E%2C+Oshawa%2C+ON+L1G+0B7","website":"https://www.kslawfirm.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Oshawa. Rated 4.8 from 42 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/simeson-law-oshawa.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Alastair H. Simeson","title":"Partner"},{"name":"Sean M. Simeson","title":"Associate Lawyer"}],"areas":["Personal injury law","Criminal defence","Employment law","Car accidents","Catastrophic injuries","Slip and fall","Wrongful death","Long-term disability","Accident benefit claims","Life insurance claims"],"serving":["Oshawa"]}}',NULL,'Simeson Law LLP is an Oshawa firm handling personal injury, criminal defence, family and employment law matters.

The firm has acted for accident victims for over 35 years, in matters such as car, bicycle and boating accidents, brain injuries, catastrophic injury, slip and falls, animal attacks, medical malpractice, product liability, accident benefits, and disability, life and property insurance disputes. Its criminal practice covers Criminal Code, provincial and Highway Traffic Act offences, and employment work addresses wrongful dismissal. Alastair H. Simeson is the partner in charge of litigation and a former president of the Oshawa Chamber of Commerce, and Sean M. Simeson is an associate lawyer.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('blfon-personal-injury-lawyer-north-bay','BLFON Personal Injury Lawyer','North Bay','ON','northern',0,5,38,46.308148,-79.459869,'{"name":"BLFON Personal Injury Lawyer","city":"North Bay","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"northern","province":"ON","lat":46.308148,"lng":-79.459869,"address":"437 Sherbrooke St, North Bay, ON P1B 2C2","phone":"+18005960743","rating":5,"count":38,"slug":"blfon-personal-injury-lawyer-north-bay","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/BLFON+Personal+Injury+Lawyer+North+Bay+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=437+Sherbrooke+St%2C+North+Bay%2C+ON+P1B+2C2","website":"https://blfonlaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in North Bay. Rated 5.0 from 38 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/blfon-personal-injury-lawyer-north-bay.png","details":{"areas":["Car accidents","Orthopaedic injuries","Slip and fall accidents","Motorcycle accidents","Public transit accidents","Pedestrian accidents","Dog bite incidents","Brain and spinal cord injuries","Personal injury"],"serving":["Sarnia","North Bay","Collingwood"]}}',NULL,'BLFON Personal Injury Lawyer is a North Bay firm handling car accidents, slip and falls and other injury cases in Ontario.

The firm has offices in Sarnia, North Bay and Collingwood and is a member of Barapp Law Alliance. Practice areas include car accidents, orthopaedic injuries, slip and fall accidents, motorcycle accidents, public transit accidents and pedestrian accidents. It acts on a contingency fee basis, so clients pay legal fees only if the case succeeds. Its lawyers include Eric Barapp, Lorne Weinstock, Eti Taylor, Nabeel Sera, Michael Brill and Albert Wong.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('fallow-gould-llp-kingston','Fallow Gould LLP','Kingston','ON','eastern',0,5,37,44.242067,-76.480842,'{"name":"Fallow Gould LLP","city":"Kingston","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["wills","litigation"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":44.242067,"lng":-76.480842,"address":"The Woolen Mill, 4 Cataraqui St #114, Kingston, ON K7K 1Z7","phone":"+16137660200","rating":5,"count":37,"slug":"fallow-gould-llp-kingston","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Fallow+Gould+LLP+Kingston+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=The+Woolen+Mill%2C+4+Cataraqui+St+%23114%2C+Kingston%2C+ON+K7K+1Z7","website":"https://www.fallowgould.ca","blurb":"Wills & Estates / Civil Litigation in Kingston. Rated 5.0 from 37 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/fallow-gould-llp-kingston.png"}',NULL,'Fallow Gould LLP is a Kingston firm offering estate planning, estate administration, beneficiary guidance and estate litigation.

The work is bespoke and carried out with discretion and precision, with the aim that a client''s legacy endures for generations. The firm''s practice areas are wills and estates and civil litigation, and it operates from The Woolen Mill at 4 Cataraqui Street in Kingston, Ontario. Estate planning, administration, guidance for beneficiaries and estate litigation make up the core of its work.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('osborne-law-group-st-catharines','Osborne Law Group','St. Catharines','ON','hamilton-niagara',0,4.8,36,43.1586812,-79.2413373,'{"name":"Osborne Law Group","city":"St. Catharines","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"hamilton-niagara","province":"ON","lat":43.1586812,"lng":-79.2413373,"address":"5 Race St, St. Catharines, ON L2R 3M1","phone":"+19056889352","rating":4.8,"count":36,"slug":"osborne-law-group-st-catharines","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Osborne+Law+Group+St.+Catharines+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=5+Race+St%2C+St.+Catharines%2C+ON+L2R+3M1","website":"https://www.osbornelaw.ca","blurb":"Wills & Estates in St. Catharines. Rated 4.8 from 36 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/osborne-law-group-st-catharines.png","details":{"areas":["Probate","Real estate law","Wills and estate planning","Corporate law","Commercial real estate","Condominium purchases and sales","Private sales and private mortgages","Refinancing and mortgage work","Title transfers"],"serving":["St. Catharines","Niagara Region"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Osborne Law Group focuses on Ontario probate applications, estate administration and wills, alongside real estate and corporate law, for Niagara residents.

Based at 5 Race Street in St. Catharines, the firm has over 17 years of practice and has served more than 3,500 clients across its practice areas. Its work covers Certificates of Appointment of Estate Trustee with and without a will, Small Estate Certificates for estates under $150,000, and the situations where a bank, investment firm or purchaser may ask for probate. Stephen Osborne is its probate and estate lawyer, and fixed-fee options exist for eligible probate applications.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ain-whitehead-llp-barrie','Ain Whitehead LLP','Barrie','ON','simcoe-central',0,4.7,36,44.390831,-79.6898911,'{"name":"Ain Whitehead LLP","city":"Barrie","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"simcoe-central","province":"ON","lat":44.390831,"lng":-79.6898911,"address":"27 Clapperton St, Barrie, ON L4M 3E6","phone":"+17057258171","rating":4.7,"count":36,"slug":"ain-whitehead-llp-barrie","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Ain+Whitehead+LLP+Barrie+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=27+Clapperton+St%2C+Barrie%2C+ON+L4M+3E6","website":"https://www.ainwhitehead.com","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Barrie. Rated 4.7 from 36 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ain-whitehead-llp-barrie.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Andrew Ain"},{"name":"Kathryn Whitehead"},{"name":"Graydon Ebert"}],"areas":["Business law","Real estate law","Wills and estates","Land development","Condominium law","Mortgage lending","Mortgage enforcement","Corporate law"]}}',NULL,'Ain Whitehead LLP is a Barrie firm handling business, real estate and wills and estates law.

The practice marks ten years and counts lawyers Andrew Ain, Graydon Ebert, Jill Annett, Kathryn Whitehead and Tony Servello among its team. Andrew''s work centres on residential real estate, mortgage lending and commercial transactions, with a focus on land development and condominium law, plus corporate matters such as new corporations, shareholder agreements and the buying and selling of businesses. Real estate work covers commercial leasing, lease negotiation and drafting, and the firm offers a land transfer calculator. Areas served include the City of Barrie and the Township of Springwater.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lambert-boenders-employment-lawyer-toronto','Lambert Boenders Employment Lawyer','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,33,43.6516092,-79.3823093,'{"name":"Lambert Boenders Employment Lawyer","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6516092,"lng":-79.3823093,"address":"65 Queen St W Ste 615, Toronto, ON M5H 2M8","phone":"+14165617323","rating":5,"count":33,"slug":"lambert-boenders-employment-lawyer-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lambert+Boenders+Employment+Lawyer+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=65+Queen+St+W+Ste+615%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5H+2M8","website":"https://www.employmentlawcounsel.ca","blurb":"Employment Law in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 33 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lambert-boenders-employment-lawyer-toronto.png","details":{"languages":["English","French","Dutch"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Lambert Boenders"}],"areas":["Employment law","Human rights law"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Lambert Boenders is a Toronto employment and human rights law practice that advises both employees and employers on termination and workplace issues.

Lambert earned a B.A. (Hons) from Victoria College at the University of Toronto and a J.D. from Osgoode Hall Law School in 1994, entered employment and human rights practice in 2009 and was admitted to the Ontario bar in 2010. Before practising law he worked for more than twenty-five years in business, including as Vice-President of Operations with an international insurance company. Services include examining employment offer letters and contracts, performance management and improvement issues, and non-solicitation and non-competition clauses. The office is on Queen Street West.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ewen-boyd-llp-barrie','Ewen Boyd LLP','Barrie','ON','simcoe-central',0,4.8,32,44.3696871,-79.7082797,'{"name":"Ewen Boyd LLP","city":"Barrie","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["family","realestate","wills"],"region":"simcoe-central","province":"ON","lat":44.3696871,"lng":-79.7082797,"address":"11 Patterson Rd #24, Barrie, ON L4N 7W5","phone":"+17052526730","rating":4.8,"count":32,"slug":"ewen-boyd-llp-barrie","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Ewen+Boyd+LLP+Barrie+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=11+Patterson+Rd+%2324%2C+Barrie%2C+ON+L4N+7W5","website":"https://www.ewenboyd.com","blurb":"Family Law / Real Estate in Barrie. Rated 4.8 from 32 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ewen-boyd-llp-barrie.webp","details":{"serving":["Barrie"]}}',NULL,'Ewen Boyd LLP is a Barrie firm that handled family, real estate, wills and estate planning and corporate law, and has announced that it is closing.

After more than eleven years of service the firm will close its doors in the near future. It no longer holds any wills or powers of attorney, which have been transferred to Ness Law in Orillia. Before the closure notice, it assisted clients across Simcoe County and Muskoka. Former clients who need a closed real estate or family file are directed to a mailing address in Barrie.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('murray-and-associates-llp-st-catharines','Murray & Associates LLP','St. Catharines','ON','hamilton-niagara',0,4.7,31,43.1576581,-79.2489043,'{"name":"Murray & Associates LLP","city":"St. Catharines","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"hamilton-niagara","province":"ON","lat":43.1576581,"lng":-79.2489043,"address":"14 Church, St. Catharines, ON L2R 3B3","phone":"+19056878200","rating":4.7,"count":31,"slug":"murray-and-associates-llp-st-catharines","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Murray+%26+Associates+LLP+St.+Catharines+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=14+Church%2C+St.+Catharines%2C+ON+L2R+3B3","website":"https://www.murlaw.ca","blurb":"Law firm in St. Catharines. Rated 4.7 from 31 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/murray-and-associates-llp-st-catharines.jpg","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"H. A. Patrick Little"},{"name":"Bryce W. B. Murray"},{"name":"Adam DiFruscia"},{"name":"William Heelis"}],"serving":["St. Catharines"]}}',NULL,'Murray & Associates LLP is a Niagara Region firm covering real estate, wills and estates, corporate, mortgages, power of sale, family and municipal law.

