This office is at 110 James Street, Suite 400, in St. Catharines, while the firm has particular depth in the Greater Toronto Area and also serves Vaughan. Support is available in more than 20 languages. Injury work is handled under a contingency fee agreement, meaning fees depend on a successful settlement or trial outcome, and cases draw on reports from physicians, accident reconstruction engineers and economists. Soft tissue injuries and rehabilitation planning are among the topics covered.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('henderson-family-law-thunder-bay','Henderson Family Law','Thunder Bay','ON','northern',0,4.9,21,48.4360337,-89.218462,'{"name":"Henderson Family Law","city":"Thunder Bay","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"northern","province":"ON","lat":48.4360337,"lng":-89.218462,"address":"34 Cumberland St N, Thunder Bay, ON P7A 4L3","phone":"+18073442400","rating":4.9,"count":21,"slug":"henderson-family-law-thunder-bay","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Henderson+Family+Law+Thunder+Bay+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=34+Cumberland+St+N%2C+Thunder+Bay%2C+ON+P7A+4L3","website":"https://www.hendersonfamilylaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Thunder Bay. Rated 4.9 from 21 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/henderson-family-law-thunder-bay.png","bioImage":"images/bio/henderson-family-law-thunder-bay.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Timothy J. Henderson"},{"name":"Lauren M. Conti"},{"name":"Timothy Matthews"}],"areas":["Family law"],"serving":["Northwestern Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Henderson Family Law is a Thunder Bay firm that works only on family law matters.

It is the only multi-lawyer firm in northwestern Ontario that focuses on family law, and its approach is candid, compassionate and respectful, with clients helped to understand what they need to know before making decisions. A trained law clerk asks a few confidential questions at first and helps match the client with a suitable lawyer. The office is in the James Whalen building at 34 Cumberland Street North, Suite 600, open weekdays from 8:30 am to 5 pm.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('fg-avocat-inc-repentigny','FG Avocat inc.','Repentigny','QC','qc-lanaudiere',0,5,20,45.7560085,-73.4453713,'{"name":"FG Avocat inc.","city":"Repentigny","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"qc-lanaudiere","province":"QC","lat":45.7560085,"lng":-73.4453713,"address":"121 Bd Industriel #218, Repentigny, Quebec J6A 7K4","phone":"+14388655297","rating":5,"count":20,"slug":"fg-avocat-inc-repentigny","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/FG+Avocat+inc.+Repentigny+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=121+Bd+Industriel+%23218%2C+Repentigny%2C+Quebec+J6A+7K4","website":"https://www.fgavocat.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Repentigny. Rated 5.0 from 20 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/fg-avocat-inc-repentigny.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Me François Gaudreau"}],"areas":["Droit criminel et pénal","Alcool au volant","Infractions criminelles","Demande de pardon","Contraventions"],"serving":["Joliette","Témiscamingue","Laval","Repentigny","Saint-Jérôme","Terrebonne","Trois-Rivières"]}}',NULL,'FG Avocat is a Repentigny firm practising criminal and penal law, from impaired driving and criminal offences to pardon applications and traffic tickets.

Me François Gaudreau defends people charged in the Joliette, Repentigny and Laval areas, with service points in Joliette, Laval, Saint-Jérôme, Terrebonne, Trois-Rivières and Témiscamingue (Ville-Marie). The firm supports clients from the first steps after an arrest for impaired driving through to court appearances, and helps challenge a ticket considered unjustified. The firm works in French.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('fabris-mciver-and-durvin-nanaimo','Fabris McIver & Durvin','Nanaimo','BC','bc-island',0,4.6,21,49.162836,-123.9356367,'{"name":"Fabris McIver & Durvin","city":"Nanaimo","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"bc-island","province":"BC","lat":49.162836,"lng":-123.9356367,"address":"40 Cavan St, Nanaimo, BC V9R 5M2","phone":"+12507536661","rating":4.6,"count":21,"slug":"fabris-mciver-and-durvin-nanaimo","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Fabris+McIver+%26+Durvin+Nanaimo+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=40+Cavan+St%2C+Nanaimo%2C+BC+V9R+5M2","website":"https://www.fabris-law.com","blurb":"Law firm in Nanaimo. Rated 4.6 from 21 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/fabris-mciver-and-durvin-nanaimo.png","details":{"founded":1980,"lawyers":[{"name":"Iain D. McIver"}],"areas":["Civil litigation","Employment law","Real estate","Personal injury","Wills and estates","Business law"],"serving":["Nanaimo","British Columbia","Vancouver Island"]}}',NULL,'Fabris McIver & Durvin is a Nanaimo association of lawyers handling civil litigation, personal injury, employment, estates, real estate and business law.

The firm has looked after clients since 1980 and practises across British Columbia from 40 Cavan Street on Vancouver Island. Its clients include individuals, partnerships, corporations, insurers, financial institutions, retailers and contractors. Its lawyers tend to concentrate on preferred areas of practice and consult each other regularly. Iain D. McIver, admitted to the bar in 1990 after law studies at UBC, works on personal injury, estate and inheritance disputes, commercial litigation and employment law.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('abramovich-immigration-law-toronto','Abramovich Immigration Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,341,43.6700261,-79.3892518,'{"name":"Abramovich Immigration Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6700261,"lng":-79.3892518,"address":"60 Bloor St W Ste 400, Toronto, ON M5R 3P5","phone":"+14165511757","rating":5,"count":341,"slug":"abramovich-immigration-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Abramovich+Immigration+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=60+Bloor+St+W+Ste+400%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5R+3P5","website":"https://atimmigrationlaw.com","blurb":"Immigration in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 341 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/abramovich-immigration-law-toronto.webp","bioImage":"images/bio/abramovich-immigration-law-toronto.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Lev Abramovich"},{"name":"Anna Aazam","title":"Senior immigration lawyer"}],"areas":["Family reunification","Express Entry","Provincial nominations","Corporate immigration","Immigration litigation","H&C and TRP applications","United States immigration"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Abramovich Immigration Law handles immigration applications, refugee matters and Federal Court litigation from its office in Toronto. The firm practises only immigration law, from student visas, provincial nominations, Express Entry and spousal sponsorships to inadmissibility issues and visa refusals, and it advises Canadian and international businesses on temporary foreign worker strategy and compliance.

Services are offered in English, Russian, Spanish and Cantonese, with professional interpreters for other languages. Clients come from the US, Latin America, India and the former Soviet republics, among other places. The firm works with Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada, the Canada Border Services Agency, the Immigration and Refugee Board and the Federal Court, and its lawyers include Lev Abramovich, Anna Aazam, Sara Pesko and Sonja Pesko.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('marwah-law-ottawa','Marwah Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,468,45.3314483,-75.7056804,'{"name":"Marwah Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration","Real Estate","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["immigration","realestate","business"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3314483,"lng":-75.7056804,"address":"38 Auriga Dr 2nd Floor, Ottawa, ON K2E 8A5","phone":"+13438040844","rating":5,"count":468,"slug":"marwah-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Marwah+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=38+Auriga+Dr+2nd+Floor%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K2E+8A5","website":"https://www.marwahlaw.com","blurb":"Immigration / Real Estate in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 468 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/marwah-law-ottawa.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Yaman Marwah","title":"Founder"},{"name":"Hisham Marwah","title":"Senior Counsel"},{"name":"Sammy Alroub","title":"Lawyer"}],"areas":["Real estate","Canadian immigration","Wills and estates","Business law","Commercial leasing","Franchising law","Notary services","Paralegal services","Family law"],"serving":["Ottawa","Hamilton","Toronto","Ontario"]}}',NULL,'In Ottawa, Marwah Law offers immigration, real estate and business law to individuals, families and businesses across Ontario. Real estate work covers purchases, sales and refinancing, and the firm also advises on family law, wills and estates, franchising and the foreign divorce opinion letters needed by people who divorced outside Canada and want to remarry in Ontario.

The firm works virtually across Ontario on an all-inclusive fixed-fee model and offers bilingual service. Its founders brought experience from Bay Street in Toronto, and its lawyers are licensed by the Law Society of Ontario. The office is on Auriga Drive in Ottawa.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('nk-lawyers-professional-corporation-north-york','NK Lawyers Professional Corporation','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.9,592,43.7648381,-79.4127089,'{"name":"NK Lawyers Professional Corporation","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7648381,"lng":-79.4127089,"address":"4950 Yonge St SUITE 2200, North York, ON M2N 6K1","phone":"+14162387147","rating":4.9,"count":592,"slug":"nk-lawyers-professional-corporation-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/NK+Lawyers+Professional+Corporation+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4950+Yonge+St+SUITE+2200%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+6K1","website":"https://www.nklawyers.ca","blurb":"Immigration in North York. Rated 4.9 from 592 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/nk-lawyers-professional-corporation-north-york.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Nilofar Ahmadi","title":"Barrister, Solicitor and Notary Public"},{"name":"Khesrau Ahmadi"}],"areas":["Real estate","Immigration"]}}',NULL,'NK Lawyers Professional Corporation, a North York practice, acts for clients in real estate and immigration matters. Its approach rests on clear communication and prompt service, with the aim of giving clients personalized and cost-effective solutions to their legal problems.

The team includes Nilofar Ahmadi, a barrister, solicitor and notary public, and Khesrau Ahmadi, and both hold B.A., M.A. and J.D. degrees. The office is in the Madison Centre at 4950 Yonge Street, Suite 2200, in North York.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('godwit-law-office-brampton','Godwit Law Office','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,4.9,546,43.7296608,-79.7963109,'{"name":"Godwit Law Office","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration","Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["immigration","realestate"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.7296608,"lng":-79.7963109,"address":"1A Conestoga Dr #300, Brampton, ON L6Z 4N5","phone":"+18883575162","rating":4.9,"count":546,"slug":"godwit-law-office-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Godwit+Law+Office+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1A+Conestoga+Dr+%23300%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6Z+4N5","website":"https://godwitlaw.com","blurb":"Immigration / Real Estate in Brampton. Rated 4.9 from 546 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/godwit-law-office-brampton.png","details":{"areas":["Immigration law","Real estate law","Family law","Permanent residence applications","Refugee and detention hearings","Procedural fairness letters"],"serving":["Brampton"]}}',NULL,'Immigration sits at the centre of Godwit Law Office, a Brampton firm that also handles family law and real estate. Its immigration work includes permanent residency, spousal sponsorships, citizenship, and work permits such as LMIA-based permits, open work permits and extensions, and it represents clients in appeals and hearings after applications are refused.

Services are offered in English, Punjabi, Hindi and Urdu, and the firm uses flat-rate pricing. From its office on Conestoga Drive it assists clients in the GTA, across Canada and abroad, including individuals and families in border regions such as Buffalo, Plattsburgh and Minneapolis who want to visit, study, work or immigrate to Canada.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('singha-law-professional-corporation-toronto','SINGHA LAW PROFESSIONAL CORPORATION','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,348,43.7052842,-79.2512318,'{"name":"SINGHA LAW PROFESSIONAL CORPORATION","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7052842,"lng":-79.2512318,"address":"2249 Kingston Rd, Scarborough, ON M1N 1T8","phone":"+14162659449","rating":4.9,"count":348,"slug":"singha-law-professional-corporation-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/SINGHA+LAW+PROFESSIONAL+CORPORATION+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2249+Kingston+Rd%2C+Scarborough%2C+ON+M1N+1T8","website":"https://www.singhalaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 348 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/singha-law-professional-corporation-toronto.png","details":{"languages":["English","Bengali","Hindi","Urdu"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Jayanta Kumar Singha","title":"Principal Lawyer"}],"areas":["Civil and estate litigation","Real estate law","Family law","Immigration law","Wills and estate planning","Notary public services","Private mortgage"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Singha Law Professional Corporation is a full-service Toronto firm covering real estate, family, immigration, wills and litigation. Litigation matters include contract and employment disputes, real estate disputes, will challenges and estate conflicts, and the firm also offers notary public services and private mortgage work for both lenders and borrowers.

Founder Jayanta Kumar Singha, known as Jay, holds an LLB from the University of Calcutta (2001) and an LLM, and has more than 24 years of legal experience across Canada, India and Bangladesh. He qualified to practise in Ontario through the National Committee on Accreditation. The office is on Kingston Road in Scarborough, and the firm serves individuals, families and businesses across Ontario.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('nazarian-law-toronto','Nazarian Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,461,43.6444776,-79.3687467,'{"name":"Nazarian Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6444776,"lng":-79.3687467,"address":"130 Queens Quay E Ste 715, Toronto, ON M5A 0P6","phone":"+16476606900","rating":4.9,"count":461,"slug":"nazarian-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Nazarian+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=130+Queens+Quay+E+Ste+715%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5A+0P6","website":"https://nazarianlaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 461 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/nazarian-law-toronto.jpg","details":{"areas":["Domestic contracts and agreements","Divorce and separation","Asset division","Financial support","Parenting","Alternative dispute resolution","Family litigation","Collaborative family practice"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Nazarian Law acts for Toronto families in divorce, custody, support and property division matters. Its family law work also covers domestic contracts and agreements, separation, parenting arrangements, financial support, alternative dispute resolution and family litigation.

The firm also takes on real estate transactions and business law matters, and Armen Nazarian is among its lawyers. Daniel Luz serves as Director of Operations. Its working values are being accessible, adaptable, collaborative and professional, and its office is on Queens Quay East in Toronto.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('x-copper-toronto','X-Copper','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.8,583,43.7085184,-79.3624351,'{"name":"X-Copper","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7085184,"lng":-79.3624351,"address":"143 Laird Dr, East York, ON M4G 3V5","phone":"+12898027134","rating":4.8,"count":583,"slug":"x-copper-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/X-Copper+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=143+Laird+Dr%2C+East+York%2C+ON+M4G+3V5","website":"https://www.xcopper.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Toronto. Rated 4.8 from 583 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/x-copper-toronto.png","details":{"areas":["Traffic tickets","Criminal charges","Careless driving","Stunt driving","Drug offences","Assault","Theft","Fraud"],"serving":["Ontario"]}}',NULL,'X-Copper is a Toronto defence firm handling traffic tickets, criminal charges and CVOR offences across Ontario. Its team includes more than 60 lawyers and paralegals as well as former police officers, working from 18 offices across Ontario, and it has handled over 300,000 tickets and charges.

Traffic matters include speeding, careless driving, stop sign offences and stunt driving, with the aim of reducing demerit points, fines and insurance impact. Criminal work covers impaired driving, assault, theft, fraud and drug offences. Fees are set as block fees, and the firm attends preliminary court appearances so that clients do not have to.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('zinati-kay-toronto','Zinati Kay','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.8,494,43.7808811,-79.2863207,'{"name":"Zinati Kay","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7808811,"lng":-79.2863207,"address":"100 Cowdray Ct #320, Scarborough, ON M1S 5C8","phone":"+14163218766","rating":4.8,"count":494,"slug":"zinati-kay-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Zinati+Kay+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=100+Cowdray+Ct+%23320%2C+Scarborough%2C+ON+M1S+5C8","website":"https://zinatikay.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Toronto. Rated 4.8 from 494 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/zinati-kay-toronto.jpg","heroImage":"images/hero/zinati-kay-toronto.webp","details":{"areas":["Real estate","Buying property","Selling property","Mortgage refinancing","Title transfers","Estates and probate"],"serving":["Toronto","Scarborough","GTA"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Zinati Kay is a Toronto real estate law firm handling home purchases, sales, refinancing and title transfers at fixed closing costs. It has practised residential real estate law in Toronto for more than 25 years and has closed over 25,000 transactions.

John Zinati heads the firm, holds degrees from the University of Toronto and Osgoode Hall Law School, writes a newsletter called Title Tips and sits on an advisory council at First Canadian Title. Other services include assignments, title insurance, title searches and virtual closings and signings. Clients come from downtown Toronto, east to Oshawa and north to Newmarket. The team also includes Jonathan Mak, Cathy Harpaul and Leroy Law.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('agnes-law-toronto','Agnes Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,292,43.7810041,-79.235865,'{"name":"Agnes Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7810041,"lng":-79.235865,"address":"885 Progress Ave Ste 218, Scarborough, ON M1H 3G3","phone":"+16475546339","rating":4.9,"count":292,"slug":"agnes-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Agnes+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=885+Progress+Ave+Ste+218%2C+Scarborough%2C+ON+M1H+3G3","website":"https://agneslaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 292 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/agnes-law-toronto.png"}',NULL,'Agnes Law is a Toronto family law practice led by its owner and principal lawyer, Agnes K Varkeychen. The practice handles family law matters, and its principal is also a notary public.

Varkeychen holds a BA, an LLB with honours and an LLM, is pursuing a doctorate, and practises as a barrister, solicitor and notary public. The office is at 885 Progress Avenue, Suite 218, in the Scarborough area of Toronto, Ontario.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('clivio-law-professional-corporation-toronto','Clivio Law Professional Corporation','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,286,43.6741189,-79.3889545,'{"name":"Clivio Law Professional Corporation","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6741189,"lng":-79.3889545,"address":"920 Yonge St Ste 510, Toronto, ON M4W 3C7","phone":"+14164772538","rating":5,"count":286,"slug":"clivio-law-professional-corporation-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Clivio+Law+Professional+Corporation+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=920+Yonge+St+Ste+510%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M4W+3C7","website":"https://www.cliviolaw.com","blurb":"Immigration in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 286 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/clivio-law-professional-corporation-toronto.webp","bioImage":"images/bio/clivio-law-professional-corporation-toronto.webp","details":{"founded":2016,"languages":["English","French","Spanish","Italian","Turkish"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Amedeo Clivio"},{"name":"Meera Budovitch"},{"name":"Alim Jiwa"}],"areas":["Immigration assessment","Permanent residence","Family sponsorship","Hearings, appeals and judicial review","Refugee determination","Canadian citizenship","Notary services"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Since 2016, Clivio Law Professional Corporation has handled immigration, refugee and citizenship matters from downtown Toronto. Services cover immigration assessments, permanent residence, family sponsorship, hearings and appeals, refugee determination and Canadian citizenship, including citizenship revocation cases, and the firm also provides notary services.

Its staff speak English, French, Haitian Creole, Spanish, Italian and Turkish, with interpreters for other languages. Founder Amedeo Clivio graduated from Osgoode Hall Law School in 2014, was called to the bar in 2015 and appears before all divisions of the Immigration and Refugee Board and the Federal Court. His cases include Feher, a constitutional challenge to a policy limiting rights of refugee applicants from certain countries by nationality.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('sondhi-defence-professional-corporation-aurora','Sondhi Defence Professional Corporation','Aurora','ON','york-durham',0,4.9,287,44.0062564,-79.4683269,'{"name":"Sondhi Defence Professional Corporation","city":"Aurora","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Civil Litigation","Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["criminal","litigation","realestate"],"region":"york-durham","province":"ON","lat":44.0062564,"lng":-79.4683269,"address":"15483 Yonge St Ste 9, Aurora, ON L4G 1P3","phone":"+18554766344","rating":4.9,"count":287,"slug":"sondhi-defence-professional-corporation-aurora","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sondhi+Defence+Professional+Corporation+Aurora+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=15483+Yonge+St+Ste+9%2C+Aurora%2C+ON+L4G+1P3","website":"https://sondhidefence.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Civil Litigation in Aurora. Rated 4.9 from 287 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/sondhi-defence-professional-corporation-aurora.png","details":{"areas":["Criminal defence","Real estate law","Assault charges","Drug crimes","Youth crimes","Domestic violence","Sexual assault","Weapons offences","White collar crime and fraud","Real estate litigation"],"serving":["Newmarket","Aurora","Minden","Greater Toronto Area"]}}',NULL,'Criminal defence and real estate law are the two main practice areas of Sondhi Defence Professional Corporation, an Aurora firm. It represents people charged with criminal offences in Newmarket, Aurora, Minden and across the Greater Toronto Area, and it appears at bail hearings, where a person arrested in Newmarket or elsewhere in the GTA seeks release while the case is pending. The firm also handles civil matters.

Real estate work covers property transactions. The firm works from Yonge Street in Aurora and has an office on Gorham Street in Newmarket.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('naimark-law-toronto','Naimark Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.7,297,43.648944,-79.384424,'{"name":"Naimark Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.648944,"lng":-79.384424,"address":"141 Adelaide St W #330, Toronto, ON M5H 3L5","phone":"+14163667246","rating":4.7,"count":297,"slug":"naimark-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Naimark+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=141+Adelaide+St+W+%23330%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5H+3L5","website":"https://www.naimarklaw.com","blurb":"Personal Injury in Toronto. Rated 4.7 from 297 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/naimark-law-toronto.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Brent Vallis"},{"name":"Sandy Williams"},{"name":"Erin M. Neal"}],"areas":["Personal injury","Motor vehicle accidents","Slip and falls","Medical malpractice","Long-term disability","Life insurance denials","Wrongful death claims"]}}',NULL,'Naimark Law is a Toronto personal injury firm representing seriously injured people and their families. Its lawyers all previously defended insurance companies before switching sides, and founder Ryan Naimark did that work for 20 years while also acting for accident victims.

Naimark graduated from Osgoode Hall Law School, was called to the Ontario bar in 1998, became a partner at an insurance defence firm in 2004 and argues cases at all levels of court in Ontario. Because employers are not always sympathetic to employees who are off work after an accident, he also advises injured clients on employment issues, including wrongful dismissal. The office is on Adelaide Street West.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('akrami-and-associates-mississauga','Akrami & Associates','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.6,691,43.5633203,-79.5941491,'{"name":"Akrami & Associates","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5633203,"lng":-79.5941491,"address":"1440 Hurontario St, Mississauga, ON L5G 3H4","phone":"+14164772545","rating":4.6,"count":691,"slug":"akrami-and-associates-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Akrami+%26+Associates+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1440+Hurontario+St%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5G+3H4","website":"https://thevisa.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Mississauga. Rated 4.6 from 691 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/akrami-and-associates-mississauga.webp","details":{"areas":["Business immigration","Express Entry and permanent residence","Conjugal partner sponsorship","Visitor visas","Work permits","Family sponsorship"],"serving":["Mississauga"]}}',NULL,'Akrami & Associates helps individuals, families and businesses in Mississauga with work permits, visitor visas, sponsorship and permanent residence. The firm also assists with Express Entry and with business immigration for people planning to establish or operate a business in Canada, and its team has worked on thousands of cases involving permanent and temporary residence.

The firm holds that anyone with a valid reason to immigrate to Canada should have the chance to do so. Its team includes licensed immigration representatives regulated by the Law Society and the Immigration Consultants of Canada Regulatory Council, and it follows government announcements that could affect an application. The office is on Hurontario Street in Mississauga.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('john-cintosun-law-professional-corporation-toronto','John Cintosun Law Professional Corporation','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,266,43.6581503,-79.3853727,'{"name":"John Cintosun Law Professional Corporation","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6581503,"lng":-79.3853727,"address":"700 Bay St. #405, Toronto, ON M5G 1Z6","phone":"+14168248155","rating":5,"count":266,"slug":"john-cintosun-law-professional-corporation-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/John+Cintosun+Law+Professional+Corporation+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=700+Bay+St.+%23405%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5G+1Z6","website":"https://www.cintosun.com","blurb":"General practice law firm in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 266 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/john-cintosun-law-professional-corporation-toronto.png","details":{"languages":["English","French","Turkish"],"lawyers":[{"name":"John Cintosun","title":"Barrister & Solicitor"}],"areas":["Refugee law","Civil litigation","Refugee appeals and judicial review","Humanitarian and compassionate","Pre-removal risk assessment","Spousal and partner sponsorship"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Refugee law and civil litigation make up the practice of John Cintosun Law Professional Corporation in Toronto. The firm helps people seeking asylum and protection in Canada and represents clients whose refugee cases were denied in appeals and court challenges, as well as clients in civil litigation.

John Cintosun is a barrister and solicitor whose career spans Ontario and California, and he works in English, French and Turkish. The firm is based on Bay Street in Toronto.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('jca-law-office-professional-corporation-toronto','JCA Law Office Professional Corporation','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.8,273,43.7082826,-79.3982462,'{"name":"JCA Law Office Professional Corporation","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Immigration","Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["family","immigration","realestate"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7082826,"lng":-79.3982462,"address":"2323 Yonge St Ste 204, Toronto, ON M4P 2C9","phone":"+18555225290","rating":4.8,"count":273,"slug":"jca-law-office-professional-corporation-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/JCA+Law+Office+Professional+Corporation+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2323+Yonge+St+Ste+204%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M4P+2C9","website":"https://jcalaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law / Immigration in Toronto. Rated 4.8 from 273 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/jca-law-office-professional-corporation-toronto.png","details":{"founded":2016,"languages":["Tagalog","English"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Josef-Jake Aguilar","title":"Founding Partner"}],"areas":["Immigration law","Family law","Real estate","Wills and estates","Philippine document services"],"serving":["Toronto","Greater Toronto Area","Ottawa","Winnipeg","Calgary","Edmonton","Vancouver"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","18:00"]],"2":[["09:00","18:00"]],"3":[["09:00","18:00"]],"4":[["09:00","18:00"]],"5":[["09:00","18:00"]]}','JCA Law Office Professional Corporation is a Midtown Toronto firm serving the Filipino-Canadian community in immigration, family law and real estate. Founded in 2016 near Yonge Street and Roehampton Avenue, it handles family sponsorship, Express Entry, work and study permits and citizenship, along with divorce, separation agreements, custody, home purchases and sales, wills and estates, notarial services and Philippine documents such as special powers of attorney and affidavits.

Founder Josef-Jake Camacho Aguilar is a barrister and solicitor, a CPA and a member of the CFA Society Toronto. He completed the Internationally Trained Lawyers Program at the University of Toronto Faculty of Law and previously practised corporate law at GSIS in the Philippines.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('peter-robert-lindsay-professional-corporation-north-york','Peter Robert Lindsay Professional Corporation','North York','ON','toronto',0,5,249,43.7588493,-79.4220287,'{"name":"Peter Robert Lindsay Professional Corporation","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7588493,"lng":-79.4220287,"address":"233 Sheppard Ave W, North York, ON M2N 1N2","phone":"+14167333313","rating":5,"count":249,"slug":"peter-robert-lindsay-professional-corporation-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Peter+Robert+Lindsay+Professional+Corporation+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=233+Sheppard+Ave+W%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+1N2","website":"https://lindsaylaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in North York. Rated 5.0 from 249 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/peter-robert-lindsay-professional-corporation-north-york.png","details":{"founded":1996,"languages":["Mandarin","Cantonese"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Peter Robert Lindsay"}],"areas":["Criminal law","Quasi-criminal","Provincial offences","Impaired driving","Careless driving","Robbery or firearm offences","Drug trafficking offences","Assault","Sexual assault"],"serving":["North York"]}}',NULL,'Criminal and quasi-criminal law is all that Peter Robert Lindsay Professional Corporation, known as Lindsay Law, practises in North York. Much of its work defends people charged with drinking and driving offences, along with traffic and other provincial offences and serious criminal charges.

Its lawyers handle set dates, bail hearings, preliminary inquiries, trials and appeals and can attend court on short notice. The team includes founder Peter Robert Lindsay, Nikita Da Silva and Aleena Mahmood, at an office on Sheppard Avenue West, and information is also provided in Chinese.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('motevalli-law-group-toronto','Motevalli Law Group','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,253,43.6540056,-79.3759036,'{"name":"Motevalli Law Group","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Family Law","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["criminal","family","litigation"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6540056,"lng":-79.3759036,"address":"151 Church St, Toronto, ON M5C 2Z3","phone":"+16476922805","rating":4.9,"count":253,"slug":"motevalli-law-group-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Motevalli+Law+Group+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=151+Church+St%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5C+2Z3","website":"https://motevallicriminallawyers.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Family Law in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 253 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/motevalli-law-group-toronto.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Hossein Motevalli"}],"areas":["Assault","Sexual assault","Driving offences","Domestic assault","Theft","Bail hearings","Fraud","Youth offences"],"serving":["Toronto","Greater Toronto Area","Newmarket","Oshawa","Brampton","Milton"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Motevalli Law Group defends criminal charges in Toronto and across the Greater Toronto Area. Hossein Motevalli''s practice centres on criminal law and litigation, including impaired driving, assault in its various forms, domestic assault under section 266 of the Criminal Code, theft, fraud, and drug possession, trafficking and importing charges.

The firm acts in Toronto, North York, Mississauga, Brampton, Scarborough, Aurora, Newmarket and Oshawa and also takes family law and civil litigation matters. Fees can be arranged as flat rates or payment plans, and the office is on Church Street in Toronto.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('infinity-law-firm-mississauga','Infinity Law Firm','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,239,43.7135716,-79.6577477,'{"name":"Infinity Law Firm","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.7135716,"lng":-79.6577477,"address":"2798 Thamesgate Dr #1, Mississauga, ON L4T 4E8","phone":"+14169395457","rating":5,"count":239,"slug":"infinity-law-firm-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Infinity+Law+Firm+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2798+Thamesgate+Dr+%231%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L4T+4E8","website":"https://www.infinitylawfirm.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 239 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/infinity-law-firm-mississauga.jpg","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Arashdeep Sidhu"}],"areas":["Real estate","Immigration","Notary services","Business law"]}}',NULL,'Infinity Law Firm in Mississauga offers real estate, immigration, notary and business law services in Ontario. Real estate work covers residential and commercial purchases, sales and leasing as well as property disputes, while immigration services include visa applications and status adjustments.

Notary services cover document verification, signatures and attestations, and business law services cover formation, contracts, compliance and dispute resolution. Arashdeep Sidhu is part of the team, and the office is on Thamesgate Drive.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('azimi-law-north-york','Azimi Law','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.9,237,43.7683002,-79.3783652,'{"name":"Azimi Law","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7683002,"lng":-79.3783652,"address":"685 Sheppard Ave E Unit 508, North York, ON M2K 1B6","phone":"+14169004128","rating":4.9,"count":237,"slug":"azimi-law-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Azimi+Law+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=685+Sheppard+Ave+E+Unit+508%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2K+1B6","website":"https://www.azimilaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in North York. Rated 4.9 from 237 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/azimi-law-north-york.png","details":{"founded":2016,"languages":["English","Farsi","Spanish","Arabic"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Ben Azimi"}],"areas":["Personal injury and disability","Immigration litigation"],"serving":["Toronto","North York","Greater Toronto Area","Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Azimi Law is a North York litigation boutique handling personal injury cases and immigration litigation across Ontario. Founded in 2016 by Bahman (Ben) Azimi, it acts for people hurt in car, motorcycle, truck, pedestrian, bicycle, ride-share and transit accidents, as well as slip and fall, dog bite, product liability and medical malpractice matters, including accident benefits and negligence actions.

On the immigration side it acts for people facing refusals, detention, delays or removal, including appeals and Federal Court litigation. Personal injury files are taken on a contingency basis, and the lawyer will travel to a client''s home, hospital or rehabilitation facility. The office is on Sheppard Avenue East.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('anton-m-katz-barrister-and-solicitor-north-york','Anton M. Katz, Barrister and Solicitor','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.9,227,43.7721085,-79.4131541,'{"name":"Anton M. Katz, Barrister and Solicitor","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Business Law"],"caseTypes":["business"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7721085,"lng":-79.4131541,"address":"5255 Yonge St, North York, ON M2N 6P4","phone":"+14166065099","rating":4.9,"count":227,"slug":"anton-m-katz-barrister-and-solicitor-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Anton+M.+Katz%2C+Barrister+and+Solicitor+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=5255+Yonge+St%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+6P4","website":"https://amklaw.ca","blurb":"Business Law in North York. Rated 4.9 from 227 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/anton-m-katz-barrister-and-solicitor-north-york.png","details":{"founded":2001,"lawyers":[{"name":"Anton M. Katz","title":"Barrister & Solicitor"}],"areas":["Corporate and commercial law","Small business law"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Anton Katz practises corporate and commercial law in North York for small and mid-size businesses. His work includes federal and Ontario incorporations, including professional corporations, share issuances, transfers and redemptions, amalgamations and reorganizations, asset and share purchase agreements, commercial leases and customer contracts.

Anton M. Katz graduated from Osgoode Hall Law School in 1994, was called to the Ontario bar in 1996 and has been a sole practitioner since 2001. He served on the Ontario Bar Association Council from 2012 to 2018 and has held executive roles in its business law and sole and small firm general practice sections. The office is on Yonge Street.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lawstop-criminal-lawyers-brampton','LawStop Criminal Lawyers','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,4.9,226,43.6815918,-79.8047579,'{"name":"LawStop Criminal Lawyers","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["criminal","litigation"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6815918,"lng":-79.8047579,"address":"80 Pertosa Dr Unit 12, Brampton, ON L6X 5E9","phone":"+19054550073","rating":4.9,"count":226,"slug":"lawstop-criminal-lawyers-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/LawStop+Criminal+Lawyers+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=80+Pertosa+Dr+Unit+12%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6X+5E9","website":"https://lawstop.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Civil Litigation in Brampton. Rated 4.9 from 226 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lawstop-criminal-lawyers-brampton.png","bioImage":"images/bio/lawstop-criminal-lawyers-brampton.webp","details":{"languages":["English","Punjabi","Hindi","Urdu"],"areas":["Criminal defence","Pre-charge services","Bail hearings","Fighting criminal charges"],"serving":["Brampton"]}}','{"1":[["00:00","23:59"]],"2":[["00:00","23:59"]],"3":[["00:00","23:59"]],"4":[["00:00","23:59"]],"5":[["00:00","23:59"]],"6":[["00:00","23:59"]],"7":[["00:00","23:59"]]}','In Brampton, LawStop Criminal Lawyers defend people under police investigation, at bail hearings and against criminal charges. When a person is being investigated, the firm communicates with police on that person''s behalf, and its defence work runs from minor offences to complex cases.

Lawyers work in English, Punjabi, Hindi and Urdu. The firm serves Brampton, Mississauga, Caledon, Toronto, Vaughan, Markham, Oakville and Burlington from its office on Pertosa Drive, and also takes civil litigation matters.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('inna-kogan-law-office-toronto','Inna Kogan Law Office','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.8,214,43.7076991,-79.394878,'{"name":"Inna Kogan Law Office","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7076991,"lng":-79.394878,"address":"120 Eglinton Ave E #1101, Toronto, ON M4P 1E2","phone":"+14163222914","rating":4.8,"count":214,"slug":"inna-kogan-law-office-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Inna+Kogan+Law+Office+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=120+Eglinton+Ave+E+%231101%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M4P+1E2","website":"https://www.innakogan.com","blurb":"Family Law in Toronto. Rated 4.8 from 214 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/inna-kogan-law-office-toronto.png","bioImage":"images/bio/inna-kogan-law-office-toronto.webp","details":{"languages":["English","Ukrainian","Russian","Hebrew","Farsi"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Inna Kogan"}],"areas":["Work visa and LMIA support","Express Entry","Appeals and mandamus","Student visa and study permit","Business immigration","Family sponsorship"],"serving":["Mississauga","Brampton","Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Led by lawyer Inna Kogan, Inna Kogan Law Office in Toronto handles Express Entry, permanent residence, permits, sponsorships and Federal Court appeals. Kogan is a member of the Law Society of Ontario and a public notary, and the firm also covers provincial nominee programs, humanitarian and compassionate applications, refugee protection, temporary resident permits, citizenship, and business and investor immigration.

It challenges refusals and delays at the Federal Court, including through mandamus applications, and appears before the Immigration and Refugee Board. Kogan oversees each file personally, and the team works in English, Ukrainian, Russian, Hebrew and Persian. Meetings are held online by Zoom, and the office is on Eglinton Avenue East in Toronto.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ang-law-professional-corporation-north-york','Ang Law Professional Corporation','North York','ON','toronto',0,5,193,43.7621855,-79.3569401,'{"name":"Ang Law Professional Corporation","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7621855,"lng":-79.3569401,"address":"150 Duncan Mill Rd Unit 2, North York, ON M3B 3M4","phone":"+16475981998","rating":5,"count":193,"slug":"ang-law-professional-corporation-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Ang+Law+Professional+Corporation+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=150+Duncan+Mill+Rd+Unit+2%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M3B+3M4","website":"https://anglawpc.com","blurb":"Real Estate in North York. Rated 5.0 from 193 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ang-law-professional-corporation-north-york.png","details":{"founded":2020,"lawyers":[{"name":"Derek Ang"},{"name":"Lia Traboco"}],"areas":["Real estate law","Family law","Wills and estates law","Civil law","Immigration law","Business law"],"serving":["North York","Greater Toronto Area","Toronto","Ontario"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Ang Law Professional Corporation is a North York firm handling real estate, family law, wills and estates, immigration and business law. Founded in 2020, it acts on residential and commercial real estate transactions, divorce and separation including mediation and support, marriage and cohabitation contracts, civil matters and estate planning.

Lawyer Derek graduated from Osgoode Hall Law School in 2018, focuses on family and real estate law and sits on the Legal Aid family panel. Lia is licensed in both the Philippines and Ontario and practises immigration and business law. Services are offered remotely for clients across the Greater Toronto Area.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('dng-law-ottawa','DNG Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,192,45.3794101,-75.6399428,'{"name":"DNG Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3794101,"lng":-75.6399428,"address":"2378 Holly Ln, Ottawa, ON K1V 7P2","phone":"+16135236277","rating":5,"count":192,"slug":"dng-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/DNG+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2378+Holly+Ln%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1V+7P2","website":"https://www.dnglaw.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 192 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/dng-law-ottawa.png","details":{"areas":["Real estate law","Wills and estates","Powers of attorney","Elder abuse and long-term care","Commercial tenancies","Corporate and business law"],"serving":["Ottawa"]}}',NULL,'DNG Law, also known as Daniel Nassrallah Law Office, handles real estate, wills and estates and business law in Ottawa. Its real estate work covers residential and commercial purchases, sales and refinancing, including title transfers and closing documents, for first-time buyers and investors alike.

