Its partners include Chris Beckett, Rob Talach, Mary-Anne Strong, Dallas Lee, Aaron Lealess, Teri-Ellen Haddy and Chelsea Hishon, and its sexual abuse lawyers act for survivors. The office is on Richmond Street in London.','dynamic','live',NULL);
