Aminder (Amy) Hayher was called to the bar in 2018 and has appeared before the Superior Court of Justice and the License Appeal Tribunal, and has worked on matters before the Divisional Court. The firm''s languages are English, Hindi, Punjabi and Urdu, and its office is on Progress Avenue in Scarborough.','dynamic','live',NULL);
