He walks through the allegations, the evidence, the options and the possible consequences of a charge, including questions about work, family and a criminal record, so that clients can make informed decisions. The firm, which also operates as Edgar Law, is on Steeles Avenue East in Brampton.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lee-and-associates-north-york','Lee & Associates','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.8,98,43.7647984,-79.4121983,'{"name":"Lee & Associates","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7647984,"lng":-79.4121983,"address":"4950 Yonge St #2000, North York, ON M2N 6K1","phone":"+14167828168","rating":4.8,"count":98,"slug":"lee-and-associates-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lee+%26+Associates+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4950+Yonge+St+%232000%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+6K1","website":"https://www.leeassociates.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in North York. Rated 4.8 from 98 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lee-and-associates-north-york.png","details":{"founded":2006,"languages":["Arabic","Cantonese","French","Hindi","Mandarin","Punjabi","Tamil","Urdu"],"areas":["Personal injury","Motor vehicle accidents","Slip and falls","Dog bites","Product liability","Long-term disability"]}}',NULL,'Lee & Associates is a North York personal injury firm acting for injured people in litigation, arbitration, mediation and negotiation. The firm was started in 2006 by Andrew, a former named partner at another firm, to focus on acting for plaintiffs, and its practice is limited to injured individuals rather than insurance companies or corporations. Fees are billed on contingency, so no fees or expenses are owed unless money is recovered.

The multicultural staff offers services in Arabic, Armenian, Belarusian, Bengali, Cantonese, French, Greek, Gujarati, Hindi, Italian, Korean, Malayalam, Mandarin, Punjabi, Russian, Tamil, Urdu and Vietnamese. Clients are seen at an office on Yonge Street.','dynamic','live',NULL);
