Based on Central Parkway West in Mississauga, it serves clients in Toronto, Oakville, Markham, Richmond Hill and elsewhere in Ontario. A team that includes Angela, Sarah and Vanessa supports each matter, and services are provided in both English and Chinese.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('kamalie-law-north-york','Kamalie Law','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.9,90,43.7613082,-79.3517784,'{"name":"Kamalie Law","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Civil Litigation","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["litigation","business"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7613082,"lng":-79.3517784,"address":"255 Duncan Mill Rd #609, North York, ON M3B 3H9","phone":"+14168061401","rating":4.9,"count":90,"slug":"kamalie-law-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kamalie+Law+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=255+Duncan+Mill+Rd+%23609%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M3B+3H9","website":"https://kamalielaw.ca","blurb":"Civil Litigation / Business Law in North York. Rated 4.9 from 90 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/kamalie-law-north-york.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Shayan Kamalie"},{"name":"Michael Campbell","title":"Civil and commercial litigator"}],"areas":["Civil and commercial litigation","Non-solicitation agreements","Partnership disputes","Defamation","Promissory note enforcement","Commercial debt collection","Mortgage enforcement","Fraudulent conveyance and asset tracing","Injunctions and urgent motions","Non-competition agreements"],"serving":["Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Civil and commercial lawsuits, from contract disputes to debt recovery, make up the whole practice of Kamalie Law in North York. The firm acts only in civil and commercial litigation, and its lawyers have commenced and defended hundreds of lawsuits involving loan agreements, promissory notes, investment agreements, shareholder and partnership agreements, construction agreements and agreements of purchase and sale.

Work includes recovering debts and enforcing promissory notes, pursuing failed investment schemes, oppression proceedings against majority shareholders, summary judgment motions, urgent Certificates of Pending Litigation, orders freezing a debtor''s assets, and applications to force the sale of jointly owned property. The firm acts for individuals and businesses that are owed money, and its office is on Duncan Mill Road.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('paciocco-and-mellow-windsor','Paciocco & Mellow','Windsor','ON','southwestern',0,4.8,91,42.3117147,-83.0264695,'{"name":"Paciocco & Mellow","city":"Windsor","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["injury","litigation"],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":42.3117147,"lng":-83.0264695,"address":"995 Howard Ave, Windsor, ON N9A 1S4","phone":"+15199157673","rating":4.8,"count":91,"slug":"paciocco-and-mellow-windsor","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Paciocco+%26+Mellow+Windsor+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=995+Howard+Ave%2C+Windsor%2C+ON+N9A+1S4","website":"https://accidentlawyerswindsor.com","blurb":"Personal Injury / Civil Litigation in Windsor. Rated 4.8 from 91 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/paciocco-and-mellow-windsor.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Jeffrey R. Mellow"},{"name":"Gino Paciocco"},{"name":"Elizabeth Essex"},{"name":"Celina De Vuono"},{"name":"Dina D’Andrea"},{"name":"James Granger"},{"name":"Colleen Caza"}],"areas":["Personal injury","Wrongful death","Head injuries","Car accidents","Animal attacks","Disability claim"],"serving":["Windsor","Essex County","Chatham-Kent","Sarnia","South-Western Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Paciocco & Mellow, founded in 2013, is a Windsor personal injury firm acting in car accident, head injury, wrongful death and fall cases. Gino Paciocco and Jeffrey Mellow started the firm, and its lawyers have practised in personal injury law for a combined total of over sixty years. Jeffrey grew up in Leamington, attended the University of Windsor, was called to the bar in 2003 and belongs to the Essex Law Association and the Ontario Trial Lawyers Association.

The firm''s matters also include animal attacks and dog bites, truck and motorcycle accidents, disability and insurance matters across South-Western Ontario. Its lawyers have appeared at trial in the Ontario Superior Court of Justice, on appeals in the Divisional Court, and before the License Appeal Tribunal, the Financial Services Commission of Ontario and the Workplace Safety and Insurance Appeals Tribunal.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('rohan-hate-litigation-lawyers-toronto','Rohan Haté Litigation Lawyers','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,87,43.6509787,-79.3719728,'{"name":"Rohan Haté Litigation Lawyers","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["injury","litigation"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6509787,"lng":-79.3719728,"address":"61 Jarvis St, Toronto, ON M5C 2H2","phone":"+14163063817","rating":5,"count":87,"slug":"rohan-hate-litigation-lawyers-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Rohan+Hat%C3%A9+Litigation+Lawyers+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=61+Jarvis+St%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5C+2H2","website":"https://www.rohanhate.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury / Civil Litigation in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 87 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/rohan-hate-litigation-lawyers-toronto.jpg","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Rohan Haté"}],"areas":["Personal injury litigation","Real estate litigation","Insurance litigation","Civil litigation","Wills and estate litigation","Insurance defence","Class action litigation","Wrongful dismissal"],"serving":["Mississauga","Toronto","Ontario"]}}','{"1":[["08:00","18:00"]],"2":[["08:00","18:00"]],"3":[["08:00","18:00"]],"4":[["08:00","18:00"]],"5":[["08:00","18:00"]]}','Insurance and personal injury litigation across Ontario is the main work of Rohan Haté Litigation Lawyers, based in Toronto. Rohan Haté was called to the bar in 2012 after earning a Juris Doctor from Santa Clara University School of Law and attending Osgoode Hall Law School for a Master of Laws. He acts for injured people and their families through the insurance process and also advises insurers on occupiers'' liability, motor vehicle tort, accident benefits and coverage.

He appears regularly in the Ontario Superior Court of Justice, has conducted jury trials and has appeared before the Financial Services Commission of Ontario and the License Appeal Tribunal. The firm has offices in Oakville, Toronto and Mississauga and acts for clients throughout Ontario, with home and hospital visits where necessary.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('sanctuary-lawyers-aurora','Sanctuary Lawyers','Aurora','ON','york-durham',0,5,86,43.9989218,-79.4670854,'{"name":"Sanctuary Lawyers","city":"Aurora","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"york-durham","province":"ON","lat":43.9989218,"lng":-79.4670854,"address":"15213 Yonge St #5, Aurora, ON L4G 1L8","phone":"+14163333529","rating":5,"count":86,"slug":"sanctuary-lawyers-aurora","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sanctuary+Lawyers+Aurora+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=15213+Yonge+St+%235%2C+Aurora%2C+ON+L4G+1L8","website":"https://sanctuarylawyers.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Aurora. Rated 5.0 from 86 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/sanctuary-lawyers-aurora.webp","heroImage":"images/hero/sanctuary-lawyers-aurora.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Adam O''Brodovich"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","Personal injury","Assault charges","Drug offences","Theft and fraud","Driving under the influence","Youth offences","Bail hearings","Civil litigation","Family law"],"serving":["Aurora","Southern Ontario","Toronto"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','With offices in Aurora and Toronto, Sanctuary Lawyers is a family-run firm handling criminal defence and personal injury. For over a decade it has represented individuals across Southern Ontario, defending charges such as assault, domestic assault, assault with a weapon, drug offences, theft and fraud, impaired driving and youth offences. It also handles bail hearings and criminal appeals.

Beyond criminal defence, the firm acts in personal injury, civil litigation and family law matters. Its Aurora office is on Yonge Street, and its service area stretches across Southern Ontario, including Barrie, Brampton, Burlington, Cambridge and Ajax.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('jafari-law-north-york','Jafari Law','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.6,92,43.761726,-79.408064,'{"name":"Jafari Law","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.761726,"lng":-79.408064,"address":"45 Sheppard Ave E Ste 900, North York, ON M2N 5W9","phone":"+14168250650","rating":4.6,"count":92,"slug":"jafari-law-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Jafari+Law+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=45+Sheppard+Ave+E+Ste+900%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+5W9","website":"https://jafarilaw.ca","blurb":"Immigration in North York. Rated 4.6 from 92 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/jafari-law-north-york.png","details":{"founded":2012,"languages":["English","Farsi","Spanish","Turkish"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Pantea Jafari"},{"name":"Yehuda Levinson"}],"areas":["Business and commercial law","Immigration and citizenship law","Litigation","Provincial nominee programs","Judicial review applications","Enforcement of foreign judgments","Shareholder and partnership agreements","Trademark registration","Incorporation","Investor and entrepreneur programs"],"serving":["Halifax"]}}',NULL,'Jafari Law serves North York clients in English, Farsi, Spanish and Turkish across immigration, business and litigation matters. Pantea Jafari opened the firm in 2012 and serves as founder and lead counsel, having helped hundreds of individuals and families immigrate to Canada temporarily and permanently and maintain their status. It acts for domestic and international clients.

Business and commercial work includes federal and provincial incorporation, while litigation services cover representation of plaintiffs and defendants at all levels of court and contractual disputes across jurisdictions. Pantea holds a law degree from the University of Ottawa, with a focus on international law, and an honours BA from York University. Team members include H.J. (Yehuda) Levinson, Elham Akhoondan and Mohammad Shirazi, the office and finance manager.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('olena-chepil-and-lawyers-etobicoke','Olena Chepil & Lawyers','Etobicoke','ON','toronto',0,4.7,90,43.6283347,-79.5231515,'{"name":"Olena Chepil & Lawyers","city":"Etobicoke","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6283347,"lng":-79.5231515,"address":"68 Jutland Rd Ste 2, Etobicoke, ON M8Z 0G7","phone":"+14162334631","rating":4.7,"count":90,"slug":"olena-chepil-and-lawyers-etobicoke","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Olena+Chepil+%26+Lawyers+Etobicoke+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=68+Jutland+Rd+Ste+2%2C+Etobicoke%2C+ON+M8Z+0G7","website":"https://terralaw.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Etobicoke. Rated 4.7 from 90 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/olena-chepil-and-lawyers-etobicoke.png","details":{"founded":2020,"areas":["Real estate transactions","Commercial leases","Wills and estates","Corporate law","Notary services"]}}',NULL,'Real estate, business and estate matters are the focus of Olena Chepil & Lawyers, an Etobicoke firm that also operates as Terralaw. Founded in 2020, the firm acts on residential and commercial property purchases, sales and financing, and prepares and negotiates commercial leases. Its corporate work covers business formation, structuring and legal compliance.

On the estates side it prepares wills and powers of attorney and assists with estate planning and administration. Notary services cover affidavits, statutory declarations and other documents. Jutland Road in Etobicoke is the firm''s address, and clients include both individuals and businesses.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('mansoor-law-oakville','Mansoor Law','Oakville','ON','peel-halton',0,5,84,43.481744,-79.716074,'{"name":"Mansoor Law","city":"Oakville","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.481744,"lng":-79.716074,"address":"216 Oak Park Blvd #114, Oakville, ON L6H 0T8","phone":"+19052871323","rating":5,"count":84,"slug":"mansoor-law-oakville","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mansoor+Law+Oakville+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=216+Oak+Park+Blvd+%23114%2C+Oakville%2C+ON+L6H+0T8","website":"https://www.mansoorlaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Oakville. Rated 5.0 from 84 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/mansoor-law-oakville.png","details":{"areas":["Real estate","Wills and trusts","Probate","Estate planning"],"serving":["Oakville"]}}',NULL,'Mansoor Law is an Oakville firm that handles real estate transactions, wills and trusts, and probate. Since it began, the firm has served over 1,000 clients, acted on $250 million worth of real estate transactions and created 350 estate plans.

A matter begins with a meeting to discuss needs in real estate, wills or probate, followed by a tailored legal strategy and a detailed examination of documents, from property titles to wills, including compliance checks and client updates. The firm then manages the final steps, whether a real estate closing or the execution of wills and probate. It is located on Oak Park Boulevard.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('prestige-law-richmond-hill','Prestige Law','Richmond Hill','ON','york-durham',0,4.9,85,43.8630314,-79.3822362,'{"name":"Prestige Law","city":"Richmond Hill","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration","Personal Injury","Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["immigration","injury","realestate"],"region":"york-durham","province":"ON","lat":43.8630314,"lng":-79.3822362,"address":"100 Mural St Ste 100, Richmond Hill, ON L4B 1J3","phone":"+16479252222","rating":4.9,"count":85,"slug":"prestige-law-richmond-hill","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Prestige+Law+Richmond+Hill+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=100+Mural+St+Ste+100%2C+Richmond+Hill%2C+ON+L4B+1J3","website":"https://www.prestigelaw.ca","blurb":"Immigration / Personal Injury in Richmond Hill. Rated 4.9 from 85 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/prestige-law-richmond-hill.png","details":{"founded":2010,"areas":["Business law","Personal injury","Real estate law","Immigration","Family sponsorship"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Prestige Law practises immigration and personal injury law in Richmond Hill, with real estate also among its practice areas. The firm has been in operation since 2010 and acts for individuals and families on visas, permanent residency and citizenship applications, as well as on personal injury matters.

Clients meet one-on-one with the firm''s lawyers, and the practice is built around personal service for people dealing with immigration status, injuries or property transactions. Mural Street in Richmond Hill, north of Toronto, is the firm''s address.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('vo-law-etobicoke','Vo Law','Etobicoke','ON','toronto',0,5,83,43.6456374,-79.5210644,'{"name":"Vo Law","city":"Etobicoke","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6456374,"lng":-79.5210644,"address":"East Tower, 3250 Bloor St W #600, Etobicoke, ON M8X 2X9","phone":"+14162917224","rating":5,"count":83,"slug":"vo-law-etobicoke","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Vo+Law+Etobicoke+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=East+Tower%2C+3250+Bloor+St+W+%23600%2C+Etobicoke%2C+ON+M8X+2X9","website":"https://www.volaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Etobicoke. Rated 5.0 from 83 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/vo-law-etobicoke.jpg","details":{"languages":["Vietnamese"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Vi Vo"}],"areas":["Business law","Real estate law","Wills and estates law"],"serving":["Toronto","Greater Toronto Area"]}}',NULL,'Vi Vo founded Vo Law, an Etobicoke firm handling residential and commercial real estate along with wills and estates. Principal lawyer Vi Vo holds Juris Doctor degrees from the University of Ottawa and Michigan State University and an Honours Bachelor of Science from the University of Toronto. Her practice covers business law, real estate law and wills and estates, and she is frequently invited to speak at first-time home buyer seminars hosted by local brokerages.

The firm acts on purchases, mortgages, sales and refinancing of detached homes, condominiums and townhouses, as well as commercial real estate. It offers traditional and non-traditional legal services to clients of all financial abilities and works from Bloor Street West, serving the Toronto market.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('prouse-dash-crouch-llp-brampton','Prouse Dash Crouch LLP','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,4.6,90,43.6864356,-79.7591045,'{"name":"Prouse Dash Crouch LLP","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6864356,"lng":-79.7591045,"address":"29 Queen St E, Brampton, ON L6W 2A7","phone":"+19054516610","rating":4.6,"count":90,"slug":"prouse-dash-crouch-llp-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Prouse+Dash+Crouch+LLP+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=29+Queen+St+E%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6W+2A7","website":"https://www.pdclawyers.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Brampton. Rated 4.6 from 90 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/prouse-dash-crouch-llp-brampton.png","details":{"founded":1948,"lawyers":[{"name":"Chris Tonks"},{"name":"Dalkeith Palmer"},{"name":"Kalen Brady"},{"name":"Paul Dhaliwal"},{"name":"Eva Iacobelli"},{"name":"Kate Saldanha"},{"name":"Louie Sopov"},{"name":"Parul Ahluwalia"},{"name":"John Mikhail"}],"areas":["Business law","Civil and commercial litigation","Criminal law","Employment law","Family law","Municipal law","Personal injury law","Residential real estate law","Wills and estate law"],"serving":["Brampton","Greater Toronto Area"]}}',NULL,'Prouse, Dash & Crouch LLP has practised in downtown Brampton since 1948, covering business, litigation, family, employment and real estate law. The firm represents clients throughout Brampton and the Greater Toronto Area, with practice areas in business law, civil and commercial litigation, criminal law, employment law, family law, municipal law, personal injury law, residential real estate law, and wills and estate law.

The business law team has represented small businesses and banks since 1948 and assists with Alcohol and Gaming Commission applications and appearances. The employment team acts for both employees and employers, and the municipal group deals with planning and land development for residential and commercial construction. John Mikhail is among the lawyers on its team.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('adam-miller-kelly-law-firm-ottawa','Adam Miller Kelly Law Firm','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.8,85,45.3354736,-75.9056189,'{"name":"Adam Miller Kelly Law Firm","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3354736,"lng":-75.9056189,"address":"300 March Rd #601, Kanata, ON K2K 2E2","phone":"+16135926290","rating":4.8,"count":85,"slug":"adam-miller-kelly-law-firm-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Adam+Miller+Kelly+Law+Firm+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=300+March+Rd+%23601%2C+Kanata%2C+ON+K2K+2E2","website":"https://amk-law.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Ottawa. Rated 4.8 from 85 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/adam-miller-kelly-law-firm-ottawa.webp","details":{"areas":["Real estate","Wills, POAs and estates","Notarizations","Estate planning"]}}',NULL,'Since 1988, Adam Miller Kelly Law Firm has served Ottawa''s West End from Kanata in real estate, wills and estates. The multi-service firm has been based in Kanata since February 1988 and serves the Kanata-Stittsville community and surrounding regions. Its lawyers practise in real estate, wills, powers of attorney, estates and living wills.

Real estate lawyers act for people purchasing, selling or refinancing residential property. The firm also provides notary public and commissioner of oaths services, and March Road in Kanata is its address.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ks-law-professional-corporation-etobicoke','KS Law Professional Corporation','Etobicoke','ON','toronto',0,4.8,82,43.7507118,-79.633866,'{"name":"KS Law Professional Corporation","city":"Etobicoke","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7507118,"lng":-79.633866,"address":"7003 Steeles Ave W, Etobicoke, ON M9W 0A2","phone":"+14166757002","rating":4.8,"count":82,"slug":"ks-law-professional-corporation-etobicoke","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/KS+Law+Professional+Corporation+Etobicoke+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=7003+Steeles+Ave+W%2C+Etobicoke%2C+ON+M9W+0A2","website":"https://www.kslawoffice.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Etobicoke. Rated 4.8 from 82 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ks-law-professional-corporation-etobicoke.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Kris Subramanian"}],"areas":["Family law","Real estate","Divorce and separation","Child custody","Wills and estates","Powers of attorney","Probate and administration","Private mortgages"],"serving":["Toronto","Brampton","Mississauga","GTA","Peel","York","Halton","Durham"]}}',NULL,'KS Law Professional Corporation is an Etobicoke boutique firm handling family law and real estate for clients across the Greater Toronto Area. Kishore (Kris) Subramanian, a barrister, solicitor and notary public, has practised in Ontario for over 20 years and handles each file personally. On the family side he deals with divorce, separation, custody and parenting time, child and spousal support, and property division, appearing in the Ontario Court of Justice, the Superior Court of Justice, arbitration and mediation.

The real estate practice covers residential purchases, sales and refinancing, commercial and investment property transactions, private mortgage lending and title transfers in Toronto, Peel, York, Halton, Durham, Simcoe County and Ottawa, along with notary services. Kris has also sat on the ethics board of Centennial College and served as a Vice-President with the Lions Club.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('chsherbinin-litigation-barristers-north-york','Chsherbinin Litigation Barristers','North York','ON','toronto',0,5,78,43.7609464,-79.4100759,'{"name":"Chsherbinin Litigation Barristers","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["litigation"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7609464,"lng":-79.4100759,"address":"4789 Yonge St Suite 419 4th Floor, North York, ON M2N 0G3","phone":"+14169072587","rating":5,"count":78,"slug":"chsherbinin-litigation-barristers-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Chsherbinin+Litigation+Barristers+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4789+Yonge+St+Suite+419+4th+Floor%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+0G3","website":"https://nclaw.ca","blurb":"Civil Litigation in North York. Rated 5.0 from 78 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/chsherbinin-litigation-barristers-north-york.png","details":{"founded":2011,"lawyers":[{"name":"Nikolay Y. Chsherbinin"}],"areas":["Workplace disputes","Immigration disputes","Civil litigation","Judicial reviews","Stay of deportation","Humanitarian and compassionate cases","Pre-removal risk assessment","Labour market assessment applications"]}}',NULL,'Wrongful dismissal, civil and immigration litigation are the focus of Chsherbinin Litigation Barristers, a North York firm. Nikolay Chsherbinin opened the practice in 2011 after several years at a Toronto labour and employment firm. He appears regularly before the Ontario Superior Court of Justice, the Court of Appeal for Ontario, the Federal Court of Canada, the Immigration and Refugee Board, the Canadian and Ontario human rights tribunals and the Ontario Labour Relations Board.

He wrote the textbook The Law of Inducement in Canadian Employment Law (Carswell, 2012), a 2023 practical guide on applications for leave published by LexisNexis Canada, and more than 100 articles on employment, civil litigation and immigration. The firm''s work covers workplace disputes, immigration and citizenship refusals and civil litigation at trial and appellate levels.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('vilma-radfar-barrister-and-solicitor-north-york','Vilma Radfar Barrister & Solicitor','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.8,80,43.7610015,-79.410212,'{"name":"Vilma Radfar Barrister & Solicitor","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7610015,"lng":-79.410212,"address":"4789 Yonge St Ste 805, North York, ON M2N 0G3","phone":"+14168352636","rating":4.8,"count":80,"slug":"vilma-radfar-barrister-and-solicitor-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Vilma+Radfar+Barrister+%26+Solicitor+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4789+Yonge+St+Ste+805%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+0G3","website":"https://vilmaradfarlaw.com","blurb":"Family Law in North York. Rated 4.8 from 80 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/vilma-radfar-barrister-and-solicitor-north-york.jpg","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Vilma Radfar"},{"name":"Rojean Pirhosseinlou"}],"areas":["Family law","Divorce","Domestic contracts and agreements","Parenting decision-making","Parenting time","Child support","Spousal support","Property division","Motion to change court orders"]}}',NULL,'Family law is the main focus of Vilma Radfar Barrister & Solicitor, a boutique firm in North York covering divorce, parenting and support. Founded by Vilma Radfar, who was called to the Ontario bar in 2017, the firm acts in decision-making responsibility and parenting time, child and spousal support, property division, motions to change court orders and child protection matters. Out-of-court work includes cohabitation agreements, marriage contracts and separation agreements.

Vilma holds a Juris Doctor from the University of Ottawa and an honours Bachelor of Arts in sociology from York University. She is a panel member of Legal Aid Ontario, serving financially eligible, low-income clients, and also assists victims of domestic abuse. Matters proceed through court or alternative dispute resolution.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('kreindler-law-toronto','Kreindler Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,75,43.6515515,-79.3822687,'{"name":"Kreindler Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6515515,"lng":-79.3822687,"address":"65 Queen St W #1505, Toronto, ON M5H 2M5","phone":"+14166494550","rating":4.9,"count":75,"slug":"kreindler-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kreindler+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=65+Queen+St+W+%231505%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5H+2M5","website":"https://kreindlerlaw.com","blurb":"Immigration in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 75 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/kreindler-law-toronto.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Jerry Kreindler","title":"Principal"}],"areas":["Business immigration","Work permits","Intra-company transfers","Permanent residence","Temporary resident permits","Labour market impact assessments","Canadian citizenship","Family sponsorship"]}}',NULL,'Kreindler Law is a Toronto immigration firm handling Canadian business immigration, work permits, permanent residence and family sponsorship. Principal Jerry Kreindler has over 30 years of experience helping domestic, multinational and international organizations transfer employees and their families across borders. The business immigration practice covers NAFTA and CETA professionals, intra-company transfers, work permits, Labour Market Impact Assessments, investors, entrepreneurs, provincial nominees, temporary resident permits and rehabilitation applications.

The firm has served clients from around the world for over 25 years and also assists private individuals with citizenship, permanent residence, visas to work, study or live in Canada, and sponsorship of family members. Jerry holds an LL.B. from Queen Mary College, University of London and a BA from McGill, and belongs to Canadian Bar Association immigration sections in Ontario.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('bola-akinnusi-barrie','Bola Akinnusi','Barrie','ON','simcoe-central',0,4.9,75,44.390117,-79.687961,'{"name":"Bola Akinnusi","city":"Barrie","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"simcoe-central","province":"ON","lat":44.390117,"lng":-79.687961,"address":"28 Owen St Ste 203, Barrie, ON L4M 3G7","phone":"+17057927818","rating":4.9,"count":75,"slug":"bola-akinnusi-barrie","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Bola+Akinnusi+Barrie+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=28+Owen+St+Ste+203%2C+Barrie%2C+ON+L4M+3G7","website":"https://www.bolalawfirm.com","blurb":"Immigration in Barrie. Rated 4.9 from 75 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/bola-akinnusi-barrie.jpg","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Bola Akinnusi","title":"Lawyer"}],"areas":["Business law","Family law","Immigration","Criminal law","Real estate","Corporate law","Purchase and sale of business","Equalization of net family property"],"serving":["Barrie","Toronto","Ontario","Greater Toronto Area"]}}',NULL,'The Law Office of Bola Akinnusi is a Barrie firm focused on immigration and citizenship, with criminal, real estate, family and business law. Bola Akinnusi was called to the bar in Nigeria in 1993 and has practised law in Ontario for more than a decade. The firm''s work in citizenship, permanent residency and temporary residency is centred on the Barrie and Simcoe area.

It also serves clients across the Greater Toronto Area, with an office on Finch Avenue West in Toronto as well as its Barrie location. Beyond immigration, the office handles criminal, real estate, family and corporate matters and can represent clients in court. Legal services are offered in English and Yoruba, with flexible hours.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('das-law-north-york','Das Law','North York','ON','toronto',0,5,73,43.7813008,-79.4164206,'{"name":"Das Law","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7813008,"lng":-79.4164206,"address":"200, 5700 Yonge St 2nd Floor, North York, ON M2M 7K2","phone":"+16476732543","rating":5,"count":73,"slug":"das-law-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Das+Law+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=200%2C+5700+Yonge+St+2nd+Floor%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2M+7K2","website":"https://daslaw.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in North York. Rated 5.0 from 73 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/das-law-north-york.png"}',NULL,'Das Law is a general practice law firm in North York, Ontario. The office is at 200, 5700 Yonge Street, 2nd Floor, North York, Ontario M2M 7K2. The firm is listed under general practice, which points to work across several everyday areas of law rather than a single field. Further details about its lawyers and services are not currently available.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('pinto-shekib-llp-north-york','Pinto Shekib LLP','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.8,75,43.7648261,-79.4128023,'{"name":"Pinto Shekib LLP","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7648261,"lng":-79.4128023,"address":"4950 Yonge St SUITE 2200, North York, ON M2N 6K1","phone":"+14169019984","rating":4.8,"count":75,"slug":"pinto-shekib-llp-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pinto+Shekib+LLP+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4950+Yonge+St+SUITE+2200%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+6K1","website":"https://www.pintoshekib.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in North York. Rated 4.8 from 75 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/pinto-shekib-llp-north-york.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Sancia Pinto"},{"name":"Farhad Shekib"}],"areas":["Civil and commercial litigation","Estates and trusts litigation","Employment law and litigation","Wrongful dismissal","Constructive dismissal","Disability insurance"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Litigation in commercial, estates and employment disputes is the work of Pinto Shekib LLP, a firm in North York. Founded by Sancia Pinto and Farhad Shekib, the firm''s litigators include former Crown prosecutors with backgrounds at Bay Street firms and experience as adjudicators and mediators at Ontario tribunals. They act for multinational corporations, professionals, entrepreneurs and small businesses in civil and commercial litigation.

Estates and trusts litigation covers disputes over wills, trusts and powers of attorney, including allegations of power of attorney abuse and disputes involving beneficiaries, creditors or family members of the deceased. The firm also handles employment law and litigation, pursuing negotiated resolutions where appropriate and litigating when necessary, from its office on Yonge Street.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('patricia-brown-barrister-and-solicitor-windsor','Patricia Brown Barrister and Solicitor','Windsor','ON','southwestern',0,4.8,74,42.3161687,-83.0399495,'{"name":"Patricia Brown Barrister and Solicitor","city":"Windsor","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":42.3161687,"lng":-83.0399495,"address":"140 Park St W, Windsor, ON N9A 6V7","phone":"+15199972777","rating":4.8,"count":74,"slug":"patricia-brown-barrister-and-solicitor-windsor","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Patricia+Brown+Barrister+and+Solicitor+Windsor+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=140+Park+St+W%2C+Windsor%2C+ON+N9A+6V7","website":"https://patriciabrownlawyer.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Windsor. Rated 4.8 from 74 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/patricia-brown-barrister-and-solicitor-windsor.png","details":{"languages":["English","French"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Patricia Brown"},{"name":"Alyssa Jervis"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","Mental health law","Immigration"],"serving":["Windsor","Chatham"]}}',NULL,'In Windsor, Patricia Brown Barrister and Solicitor handles criminal defence, mental health law and immigration matters. Patricia Brown founded the firm in 2013 and is licensed to practise in both Ontario and the State of Michigan. The practice serves Windsor, Chatham and the surrounding area and handles Canadian and US immigration matters alongside its criminal defence and mental health work.

The firm appears before the Ontario Court of Justice, the Superior Court of Justice, the Court of Appeal for Ontario, the Supreme Court of Canada, the Immigration and Refugee Board of Canada, the Consent and Capacity Board and Provincial Offences Court. Alyssa Jervis and Monique Jewell are also named on the firm''s team.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lawyerrealtor-ca-toronto','LawyerRealtor.ca','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.7,75,43.6374886,-79.4242819,'{"name":"LawyerRealtor.ca","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6374886,"lng":-79.4242819,"address":"147 E Liberty St, Toronto, ON M6K 3G3","phone":"+16472370669","rating":4.7,"count":75,"slug":"lawyerrealtor-ca-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/LawyerRealtor.ca+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=147+E+Liberty+St%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M6K+3G3","website":"https://lawyerrealtor.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Toronto. Rated 4.7 from 75 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lawyerrealtor-ca-toronto.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Anita Verma","title":"Lawyer"}]}}',NULL,'Anita Verma works as both a lawyer and a realtor at LawyerRealtor, a Toronto practice covering real estate, immigration and wills and estates. Operating as Verma Law P.C., the practice also prepares family law contracts and small business contracts.

For home buyers and sellers, it offers a land transfer tax calculator, information on the first-time home buyer rebate and non-resident vendors, and checklists for purchases, sales and refinancing. Anita has communicated with clients over WhatsApp, and meetings at the Liberty Street office are by appointment only.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('nirwal-law-brampton','Nirwal Law','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,5,70,43.6826551,-79.7164914,'{"name":"Nirwal Law","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6826551,"lng":-79.7164914,"address":"104-350 Rutherford Rd S, Plaza, 2, Brampton, ON L6W 3M2","phone":"+14169093735","rating":5,"count":70,"slug":"nirwal-law-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Nirwal+Law+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=104-350+Rutherford+Rd+S%2C+Plaza%2C+2%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6W+3M2","website":"https://nirwallaw.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Brampton. Rated 5.0 from 70 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/nirwal-law-brampton.png","details":{"languages":["English","Punjabi","Hindi"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Manbir Nirwal","title":"Criminal defence lawyer"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","Assault defence","Assault causing bodily harm"],"serving":["Brampton","Ontario"]}}','{"1":[["00:00","23:59"]],"2":[["00:00","23:59"]],"3":[["00:00","23:59"]],"4":[["00:00","23:59"]],"5":[["00:00","23:59"]],"6":[["00:00","23:59"]],"7":[["00:00","23:59"]]}','Led by Manbir Nirwal, Nirwal Law is a Brampton firm that defends people charged with assault, impaired driving, drug and fraud offences. The firm practises criminal defence exclusively and serves clients across the GTA and Southern Ontario. Its areas include assault, DUI and impaired driving, drug offences, sexual offences, theft, fraud, firearms offences and stunt driving.

Manbir Nirwal earned his law degree at the University of Leicester, articled at a multidisciplinary firm in Mississauga and worked as an associate at a criminal defence firm in downtown Toronto, appearing in the Ontario Court of Justice and the Superior Court of Justice. Clients deal directly with him, and appointments can be arranged for evenings and weekends.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('pkc-law-professional-corporation-oakville','PKC Law Professional Corporation','Oakville','ON','peel-halton',0,5,69,43.4934074,-79.6786438,'{"name":"PKC Law Professional Corporation","city":"Oakville","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.4934074,"lng":-79.6786438,"address":"1939 Ironoak Wy #207, Oakville, ON L6H 3V7","phone":"+12893161723","rating":5,"count":69,"slug":"pkc-law-professional-corporation-oakville","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/PKC+Law+Professional+Corporation+Oakville+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1939+Ironoak+Wy+%23207%2C+Oakville%2C+ON+L6H+3V7","website":"https://pkclaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Oakville. Rated 5.0 from 69 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/pkc-law-professional-corporation-oakville.webp","details":{"languages":["English","Punjabi"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Preeya Cheema"}],"areas":["Real estate law","Home purchases","Home sales","Refinancing","Private mortgages","Transfer of ownership","Notary services"],"serving":["Ontario"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Home purchases, sales, refinancing and private mortgages are the core of PKC Law Professional Corporation, an Oakville real estate firm. Lawyer Preeya Cheema holds a paralegal diploma from Sheridan College and a law degree from the University of Leicester in England. Before opening the firm she worked at a firm handling traffic tickets, at a personal injury firm on motor vehicle accidents, dog bites and slip-and-fall incidents, and then at a real estate firm.

On purchases the firm examines builder agreements, agreements of purchase and sale and status certificates, and it also performs title searches and drafts contracts and negotiates terms. It provides notary services, works in English and Punjabi, and serves clients in Oakville, Mississauga, Toronto and elsewhere in Ontario.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('mo-s-law-office-london','MO''S LAW OFFICE','London','ON','southwestern',0,5,69,42.984244,-81.244236,'{"name":"MO''S LAW OFFICE","city":"London","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":42.984244,"lng":-81.244236,"address":"380 Wellington St Tower B, 6th Floor, London, ON N6A 5B5","phone":"+15197831455","rating":5,"count":69,"slug":"mo-s-law-office-london","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/MO%27S+LAW+OFFICE+London+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=380+Wellington+St+Tower+B%2C+6th+Floor%2C+London%2C+ON+N6A+5B5","website":"https://moslawoffice.com","blurb":"Immigration in London. Rated 5.0 from 69 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/mo-s-law-office-london.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Moyosore Sadiq-Soneye"}],"areas":["Immigration law","Mental health law","Notary public services","Family sponsorship","Citizenship applications","Judicial review","Procedural fairness letters","Citizenship revocation"]}}',NULL,'Mo''s Law Office in London, Ontario, offers immigration law, mental health law and notary public services. Principal counsel Moyosore Sadiq-Soneye previously served as Senior State Counsel at the Ministry of Justice in Lagos State, as a Court and Client Representative with the Ontario Public Service and as an adjudicator with the Refugee Protection Division of the Immigration and Refugee Board of Canada.

Immigration work covers sponsorship, permits, permanent residence, citizenship and appeals, with study permit and pathway support for students. Mental health matters include consent and capacity. As a notary public and commissioner of oaths, the firm handles statutory declarations, affidavits, consent to travel letters and the ordering of GCMS notes. Its office is on Wellington Street.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('keyork-immigration-law-north-york','Keyork Immigration Law','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.9,69,43.766264,-79.412998,'{"name":"Keyork Immigration Law","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.766264,"lng":-79.412998,"address":"5000 Yonge St Ste 1901, North York, ON M2N 7E9","phone":"+14164793632","rating":4.9,"count":69,"slug":"keyork-immigration-law-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Keyork+Immigration+Law+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=5000+Yonge+St+Ste+1901%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+7E9","website":"https://immigrating-to-canada.com","blurb":"Immigration in North York. Rated 4.9 from 69 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/keyork-immigration-law-north-york.png","heroImage":"images/hero/keyork-immigration-law-north-york.webp","details":{"languages":["English","French","Mandarin"],"areas":["Humanitarian and compassionate","Refugee claims","Canadian citizenship","Family sponsorship","Visitor visa","Permanent residency","Denied entry and criminality"]}}',NULL,'Keyork Immigration Law is a North York firm handling complex Canadian immigration applications, appeals and hearings. Mary Keyork is a lawyer with the Law Society of Ontario and a conseiller juridique canadien with the Quebec Bar, with more than 10 years in immigration law. She contests negative and complex decisions at all three divisions of the Immigration and Refugee Board and at the Federal Court of Canada, and works in English, French and Armenian, with conversational Spanish.

Matters include humanitarian and compassionate applications, permanent residence and residency obligations, refugee hearings, spousal and family sponsorship, visitor visas and super visas, denied entry and criminality, deportation and citizenship. The firm is based in Toronto and Montreal, and its team includes a case coordinator, a drafting assistant and a legal onboarding coordinator.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('godinho-zager-kraska-llp-mississauga','Godinho Zager Kraska LLP','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,67,43.5995714,-79.6418063,'{"name":"Godinho Zager Kraska LLP","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5995714,"lng":-79.6418063,"address":"4310 Sherwoodtowne Blvd #104, Mississauga, ON L4Z 2G6","phone":"+14167820056","rating":5,"count":67,"slug":"godinho-zager-kraska-llp-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Godinho+Zager+Kraska+LLP+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4310+Sherwoodtowne+Blvd+%23104%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L4Z+2G6","website":"https://www.gzdefence.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 67 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/godinho-zager-kraska-llp-mississauga.webp","details":{"languages":["Polish","Portuguese","English"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Reyam Zager"},{"name":"Mike Godinho","title":"Partner"},{"name":"Robert Kraska"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","Assault causing bodily harm","Sexual assault","Impaired operation","Dangerous driving","Theft"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Former criminal prosecutors make up the partnership at Godinho Zager Kraska LLP, a Mississauga criminal defence firm. Partners Mike Godinho, Reyam Zager and Robert Kraska bring more than 20 years of experience as criminal prosecutors and now defend people charged with offences ranging from murder, impaired driving causing death, armed robbery, drug trafficking and home invasion to petty theft and minor assault.

The firm acts at every stage of the criminal justice system, from bail through trial, and in quasi-criminal and regulatory matters. Services cover assault, criminal harassment, uttering threats, sexual assault, DUI and other driving offences, property crimes, fraud, firearms and drug offences, as well as record suspensions and pardons.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('steven-tress-barrister-and-solicitor-toronto','Steven Tress, Barrister & Solicitor','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.7,71,43.6542327,-79.3876639,'{"name":"Steven Tress, Barrister & Solicitor","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration","Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["immigration","criminal"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6542327,"lng":-79.3876639,"address":"425 University Ave #601, Toronto, ON M5G 1T6","phone":"+14169773657","rating":4.7,"count":71,"slug":"steven-tress-barrister-and-solicitor-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Steven+Tress%2C+Barrister+%26+Solicitor+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=425+University+Ave+%23601%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5G+1T6","website":"https://steventress.com","blurb":"Immigration / Criminal Defence in Toronto. Rated 4.7 from 71 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/steven-tress-barrister-and-solicitor-toronto.webp","bioImage":"images/bio/steven-tress-barrister-and-solicitor-toronto.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Steven Tress","title":"Criminal and Immigration Lawyer"}],"areas":["Family reunification","Visa students","Global mobility","Investors and entrepreneurs","Foreign recruitment","Regularize status","Hearings and appeals","Criminal law"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Steven Tress, Barrister & Solicitor, practises immigration law in Toronto, handling family sponsorship, permanent residence and appeals. The firm has practised Canadian immigration law in Toronto for over 35 years, acting for spouses and family members seeking sponsorship, students applying for study visas, skilled immigrants and professionals seeking permanent residence, business people and investors, and employers arranging corporate transfers or foreign recruitment.

It also assists people in Canada who want to restore status or apply on humanitarian and compassionate grounds, and those facing admissibility or deportation proceedings, immigration appeals or Federal Court applications. Cases include criminal and medical inadmissibility, misrepresentation, rehabilitation and residency appeals. Criminal law services are also offered from the University Avenue office.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('fine-and-associates-toronto','Fine & Associates','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,66,43.6503224,-79.386983,'{"name":"Fine & Associates","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6503224,"lng":-79.386983,"address":"250 University Ave Ste 200, Toronto, ON M5H 3E5","phone":"+16474926865","rating":5,"count":66,"slug":"fine-and-associates-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Fine+%26+Associates+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=250+University+Ave+Ste+200%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5H+3E5","website":"https://www.torontodivorcelaw.com","blurb":"Family Law in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 66 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/fine-and-associates-toronto.png","details":{"languages":["English","Hebrew","Russian","Urdu","Hindi","Punjabi","Gujarati"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Lori Dubin"}],"areas":["Family law","Divorce","Separation agreements","Criminal law","Prenuptial and marriage agreements","Parenting arrangements","Property division"],"serving":["Toronto","Markham","Mississauga","Brampton","Oakville","Burlington","Milton","Greater Toronto Area"]}}',NULL,'Fine & Associates Professional Corporation limits its Toronto practice to family law and divorce, including parenting, support and property division. Lawyer Lorne J. Fine graduated from Osgoode Hall Law School in 1990, was called to the bar in 1992 and has studied at Oxford. He holds certificates in negotiation, collaborative law and mediation, has mediated numerous cases and is a qualified arbitrator.

The firm seeks settlements through mediation where possible and prepares for trial when a fair resolution cannot be reached. It acts for clients across Toronto and the Greater Toronto Area, including Markham, Oakville and Mississauga, and Lorne has been interviewed on Global television and CHCH television about major family law issues in Ontario.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('baig-law-firm-mississauga','BAIG LAW FIRM','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.9,67,43.5821636,-79.7147296,'{"name":"BAIG LAW FIRM","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Immigration","Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["injury","immigration","realestate"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5821636,"lng":-79.7147296,"address":"168 Queen St S Unit 215, Mississauga, ON L5M 1K8","phone":"+19055674000","rating":4.9,"count":67,"slug":"baig-law-firm-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/BAIG+LAW+FIRM+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=168+Queen+St+S+Unit+215%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5M+1K8","website":"https://www.baiglawfirm.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury / Immigration in Mississauga. Rated 4.9 from 67 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/baig-law-firm-mississauga.jpg","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Abbas M. Baig","title":"Founding Principal"}],"areas":["Personal injury","Real estate law","Immigration law","Contract law","Franchise law","Corporate law"],"serving":["Mississauga"]}}',NULL,'BAIG LAW FIRM is a Mississauga practice handling personal injury, immigration, real estate and franchise law. Founding principal Abbas M. Baig holds a Juris Doctor from the University of Ottawa and a BSc and MSc from the University of Guelph. Before practising law he served as chief of staff to a federal Member of Parliament and as an advisor to cabinet ministers in the Government of Ontario.

He has appeared in the Federal Court of Canada, the Ontario Superior Court of Justice and the Refugee Protection Division, Refugee Appeal Division and Immigration Appeal Division of the Immigration and Refugee Board. The firm also handles motor vehicle accident, contract, corporate and civil litigation matters and serves Oakville, Milton, Brampton, Toronto, Kitchener, Waterloo, Hamilton and Niagara Falls.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('workly-law-toronto','Workly Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.8,68,43.6499932,-79.3811834,'{"name":"Workly Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6499932,"lng":-79.3811834,"address":"330 Bay St. Ste 1304, Toronto, ON M5H 2S8","phone":"+16473709787","rating":4.8,"count":68,"slug":"workly-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Workly+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=330+Bay+St.+Ste+1304%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5H+2S8","website":"https://worklylaw.com","blurb":"Employment Law in Toronto. Rated 4.8 from 68 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/workly-law-toronto.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Sunira Chaudhri"},{"name":"Tiana Perricone"},{"name":"Samantha Khaouli"}],"areas":["Employment law","HR & Employer Advisory","Workplace investigations","Corporate & Startup law","AI law","Board governance","Constructive dismissal","Wrongful dismissal","Executive compensation","Non-competition agreements"]}}',NULL,'Workly Law is a Toronto firm handling employment, labour and corporate matters for employees, executives, employers and boards. Led by Sunira Chaudhri, the firm acts across Canada on terminations, constructive and wrongful dismissal, employment contracts and offers, non-competition agreements, discrimination and human rights cases, and sexual harassment and bullying. Executive work includes negotiating contracts and disputes over bonuses, restricted share units, equity pay and long-term incentives.

Its corporate and civil work includes partnership disputes and startup law. Sunira Chaudhri comments on employment cases in the media, including radio appearances on Newstalk 1010, and the team includes Tiana Perricone, Samantha Khaouli, Jan Tomiska and Ceviel Alizadeh-Najmi. The office is on Bay Street in Toronto.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('licata-law-north-york','Licata Law','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.9,66,43.7609464,-79.4100759,'{"name":"Licata Law","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["realestate","business"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7609464,"lng":-79.4100759,"address":"4789 Yonge St Unit 1001, North York, ON M2N 0G3","phone":"+16474050470","rating":4.9,"count":66,"slug":"licata-law-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Licata+Law+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4789+Yonge+St+Unit+1001%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+0G3","website":"https://licatalawoffice.com","blurb":"Real Estate / Business Law in North York. Rated 4.9 from 66 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/licata-law-north-york.png","details":{"areas":["Real estate law","Power of sale","Family law","Commercial law & litigation","Mining law"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Licata Law is a boutique firm in North York handling real estate, family, commercial and mining law matters. Its fertility work covers surrogacy and IVF agreements.

Real estate services cover residential and commercial properties and power of sale procedures, while the family practice covers contracts and litigation. In mining, the firm acts for small, medium-sized and large businesses in the mining and natural resources sector in South America. Caterina Licata founded the firm, which serves clients across Toronto from its Yonge Street office. Most of its business comes from existing clients and referrals.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('vey-willetts-llp-ottawa','Vey Willetts LLP','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.9,66,45.4202825,-75.7010451,'{"name":"Vey Willetts LLP","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4202825,"lng":-75.7010451,"address":"222 Queen St Ste 1023, Ottawa, ON K1P 5E4","phone":"+18002967989","rating":4.9,"count":66,"slug":"vey-willetts-llp-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Vey+Willetts+LLP+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=222+Queen+St+Ste+1023%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1P+5E4","website":"https://www.vwlawyers.ca","blurb":"Employment Law in Ottawa. Rated 4.9 from 66 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/vey-willetts-llp-ottawa.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Andrew N. Vey"},{"name":"Paul J. Willetts"},{"name":"Maureen Carlos"},{"name":"R. Ross Dunsmore"}],"areas":["Employment law","Workplace law"],"serving":["Ottawa","Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Employment law is the sole focus of Vey Willetts LLP, an Ottawa firm acting for both employers and employees in workplace disputes.

Its lawyers are Andrew N. Vey, Paul J. Willetts, Maureen Carlos and R. Ross Dunsmore. They have appeared before the Ontario Court of Justice, the Superior Court of Justice, the Court of Appeal for Ontario, the Human Rights Tribunal of Ontario, the Ontario Labour Relations Board and the Canada Industrial Relations Board, as well as in arbitrations and mediations. The downtown Ottawa office serves the National Capital Region and communities including Brockville, Cornwall, Kingston, Pembroke, Petawawa and Carleton Place.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('rpc-personal-injury-lawyer-richmond-hill','RPC Personal Injury Lawyer','Richmond Hill','ON','york-durham',0,4.9,61,43.844475,-79.385304,'{"name":"RPC Personal Injury Lawyer","city":"Richmond Hill","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"york-durham","province":"ON","lat":43.844475,"lng":-79.385304,"address":"15 Wertheim Ct, Richmond Hill, ON L4B 3H7","phone":"+12898092817","rating":4.9,"count":61,"slug":"rpc-personal-injury-lawyer-richmond-hill","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/RPC+Personal+Injury+Lawyer+Richmond+Hill+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=15+Wertheim+Ct%2C+Richmond+Hill%2C+ON+L4B+3H7","website":"https://rpclaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Richmond Hill. Rated 4.9 from 61 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/rpc-personal-injury-lawyer-richmond-hill.png","details":{"areas":["Personal injury","Car accidents","Slip and fall accidents","Pedestrian accidents","Motorcycle accidents","Dog bite incidents","Public transit accidents","Orthopaedic injuries","Brain and spinal cord injuries"],"serving":["Vaughan","Richmond Hill","Georgetown"]}}',NULL,'Based in Richmond Hill, RPC Personal Injury Lawyer handles car accidents, slip and falls and other personal injury cases.

The practice also covers pedestrian and motorcycle accidents, dog bite incidents, public transit accidents, orthopaedic injuries and traumatic brain injuries. Operating as RPC Law, it has offices in Richmond Hill, Vaughan and Georgetown and belongs to the BARAPP Law Alliance. Its staff are multilingual, and its lawyers deal with insurance adjusters on behalf of injured people.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('s-and-s-lex-pc-mississauga','S & S LEX PC','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,59,43.591005,-79.636756,'{"name":"S & S LEX PC","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration","Criminal Defence","Real Estate","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["immigration","criminal","realestate","litigation"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.591005,"lng":-79.636756,"address":"90 Burnhamthorpe Rd W Ste 1501, Mississauga, ON L5B 3C3","phone":"+16476769745","rating":5,"count":59,"slug":"s-and-s-lex-pc-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/S+%26+S+LEX+PC+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=90+Burnhamthorpe+Rd+W+Ste+1501%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5B+3C3","website":"https://sslex.ca","blurb":"Immigration / Criminal Defence in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 59 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/s-and-s-lex-pc-mississauga.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Shivangi Bansal"},{"name":"Shubham Bansal"}],"areas":["Real estate law","Criminal defence","Immigration litigation","Power of attorney"]}}',NULL,'Immigration, real estate and criminal defence matters across Ontario are handled by S & S LEX PC, a Mississauga law firm.

Directors Shivangi Bansal and Shubham Bansal bring backgrounds in both Canadian and international law. Real estate work covers residential and commercial transactions, title transfers, mortgage refinancing and contract drafting. Immigration work covers visa processing, sponsorship, citizenship and permanent residence applications and appeals, and Shivangi Bansal has taken challenges to IRCC decisions to the Federal Court. The firm also prepares powers of attorney and defends criminal charges in the Ontario justice system.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('harsimran-makkar-law-professional-corporation-brampton','Harsimran Makkar Law Professional Corporation','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,5,59,43.6816981,-79.7648438,'{"name":"Harsimran Makkar Law Professional Corporation","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration","Family Law"],"caseTypes":["immigration","family"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6816981,"lng":-79.7648438,"address":"180 Queen St W, Brampton, ON L6X 1A8","phone":"+14168981313","rating":5,"count":59,"slug":"harsimran-makkar-law-professional-corporation-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Harsimran+Makkar+Law+Professional+Corporation+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=180+Queen+St+W%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6X+1A8","website":"https://hmakkarlaw.ca","blurb":"Immigration / Family Law in Brampton. Rated 5.0 from 59 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/harsimran-makkar-law-professional-corporation-brampton.png","bioImage":"images/bio/harsimran-makkar-law-professional-corporation-brampton.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Harsimran Makkar"}]}}',NULL,'In Brampton, Harsimran Makkar Law Professional Corporation handles immigration, family and civil litigation matters.

Harsimran Makkar takes the time to listen to each client, assess the available legal options and give strategic guidance tailored to the client''s situation. The practice works within Ontario''s laws and regulations and takes a proactive approach to each file. Its family law work looks at the rights and obligations people hold before they make significant decisions about their family. The office is on Queen Street West.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('hoffman-law-toronto','Hoffman Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,60,43.7323261,-79.4188601,'{"name":"Hoffman Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7323261,"lng":-79.4188601,"address":"193 Roe Ave, Toronto, ON M5M 2J1","phone":"+14166310000","rating":4.9,"count":60,"slug":"hoffman-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Hoffman+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=193+Roe+Ave%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5M+2J1","website":"https://www.hoffmanlaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 60 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/hoffman-law-toronto.png","heroImage":"images/hero/hoffman-law-toronto.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Jennifer Hoffman"},{"name":"Angela Broccolini"}],"areas":["Personal injury","Disability"],"serving":["Toronto","North York","Ontario"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Toronto personal injury and disability lawyers at Hoffman Law handle accident benefits, motor vehicle cases and long-term disability denials. The firm also deals with life insurance disputes.

Jennifer Hoffman has nearly a decade of experience at personal injury practices in Toronto, and the team includes Angela Broccolini, Anastasia Aivalis and Eli Yufest. Hoffman Law serves clients in Toronto and North York as well as throughout Ontario from its office on Roe Avenue, and it addresses who may be responsible after impaired-driving and motorcycle collisions and how accident benefits differ from an injury lawsuit.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('dudzic-peter-hamilton','Dudzic, Peter','Hamilton','ON','hamilton-niagara',0,4.8,61,43.2204865,-79.8624978,'{"name":"Dudzic, Peter","city":"Hamilton","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"hamilton-niagara","province":"ON","lat":43.2204865,"lng":-79.8624978,"address":"883 Upper Wentworth St, Hamilton, ON L9A 4Y6","phone":"+19053184441","rating":4.8,"count":61,"slug":"dudzic-peter-hamilton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Dudzic%2C+Peter+Hamilton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=883+Upper+Wentworth+St%2C+Hamilton%2C+ON+L9A+4Y6","website":"https://www.dudziclaw.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Hamilton. Rated 4.8 from 61 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/dudzic-peter-hamilton.png","details":{"areas":["Residential real estate","Mortgage transactions"]}}',NULL,'Residential real estate and mortgages are the main work of Peter Dudzic Law, a Hamilton practice.

Peter Dudzic, B.A., LL.B., earned his law degree at the University of New Brunswick after a Bachelor of Arts at the University of Western Ontario, and was called to the bar in 1994. He has practised in Hamilton since then and is a member of the Hamilton Law Association. The office handles the sale and purchase of resale properties and new and refinanced mortgages. It is in the Lime Ridge Office Complex on Hamilton Mountain, across from Lime Ridge Mall, and is wheelchair accessible.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('legal-route-brampton','Legal Route','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,5,58,43.7103569,-79.6851176,'{"name":"Legal Route","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.7103569,"lng":-79.6851176,"address":"2074 Steeles Ave E Unit 17, Brampton, ON L6T 5A5","phone":"+19052838514","rating":5,"count":58,"slug":"legal-route-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Legal+Route+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2074+Steeles+Ave+E+Unit+17%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6T+5A5","website":"https://www.legalroute.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Brampton. Rated 5.0 from 58 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/legal-route-brampton.png","details":{"areas":["Business law","Civil litigation","Criminal law","Construction law","Family law","Personal injury","Real estate law","Wills & estates"],"serving":["Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Business, family, real estate, criminal, personal injury and estate law are all offered by Legal Route, a full-service firm in Brampton.

Founder Vinay Thapliyal conceived the firm in 2017 while studying law at the University of Windsor, after noticing that many firms practise in only a few areas. The practice also covers civil litigation and construction law, and its business law work includes formation, contracts, compliance, mergers and acquisitions. Meetings take place virtually or in person, and clients are served across the Greater Toronto Area and in cities such as Ottawa, Hamilton, London, Kitchener and Windsor.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('wpc-personal-injury-lawyer-etobicoke','WPC Personal Injury Lawyer','Etobicoke','ON','toronto',0,5,58,43.736019,-79.600555,'{"name":"WPC Personal Injury Lawyer","city":"Etobicoke","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.736019,"lng":-79.600555,"address":"127 Westmore Dr, Etobicoke, ON M9V 3Y6","phone":"+18002990336","rating":5,"count":58,"slug":"wpc-personal-injury-lawyer-etobicoke","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/WPC+Personal+Injury+Lawyer+Etobicoke+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=127+Westmore+Dr%2C+Etobicoke%2C+ON+M9V+3Y6","website":"https://wpclaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Etobicoke. Rated 5.0 from 58 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/wpc-personal-injury-lawyer-etobicoke.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Eric Barapp"},{"name":"Lorne Weinstock"},{"name":"Eti Taylor"},{"name":"Nabeel Sera"},{"name":"Dino Ranchan Pius"},{"name":"Michael Brill"},{"name":"Albert Wong"},{"name":"Aurora Mancuso"},{"name":"Jeffrey Baum"},{"name":"Alexander Makaronets"},{"name":"Alex Rozine"},{"name":"Marc Tavernese"}],"areas":["Personal injury","Car accidents","Orthopaedic injuries","Slip and fall accidents","Motorcycle accidents","Public transit accidents","Pedestrian accidents","Dog bite incidents","Brain and spinal cord injuries"],"serving":["Etobicoke","Scarborough","Cayuga"]}}',NULL,'Etobicoke-based WPC Personal Injury Lawyer handles car accidents, slips and falls and other injury cases.

Eric Barapp leads a team that also includes Lorne Weinstock, Eti Taylor and Nabeel Sera, and he is a graduate of Osgoode Hall Law School. Practice areas include orthopaedic injuries, motorcycle, pedestrian and public transit accidents and dog bite incidents. Each case is assigned a case manager who coordinates documents and communication with the other parties. Operating as WPC Law, the firm has offices in Etobicoke, Scarborough and Cayuga and belongs to the BARAPP Law Alliance.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('yazdani-law-north-york','Yazdani Law','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.9,59,43.7662143,-79.4128728,'{"name":"Yazdani Law","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7662143,"lng":-79.4128728,"address":"5000 Yonge St Ste 1901, North York, ON M2N 0A7","phone":"+14166308880","rating":4.9,"count":59,"slug":"yazdani-law-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Yazdani+Law+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=5000+Yonge+St+Ste+1901%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+0A7","website":"https://disabilitylawyertoronto.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in North York. Rated 4.9 from 59 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/yazdani-law-north-york.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Mark Yazdani","title":"Disability Lawyer"}],"areas":["Fibromyalgia & chronic pain","Psychiatric disability claims","Short-term and long-term disability"],"serving":["Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Denied and terminated long-term disability benefits are the focus of Yazdani Law, a North York practice led by Mark Yazdani. The practice acts in court against insurance companies for people whose short-term or long-term disability benefits were denied or cut off.

Mark Yazdani has more than 17 years of experience as a disability lawyer. His cases involve fibromyalgia and chronic pain as well as psychiatric conditions such as depression, anxiety, bipolar disorder, PTSD and panic disorder. The practice serves Toronto and the surrounding areas from its Yonge Street office and acts for clients across Ontario.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('leadright-law-barrie','LeadRight Law','Barrie','ON','simcoe-central',0,4.9,59,44.392545,-79.6934445,'{"name":"LeadRight Law","city":"Barrie","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Immigration","Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["family","immigration","criminal"],"region":"simcoe-central","province":"ON","lat":44.392545,"lng":-79.6934445,"address":"136 Bayfield St Ste 108, Barrie, ON L4M 3B3","phone":"+16479545515","rating":4.9,"count":59,"slug":"leadright-law-barrie","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/LeadRight+Law+Barrie+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=136+Bayfield+St+Ste+108%2C+Barrie%2C+ON+L4M+3B3","website":"https://www.leadrightlaw.com","blurb":"Family Law / Immigration in Barrie. Rated 4.9 from 59 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/leadright-law-barrie.png","details":{"languages":["English","Hindi","Tamil"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Sreejith Subrahmanian","title":"Barrister & Solicitor"}]}}',NULL,'From its Barrie office, LeadRight Law offers real estate, family, criminal, immigration and estates services.

Principal lawyer Sreejith Subrahmanian has more than a decade of experience and worked with domestic and international law firms before founding the practice. Services are offered in English, Malayalam, Hindi and Tamil. Real estate work includes the purchase, sale and lease of commercial property and the drafting of contracts and leases, family work includes pre-nuptial agreements and parenting plans, and notary services include powers of attorney for selling overseas property. Fees may be flat fees or limited scope retainers.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('kinza-law-office-professional-corporation-north-york','Kinza Law Office Professional Corporation','North York','ON','toronto',0,5,57,43.7734292,-79.3313383,'{"name":"Kinza Law Office Professional Corporation","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7734292,"lng":-79.3313383,"address":"150 Consumers Rd Ste 105, North York, ON M2J 1P9","phone":"+14162690444","rating":5,"count":57,"slug":"kinza-law-office-professional-corporation-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kinza+Law+Office+Professional+Corporation+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=150+Consumers+Rd+Ste+105%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2J+1P9","website":"https://www.kinzalawoffice.com","blurb":"Real Estate in North York. Rated 5.0 from 57 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/kinza-law-office-professional-corporation-north-york.png","bioImage":"images/bio/kinza-law-office-professional-corporation-north-york.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Kinza Haider"}],"areas":["Residential real estate","Private mortgages","Immigration applications and appeals","Notary public","Status certificate review","Wills","Power of attorney","Marriage contracts","Divorce applications","Commercial lease agreements"]}}',NULL,'Residential sales, purchases, refinancing and private mortgages are the core work of Kinza Law Office Professional Corporation in North York.

Kinza Haider is the barrister, solicitor and notary public behind the firm, and the team also includes Sameena Naz and Mohammad Asad. Other services include notary public work, status certificates, affidavits, marriage contracts, commercial lease agreements and wills. The office on Consumers Road is open Monday to Friday from 9:30 a.m. to 5:30 p.m. and on weekends by appointment.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('brykman-lefler-lawyers-north-york','Brykman Lefler Lawyers','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.9,58,43.7649894,-79.4121411,'{"name":"Brykman Lefler Lawyers","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7649894,"lng":-79.4121411,"address":"4950 Yonge St Ste 1202, North York, ON M2N 6K1","phone":"+19053004991","rating":4.9,"count":58,"slug":"brykman-lefler-lawyers-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Brykman+Lefler+Lawyers+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4950+Yonge+St+Ste+1202%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+6K1","website":"https://www.bllawyers.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in North York. Rated 4.9 from 58 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/brykman-lefler-lawyers-north-york.webp","bioImage":"images/bio/brykman-lefler-lawyers-north-york.webp","details":{"founded":2014,"lawyers":[{"name":"Bobby Brykman"}],"areas":["Real estate law","Litigation","Business law","Estates"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Practising in association from North York, Brykman Lefler Lawyers covers real estate, litigation, business and estate matters.

The lawyers are not in partnership, and they combine litigation and solicitor work. The firm was formed in early 2014 and is located in the Madison Centre on Yonge Street. Bobby Brykman, an Osgoode Hall Law School graduate of 2010, handles purchases, sales, title transfers, refinances, condominium and development work, leasing and title inquiries. The firm is a member of the LawyerConnection network.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('day-borg-llp-mississauga','Day + Borg LLP','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.8,59,43.5845893,-79.7173128,'{"name":"Day + Borg LLP","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5845893,"lng":-79.7173128,"address":"93 Queen St S, Mississauga, ON L5M 1K7","phone":"+19058265670","rating":4.8,"count":59,"slug":"day-borg-llp-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Day+%2B+Borg+LLP+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=93+Queen+St+S%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5M+1K7","website":"https://www.dayborg.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Mississauga. Rated 4.8 from 59 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/day-borg-llp-mississauga.webp","bioImage":"images/bio/day-borg-llp-mississauga.webp","details":{"founded":1980,"lawyers":[{"name":"Michael J. Day"},{"name":"David J. Borg"},{"name":"Christopher A. Gray"},{"name":"Terrence M. Langlois"},{"name":"Surabhi Pahwa"},{"name":"Sanitha M. Miranda"}],"areas":["Business law","Family law","Wills and estates","Real estate","Corporate/commercial law","Litigation"],"serving":["Streetsville"]}}',NULL,'Established in 1980, Day + Borg LLP practises business, real estate, family and estate law from Streetsville in Mississauga.

The practice has stayed in the Village of Streetsville, moving in 1989 and again in 1994 to its current office on Queen Street South, and it now employs 14 staff. Business clients include corporations, entrepreneurs, emerging companies, controlling shareholders, management buy-out groups and boards of directors. The real estate group handles title searches, residential and commercial purchases and sales, and secured and unsecured mortgage lending, while the estates group prepares wills, family trusts and powers of attorney.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('nathens-siegel-llp-north-york','Nathens, Siegel LLP','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.6,61,43.7594667,-79.4098833,'{"name":"Nathens, Siegel LLP","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7594667,"lng":-79.4098833,"address":"4711 Yonge St Ste 101, North York, ON M2N 6K8","phone":"+12269802200","rating":4.6,"count":61,"slug":"nathens-siegel-llp-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Nathens%2C+Siegel+LLP+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4711+Yonge+St+Ste+101%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+6K8","website":"https://www.nathenssiegel.com","blurb":"Family Law in North York. Rated 4.6 from 61 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/nathens-siegel-llp-north-york.webp","details":{"founded":1995,"languages":["English","French"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Ken Nathens"},{"name":"Brahm D. Siegel"},{"name":"Barbara Kristanic","title":"Partner"},{"name":"Glen Schwartz","title":"Partner"},{"name":"Denniel Duong"},{"name":"Zakiya Bhayat"},{"name":"Kiana Malizia"}],"areas":["Family law","Divorce","High net-worth divorce","Alternative dispute resolution"],"serving":["North York","Mississauga","Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Family law and divorce clients in North York and Mississauga are served by Nathens, Siegel LLP, a firm founded in 1995.

Ken Nathens and Brahm Siegel started the firm, and both are certified in family law by the Law Society of Ontario. Barbara Kristanic and Glen Schwartz are also partners. Lawyers can serve clients in English or French. Matters are resolved by agreement, alternative dispute resolution or in court, and topics include the date of separation and how spousal support is calculated. The lawyers write and speak on family law, and the two offices serve families across the Greater Toronto Area.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('marin-immigration-law-ottawa','Marin Immigration Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,55,45.4189676,-75.7020451,'{"name":"Marin Immigration Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4189676,"lng":-75.7020451,"address":"280 Albert St #802, Ottawa, ON K1P 5G8","phone":"+16134545760","rating":5,"count":55,"slug":"marin-immigration-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Marin+Immigration+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=280+Albert+St+%23802%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1P+5G8","website":"https://www.marinimmigrationlaw.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 55 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/marin-immigration-law-ottawa.webp","details":{"languages":["English","French","Spanish"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Cédric Marin","title":"Founder"},{"name":"Harleen Kaur Chadha","title":"Associate Lawyer"},{"name":"Michaël Delagrée","title":"Associate Lawyer"},{"name":"Chanelle Rosenbaum","title":"Associate Lawyer"},{"name":"Agnès Chaudron","title":"Associate Lawyer"}],"areas":["Citizenship by descent","Express Entry","Judicial review","Spousal sponsorship","Reconsideration request","Work permit"],"serving":["Ottawa"]}}',NULL,'Ottawa''s Marin Immigration Law handles citizenship by descent, Express Entry and sponsorship applications for families around the world.

Founded in 2023, the firm pairs its lawyers with an in-house genealogist who locates family records for citizenship by descent applications, including those under Bill C-3. It also prepares work and study permits, files reconsideration requests, and brings Federal Court applications to overturn IRCC refusals, as well as mandamus applications. The lawyers work in English and French and are licensed by the Law Society of Ontario.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('prior-law-pc-ottawa','Prior Law PC','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.9,56,45.4184241,-75.6905294,'{"name":"Prior Law PC","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4184241,"lng":-75.6905294,"address":"200 Cooper St #4, Ottawa, ON K2P 0G1","phone":"+16134342136","rating":4.9,"count":56,"slug":"prior-law-pc-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Prior+Law+PC+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=200+Cooper+St+%234%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K2P+0G1","website":"https://www.priorlaw.ca","blurb":"Employment Law in Ottawa. Rated 4.9 from 56 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/prior-law-pc-ottawa.png","details":{"areas":["Employment law","Constructive dismissal","Employment standards","Severance package review","Human rights"]}}',NULL,'Luke Prior practises employment law for employees in Ottawa through Prior Law PC, covering severance, dismissal and human rights.

His work covers Ontario and federal workplace law, including constructive dismissal, employment standards, human rights and the assessment of severance packages. He also advises unions on collective agreement interpretation, grievance management, arbitration and bargaining, drawing on articling at an Ottawa labour firm. Meetings can be held virtually, by telephone or in person.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('aj-murray-legal-services-professional-corporation-ottawa','AJ Murray Legal Services Professional Corporation','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.6,59,45.4188072,-75.7015609,'{"name":"AJ Murray Legal Services Professional Corporation","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4188072,"lng":-75.7015609,"address":"275 Slater St. #900, Ottawa, ON K1P 6A6","phone":"+18882176707","rating":4.6,"count":59,"slug":"aj-murray-legal-services-professional-corporation-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/AJ+Murray+Legal+Services+Professional+Corporation+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=275+Slater+St.+%23900%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1P+6A6","website":"https://www.ajmurraylaw.ca","blurb":"Employment Law in Ottawa. Rated 4.6 from 59 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/aj-murray-legal-services-professional-corporation-ottawa.png","details":{"areas":["Landlord and tenant disputes","Small claims court","Human rights","Provincial offences","Employment standards","Accident benefits"]}}',NULL,'Paralegals at AJ Murray Legal Services Professional Corporation handle landlord and tenant, human rights and provincial offences matters in Ottawa.

The firm also has offices in Toronto and Hamilton. Licensed paralegal and notary public Amri Murray holds a law degree from the University of London and has more than 16 years in the legal industry. The firm appears before the Landlord and Tenant Board, the Ontario Court of Justice and the Human Rights Tribunal, and handles employment standards issues such as minimum wage and hours of work, from negotiation through to litigation.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('archstone-law-professional-corporation-mississauga','Archstone Law Professional Corporation','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.6,57,43.5971519,-79.6360272,'{"name":"Archstone Law Professional Corporation","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5971519,"lng":-79.6360272,"address":"4 Robert Speck Pkwy Ste 200, Mississauga, ON L4Z 1S1","phone":"+14167314272","rating":4.6,"count":57,"slug":"archstone-law-professional-corporation-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Archstone+Law+Professional+Corporation+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4+Robert+Speck+Pkwy+Ste+200%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L4Z+1S1","website":"https://archstonelaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Mississauga. Rated 4.6 from 57 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/archstone-law-professional-corporation-mississauga.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Moyna Khatun"}],"areas":["Family law","Accident injuries","Business taxation","Civil litigation","Real estate","Wills estate litigation"]}}',NULL,'Archstone Law Professional Corporation, in Mississauga, acts in real estate, family, immigration, estates and civil litigation matters.

Areesha Raja is the principal lawyer. She articled at an estate litigation firm in downtown Toronto, worked at firms in immigration, family, civil litigation and real estate, and represented clients at a ten-day civil trial in her first year as a lawyer. The firm acts for both plaintiffs and defendants in Ontario litigation, handles residential and commercial real estate transactions and prepares wills. During law school Areesha sat on a pro bono committee, and she still serves clients who might not otherwise afford a lawyer.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('li-cheng-business-and-real-estate-law-hamilton','Li Cheng Business & Real Estate Law','Hamilton','ON','hamilton-niagara',0,4.9,53,43.2575053,-79.8746777,'{"name":"Li Cheng Business & Real Estate Law","city":"Hamilton","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills","business"],"region":"hamilton-niagara","province":"ON","lat":43.2575053,"lng":-79.8746777,"address":"10 George St Ste 200, Hamilton, ON L8P 1C8","phone":"+19055262127","rating":4.9,"count":53,"slug":"li-cheng-business-and-real-estate-law-hamilton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Li+Cheng+Business+%26+Real+Estate+Law+Hamilton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10+George+St+Ste+200%2C+Hamilton%2C+ON+L8P+1C8","website":"https://lcheng.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Hamilton. Rated 4.9 from 53 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/li-cheng-business-and-real-estate-law-hamilton.jpg","bioImage":"images/bio/li-cheng-business-and-real-estate-law-hamilton.webp","details":{"languages":["English","Mandarin","Cantonese","Arabic"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Li Cheng"}],"areas":["Residential real estate law","Commercial real estate law","Private mortgages","Title transfers","Refinancing","Home purchase closings"],"serving":["Hamilton","Burlington","St. Catharines","Niagara","Brantford"]}}',NULL,'Serving Hamilton, Burlington and Oakville, Li Cheng Business & Real Estate Law handles residential and commercial real estate and business law. The firm has been in practice for more than ten years.

Li Cheng previously worked for all three levels of government advising on major public land development projects, and now acts for developers, lenders, businesses and home buyers and sellers. His work includes residential development projects ranging from $10 million to $200 million, as well as purchases, sales, refinancing, title transfers and private mortgages. Offices serve Hamilton, Burlington, St. Catharines and the Niagara Region, and services are available in English, Mandarin, Cantonese and Arabic.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lakhan-tram-llp-mississauga','Lakhan Tram LLP','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.9,52,43.5912644,-79.636863,'{"name":"Lakhan Tram LLP","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Civil Litigation","Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["family","litigation","realestate"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5912644,"lng":-79.636863,"address":"90 Burnhamthorpe Rd W #1400, Mississauga, ON L5B 3C3","phone":"+14166131158","rating":4.9,"count":52,"slug":"lakhan-tram-llp-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lakhan+Tram+LLP+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=90+Burnhamthorpe+Rd+W+%231400%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5B+3C3","website":"https://ltllp.ca","blurb":"Family Law / Civil Litigation in Mississauga. Rated 4.9 from 52 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lakhan-tram-llp-mississauga.webp","bioImage":"images/bio/lakhan-tram-llp-mississauga.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Ravi Sean Lakhan"},{"name":"Daniel Tram"},{"name":"Steven Le"},{"name":"Saundarya Patil"},{"name":"Anderson Ma"},{"name":"Erica Lee"},{"name":"Kathleen Watt"}],"areas":["Family law","Civil litigation","Child support","Spousal support","Property division","Parenting disputes","Construction law","Debt collection","Fraud and misrepresentation","Alternative dispute resolution"],"serving":["Mississauga","GTA"]}}','{"1":[["08:30","17:00"],["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["08:30","17:00"],["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["08:30","17:00"],["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["08:30","17:00"],["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["08:30","17:00"],["09:00","17:00"]]}','Family law and civil litigation clients across Mississauga and the GTA are served by Lakhan Tram LLP, a boutique firm.

Sean Lakhan and Daniel Tram lead the firm, whose lawyers appear regularly before the Ontario Court of Justice and the Superior Court of Justice for conferences, motions and trials. They also handle mediations and prepare domestic contracts. Family matters include child support, spousal support, property division, parenting disputes, exclusive possession of the family home, and unjust enrichment and constructive trust issues. Clients include individuals, families and small businesses.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('duke-law-firm-etobicoke','Duke Law Firm','Etobicoke','ON','toronto',0,4.9,51,43.621559,-79.522878,'{"name":"Duke Law Firm","city":"Etobicoke","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.621559,"lng":-79.522878,"address":"1199 The Queensway, Etobicoke, ON M8Z 1R7","phone":"+14164568501","rating":4.9,"count":51,"slug":"duke-law-firm-etobicoke","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Duke+Law+Firm+Etobicoke+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1199+The+Queensway%2C+Etobicoke%2C+ON+M8Z+1R7","website":"https://www.dukelawfirm.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Etobicoke. Rated 4.9 from 51 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/duke-law-firm-etobicoke.jpg","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Marko Djukic"}],"areas":["Wills, estates and trusts","Business law","Real estate law"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Real estate, business and wills and estates work in Etobicoke is the focus of Duke Law Firm, based in Toronto''s west end.

Marko Djukic leads the practice. A graduate of Osgoode Hall Law School, he finished the Schulich School of Business with distinction and worked in financial services before becoming a lawyer. The firm acts for individuals and small businesses and for national and international clients, including on probate. It bills by task, with the same fees for everyone and no hidden fees or disbursements, so clients have cost certainty.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('nika-law-llp-etobicoke','NIKA LAW LLP','Etobicoke','ON','toronto',0,4.8,52,43.6455391,-79.5222505,'{"name":"NIKA LAW LLP","city":"Etobicoke","featured":false,"tags":["Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["litigation"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6455391,"lng":-79.5222505,"address":"Bloor Islington Place, 3280 Bloor St W Ste 1050, Etobicoke, ON M8X 2X3","phone":"+19056027370","rating":4.8,"count":52,"slug":"nika-law-llp-etobicoke","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/NIKA+LAW+LLP+Etobicoke+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Bloor+Islington+Place%2C+3280+Bloor+St+W+Ste+1050%2C+Etobicoke%2C+ON+M8X+2X3","website":"https://www.nikalaw.ca","blurb":"Civil Litigation in Etobicoke. Rated 4.8 from 52 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/nika-law-llp-etobicoke.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Kavina Nagrani"},{"name":"Nithila Murugadas"},{"name":"Mandy Ubhi"},{"name":"Victoria ML Holland"},{"name":"Shireen Daneshvar"},{"name":"Marie Kazmer"}],"areas":["Wills, estates and elder law","Estate and probate","Elder abuse"]}}',NULL,'Wills, estates, trusts and elder law, including estate litigation, are the work of NIKA LAW LLP, a boutique firm in Etobicoke.

The name joins the names of founders Nithila Murugadas and Kavina Nagrani, who practise on the Etobicoke and Mississauga border. Kavina Nagrani is certified in estates and trusts law by the Law Society of Ontario and holds the TEP designation. The firm handles both planning and litigation, including will challenges, dependants support applications, estate accounting, probate and cases of financial elder abuse and power of attorney abuse. Lawyers meet clients in the office, which sits above Islington subway station, or at home.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('tlc-legal-professional-corporation-ottawa','TLC Legal Professional Corporation','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.8,51,45.2649752,-75.777379,'{"name":"TLC Legal Professional Corporation","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.2649752,"lng":-75.777379,"address":"240 Kennevale Dr Ste 102, Nepean, ON K2J 0C3","phone":"+16134407400","rating":4.8,"count":51,"slug":"tlc-legal-professional-corporation-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/TLC+Legal+Professional+Corporation+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=240+Kennevale+Dr+Ste+102%2C+Nepean%2C+ON+K2J+0C3","website":"https://www.tlclegal.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Ottawa. Rated 4.8 from 51 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/tlc-legal-professional-corporation-ottawa.webp","details":{"areas":["Real estate law","Wills and estates","Business and not-for-profit law"]}}',NULL,'In the Barrhaven area of Ottawa, TLC Legal Professional Corporation focuses on real estate, wills and estates, and charity law.

Tanya Carlton founded the firm after practising since 2013, including time at Carter''s Professional Corporation and Drache Aptowitzer LLP, where she served not-for-profit clients. She holds a Juris Doctor from the University of Ottawa. Lawyers Jordan Scorgie and Dean Barrett also practise there. The practice covers home purchases, sales and remortgages, wills and estates, and business, charity and not-for-profit law, and it offers notary public services.','dynamic','live',NULL);
