The firm acts for individuals and their families who have suffered serious injury, including injuries from car accidents, brain injuries, chronic pain, slip and fall injuries, product liability matters and disability cases.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('realcorp-law-professional-corporation-mississauga','RealCorp Law Professional Corporation','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.9,49,43.5203179,-79.6899752,'{"name":"RealCorp Law Professional Corporation","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5203179,"lng":-79.6899752,"address":"3075 Ridgeway Dr Unit 32, Mississauga, ON L5L 5M6","phone":"+19055697920","rating":4.9,"count":49,"slug":"realcorp-law-professional-corporation-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/RealCorp+Law+Professional+Corporation+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=3075+Ridgeway+Dr+Unit+32%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5L+5M6","website":"https://www.real-corp-law.com","blurb":"General practice law firm in Mississauga. Rated 4.9 from 49 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/realcorp-law-professional-corporation-mississauga.png"}',NULL,'RealCorp Law Professional Corporation is a general practice law firm in Mississauga, Ontario. The office is located at 3075 Ridgeway Drive, Unit 32, in Mississauga, Ontario L5L 5M6. As a general practice, the firm is not limited to a single area of law, and it operates under the name RealCorp Law.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('matthew-m-granic-and-assoc-toronto','Matthew M Granic & Assoc','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,48,43.6682843,-79.3406617,'{"name":"Matthew M Granic & Assoc","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6682843,"lng":-79.3406617,"address":"942 Gerrard St E, Toronto, ON M4M 1Z2","phone":"+14164611291","rating":4.9,"count":48,"slug":"matthew-m-granic-and-assoc-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Matthew+M+Granic+%26+Assoc+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=942+Gerrard+St+E%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M4M+1Z2","website":"https://mglaw.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 48 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/matthew-m-granic-and-assoc-toronto.jpg","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Matthew M. Granic"}],"areas":["Immigration law","Criminal law","Labour market impact assessments","Humanitarian and compassionate applications","Federal Court judicial review","Permanent resident card renewals"]}}',NULL,'Matthew Granic has practised law in Toronto since 2001, handling immigration applications and criminal defence through Matthew M Granic & Assoc. The office serves clients in the Greater Toronto Area.

He graduated in law from the University of Windsor in 1999 and works from an office at Gerrard Street East and Pape Avenue, practising in association with the long-established Sharma law office. His practice includes humanitarian and compassionate applications and the defence of criminal and regulatory charges, with attention to the immigration consequences of facing charges. He manages each file personally, and flexible fee rates and payment plans are offered. He is a member of the Law Society of Ontario, the Toronto Lawyers Association and the Criminal Lawyers'' Association.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('justin-t-chan-toronto','Justin T. Chan','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,47,43.6515771,-79.3813526,'{"name":"Justin T. Chan","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["litigation"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6515771,"lng":-79.3813526,"address":"390 Bay St. #300, Toronto, ON M5H 2Y2","phone":"+14168672565","rating":5,"count":47,"slug":"justin-t-chan-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Justin+T.+Chan+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=390+Bay+St.+%23300%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5H+2Y2","website":"https://www.jtcprofcorp.com","blurb":"Civil Litigation in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 47 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/justin-t-chan-toronto.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Justin T. Chan"}],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Justin Chan is a Toronto barrister and solicitor handling commercial litigation and part-time general counsel work. The practice focuses on helping businesses prevent and prepare for litigation and on representing clients in litigation.

Chan was called to the bar in 2013 and holds LL.B. and LL.M. degrees from Cardiff Law School in Wales. He covers contracts and court processes in plain language, and his approach is to listen, identify the relevant facts, establish the client''s goal and advise on the most efficient way to reach it. His office is on Bay Street, and he will travel to meet clients across the GTA. He is also Vice President of Operations of Judo Ontario.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('thind-law-enterprise-professional-corporation-brampton','Thind Law Enterprise Professional Corporation','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,5,47,43.7383877,-79.6877585,'{"name":"Thind Law Enterprise Professional Corporation","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.7383877,"lng":-79.6877585,"address":"50 Delta Park Blvd Unit 4, Brampton, ON L6T 5E8","phone":"+16475675218","rating":5,"count":47,"slug":"thind-law-enterprise-professional-corporation-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Thind+Law+Enterprise+Professional+Corporation+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=50+Delta+Park+Blvd+Unit+4%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6T+5E8","website":"https://www.tlepc.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Brampton. Rated 5.0 from 47 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/thind-law-enterprise-professional-corporation-brampton.jpg","details":{"areas":["Real estate","Corporate","Immigration","Civil litigation"]}}',NULL,'Real estate, corporate and immigration law are the main work of Thind Law Enterprise Professional Corporation in Brampton. The firm also takes on civil litigation and other matters for clients across Canada.

Its office is on Delta Park Boulevard, and meetings are held in person or virtually. Clients are kept informed at each stage of a file and have easy access to their lawyer. Fees are competitive, payment arrangements are flexible, and legal strategy is set around each client''s goals. The corporate, real estate and immigration work is aimed at keeping transactions manageable for business owners who want to focus on growth.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('bridgepoint-law-kingston','BridgePoint Law','Kingston','ON','eastern',0,5,47,44.2336323,-76.4882174,'{"name":"BridgePoint Law","city":"Kingston","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["immigration","litigation"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":44.2336323,"lng":-76.4882174,"address":"221 Queen St Unit 127, Kingston, ON K7K 1B4","phone":"+16134171850","rating":5,"count":47,"slug":"bridgepoint-law-kingston","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/BridgePoint+Law+Kingston+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=221+Queen+St+Unit+127%2C+Kingston%2C+ON+K7K+1B4","website":"https://bridgepointlaw.ca","blurb":"Immigration / Civil Litigation in Kingston. Rated 5.0 from 47 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/bridgepoint-law-kingston.png","details":{"languages":["Mandarin","Cantonese","English"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Natalie Zhang","title":"Founder"}],"areas":["Immigration litigation","Business immigration","Criminal inadmissibility","Family immigration","Refugee law","U.S. immigration","China-related legal services","International arbitration"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["10:00","14:00"]]}','From offices in Kingston and Toronto, BridgePoint Law handles immigration and refugee law, Federal Court litigation and cross-border matters. Its lawyers work in English, Mandarin, Cantonese and Persian.

The immigration practice covers Federal Court applications, appeals to the Immigration Appeal Division and Refugee Appeal Division, mandamus, business immigration, family sponsorship, study and work permits, and inadmissibility arising from criminal records. Refugee work includes hearings before the Refugee Protection Division, and Legal Aid Ontario certificates are accepted. The firm also handles China-related matters, international arbitration, real estate, corporate law and wills, and Dr. Ningjing (Natalie) Zhang is a published legal scholar practising there.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ayf-law-firm-markham','AYF Law Firm','Markham','ON','york-durham',0,4.8,47,43.8539142,-79.3381945,'{"name":"AYF Law Firm","city":"Markham","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration","Criminal Defence","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["immigration","criminal","litigation"],"region":"york-durham","province":"ON","lat":43.8539142,"lng":-79.3381945,"address":"3601 Hwy 7 Suite 1104, Markham, ON L3R 0M3","phone":"+19054708929","rating":4.8,"count":47,"slug":"ayf-law-firm-markham","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/AYF+Law+Firm+Markham+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=3601+Hwy+7+Suite+1104%2C+Markham%2C+ON+L3R+0M3","website":"https://www.ayf-law.com","blurb":"Immigration / Criminal Defence in Markham. Rated 4.8 from 47 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ayf-law-firm-markham.png","details":{"languages":["English","Mandarin","Cantonese"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Alice Fan"},{"name":"Alina Zhang"}],"areas":["Family law","Criminal law","Real estate","Immigration","Paralegal services"],"serving":["GTA"]}}',NULL,'Family, criminal, immigration and real estate matters across the Greater Toronto Area are handled by AYF Law Firm in downtown Markham. The team combines lawyers, paralegals and immigration consultants.

Family services include divorce, separation, arbitration and mediation, asset division, child custody and access, and child support and spousal support. Real estate work covers residential and commercial transactions, title transfers and refinances. The firm also prepares wills and handles civil litigation, immigration appeals and criminal charges, and it works with clients around the globe as well as in the Greater Toronto Area.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('aaries-family-law-kingston','Aaries Family Law','Kingston','ON','eastern',0,4.8,45,44.2304953,-76.4827347,'{"name":"Aaries Family Law","city":"Kingston","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":44.2304953,"lng":-76.4827347,"address":"159 Wellington St #4, Kingston, ON K7L 3E1","phone":"+16134532275","rating":4.8,"count":45,"slug":"aaries-family-law-kingston","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Aaries+Family+Law+Kingston+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=159+Wellington+St+%234%2C+Kingston%2C+ON+K7L+3E1","website":"https://www.familylawyerdivorcetoronto.com","blurb":"Family Law in Kingston. Rated 4.8 from 45 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/aaries-family-law-kingston.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Mark Kim"}],"areas":["Family law","Divorce and separation","Separation agreements","Varying court orders"],"serving":["Toronto","Kingston","Greater Toronto Area","Oshawa","Brampton","Napanee","Belleville","Brockville"]}}',NULL,'Aaries Family Law has offices in Kingston and Toronto and handles divorce, separation, custody, support and property division. Separation agreements and prenuptial agreements are also part of the work.

Founder Mark Kim practised as a family mediator before becoming a family lawyer, holds a Certificate in Family Mediation from York University and completed an internship with child psychologist Dr. Barbara Fidler. Helena Kim is the firm''s chief executive officer. Clients set their budget, services and timeframe, and cases can be resolved through negotiation, mediation or collaborative family law. The offices are at Bay and Dundas in Toronto and at Brock and Wellington in Kingston, and the firm serves the GTA, Oshawa, Napanee, Belleville and Brockville.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('raluca-m-soica-barrister-and-solicitor-north-york','Raluca M. Soica, Barrister & Solicitor','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.9,44,43.7742825,-79.3384032,'{"name":"Raluca M. Soica, Barrister & Solicitor","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7742825,"lng":-79.3384032,"address":"2005 Sheppard Ave E Ste 100, North York, ON M2J 5B4","phone":"+16478499359","rating":4.9,"count":44,"slug":"raluca-m-soica-barrister-and-solicitor-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Raluca+M.+Soica%2C+Barrister+%26+Solicitor+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2005+Sheppard+Ave+E+Ste+100%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2J+5B4","website":"https://www.rms-law.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in North York. Rated 4.9 from 44 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/raluca-m-soica-barrister-and-solicitor-north-york.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Raluca Soica"}],"areas":["Estate planning","Estate administration","Probate","Guardianship","Professional executor services","Real estate transactions"],"serving":["Toronto","Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Raluca Soica, Barrister & Solicitor is a general practice law office in North York, Ontario. The office is located at 2005 Sheppard Avenue East, Suite 100, in the Toronto area. Barrister and solicitor is the title used by Ontario lawyers, and the practice is listed as a general practice rather than being limited to one area of law.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('chronicle-law-p-c-mississauga','Chronicle Law P.C.','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,43,43.5578876,-79.6996454,'{"name":"Chronicle Law P.C.","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5578876,"lng":-79.6996454,"address":"2133 The Chase, Mississauga, ON L5M 3C8","phone":"+12892709996","rating":5,"count":43,"slug":"chronicle-law-p-c-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Chronicle+Law+P.C.+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2133+The+Chase%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5M+3C8","website":"https://www.chroniclelaw.com","blurb":"Family Law in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 43 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/chronicle-law-p-c-mississauga.jpg","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Mustafa N. Khan","title":"Founder"}],"areas":["Family law","Wills and estates","Civil litigation","Divorce and separation","Parenting and custody","Child and spousal support","Property and asset division","Separation agreements","Mediation"],"serving":["Mississauga","Toronto","Brampton","Oakville","Greater Toronto Area"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Founded by lawyer Mustafa Khan, Chronicle Law handles family law, wills and estates and civil litigation from Mississauga. Legal services are available in English and Urdu.

Mustafa Khan was called to the Ontario bar in 2018 and holds an LL.B. from City, University of London. The practice, which operates as Chronicle Law P.C., serves clients in Mississauga, Toronto, Brampton, Oakville and the wider Greater Toronto Area, with attention to clients of South Asian, Middle Eastern and Muslim heritage. Family work covers divorce, parenting, support, property division, domestic agreements, mediation and collaborative family law, including religious divorce.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lafreniere-sanna-estate-law-ottawa','Lafrenière Sanna Estate Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,43,45.301497,-75.9133406,'{"name":"Lafrenière Sanna Estate Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.301497,"lng":-75.9133406,"address":"737 Silver Seven Rd Unit 10, Stittsville, ON K2V 0H3","phone":"+16138369915","rating":5,"count":43,"slug":"lafreniere-sanna-estate-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lafreni%C3%A8re+Sanna+Estate+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=737+Silver+Seven+Rd+Unit+10%2C+Stittsville%2C+ON+K2V+0H3","website":"https://estatelawboutique.com","blurb":"Wills & Estates in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 43 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lafreniere-sanna-estate-law-ottawa.png","bioImage":"images/bio/lafreniere-sanna-estate-law-ottawa.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Chantal M.J. Lafrenière"},{"name":"Natalie A. Sanna"}],"areas":["Probate applications","Wills","Estates","Trusts","Guardianship"]}}',NULL,'Estate planning and trusts are the focus of Lafrenière Sanna Estate Law, formerly Persona Law Group, in the Ottawa area. Its office is in Stittsville.

Each lawyer practises in a limited number of areas so that advice is detailed within those fields, and the combined practices extend from estate planning and powers of attorney to trusts and real estate. Chantal Lafrenière earned her law degree in French at the University of Ottawa and articled at an Ottawa labour and employment firm, and Natalie Sanna is also a lawyer with the firm. A law clerk and administrative staff support the lawyers, and a first meeting is arranged with the lawyer able to advise on the matter.','dynamic','live',NULL);
