The office is at 43 Church Street in St. Catharines. Lawyer Lilia holds an Honours Bachelor of Arts in political science from the University of Toronto and received a full academic scholarship in law school, where she was involved with a neighbourhood legal clinic. She volunteers as a mock trial coach with the Ontario Justice Education Network. The business work covers starting, buying or merging with an existing business, and the wills work covers will drafting.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('kooner-law-brampton','Kooner Law','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,4.9,43,43.685466,-79.7615123,'{"name":"Kooner Law","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.685466,"lng":-79.7615123,"address":"9 George St N Unit 102, Brampton, ON L6X 0T6","phone":"+19057981826","rating":4.9,"count":43,"slug":"kooner-law-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kooner+Law+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=9+George+St+N+Unit+102%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6X+0T6","website":"https://www.koonerlaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Brampton. Rated 4.9 from 43 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/kooner-law-brampton.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Indervir Kooner"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","Driving offences","Assault","Drug offences","Bail hearings"],"serving":["Brampton","Mississauga","Greater Toronto Area"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Criminal defence is the only work of Kooner Law, a Brampton firm acting on driving, assault and drug charges. Lawyer Indervir Kooner represents clients at every stage, from arrest through bail, trial and sentencing.

The firm serves Brampton, Mississauga and the wider Greater Toronto Area and acts across Ontario. It accepts Legal Aid certificates and offers flexible payment options. It also helps clients understand bail and release from custody, how a case will be heard, their rights at trial and sentencing principles, and whether they qualify for Legal Aid Ontario coverage.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('mackenzie-family-law-pc-toronto','Mackenzie Family Law PC','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,41,43.7072517,-79.3994818,'{"name":"Mackenzie Family Law PC","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7072517,"lng":-79.3994818,"address":"2300 Yonge St, Toronto, ON M4P 1E4","phone":"+14165491649","rating":5,"count":41,"slug":"mackenzie-family-law-pc-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mackenzie+Family+Law+PC+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2300+Yonge+St%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M4P+1E4","website":"https://mackenziefamilylaw.com","blurb":"Family Law in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 41 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/mackenzie-family-law-pc-toronto.png","details":{"founded":2018,"lawyers":[{"name":"Jaclyn Mackenzie","title":"Senior family law counsel"}],"areas":["Family law","Child protection"],"serving":["Toronto","GTA"]}}',NULL,'Jaclyn Mackenzie leads Mackenzie Family Law PC, a Toronto firm for divorce, parenting, support and child protection cases. Her practice is exclusively family law and child protection law.

Jaclyn Mackenzie was called to the Ontario bar in 2014 and founded the firm in 2018 after several years at a boutique family law practice. Her work covers decision-making responsibility, parenting time, child support, spousal support and restraining orders, and a significant part of it involves representing parents and other family members in proceedings with Children''s Aid Societies. Legal Aid Ontario certificates are accepted, and private clients can retain the firm hourly or on a flat fee for court materials.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('farjoud-law-professional-corporation-north-york','Farjoud Law Professional Corporation','North York','ON','toronto',0,5,40,43.7647786,-79.412983,'{"name":"Farjoud Law Professional Corporation","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7647786,"lng":-79.412983,"address":"4950 Yonge St Ste 2200-12, North York, ON M2N 6K1","phone":"+16476066776","rating":5,"count":40,"slug":"farjoud-law-professional-corporation-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Farjoud+Law+Professional+Corporation+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4950+Yonge+St+Ste+2200-12%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+6K1","website":"https://www.farjoudlaw.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in North York. Rated 5.0 from 40 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/farjoud-law-professional-corporation-north-york.png","details":{"areas":["Bail hearings","Weapons offences","Impaired driving","Domestic assault","Fraud","Robbery","Drug offences","Sexual assault","Bail reviews","Criminal defence"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'In North York, Farjoud Law Professional Corporation defends clients charged with criminal offences in Toronto and across Ontario. The firm is led by criminal defence lawyer Arman Farjoud.

Arman Farjoud earned a Bachelor of Arts with Honours at the University of Guelph and a Juris Doctor at the University of Windsor, and he has focused his practice on criminal law, from theft and assault to robbery and murder charges. Services include surrendering to police, bail hearings and bail variations, pre-trials, preliminary hearings, trials, and applications to destroy fingerprints and photos or suspend a criminal record. Clients can reach counsel directly and expect a reply within 24 hours. The firm works in Scarborough, Brampton, Newmarket, Etobicoke, Mississauga and Oshawa.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('quail-warfe-kreder-llp-mississauga','Quail Warfe Kreder LLP','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.8,41,43.5923772,-79.6380369,'{"name":"Quail Warfe Kreder LLP","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["injury","employment"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5923772,"lng":-79.6380369,"address":"East Tower, 77 City Centre Dr Ste 501, Mississauga, ON L5B 1M5","phone":"+19056025265","rating":4.8,"count":41,"slug":"quail-warfe-kreder-llp-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Quail+Warfe+Kreder+LLP+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=East+Tower%2C+77+City+Centre+Dr+Ste+501%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5B+1M5","website":"https://www.qwklawyers.com","blurb":"Personal Injury / Employment Law in Mississauga. Rated 4.8 from 41 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/quail-warfe-kreder-llp-mississauga.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Luis Quail"},{"name":"Michael Warfe"},{"name":"Richard Kreder"}],"areas":["Short-term and long-term disability"]}}',NULL,'Known as QWK Lawyers, Quail Warfe Kreder LLP is a Mississauga personal injury and employment law firm. Its East Tower office is on City Centre Drive.

Founders Luis Quail, Michael Warfe and Richard Kreder established the firm on a philosophy of putting the client first, and they have acted for clients at every level of court. The firm deals with insurance companies, employers, government agencies and other lawyers on a client''s behalf so the client can focus on recovery. Personal injury work includes school, daycare and summer camp accidents.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('howard-and-howard-ottawa','Howard and Howard','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.8,41,45.3928326,-75.7546329,'{"name":"Howard and Howard","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3928326,"lng":-75.7546329,"address":"376 Churchill Ave N Ste 302, Ottawa, ON K1Z 5C3","phone":"+16137261221","rating":4.8,"count":41,"slug":"howard-and-howard-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Howard+and+Howard+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=376+Churchill+Ave+N+Ste+302%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1Z+5C3","website":"https://howardlawoffice.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Ottawa. Rated 4.8 from 41 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/howard-and-howard-ottawa.jpg","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Daniel Howard"},{"name":"David Howard"}],"areas":["Criminal law","Family law","Wills and estates","Mental health law","Consent and capacity board hearings","Criminal defence","Powers of attorney"],"serving":["Ottawa","Eastern Region of Ontario","Pembroke","Renfrew","Kingston","Brockville","Perth","Cornwall"]}}',NULL,'Howard and Howard is an Ottawa law office covering criminal defence, family law, wills and estates and mental health law. Lawyers David Howard and Daniel Howard serve eastern Ontario and accept Legal Aid certificates for criminal and family matters.

The firm serves Ottawa, L''Orignal, Pembroke, Renfrew, Killaloe, Kingston, Brockville, Perth, Smiths Falls and Cornwall, and its lawyers have appeared in all levels of court in Ontario. Criminal work ranges from domestic and sexual assault, impaired driving and drug offences to homicide, and includes arranging bail and conducting trials. The firm also prepares wills, powers of attorney and estate applications with or without a will.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('jbrennan-law-london','JBrennan Law','London','ON','southwestern',0,4.7,41,42.9884909,-81.2549378,'{"name":"JBrennan Law","city":"London","featured":false,"tags":["Civil Litigation","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["litigation","business"],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":42.9884909,"lng":-81.2549378,"address":"585 Talbot St, London, ON N6A 2T2","phone":"+12262366306","rating":4.7,"count":41,"slug":"jbrennan-law-london","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/JBrennan+Law+London+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=585+Talbot+St%2C+London%2C+ON+N6A+2T2","website":"https://www.jbrennanlaw.ca","blurb":"Civil Litigation / Business Law in London. Rated 4.7 from 41 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/jbrennan-law-london.jpg","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"John Brennan"}],"areas":["Commercial litigation","Business disputes","Contractual disputes","Property disputes"],"serving":["Ontario"]}}',NULL,'John Brennan runs JBrennan Law in London, Ontario, handling commercial litigation and business, contract and property disputes. He acts for clients at all levels of court throughout Ontario.

He also appears before the Human Rights Tribunal, the License Appeal Tribunal and other administrative tribunals. John Brennan is a member of the Middlesex, Elgin, Ontario and Canadian Bar Associations, the Osgoode Society for Legal History and the Advocates Society, and his office is on Talbot Street.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('stellar-law-professional-corporation-north-york','Stellar Law Professional Corporation','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.8,40,43.7617192,-79.4080531,'{"name":"Stellar Law Professional Corporation","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7617192,"lng":-79.4080531,"address":"45 Sheppard Ave E #414, North York, ON M2N 5W9","phone":"+14168212529","rating":4.8,"count":40,"slug":"stellar-law-professional-corporation-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Stellar+Law+Professional+Corporation+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=45+Sheppard+Ave+E+%23414%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+5W9","website":"https://stellarlaw.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in North York. Rated 4.8 from 40 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/stellar-law-professional-corporation-north-york.png","details":{"languages":["English","Farsi"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Rana Nosratpanah"},{"name":"David Lee"}],"areas":["Civil litigation","Family law","Criminal defence","Corporate commercial law","Wills and estates"]}}',NULL,'Lawyers at Stellar Law Professional Corporation in North York act in civil litigation, family law and criminal defence. The practice also covers corporate commercial law and wills and estates.

Its lawyers, including Rana Nosratpanah and David Lee, have argued before provincial and federal courts. In family matters the firm works toward resolution through alternative dispute resolution or at trial. Flexible retainers are offered, and legal help is available outside business hours across the Greater Toronto Area, with an office on Sheppard Avenue East.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('moreau-family-law-professional-corporation-barrie','Moreau Family Law Professional Corporation','Barrie','ON','simcoe-central',0,4.8,40,44.3947664,-79.695176,'{"name":"Moreau Family Law Professional Corporation","city":"Barrie","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"simcoe-central","province":"ON","lat":44.3947664,"lng":-79.695176,"address":"178 Bayfield St Ste 302, Barrie, ON L4M 3B5","phone":"+17057214441","rating":4.8,"count":40,"slug":"moreau-family-law-professional-corporation-barrie","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Moreau+Family+Law+Professional+Corporation+Barrie+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=178+Bayfield+St+Ste+302%2C+Barrie%2C+ON+L4M+3B5","website":"https://www.moreaufamilylaw.com","blurb":"Family Law in Barrie. Rated 4.8 from 40 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/moreau-family-law-professional-corporation-barrie.png","details":{"areas":["Family law","Separation agreements","Property division","Spousal support","Child support"],"serving":["Barrie","Orillia","Midland","Collingwood","Angus","Alliston","Innisfil","Springwater"]}}',NULL,'Divorce, spousal support, child support and property division are the focus of Moreau Family Law Professional Corporation in Barrie. The practice also prepares separation agreements and cohabitation or marriage contracts.

It advises on changes in circumstances involving children or finances and explores alternative dispute resolution with each client, aiming for low-cost, low-conflict outcomes. Litigation is recommended and handled when needed. Clients come from Barrie, Orillia, Midland, Collingwood, Angus, Alliston, Innisfil, Springwater, Oro Medonte, Bracebridge and the Muskoka area.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('garson-immigration-law-north-york','Garson Immigration Law','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.9,39,43.7648261,-79.4128023,'{"name":"Garson Immigration Law","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7648261,"lng":-79.4128023,"address":"4950 Yonge St # 302, North York, ON M2N 6K1","phone":"+14163212860","rating":4.9,"count":39,"slug":"garson-immigration-law-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Garson+Immigration+Law+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4950+Yonge+St+%23+302%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+6K1","website":"https://www.garsonil.com","blurb":"Immigration in North York. Rated 4.9 from 39 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/garson-immigration-law-north-york.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"David L.P. Garson"}],"areas":["Canadian immigration","U.S. immigration","Immigration law"]}}',NULL,'Immigration law is the only practice of Garson Immigration Law, a North York firm acting for corporations and individuals. It handles Canadian immigration as well as U.S. immigration for Canadians.

Founding partner David Garson has led immigration firms in Toronto and is certified by the Law Society of Ontario in the field. The firm advises on Canadian immigration, including Express Entry, provincial nominee programs and family sponsorship such as the Parents and Grandparents Program, and assists Canadians who want to immigrate to the USA. Clients include businesses and professionals across a range of industries.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('amani-law-office-richmond-hill','Amani Law Office','Richmond Hill','ON','york-durham',0,5,38,43.8712158,-79.4362765,'{"name":"Amani Law Office","city":"Richmond Hill","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"york-durham","province":"ON","lat":43.8712158,"lng":-79.4362765,"address":"27 Major Mackenzie Dr E Ste 203, Richmond Hill, ON L4C 1G6","phone":"+18669485951","rating":5,"count":38,"slug":"amani-law-office-richmond-hill","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Amani+Law+Office+Richmond+Hill+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=27+Major+Mackenzie+Dr+E+Ste+203%2C+Richmond+Hill%2C+ON+L4C+1G6","website":"https://amanilaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Richmond Hill. Rated 5.0 from 38 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/amani-law-office-richmond-hill.jpg","details":{"serving":["Richmond Hill"]}}',NULL,'Immigration, notary public, real estate and estate-planning services are offered by Amani Law Office in Richmond Hill. It also acts in civil litigation and criminal matters.

The office is in Suite 203 at 27 Major Mackenzie Drive East in Richmond Hill, and appointments can be booked. Information about the practice is presented in both English and Farsi. In all, the six service areas are immigration, notary public, real estate, wills and powers of attorney, civil litigation and criminal matters.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ian-j-collins-toronto','Ian J. Collins','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.6,40,43.6686842,-79.3882061,'{"name":"Ian J. Collins","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6686842,"lng":-79.3882061,"address":"44 Charles St W Ste 1806, Toronto, ON M4Y 1R7","phone":"+14168169455","rating":4.6,"count":40,"slug":"ian-j-collins-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Ian+J.+Collins+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=44+Charles+St+W+Ste+1806%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M4Y+1R7","website":"https://www.iancollinslawyer.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Toronto. Rated 4.6 from 40 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ian-j-collins-toronto.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Ian J. Collins","title":"Senior Trial & Traffic Ticket Lawyer"}],"areas":["Drug offences","Traffic tickets"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Toronto trial lawyer Ian Collins defends impaired driving, traffic and drug charges across the Greater Toronto Area. His practice is restricted to defending charges.

Charges include over 80, fail to remain, dangerous driving, stunt driving, careless driving and drug offences, as well as traffic tickets. He articled for the Attorney General of Ontario and has conducted trials in all levels of court throughout Ontario. His defence work includes challenging police evidence, notes and reports and raising breaches of the Canadian Charter of Rights. He acts for clients in Toronto, Mississauga, Whitby, Richmond Hill, Markham, Brampton and Oshawa.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('david-genis-north-york','David Genis','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.8,38,43.7833298,-79.4160491,'{"name":"David Genis","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["criminal","litigation"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7833298,"lng":-79.4160491,"address":"5775 Yonge St #602, North York, ON M2M 4J1","phone":"+14165122345","rating":4.8,"count":38,"slug":"david-genis-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/David+Genis+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=5775+Yonge+St+%23602%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2M+4J1","website":"https://davidgenis.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Civil Litigation in North York. Rated 4.8 from 38 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/david-genis-north-york.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"David Genis"}],"areas":["Driving offences","Assault","Sexual offences","Theft and fraud","Drug offences","Impaired driving","Domestic assault","Over 80 mg","Drug possession","Sexual assault"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}','{"1":[["00:00","23:59"]],"2":[["00:00","23:59"]],"3":[["00:00","23:59"]],"4":[["00:00","23:59"]],"5":[["00:00","23:59"]],"6":[["00:00","23:59"]],"7":[["00:00","23:59"]]}','Criminal lawyer David Genis defends impaired driving, assault, drug and other charges from his North York office. He also appears as an immigration lawyer in matters before the Immigration Appeal Division and the Federal Court of Canada.

He graduated from Osgoode Hall Law School, articled with a Toronto criminal defence firm and appears in the Ontario Court of Justice, the Superior Court and the Court of Appeal for Ontario. Clients speak English, Mandarin, Cantonese, Russian and Ukrainian, and most appear in Toronto, Newmarket or Brampton courts. Charges handled include over 80 mg, refuse sample, dangerous driving, sexual offences, thefts, frauds and domestic assault. He belongs to the Criminal Lawyers Association.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('junction-law-professional-corporation-toronto','Junction Law Professional Corporation','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,37,43.664227,-79.4561636,'{"name":"Junction Law Professional Corporation","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.664227,"lng":-79.4561636,"address":"1655 Dupont St Ste 101, Toronto, ON M6P 3T1","phone":"+14184551524","rating":4.9,"count":37,"slug":"junction-law-professional-corporation-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Junction+Law+Professional+Corporation+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1655+Dupont+St+Ste+101%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M6P+3T1","website":"https://www.junctionlaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 37 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/junction-law-professional-corporation-toronto.png","details":{"founded":2022,"languages":["English","French"],"areas":["Real estate law","Residential real estate","Commercial real estate"],"serving":["Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Serving clients across Ontario in English and French, Junction Law Professional Corporation is a Toronto real estate law firm. The firm was founded in 2022 by Laurence and has grown into a team of four working only in real estate law.

Residential and commercial work covers acquisitions, financing, dispositions and development for investors, developers, business owners, lenders and property owners, as well as home purchases and refinancing. Laurence holds an LL.B. from Université Laval and an LL.M. in Canadian common law from Osgoode Hall Law School, and her family has a multi-generational involvement in real estate.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('bickhram-litigation-mississauga','Bickhram Litigation','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.9,37,43.5937158,-79.6381064,'{"name":"Bickhram Litigation","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["litigation"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5937158,"lng":-79.6381064,"address":"55 City Centre Dr #700, Mississauga, ON L4Z 0B8","phone":"+19053619787","rating":4.9,"count":37,"slug":"bickhram-litigation-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Bickhram+Litigation+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=55+City+Centre+Dr+%23700%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L4Z+0B8","website":"https://www.bickhramlitigation.com","blurb":"Civil Litigation in Mississauga. Rated 4.9 from 37 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/bickhram-litigation-mississauga.png","bioImage":"images/bio/bickhram-litigation-mississauga.webp","details":{"areas":["Power of attorney litigation"]}}',NULL,'Estate, trust, capacity and guardian litigation, along with family law litigation, is the work of Bickhram Litigation in Mississauga. Rick Bickhram leads the practice, which resolves disputes through negotiation, mediation or advocacy in the courtroom.

Estate work includes contesting an estate trustee''s compensation, and family matters include the enforceability of kitchen table domestic contracts, as considered in Anderson v. Anderson, 2023 SCC 13. Evening and weekend meetings can be arranged on request, and Shaista Uddin serves as operations manager. The office is on City Centre Drive.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('davylaw-north-york','DavyLaw','North York','ON','toronto',0,5,36,43.7602644,-79.4109593,'{"name":"DavyLaw","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7602644,"lng":-79.4109593,"address":"4750 Yonge St Unit 352, North York, ON M2N 0J6","phone":"+16476136349","rating":5,"count":36,"slug":"davylaw-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/DavyLaw+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4750+Yonge+St+Unit+352%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+0J6","website":"https://davylaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in North York. Rated 5.0 from 36 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/davylaw-north-york.webp","heroImage":"images/hero/davylaw-north-york.webp","details":{"languages":["English","Russian"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Irina Davydova"}],"areas":["Real estate","Business","Wills and estates","Notary","Immigration","Family","Franchise"]}}',NULL,'DavyLaw is a North York practice handling real estate, wills and estates, business and immigration matters across Toronto and the GTA. It also takes on family and franchise work and provides notary services, along with a check of documents before signing, such as agreements of purchase and sale, status certificates and commercial leases.

Irina Davydova studied law at City, University of London, and has experience in real estate law, particularly mortgage matters, having once managed a boutique mortgage brokerage. She also acts on commercial matters and offers immigration services. The firm works in English and Russian, supports virtual signing, offers after-hours and weekend appointments, and provides a land transfer tax calculator that accounts for first-time homebuyer rebates.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('mehrez-law-ottawa','Mehrez Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,36,45.3443123,-75.9246964,'{"name":"Mehrez Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3443123,"lng":-75.9246964,"address":"1000 Innovation Dr Ste 500, Kanata, ON K2K 3E7","phone":"+16132663239","rating":5,"count":36,"slug":"mehrez-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mehrez+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1000+Innovation+Dr+Ste+500%2C+Kanata%2C+ON+K2K+3E7","website":"https://www.mehrezlaw.com","blurb":"General practice law firm in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 36 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/mehrez-law-ottawa.png","details":{"areas":["Business law","Litigation and dispute resolution","Employment law","Immigration law"],"serving":["Ontario","Quebec"]}}',NULL,'From its Kanata office in Ottawa, Mehrez Law handles business law, employment law, immigration and litigation for clients in Ontario and Quebec. The firm was founded in Ottawa and combines legal training from several jurisdictions with local knowledge.

Its work covers business transactions, litigation and dispute resolution, employment matters for employers and employees, and immigration to Canada. A fractional legal counsel service gives businesses on-demand access to lawyers licensed in Ontario and Québec for contracts, employment questions, litigation risk and immigration issues. Clients include individuals, families and corporations, and the firm also serves people internationally.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('sheard-law-professional-corporation-toronto','Sheard Law Professional Corporation','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,36,43.6633962,-79.3403069,'{"name":"Sheard Law Professional Corporation","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["family","litigation"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6633962,"lng":-79.3403069,"address":"235 Carlaw Ave 5th Floor, Toronto, ON M4M 2S1","phone":"+14168609990","rating":5,"count":36,"slug":"sheard-law-professional-corporation-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sheard+Law+Professional+Corporation+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=235+Carlaw+Ave+5th+Floor%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M4M+2S1","website":"https://www.sheardlaw.com","blurb":"Family Law / Civil Litigation in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 36 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/sheard-law-professional-corporation-toronto.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"John Sheard","title":"Senior Litigator"}],"areas":["Family law","Parenting and child support","Property division","Probate and estate administration","Will challenges and estate litigation","Separation agreements and mediation"],"serving":["Toronto","Danforth","Riverdale","Leslieville","East York","GTA"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Family law and estate litigation are the core of Sheard Law Professional Corporation, a Toronto firm founded in 2005. Its work also includes probate, estate administration and mediation, and it serves Danforth Village, Riverdale, Leslieville, Playter Estates and East York.

John Sheard has more than 20 years of legal experience and training in family mediation. His approach is to organize the issues, run the calculations and seek resolution first, litigating only when necessary. For nearly ten years he has also acted as an agent for the Office of the Children''s Lawyer, representing children in high-conflict custody disputes. The firm practises in association with Longo Lawyers, which adds a second office at Yonge and Sheppard.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('stampone-law-hamilton','Stampone Law','Hamilton','ON','hamilton-niagara',0,5,36,43.2175435,-79.7219142,'{"name":"Stampone Law","city":"Hamilton","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"hamilton-niagara","province":"ON","lat":43.2175435,"lng":-79.7219142,"address":"426 ON-8, Stoney Creek, ON L8G 1G2","phone":"+19055611444","rating":5,"count":36,"slug":"stampone-law-hamilton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Stampone+Law+Hamilton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=426+ON-8%2C+Stoney+Creek%2C+ON+L8G+1G2","website":"https://stamponelaw.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Hamilton. Rated 5.0 from 36 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/stampone-law-hamilton.png"}',NULL,'Real estate, wills and family law are the work of Stampone Law, a Hamilton-area practice based in Stoney Creek. Siera Stampone is the owner and principal lawyer, and she also advises on estate planning, estate administration and corporate law.

She earned a Juris Doctor from the University of Ottawa in 2021, where she received the Corbin Estates Law Annual Prize and the STEP Canada Prize in wills and the law of succession. The firm is successor to the practice of Murray Mazza, who practised in Hamilton and the Niagara region for over 40 years, and it now has carriage of his files. Services include home purchases and sales, mortgage refinancing, powers of attorney, trusts and domestic contracts such as cohabitation agreements, marriage contracts and separation agreements.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('belecky-and-belecky-london','Belecky & Belecky','London','ON','southwestern',0,5,36,43.0292355,-81.2833351,'{"name":"Belecky & Belecky","city":"London","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills","business"],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":43.0292355,"lng":-81.2833351,"address":"235 N Centre Rd Ste 104, London, ON N5X 4E7","phone":"+15196735630","rating":5,"count":36,"slug":"belecky-and-belecky-london","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Belecky+%26+Belecky+London+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=235+N+Centre+Rd+Ste+104%2C+London%2C+ON+N5X+4E7","website":"https://belecky.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in London. Rated 5.0 from 36 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/belecky-and-belecky-london.png","details":{"founded":1972,"areas":["Real estate","Corporate and commercial law","Family law","Wills and estates"]}}',NULL,'Since 1972, Belecky & Belecky has handled real estate, family, wills and estates and corporate work from London, Ontario. Real estate services cover purchases and sales of homes, condominiums and cottages, title transfers, survivorship applications, private and institutional mortgages, and commercial property transactions, and documents can be signed remotely from anywhere.

Al Belecky has practised in Ontario for over 50 years in commercial real estate, business and corporate law. John Belecky has practised since 2010, focusing on residential real estate, wills and estates and family law, including probate, powers of attorney, family contracts and divorce filings. Together the lawyers serve clients across Ontario online and in person.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('coach-house-law-toronto','Coach House Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.6,39,43.6698378,-79.3856671,'{"name":"Coach House Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6698378,"lng":-79.3856671,"address":"33 Bloor St E Suite 1605, Toronto, ON M4Y 3B8","phone":"+16474838111","rating":4.6,"count":39,"slug":"coach-house-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Coach+House+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=33+Bloor+St+E+Suite+1605%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M4Y+3B8","website":"https://www.coachhouselaw.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Toronto. Rated 4.6 from 39 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/coach-house-law-toronto.webp"}',NULL,'Business, real estate, health, family and estates law, plus litigation, are handled by the lawyers of Coach House Law in Toronto. David Woodside is managing lawyer, working with lawyers Alex Litwin, Ben Hahn, Bobby Feldman, Sean Carrie and Kelly Sinclair.

Business work ranges from start-ups to large private companies, covering mergers, acquisitions, restructuring, intellectual property, employment, debt financing and capital markets. Real estate covers residential and commercial transactions, leasing and financing, while health law deals with regulatory matters, advertising and new ventures. Family law includes divorce, custody and access, support and domestic contracts, and estate planning covers wills, powers of attorney, living wills and trusts. Litigation runs from settlement and alternative dispute resolution to motions and trials.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('nspc-law-firm-ottawa','NSPC Law Firm','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.8,37,45.3784357,-75.639063,'{"name":"NSPC Law Firm","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Civil Litigation","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["family","litigation","business"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3784357,"lng":-75.639063,"address":"2417 Holly Ln Units 212B-D, Ottawa, ON K1V 7P2","phone":"+16136003705","rating":4.8,"count":37,"slug":"nspc-law-firm-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/NSPC+Law+Firm+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2417+Holly+Ln+Units+212B-D%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1V+7P2","website":"https://www.nspclaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law / Civil Litigation in Ottawa. Rated 4.8 from 37 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/nspc-law-firm-ottawa.webp","details":{"areas":["Family law","Separation and divorce","Parenting arrangements","Child and spousal support","Property division"]}}',NULL,'In Ottawa, the multilingual NSPC Law Firm practises family law, civil litigation and commercial law across Ontario. It is a general practice serving the Greater Ottawa area and the rest of the province, acting for families on personal matters and for businesses on commercial and litigation files.

Nikolay Stanchulov is the principal lawyer and director. He holds a Master of International Affairs from Carleton University and a Juris Doctor from the University of Ottawa, and worked in the hospitality industry before founding the firm.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('glass-gavel-professional-corporation-barrie','Glass Gavel Professional Corporation','Barrie','ON','simcoe-central',0,4.8,37,44.3878126,-79.6946248,'{"name":"Glass Gavel Professional Corporation","city":"Barrie","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"simcoe-central","province":"ON","lat":44.3878126,"lng":-79.6946248,"address":"49 High St 3rd floor, Barrie, ON L4N 5J4","phone":"+18333442835","rating":4.8,"count":37,"slug":"glass-gavel-professional-corporation-barrie","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Glass+Gavel+Professional+Corporation+Barrie+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=49+High+St+3rd+floor%2C+Barrie%2C+ON+L4N+5J4","website":"https://www.glassgavellaw.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Barrie. Rated 4.8 from 37 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/glass-gavel-professional-corporation-barrie.webp","details":{"areas":["Assault","Breach of court order","Break and enter","Cannabis and drugs","Driving offences","Firearm offences","Fraud and forgery","Sexual offences","Traffic tickets","Criminal harassment"],"serving":["Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Criminal charges, bail and driving offences are the focus of Glass Gavel Professional Corporation, a Barrie paralegal firm. It is owned and operated by Larissa Kushwara, a licensed paralegal and Notary Public in Ontario, and acts for people charged with criminal offences who do not qualify for Legal Aid, with flat fees and payment plans.

Areas include assault, breach of court order, break and enter, cannabis and drug offences, currency and financial offences, environmental offences and firearm offences. Ms. Kushwara grew up in Blind River, Ontario, has represented clients in courtrooms across the province, and started the firm to make legal services more accessible in Northern Ontario.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('s-s-loomba-law-professional-corporation-brampton','S S Loomba Law Professional Corporation','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,4.9,36,43.72941,-79.79622,'{"name":"S S Loomba Law Professional Corporation","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.72941,"lng":-79.79622,"address":"5 B Conestoga Dr Unit 304, Brampton, ON L6Z 4N5","phone":"+16479171707","rating":4.9,"count":36,"slug":"s-s-loomba-law-professional-corporation-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/S+S+Loomba+Law+Professional+Corporation+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=5+B+Conestoga+Dr+Unit+304%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6Z+4N5","website":"https://www.ssloombalaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Brampton. Rated 4.9 from 36 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/s-s-loomba-law-professional-corporation-brampton.webp","details":{"areas":["Immigration","Real estate","Civil litigation","Family law","Business and corporate law"],"serving":["Brampton","Greater Toronto Area"]}}',NULL,'Immigration, real estate, civil litigation and family law are handled at S S Loomba Law Professional Corporation in Brampton. Managing director Shubinder Singh Loomba is a member of the Law Society of Ontario whose practice covers civil litigation, real estate, immigration, corporate and family law.

He has assisted with matters in the Superior Court and the Ontario Court of Justice, and completed a Master of Laws in Canadian common law at Osgoode Hall Law School and a Master of Laws in corporate law at Amity Law School. The firm serves clients throughout the Greater Toronto Area, offers flexible appointment times and works with flat fees and payment plans.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('sean-kelly-law-ottawa','Sean Kelly Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.9,36,45.2703204,-75.7365905,'{"name":"Sean Kelly Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.2703204,"lng":-75.7365905,"address":"301 Bayrose Dr #102, Ottawa, ON K2J 5W3","phone":"+16139037227","rating":4.9,"count":36,"slug":"sean-kelly-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sean+Kelly+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=301+Bayrose+Dr+%23102%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K2J+5W3","website":"https://sklawottawa.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Ottawa. Rated 4.9 from 36 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/sean-kelly-law-ottawa.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Sean B. Kelly"}],"areas":["Real estate","Wills and estate planning"],"serving":["Ottawa","Barrhaven"]}}',NULL,'Based in Barrhaven, Sean Kelly Law handles real estate, wills and estate planning for clients across Ottawa. Sean Kelly is a second-generation lawyer, born and raised in Ottawa, with more than 15 years of experience.

He acts for first-time home buyers and seasoned investors, prepares agreements of purchase and sale, acts for borrowers or lenders in private financing, and handles title transfers between spouses or family members. The firm also prepares wills and advises on estate planning, and serves all neighbourhoods in Ottawa and surrounding areas.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('brown-family-law-guelph','Brown Family Law','Guelph','ON','waterloo-guelph',0,4.9,36,43.5473182,-80.2542671,'{"name":"Brown Family Law","city":"Guelph","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"waterloo-guelph","province":"ON","lat":43.5473182,"lng":-80.2542671,"address":"164 Norfolk St, Guelph, ON N1H 1Y2","phone":"+15197671111","rating":4.9,"count":36,"slug":"brown-family-law-guelph","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Brown+Family+Law+Guelph+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=164+Norfolk+St%2C+Guelph%2C+ON+N1H+1Y2","website":"https://www.brownfamilylaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Guelph. Rated 4.9 from 36 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/brown-family-law-guelph.png","bioImage":"images/bio/brown-family-law-guelph.webp","details":{"areas":["Family law","Collaborative family law","Mediation"]}}',NULL,'Brown Family Law and Mediation is a Guelph practice focused on family law settlements, mediation and collaborative law. The principal lawyer became a member of the Ontario bar in 2001, has practised only family law since 2004 and has worked as a sole practitioner since 2007.

After about 20 years in the courts, he stopped litigating to concentrate on settlement work, which leaves a more open schedule. He has training in collaborative family law and mediation, seeks to reduce conflict and create value for both sides, and limits the number of clients he acts for. Clients meet with him directly rather than with an assistant or a junior lawyer.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('viridius-lex-llp-kingston','Viridius Lex LLP','Kingston','ON','eastern',0,5,35,44.2336323,-76.4882174,'{"name":"Viridius Lex LLP","city":"Kingston","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["realestate","business"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":44.2336323,"lng":-76.4882174,"address":"221 Queen St, Kingston, ON K7K 1B4","phone":"+16139001981","rating":5,"count":35,"slug":"viridius-lex-llp-kingston","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Viridius+Lex+LLP+Kingston+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=221+Queen+St%2C+Kingston%2C+ON+K7K+1B4","website":"https://www.viridius.com","blurb":"Real Estate / Business Law in Kingston. Rated 5.0 from 35 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/viridius-lex-llp-kingston.jpg","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Rizwan Khan"}],"areas":["Real estate transactions","Environmental law","Not-for-profit","Business formation","Commercial leases and contracts"],"serving":["Kingston","Toronto","Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Real estate, corporate and commercial, environmental and not-for-profit law make up Viridius Lex LLP, a Kingston firm. It also has an office in Toronto, and a digital platform lets it handle real estate transactions anywhere in Ontario, with virtual meetings and electronic signing available.

Business services include formation, restructuring, commercial leases and contracts. Environmental work covers regulatory compliance, allocating environmental risk in business and real estate transactions, and drafting and registering conservation easement agreements. The lawyers share a background in public interest law, and the team includes partner Rizwan Khan and law clerk Sandra Choi.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('the-criminal-law-team-north-york','The Criminal Law Team','North York','ON','toronto',0,4.8,36,43.7648381,-79.4127089,'{"name":"The Criminal Law Team","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7648381,"lng":-79.4127089,"address":"4950 Yonge St SUITE 2200, North York, ON M2N 6K1","phone":"+14165506554","rating":4.8,"count":36,"slug":"the-criminal-law-team-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/The+Criminal+Law+Team+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4950+Yonge+St+SUITE+2200%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+6K1","website":"https://thecriminallawteam.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in North York. Rated 4.8 from 36 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/the-criminal-law-team-north-york.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Stephen Hebscher"},{"name":"Bruce Karten"},{"name":"Mikaela Thompson"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","Sexual assault","Dangerous driving","Violent crimes","Domestic assault","Property offences","Sexual crimes","Youth crime"],"serving":["North York","Toronto"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Criminal defence across Toronto, the GTA and Southern Ontario is the work of The Criminal Law Team, based in North York. Co-founded by Stephen Hebscher, the firm represents people facing domestic assault, sexual assault, dangerous driving, property, violent crime, drug and youth charges, including cases involving mental health considerations.

Its lawyers have decades of combined courtroom experience and have represented clients across Ontario. Stephen Hebscher and Bruce Karten, now retired, each kept their own roster of clients while working together on cases. The firm is available around the clock and publishes case summaries showing the types of matters it has handled.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('kevin-mehar-toronto','Kevin Mehar','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,34,43.6493076,-79.3853037,'{"name":"Kevin Mehar","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6493076,"lng":-79.3853037,"address":"181 University Ave #2200, Toronto, ON M5H 2X7","phone":"+14166248484","rating":5,"count":34,"slug":"kevin-mehar-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kevin+Mehar+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=181+University+Ave+%232200%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5H+2X7","website":"https://www.dumasmeharlaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 34 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/kevin-mehar-toronto.jpg","details":{"languages":["French","English"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Kevin Mehar","title":"Founder"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","Bail hearings","Violent offences","Drug offences","Sexual offences","Driving offences","Threats and criminal harassment","Firearms and weapons","Fraud and theft","Charter rights"],"serving":["Toronto","Brampton","Barrie","Mississauga","Milton","Newmarket","Oshawa","Hamilton"]}}',NULL,'Led by Kevin Mehar, Dumas Mehar Law is a Toronto criminal defence firm handling bail hearings and violent, drug and sexual offence charges. Its work also covers driving offences, threats and criminal harassment, firearms and weapons charges, fraud and theft, and Charter rights issues.

Kevin Mehar founded the firm after working at the former Adler Bytensky Prutschi and has practised criminal law for over a decade. He earned his Juris Doctor at Osgoode Hall Law School, where he took the Criminal Law Intensive Program, and appears at all levels of court in Ontario. He is fluent in French and English and represents clients in both official languages, and the firm is available 24/7.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('onley-law-business-lawyers-oshawa','Onley Law Business Lawyers','Oshawa','ON','york-durham',0,5,34,43.897281,-78.8638755,'{"name":"Onley Law Business Lawyers","city":"Oshawa","featured":false,"tags":["Business Law"],"caseTypes":["business"],"region":"york-durham","province":"ON","lat":43.897281,"lng":-78.8638755,"address":"2 Simcoe St S Ste 300, Oshawa, ON L1H 8C1","phone":"+19052152156","rating":5,"count":34,"slug":"onley-law-business-lawyers-oshawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Onley+Law+Business+Lawyers+Oshawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2+Simcoe+St+S+Ste+300%2C+Oshawa%2C+ON+L1H+8C1","website":"https://www.onleylaw.ca","blurb":"Business Law in Oshawa. Rated 5.0 from 34 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/onley-law-business-lawyers-oshawa.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Robert Onley"}],"areas":["Fractional general counsel","Business structuring","Business contracts","Trademarks","Mergers and acquisitions","Trademark and brand protection","Contract and policy reviews"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Onley Law, an Oshawa firm, acts for startups and growing businesses on incorporations, contracts, trademarks and fractional general counsel. It serves founders and owner-managed businesses across Canada, with a licensed Ontario lawyer who has more than 13 years of experience.

Trish Sawhney, a registered Canadian trademark agent, leads its trademark services: clearance searches, registration, office action responses, opposition, infringement and licensing, with recent files in SaaS, mobile apps, fintech, legal tech and EdTech. Other services cover business structuring, shareholder and employment agreements, business purchases and sales, and fractional general counsel on a monthly retainer. Work is fixed-fee wherever possible and quoted before it begins.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('progressive-legal-solutions-barrie','Progressive Legal Solutions','Barrie','ON','simcoe-central',0,4.7,36,44.3916603,-79.6938668,'{"name":"Progressive Legal Solutions","city":"Barrie","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["family","litigation"],"region":"simcoe-central","province":"ON","lat":44.3916603,"lng":-79.6938668,"address":"18 Sophia St W, Barrie, ON L4N 1J1","phone":"+17053930009","rating":4.7,"count":36,"slug":"progressive-legal-solutions-barrie","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Progressive+Legal+Solutions+Barrie+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=18+Sophia+St+W%2C+Barrie%2C+ON+L4N+1J1","website":"https://plslawyers.ca","blurb":"Family Law / Civil Litigation in Barrie. Rated 4.7 from 36 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/progressive-legal-solutions-barrie.jpg","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Evgeniy Osipov","title":"Principal Lawyer"}],"areas":["Divorce","Child custody disputes","Family law","Common law relationships","Mediation"],"serving":["Toronto","GTA","Barrie"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Divorce, parenting, support and property division are the focus of Progressive Legal Solutions, a Barrie family law firm. Founded in 2022, it serves Barrie, Simcoe County, Toronto and the GTA and is led by principal lawyer Evgeniy Osipov, with associate lawyers Ho-Ly Ha, Eva Janta and Sheikh-Arsalan Ahmed.

The firm gives priority to settling matters amicably where possible and appears in court when settlement fails. It also handles custody disputes, common-law relationships and wills. Unbundled services let people hire help for a single task, such as drafting a separation agreement or preparing for a court appearance, without taking on full representation.','dynamic','live',NULL);
