Business work includes share and asset acquisitions and dispositions and incorporations, including professional corporations. The firm also drafts domestic contracts such as cohabitation agreements, marriage contracts and separation agreements, assists with divorce, and handles residential tenancies, real estate disputes and power of sale or mortgage enforcement.','dynamic','live',NULL);
