Real estate services cover the purchase, sale and refinancing of residential property for first-time buyers and seasoned investors. Estate work includes powers of attorney for personal care and property, probate applications and estate administration. Christopher Tesseyman is also a lawyer at the firm.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('temple-of-justice-legal-service-hamilton','TEMPLE OF JUSTICE LEGAL SERVICE','Hamilton','ON','hamilton-niagara',0,5,31,43.2218169,-79.8851284,'{"name":"TEMPLE OF JUSTICE LEGAL SERVICE","city":"Hamilton","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"hamilton-niagara","province":"ON","lat":43.2218169,"lng":-79.8851284,"address":"1030 Upper James St Unit 403, Hamilton, ON L9C 6X6","phone":"+16475749545","rating":5,"count":31,"slug":"temple-of-justice-legal-service-hamilton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/TEMPLE+OF+JUSTICE+LEGAL+SERVICE+Hamilton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1030+Upper+James+St+Unit+403%2C+Hamilton%2C+ON+L9C+6X6","website":"https://templeofjustice.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Hamilton. Rated 5.0 from 31 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/temple-of-justice-legal-service-hamilton.webp","details":{"areas":["Provincial offences","Landlord and tenant","Small claims","Notary public"]}}',NULL,'Paralegals at Temple of Justice Legal Service in Hamilton handle provincial offences, tribunal matters and notary public work. The firm acts for individuals and businesses, including at the Landlord and Tenant Board and the Human Rights Tribunal of Ontario. It aims to provide a safe, welcoming environment in which clients'' rights are protected and their voices are heard.

