Personal injury matters carry no upfront legal fees, and the firm is paid only after a settlement or judgment; other services are offered at hourly rates or fixed fees. Mr. Patel earned his LL.B. and LL.M. at Osgoode Hall Law School, has practised since 2016, has appeared before the Ontario Superior Court of Justice and the Financial Services Commission of Ontario, and belongs to the Ontario Trial Lawyers Association, the Ontario Bar Association and the South Asian Bar Association.','dynamic','live',NULL);
