Its services include counsel for businesses, representation in court, estate services and advice on family legal matters. The firm aims to keep clients informed with clear advice and to treat each client as an individual rather than a case number. The office is on Holly Lane in Ottawa.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ldr-law-professional-corporation-toronto','LDR Law Professional Corporation','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,27,43.6522054,-79.3750722,'{"name":"LDR Law Professional Corporation","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6522054,"lng":-79.3750722,"address":"103 Church St #512, Toronto, ON M5C 2G3","phone":"+14169213511","rating":5,"count":27,"slug":"ldr-law-professional-corporation-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/LDR+Law+Professional+Corporation+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=103+Church+St+%23512%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5C+2G3","website":"https://www.ldrlaw.ca","blurb":"Wills & Estates in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 27 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ldr-law-professional-corporation-toronto.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Leslie Robinson"}],"areas":["Real estate law","Wills and estate planning","Estate administration","Commissioner of oaths and notary services","Corporate and business law","Family agreements and planning"],"serving":["Toronto","Ontario"]}}',NULL,'Founded in 2022 by Leslie Robinson, LDR Law Professional Corporation handles real estate, wills and estates for Toronto clients. Mr. Robinson works with individuals, families and businesses across Toronto and the GTA on purchases, sales and refinancing, new condominiums, cottage and waterfront properties, private lending, title transfers and Land Registry corrections.

