Its lawyers have trial experience and an understanding of the Ontario court system. Reported decisions from its cases include R. v. Bajcinca, R. v. Bhagat and R. v. Gill.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('morneau-family-law-and-legal-innovation-kitchener','Morneau Family Law & Legal Innovation','Kitchener','ON','waterloo-guelph',0,5,27,43.4557723,-80.5011521,'{"name":"Morneau Family Law & Legal Innovation","city":"Kitchener","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"waterloo-guelph","province":"ON","lat":43.4557723,"lng":-80.5011521,"address":"67 Louisa St B, Kitchener, ON N2H 5L9","phone":"+15196359145","rating":5,"count":27,"slug":"morneau-family-law-and-legal-innovation-kitchener","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Morneau+Family+Law+%26+Legal+Innovation+Kitchener+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=67+Louisa+St+B%2C+Kitchener%2C+ON+N2H+5L9","website":"https://davidmorneau.com","blurb":"Family Law in Kitchener. Rated 5.0 from 27 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/morneau-family-law-and-legal-innovation-kitchener.webp","details":{"areas":["Family law","Separation agreements","Cohabitation & marriage contracts","Mediation","Collaborative law"],"serving":["Waterloo"]}}',NULL,'In Kitchener, Morneau Family Law & Legal Innovation offers separation agreements, mediation and collaborative law. David Morneau Jr. serves families in the Waterloo Region and holds the title of Creative Evolution Officer at the firm.

Services also include cohabitation agreements and marriage contracts, education and training, and mentoring. He speaks at seminars, conferences and symposiums on conflict definition, management and resolution. His approach, built around a written vision, mission and set of values, treats family separation as mostly emotional rather than legal and aims to reduce polarization and improve communication.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('burshtein-law-toronto','Burshtein Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.7,28,43.7073893,-79.3994979,'{"name":"Burshtein Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7073893,"lng":-79.3994979,"address":"2300 Yonge St #1600, Toronto, ON M4R 2E9","phone":"+14165465022","rating":4.7,"count":28,"slug":"burshtein-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Burshtein+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2300+Yonge+St+%231600%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M4R+2E9","website":"https://burshlaw.com","blurb":"General practice law firm in Toronto. Rated 4.7 from 28 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/burshtein-law-toronto.png","details":{"areas":["Business law","Contract law","Technology and privacy","Wills and estates","Power of attorney for property","Estate administration"]}}',NULL,'Burshtein Law, at Yonge and Eglinton in Toronto, practises business, technology and estates law. Jonathan Burshtein is the founding lawyer and helps startups and small businesses with incorporations, share and asset purchases and sales, reorganizations and succession planning, including estate freezes and family trusts.

He drafts shareholder, partnership, joint venture, employment and independent contractor agreements. Estates work covers wills, powers of attorney, trusts and estate administration, including applications for a Certificate of Appointment of Estate Trustee. The firm uses fixed pricing for most files and has released Groove Law, a platform where startups request and manage legal documents.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('slc-law-mississauga','SLC Law','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,26,43.5895294,-79.6416551,'{"name":"SLC Law","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5895294,"lng":-79.6416551,"address":"201 City Centre Dr Ste 200, Mississauga, ON L5B 2T4","phone":"+14163192220","rating":5,"count":26,"slug":"slc-law-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/SLC+Law+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=201+City+Centre+Dr+Ste+200%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5B+2T4","website":"https://slclaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 26 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/slc-law-mississauga.png","details":{"areas":["Business law","Corporate law","IP law","Intellectual property"],"serving":["Mississauga","Toronto"]}}','{"1":[["08:00","20:00"]],"2":[["08:00","20:00"]],"3":[["08:00","20:00"]],"4":[["08:00","20:00"]],"5":[["08:00","20:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Business, corporate and intellectual property law for owners and startups is the focus of SLC Law, a boutique firm in Mississauga. Services include incorporations and minute books, shareholders'' agreements and governance, contract drafting, commercial lease negotiation, asset and share purchases, reorganizations and IP strategy, along with employment and litigation matters.

One of its lawyers, Michael, is also a trademark agent in Canada who represents clients before the Canadian Intellectual Property Office. The office is on City Centre Drive in Mississauga, and the firm serves Port Credit, Streetsville, Meadowvale, Erin Mills, Clarkson, Cooksville, Lorne Park, Toronto, Woodbridge, Oakville, Brampton, Milton, Vaughan and Hamilton.','dynamic','live',NULL);
