Matters include bail hearings, youth cases, domestic assault, sexual assault, robbery, over 80 charges, attempted murder and murder. His approach covers understanding the court process, identifying flaws in the Crown''s case, building a defence strategy and protecting a client''s rights.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('jyd-llp-north-york','JYD LLP','North York','ON','toronto',0,5,25,43.7797578,-79.3419102,'{"name":"JYD LLP","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7797578,"lng":-79.3419102,"address":"245 Fairview Mall Dr #703, North York, ON M2J 4T1","phone":"+14164911666","rating":5,"count":25,"slug":"jyd-llp-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/JYD+LLP+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=245+Fairview+Mall+Dr+%23703%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2J+4T1","website":"https://jydllp.com","blurb":"General practice law firm in North York. Rated 5.0 from 25 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/jyd-llp-north-york.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Jingkun Dong","title":"Co-founding Partner"}],"areas":["Real estate","Immigration","Corporate & commercial law","Wills and estate planning","Family law","Notarization"]}}',NULL,'JYD LLP, a North York firm, serves clients in real estate, immigration, corporate, estate planning and family law in English and Chinese. Its real estate practice advises investors, property owners, buyers, sellers, lenders, receivers, brokers, landlords and tenants across Ontario.

Other services include wills and estate planning, corporate and commercial law, family law and notarization of legal documents. The team includes Jingkun Dong, and the firm takes a proactive, forward-looking approach to its clients'' current and future legal needs, with its lawyers communicating with clients personally.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('smithen-family-law-professional-corporation-north-york','Smithen Family Law Professional Corporation','North York','ON','toronto',0,5,25,43.7594667,-79.4098833,'{"name":"Smithen Family Law Professional Corporation","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7594667,"lng":-79.4098833,"address":"4711 Yonge St #1000, North York, ON M2N 7E4","phone":"+14169252123","rating":5,"count":25,"slug":"smithen-family-law-professional-corporation-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Smithen+Family+Law+Professional+Corporation+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4711+Yonge+St+%231000%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M2N+7E4","website":"https://www.smithenlaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in North York. Rated 5.0 from 25 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/smithen-family-law-professional-corporation-north-york.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Kathryn Smithen"}],"areas":["Divorce","Child custody & parenting","Child support","Spousal support","Separation agreements","Property division","Mediation & ADR","Same-sex & LGBTQ+ family law","Cohabitation agreements"],"serving":["North York","Toronto"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Kathryn Smithen leads Smithen Family Law Professional Corporation, a North York firm handling divorce, custody, support and property division. She has practised family law for over fifteen years and acts for women and families in contested and uncontested proceedings, including high-conflict and high-worth cases.

