Examples include incorporations, shareholder agreements and share purchases; dismissal and severance matters; separation agreements and marriage contracts; sponsorship, study permit, work permit and refugee applications; mortgage enforcement; affidavits and declarations; motor vehicle accident, slip and fall and dog bite injuries; and property purchases, sales and refinancing. Business matters are approached from a commercial perspective, and the office is in Scarborough.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('danson-delavar-llp-toronto','Danson Delavar LLP','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.8,26,43.7068446,-79.3990722,'{"name":"Danson Delavar LLP","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7068446,"lng":-79.3990722,"address":"20 Eglinton Ave W Ste 1902, Toronto, ON M4R 1K8","phone":"+14169292200","rating":4.8,"count":26,"slug":"danson-delavar-llp-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Danson+Delavar+LLP+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=20+Eglinton+Ave+W+Ste+1902%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M4R+1K8","website":"https://ddlitigators.com","blurb":"General practice law firm in Toronto. Rated 4.8 from 26 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/danson-delavar-llp-toronto.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Timothy S.B. Danson"},{"name":"Marjan Delavar"}],"areas":["Corporate and commercial law","Civil litigation","Employment law","Constitutional law","Insurance litigation","Defamation litigation"]}}',NULL,'Toronto litigation boutique Danson Delavar LLP handles high-stakes commercial, employment, constitutional, defamation and insurance disputes. Partners Timothy Danson and Marjan Delavar bring decades of courtroom experience to these matters and focus on identifying risk early, before disputes escalate.

Core practice areas are corporate, commercial and civil litigation, employment law, constitutional law, insurance litigation and defamation litigation. The practice also includes complex personal injury litigation, appellate advocacy, administrative law, sports law and professional negligence. Clients include corporations, professionals, executives, insurers and professional athletes.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('morrison-williams-llp-oakville','Morrison Williams LLP','Oakville','ON','peel-halton',0,4.8,26,43.4750715,-79.6620168,'{"name":"Morrison Williams LLP","city":"Oakville","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.4750715,"lng":-79.6620168,"address":"1400 Cornwall Rd Unit 6a, Oakville, ON L6J 7W5","phone":"+19053370002","rating":4.8,"count":26,"slug":"morrison-williams-llp-oakville","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Morrison+Williams+LLP+Oakville+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1400+Cornwall+Rd+Unit+6a%2C+Oakville%2C+ON+L6J+7W5","website":"https://ontariofamilylaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Oakville. Rated 4.8 from 26 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/morrison-williams-llp-oakville.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Rachel Williams"},{"name":"Megan Jamieson"}],"areas":["Family law","Divorce","Common-law separation","Property division","Parenting","Child support","Spousal support"],"serving":["Oakville"]}}',NULL,'Oakville families facing divorce, support, custody or property division are served by Morrison Williams LLP, a family law firm. Its lawyers have practised family law exclusively throughout their careers, and matters also include access, spousal support, common-law settlements and the global settlement of a separation.

The process is chosen to suit the family: negotiation, collaboration, mediation, arbitration or litigation. The lawyers work as a team to bring different perspectives and strategy to each matter, and involve other professionals such as financial planners where helpful. The firm focuses on timely service and on a solicitor-client relationship tailored to each client''s circumstances.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('gale-law-professional-corporation-toronto','Gale Law Professional Corporation','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.6,27,43.6496097,-79.3810483,'{"name":"Gale Law Professional Corporation","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6496097,"lng":-79.3810483,"address":"320 Bay St. Ste 101, Toronto, ON M5H 4A6","phone":"+14168683263","rating":4.6,"count":27,"slug":"gale-law-professional-corporation-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Gale+Law+Professional+Corporation+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=320+Bay+St.+Ste+101%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5H+4A6","website":"https://galelaw.ca","blurb":"Wills & Estates in Toronto. Rated 4.6 from 27 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/gale-law-professional-corporation-toronto.png","bioImage":"images/bio/gale-law-professional-corporation-toronto.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Kim Gale","title":"Founder"},{"name":"Palak Mahajan"}],"areas":["Estate litigation","Probate","Estate administration","Power of attorney disputes","Guardianship","Dependent support claims","Estate and trust disputes","Elder abuse"]}}',NULL,'Gale Law Professional Corporation, a Toronto firm led by mediator Kim Gale, concentrates on estate litigation. Its work covers will challenges, capacity disputes, powers of attorney and guardianship disputes, elder abuse, dependant support applications and recovering money owed by a deceased person, along with probate and estate administration.

The firm has offices in downtown Toronto and North York. Its lawyers include Kim Gale, Mitchell Reiss, Palak Mahajan and Jessica Campolucci, and mediation is offered as a route to resolving estate disputes.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('taerk-family-law-toronto','Taerk Family Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.7,26,43.6501852,-79.3885485,'{"name":"Taerk Family Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6501852,"lng":-79.3885485,"address":"243 Queen St W Second Floor, Toronto, ON M5V 1Z4","phone":"+14167559910","rating":4.7,"count":26,"slug":"taerk-family-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Taerk+Family+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=243+Queen+St+W+Second+Floor%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5V+1Z4","website":"https://taerkfamilylaw.com","blurb":"Family Law in Toronto. Rated 4.7 from 26 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/taerk-family-law-toronto.png","bioImage":"images/bio/taerk-family-law-toronto.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Amanda Taerk"},{"name":"Sara Omer"}],"areas":["Divorce & separation","Parenting plans & agreements","Child support","Spousal support","Property division & equalization","Motions to change","Domestic contracts","Separation agreements","Unbundled services"],"serving":["Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Taerk Family Law, on Queen Street West in Toronto, acts in divorce, separation, parenting, support and property division matters. The firm has more than 22 years of experience in family law and serves families across Toronto and the GTA.

Services include parenting plans and agreements, child support including Section 7 expenses, spousal support, property division and equalization, motions to change, domestic contracts and separation agreements. It also acts for high net worth individuals and families, and unbundled services allow people to hire a lawyer for a specific legal step rather than the whole file.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('pelican-law-immigration-and-refugee-lawyer-mississauga','Pelican Law- Immigration & Refugee Lawyer','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,24,43.5971519,-79.6360272,'{"name":"Pelican Law- Immigration & Refugee Lawyer","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5971519,"lng":-79.6360272,"address":"4 Robert Speck Pkwy Ste 1500, Mississauga, ON L4Z 1S1","phone":"+19058052266","rating":5,"count":24,"slug":"pelican-law-immigration-and-refugee-lawyer-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pelican+Law-+Immigration+%26+Refugee+Lawyer+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4+Robert+Speck+Pkwy+Ste+1500%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L4Z+1S1","website":"https://pelicanlaw.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 24 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/pelican-law-immigration-and-refugee-lawyer-mississauga.png","details":{"languages":["English","Punjabi","Hindi"],"areas":["Family sponsorship","Temporary visas","Express Entry","Citizenship applications","Deportation","Inadmissibility","Refugee claims","Judicial reviews","Study permits","Work permits"]}}',NULL,'From Mississauga, Pelican Law handles immigration matters including family sponsorship, work and study permits, Express Entry and citizenship. It also acts in inadmissibility and refusal matters and in removal proceedings, including deferrals and Federal Court stay applications.

Express Entry work covers the Canadian Experience Class, Federal Skilled Worker, skilled trades and Ontario PNP, and temporary visa work covers study permits, work permits, visitor visas and super visas. Narinder Mann is the founder and principal legal counsel. He practised civil law in India, earned a paralegal diploma at Humber College, became a licensed paralegal in January 2021 and joined the Ontario bar in March 2024.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ndm-law-mississauga','NDM Law','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.8,25,43.5820859,-79.714629,'{"name":"NDM Law","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5820859,"lng":-79.714629,"address":"168 Queen St S, Mississauga, ON L5M 1L2","phone":"+19059978118","rating":4.8,"count":25,"slug":"ndm-law-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/NDM+Law+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=168+Queen+St+S%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5M+1L2","website":"https://ndmlaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Mississauga. Rated 4.8 from 25 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ndm-law-mississauga.jpg","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Navnit Dhillon"}],"areas":["Family law","Criminal law","Corporate law","Real estate","Personal injury law","Wills & estates"]}}',NULL,'Founded by Navnit Dhillon, NDM Law serves Mississauga and the GTA in family, criminal, corporate, real estate, personal injury and estate law. The office is in Streetsville, and the firm acts for individuals and for corporations, including companies throughout Canada and globally.

Legal services are available in English, Hindi, Polish, Portuguese and Urdu. Ms. Dhillon completed a Bachelor of Law at the University of Leicester in 2008, joined the Ontario bar in 2011 and founded the firm shortly afterward. She has spoken about legal topics on television and radio and gives education seminars.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('brazeau-seller-law-ottawa','Brazeau Seller Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.8,25,45.4216952,-75.6974492,'{"name":"Brazeau Seller Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4216952,"lng":-75.6974492,"address":"100 Queen St #700, Ottawa, ON K1P 1J9","phone":"+16132374000","rating":4.8,"count":25,"slug":"brazeau-seller-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Brazeau+Seller+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=100+Queen+St+%23700%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1P+1J9","website":"https://brazeauseller.com","blurb":"General practice law firm in Ottawa. Rated 4.8 from 25 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/brazeau-seller-law-ottawa.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Alexander Shaw"},{"name":"Barbara Sinclair"},{"name":"David Reid","title":"Partner"},{"name":"Fred Seller"},{"name":"Geoffrey Cullwick"},{"name":"Harold Feder"},{"name":"Howard Yegendorf"},{"name":"Michael Marcogliese"},{"name":"Najma M. Rashid"},{"name":"Trina Fraser"},{"name":"Donald Brazeau"},{"name":"Ron Prehogan"}],"areas":["Business law"]}}',NULL,'Founded in 1989, Brazeau Seller Law advises Ottawa family-owned businesses on corporate, tax, real estate and estate planning matters. Its practice was designed to protect and maintain the wealth of such businesses, and it works with owners, entrepreneurs, managers and professionals in nearly every sector of the Ottawa community.

Services include acquisitions and mergers, cannabis licensing, corporate and commercial law, employment law, intellectual property, litigation, municipal and development law, and non-profit and charity law. The firm belongs to Meritas Law Firms Worldwide, the Canadian Bar Association, the Canadian Tax Foundation and the Society of Trust and Estate Practitioners, among other bodies.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('a-circelli-law-guelph','A.Circelli Law','Guelph','ON','waterloo-guelph',0,4.6,25,43.5518497,-80.2588269,'{"name":"A.Circelli Law","city":"Guelph","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"waterloo-guelph","province":"ON","lat":43.5518497,"lng":-80.2588269,"address":"367 Woolwich St, Guelph, ON N1H 3W4","phone":"+15198041513","rating":4.6,"count":25,"slug":"a-circelli-law-guelph","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/A.Circelli+Law+Guelph+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=367+Woolwich+St%2C+Guelph%2C+ON+N1H+3W4","website":"https://www.a-circelli-law.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Guelph. Rated 4.6 from 25 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/a-circelli-law-guelph.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Antonio Circelli"}],"areas":["Family law","Estate law"],"serving":["Guelph","Waterloo"]}}',NULL,'Antonio Circelli runs A.Circelli Law, a family-run Guelph practice handling divorce, separation, custody, child protection and estates. He has close to 20 years of litigation experience, including trial and appellate work, and served for 11 years as counsel to the Children''s Aid Society, most recently with Family and Children''s Services of Guelph and Wellington County.

He has appeared in the Ontario Court of Justice, the Superior Court of Justice, the Divisional Court and the Ontario Court of Appeal. The firm also handles equalization and property division and child and spousal support, and legal clerk Melanie Pavone works with him in serving the Guelph and Waterloo area.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('pereira-walter-lawyers-llp-mississauga','Pereira Walter Lawyers LLP','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.8,23,43.5894491,-79.6415543,'{"name":"Pereira Walter Lawyers LLP","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5894491,"lng":-79.6415543,"address":"201 City Centre Dr Ste 300, Mississauga, ON L5B 3A3","phone":"+19052703600","rating":4.8,"count":23,"slug":"pereira-walter-lawyers-llp-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pereira+Walter+Lawyers+LLP+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=201+City+Centre+Dr+Ste+300%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5B+3A3","website":"https://pwlaw.ca","blurb":"Employment Law in Mississauga. Rated 4.8 from 23 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/pereira-walter-lawyers-llp-mississauga.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Michael Walter","title":"Partner"}],"areas":["Employment law","Disability","Personal injury law","Long-term disability","Constructive dismissal","Termination and severance disputes"],"serving":["Mississauga","Oakville","Toronto"]}}',NULL,'Pereira Walter Lawyers LLP, also known as Walter Law Group, is a Mississauga firm handling employment, disability and personal injury law. Its lawyers act for employers and employees in matters such as harassment, poisoned work environments, termination and constructive dismissal, as well as long-term disability and personal injury cases, in Mississauga and Toronto.

The firm has practised for roughly 30 years and appears at all levels of court, as well as at tribunals and mediations. Michael Walter has spoken to the Canadian Press about power dynamics in the workplace.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('fosters-law-llp-london','Fosters Law LLP','London','ON','southwestern',0,4.8,23,42.9869306,-81.2512567,'{"name":"Fosters Law LLP","city":"London","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":42.9869306,"lng":-81.2512567,"address":"150 Dufferin Ave, London, ON N6A 5N6","phone":"+15196725272","rating":4.8,"count":23,"slug":"fosters-law-llp-london","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Fosters+Law+LLP+London+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=150+Dufferin+Ave%2C+London%2C+ON+N6A+5N6","website":"https://www.fosterslaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in London. Rated 4.8 from 23 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/fosters-law-llp-london.png","heroImage":"images/hero/fosters-law-llp-london.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Laura Zeleznik"}],"areas":["Civil litigation","Personal injury law","Motor vehicle accidents","Accident benefits","Sports injuries","Professional and medical malpractice","Mediation & arbitration"],"serving":["London","Ontario"]}}','{"1":[["08:00","17:00"]],"2":[["08:00","17:00"]],"3":[["08:00","17:00"]],"4":[["08:00","17:00"]],"5":[["08:00","17:00"]],"6":[["08:00","17:00"]],"7":[["08:00","17:00"]]}','Fosters Law LLP, founded in 1975, handles personal injury cases and insurance litigation from its London, Ontario office. Its lawyers act for injured people in motor vehicle accident, wrongful death and medical or professional malpractice matters, and for insurers, businesses and property owners across Ontario in insurance defence and advisory work.

Insurance work covers property damage disputes, subrogation and coverage questions, and the firm takes a technology-forward approach to efficient litigation. It has served clients across Ontario for almost 50 years.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('handa-law-professional-corporation-brampton','Handa Law Professional Corporation','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,4.7,23,43.6840835,-79.7623082,'{"name":"Handa Law Professional Corporation","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Immigration","Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["family","immigration","realestate"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6840835,"lng":-79.7623082,"address":"100 Queen St W, Brampton, ON L6X 1A4","phone":"+14169018569","rating":4.7,"count":23,"slug":"handa-law-professional-corporation-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Handa+Law+Professional+Corporation+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=100+Queen+St+W%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6X+1A4","website":"https://www.handalawpc.ca","blurb":"Family Law / Immigration in Brampton. Rated 4.7 from 23 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/handa-law-professional-corporation-brampton.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Kritika Handa","title":"Founder and Principal Lawyer"}],"areas":["Real estate law","Family law"],"serving":["Toronto","Brampton"]}}',NULL,'With offices in downtown Brampton and North York, Handa Law Professional Corporation practises family law and real estate law. Kritika Handa founded the firm and focuses her own practice on those two areas, and the firm''s lawyers also assist with immigration matters.

Handa Law has been paperless since it opened, and clients can meet by video conference and sign real estate or family documents electronically from anywhere. The team follows a four-part method: listening, educating clients about their rights, developing a clear strategy and executing it. Its head office is at Yonge and Sheppard in North York.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('odele-law-group-ottawa','Odele Law Group','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.7,23,45.4915164,-75.4820565,'{"name":"Odele Law Group","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4915164,"lng":-75.4820565,"address":"890 Taylor Creek Dr #2, Orléans, ON K4A 0Z9","phone":"+13438821600","rating":4.7,"count":23,"slug":"odele-law-group-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Odele+Law+Group+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=890+Taylor+Creek+Dr+%232%2C+Orl%C3%A9ans%2C+ON+K4A+0Z9","website":"https://odelelaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Ottawa. Rated 4.7 from 23 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/odele-law-group-ottawa.jpg","bioImage":"images/bio/odele-law-group-ottawa.webp","details":{"areas":["Family law","Corporate law","Estate planning","Business name registration","Notarization of legal documents"],"serving":["Ottawa","Nunavut","Orleans"]}}',NULL,'Odele Law Group is an Ottawa firm in Orléans with a strong focus on family law, alongside corporate law and estate planning. Its approach puts people first, with legal service meant to be client-focused, transparent and approachable.

Lawyers take the time to listen to clients'' concerns and goals before developing a customized strategy. The office is on Taylor Creek Drive in Orléans, and the firm serves families and businesses in the Ottawa area.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('pallavi-law-office-mississauga','Pallavi Law Office','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,21,43.5891314,-79.7221662,'{"name":"Pallavi Law Office","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5891314,"lng":-79.7221662,"address":"1965 Britannia Rd W Ste 212, Mississauga, ON L5M 4Y4","phone":"+14377889349","rating":5,"count":21,"slug":"pallavi-law-office-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pallavi+Law+Office+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1965+Britannia+Rd+W+Ste+212%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5M+4Y4","website":"https://pallavilaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 21 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/pallavi-law-office-mississauga.png","details":{"areas":["Immigration law","Family law","Criminal defence","Real estate law","Business law"],"serving":["Mississauga"]}}',NULL,'Immigration law leads the practice at Pallavi Law Office in Mississauga, alongside family, business, criminal defence and real estate work. Immigration services cover family-based and employment-based applications, asylum and refugee matters, permanent residence and citizenship applications, refusal cases and deportation cases, for individuals and businesses.

Family law services include divorce, child custody disputes, legal separation and domestic contracts such as separation agreements and prenuptial agreements. The office is on Britannia Road West in Mississauga.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('stewart-sharma-harsanyi-immigration-law-calgary','Stewart Sharma Harsanyi Immigration Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.7,656,51.0480333,-114.0732375,'{"name":"Stewart Sharma Harsanyi Immigration Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0480333,"lng":-114.0732375,"address":"CALGARY HOUSE, 550 6 Ave SW #950, Calgary, AB T2P 0S2","phone":"+14037053398","rating":4.7,"count":656,"slug":"stewart-sharma-harsanyi-immigration-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Stewart+Sharma+Harsanyi+Immigration+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=CALGARY+HOUSE%2C+550+6+Ave+SW+%23950%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2P+0S2","website":"https://www.sshlaw.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Calgary. Rated 4.7 from 656 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/stewart-sharma-harsanyi-immigration-law-calgary.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Raj Sharma","title":"Partner"},{"name":"Bjorn Harsanyi","title":"Partner"},{"name":"Faraz Bawa","title":"Partner"},{"name":"Chelsea Jaques","title":"Associate"},{"name":"Sarah Shibley","title":"Associate"},{"name":"Ammar Ishaq","title":"Associate"},{"name":"Kevin Lasaleta","title":"Associate"},{"name":"Jasprit Gill","title":"Associate"}],"areas":["Immigration hearings and appeals","Family sponsorship","Family and divorce law","Immigration Appeal Division","Federal Court","Record suspension","Misrepresentation","Financial inadmissibility","Consequences of criminality","Criminal defence"],"serving":["Calgary","Alberta"]}}',NULL,'Stewart Sharma Harsanyi Immigration Law is a Calgary firm handling immigration applications, appeals and refugee protection matters. Its partners are former immigration officers and hearings officers who made decisions under the Immigration and Refugee Protection Act, and a former Refugee Board member works with the team.

The practice acts for corporations, executives, families and people seeking refugee protection, and covers spousal and family sponsorship, financial and medical inadmissibility, and appeals to the Immigration Appeal Division and Federal Court. Family and divorce law and criminal defence are also practised, and the lawyers work where criminal and immigration law overlap. The office is in Calgary House on 6 Avenue SW.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('shory-law-llp-calgary','Shory Law LLP','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.6,363,51.1005459,-113.9630324,'{"name":"Shory Law LLP","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.1005459,"lng":-113.9630324,"address":"4851 Westwinds Dr NE, Calgary, AB T3J 4L4","phone":"+14032161199","rating":4.6,"count":363,"slug":"shory-law-llp-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Shory+Law+LLP+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4851+Westwinds+Dr+NE%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T3J+4L4","website":"https://www.shorylaw.com","blurb":"Immigration in Calgary. Rated 4.6 from 363 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/shory-law-llp-calgary.webp","heroImage":"images/hero/shory-law-llp-calgary.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Devinder Shory","title":"KC"},{"name":"Jatin Shory"},{"name":"Chetan Shory"},{"name":"Laura-Anne Goulding"},{"name":"Ahmad Nasser"},{"name":"Jaclyn Dorchak"},{"name":"Neetu Shory"},{"name":"Samantha Ta"},{"name":"Leticia Forteath"},{"name":"Alexandra Bleichert"},{"name":"Sajan Kapoor"}],"areas":["Business immigration","Business law","Immigration law","Real estate law"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Shory Law LLP is a Calgary firm offering immigration, business and real estate law, and has served the city and surrounding areas since 1998. Its practice areas are brought together in one office on Westwinds Drive NE.

Immigration work covers permanent residence, work permits and appeals, while business immigration includes intra-company transfers and routes for entrepreneurs and investors who want to buy or start a business in Canada. Business law covers incorporation, mergers and acquisitions, corporate finance and securities, compliance, commercial agreements and governance. The real estate team handles residential and commercial transactions and refinancing.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('htm-law-llp-edmonton','HTM Law LLP','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.9,244,53.5310753,-113.407224,'{"name":"HTM Law LLP","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["family","realestate","wills"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5310753,"lng":-113.407224,"address":"102, 9333 47 St NW, Edmonton, AB T6B 2R7","phone":"+17804690494","rating":4.9,"count":244,"slug":"htm-law-llp-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/HTM+Law+LLP+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=102%2C+9333+47+St+NW%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T6B+2R7","website":"https://www.edmontonlaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law / Real Estate in Edmonton. Rated 4.9 from 244 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/htm-law-llp-edmonton.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Derrick Hwang"},{"name":"Sal Tinajero"},{"name":"Greg Miskie"}],"areas":["Real estate law","Wills and estate law","Corporate law","Litigation"],"serving":["Edmonton"]}}',NULL,'HTM Law LLP is an Edmonton boutique firm handling real estate, wills and estates, corporate and commercial law, and litigation. Its lawyers have more than 40 years of combined service to residential and business clients in Edmonton and across Canada.

The firm purposely stays small and works for small businesses, first-time home buyers and new business owners, and it added associates and staff in 2024. Its working principles are plain language without legal jargon, work done quickly but thoroughly, and lasting relationships rather than one-off transactions. Family law is also part of the practice.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('taurus-law-edmonton','Taurus Law','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.9,193,53.4768573,-113.4855319,'{"name":"Taurus Law","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Civil Litigation","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["family","litigation","business"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.4768573,"lng":-113.4855319,"address":"4107 99 St NW, Edmonton, AB T6E 3N4","phone":"+17802855474","rating":4.9,"count":193,"slug":"taurus-law-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Taurus+Law+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4107+99+St+NW%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T6E+3N4","website":"https://tauruslaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law / Civil Litigation in Edmonton. Rated 4.9 from 193 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/taurus-law-edmonton.png","details":{"areas":["Civil litigation","Family law","Personal injury","Estate litigation","Metis and Aboriginal law","Trusts, wills and estates","Real estate law","Corporate and commercial law","Employment law"],"serving":["Edmonton"]}}',NULL,'Taurus Law is a full-service Edmonton firm handling civil litigation, family law, personal injury and estate litigation. Its office is on 99 Street NW.

Further practice areas include Metis and Aboriginal law, trusts, wills and estates, real estate, corporate and commercial law, and employment law. The firm acts for both individuals and businesses, whether they are facing a dispute or seeking advice before a problem arises. Each matter is prepared thoroughly and handled with a focused strategy, and the firm''s core values are trust, integrity and excellence.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('brij-mohan-and-associates-edmonton','Brij Mohan & Associates','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.8,189,53.4585813,-113.4281517,'{"name":"Brij Mohan & Associates","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Immigration","Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["injury","immigration","criminal"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.4585813,"lng":-113.4281517,"address":"6147 28 Ave NW, Edmonton, AB T6L 6N5","phone":"+17809512662","rating":4.8,"count":189,"slug":"brij-mohan-and-associates-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Brij+Mohan+%26+Associates+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=6147+28+Ave+NW%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T6L+6N5","website":"https://www.brijmohan.com","blurb":"Personal Injury / Immigration in Edmonton. Rated 4.8 from 189 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/brij-mohan-and-associates-edmonton.webp","details":{"founded":1996,"areas":["Personal injury","Criminal defence","Immigration law"],"serving":["Surrey","Brampton","Calgary","Edmonton"]}}','{"1":[["08:30","18:00"]],"2":[["08:30","18:00"]],"3":[["08:30","18:00"]],"4":[["08:30","18:00"]],"5":[["08:30","18:00"]],"6":[["08:30","18:00"]]}','Brij Mohan & Associates is a criminal defence, immigration and personal injury firm with offices in Edmonton, Calgary, Brampton and Surrey. Established in 1996, it acts for individuals and families across Canada.

Founder Brij Mohan holds a law degree from London Guildhall University and has represented clients before every level of court in Canada. The lawyers prepare each case for trial, and criminal matters have ranged from shoplifting to first-degree murder. Immigration work covers applications, refusals, appeals and hearings across Canada, and services are offered in English, Punjabi, Hindi and Urdu.','dynamic','live',NULL);
