Immigration work supports individuals and families from the first meeting through to a final decision, including appeals, while the injury practice acts for people hurt through negligence or in accidents. Real estate, family and criminal law are also handled, along with wills and estates. The office is on 26 Street NE.','dynamic','live',NULL);
