Its practice also covers personal injury, employment law, estate administration, and complex commercial and civil litigation, and its lawyers provide litigation and research support to other law firms. The lawyers bring legal experience from Canada, the United Kingdom, India, Nigeria and the Caribbean. Services are delivered online, with in-person meetings where necessary, for clients across Canada.','dynamic','live',NULL);
