Criminal work includes impaired driving cases, and family work covers divorce, separation, child custody, child support and the division of marital property. Its lawyers, including Angus Boyd, Conor Davis, Jordan Bienert, Simon Trela, Anna Shulman and Izabella Sulikowski, have experience at all levels of court, including the Supreme Court of Canada and the Alberta Court of Appeal.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('el-asmar-legal-edmonton','El-Asmar Legal','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,5,87,53.5850353,-113.4960141,'{"name":"El-Asmar Legal","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5850353,"lng":-113.4960141,"address":"10212 127 Ave NW Ste 200, Edmonton, AB T5E 0B9","phone":"+17805992599","rating":5,"count":87,"slug":"el-asmar-legal-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/El-Asmar+Legal+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10212+127+Ave+NW+Ste+200%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5E+0B9","website":"https://elasmarlegal.com","blurb":"General practice law firm in Edmonton. Rated 5.0 from 87 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/el-asmar-legal-edmonton.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Jouman El-Asmar"}],"areas":["Immigration law","Refugee law","Human rights law","Appeals and reviews"]}}',NULL,'El-Asmar Legal is an Edmonton firm handling immigration, refugee and human rights law with a trauma-informed approach to client work. The practice was established in 2010 by Jouman El-Asmar, who is licensed in Quebec and Alberta.

The firm appears before the Immigration and Refugee Board and the Federal Court of Canada. Work covers asylum and humanitarian applications, PRRA, sponsorships, Express Entry, provincial nominee programs, work, study and visitor permits, LMIA and Super Visa applications, and appeals. It also acts in discrimination and employment matters before human rights commissions and tribunals.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('zemp-law-group-calgary','Zemp Law Group','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,88,51.063042,-114.062785,'{"name":"Zemp Law Group","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.063042,"lng":-114.062785,"address":"1217 Centre St NW #205, Calgary, AB T2E 2R3","phone":"+14032462692","rating":4.9,"count":88,"slug":"zemp-law-group-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Zemp+Law+Group+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1217+Centre+St+NW+%23205%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2E+2R3","website":"https://www.zemplaw.com","blurb":"Immigration in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 88 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/zemp-law-group-calgary.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Kevin Zemp","title":"Founder"}],"areas":["Canadian immigration","US immigration","Corporate and personal immigration"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}',NULL,'Zemp Law Group is a Calgary immigration firm covering both Canadian and American immigration for individuals and businesses. The firm is led by Kevin Zemp, who is licensed to practise immigration and citizenship law in Canada and the USA.

Staff include former senior Canadian immigration officials and immigration paralegals, and speak Filipino, Chinese, Ukrainian, Russian, Slovak and Polish. Services include work permits under NAFTA, GATS and intra-company transfer categories, LMIA applications, study permits, super visas, permanent residence in Canada and the USA, citizenship, and inadmissibility matters.','dynamic','live',NULL);
