The firm also acts in corporate law, residential and commercial real estate, employment, wills and estates, family law and refugee matters. Injury work covers motor vehicle accidents, trips and falls, medical accidents and traumatic injuries from car collisions. The office is on Westwinds Drive NE and serves Calgary and the surrounding area.','dynamic','live',NULL);
