Notary services include notarization and commissioning of documents, certified copies of electronic documents and letters of invitation for visa applicants, and the office is registered with the US Consulate for notary services. The team of lawyers and other professionals includes Amina Muhammad, Muhammad Nazeef, Oyeyemi Ogunsan, Brian Seaman and Ada Blagoslov, and work is carried out in a cost-effective manner.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('cameron-horne-law-office-calgary','Cameron Horne Law Office','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,84,50.9645569,-114.073175,'{"name":"Cameron Horne Law Office","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":50.9645569,"lng":-114.073175,"address":"10201 Southport Rd SW, Calgary, AB T2W 4X9","phone":"+14035312700","rating":4.9,"count":84,"slug":"cameron-horne-law-office-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Cameron+Horne+Law+Office+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10201+Southport+Rd+SW%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2W+4X9","website":"https://www.cameronhorne.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 84 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/cameron-horne-law-office-calgary.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Geoffrey Horne"}],"areas":["Real estate law","Business law","Wills and estates"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}',NULL,'Cameron Horne Law Office is a south Calgary firm focused on residential real estate, condominium governance, wills and estates, and small business law.

Real estate work covers purchases and sales of new and existing homes and refinancing, and business work includes incorporations and the purchase and sale of businesses. Geoffrey Horne joined Sandy Cameron as a partner after being admitted to the Alberta bar in 2003, having earlier worked in professional baseball and national men''s hockey. He teaches a business law course for the Professional Home Builders Institute of Alberta. The office is beside the Southland LRT station and arranges out-of-office appointments on request.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('smith-thompson-law-llp-edmonton','Smith Thompson Law LLP','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.9,84,53.4983446,-113.5000472,'{"name":"Smith Thompson Law LLP","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.4983446,"lng":-113.5000472,"address":"10430 61 Ave NW #301, Edmonton, AB T6H 2J3","phone":"+17805403555","rating":4.9,"count":84,"slug":"smith-thompson-law-llp-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Smith+Thompson+Law+LLP+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10430+61+Ave+NW+%23301%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T6H+2J3","website":"https://www.smiththompsonlaw.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Edmonton. Rated 4.9 from 84 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/smith-thompson-law-llp-edmonton.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Mark Alexander Smith","title":"Founding Partner"},{"name":"Brian E. Thompson","title":"Founding Partner"},{"name":"Peter Alexander","title":"Associate"}],"areas":["Personal injury","Motor vehicle accidents","Slip and fall claims","Professional negligence","Medical and dental malpractice","Wrongful dismissal","Insurance disputes","Contract disputes","Real estate conveyancing","Wills and personal directives"],"serving":["Edmonton","Alberta"]}}',NULL,'Smith Thompson Law LLP is an Edmonton litigation firm handling car accidents, personal injury, employment and harassment matters. It was founded in 2018 by Mark Alexander Smith and Brian E. Thompson and is a small firm of litigation lawyers.

Litigation work also covers slip and fall cases, fatalities, professional negligence, medical and dental malpractice, insurance policy denials, real estate disputes and contract disputes. Employment matters include wrongful and constructive dismissal and employment contracts, and confidential legal support is offered in sexual misconduct cases. Injury files can be handled on a contingency basis, with fees collected only when a settlement is reached.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ansari-immigration-law-calgary','Ansari Immigration Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,80,51.0484902,-114.0756475,'{"name":"Ansari Immigration Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0484902,"lng":-114.0756475,"address":"639 5 Ave SW Suite 2500, Calgary, AB T2P 0M9","phone":"+16474948299","rating":4.9,"count":80,"slug":"ansari-immigration-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Ansari+Immigration+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=639+5+Ave+SW+Suite+2500%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2P+0M9","website":"https://ansarilaw.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 80 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ansari-immigration-law-calgary.png","details":{"languages":["English","French","Hindi","Urdu"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Yameena Ansari"}],"areas":["Express Entry","Provincial Nominee Program","Family sponsorship","Study permits","Work permits","Business and investment visa","Citizenship and refugee law","Refugee and humanitarian"],"serving":["Calgary","St. Albert","Alberta"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Ansari Immigration Law is a Calgary firm handling Express Entry, permanent residence, work and study permits and family sponsorship. Founder Yameena Ansari is licensed in Ontario, Alberta and the Northwest Territories and graduated from the University of Victoria Faculty of Law.

The firm works in English, French, Hindi and Urdu, and also assists with LMIA applications, super visas, citizenship, refugee and humanitarian matters, and employers hiring foreign workers. Since November 2023 Ansari has focused on immigration measures for Gazans, founding the Gaza Family Reunification Project with fellow lawyers to petition the federal government.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('star-legal-services-edmonton','Star Legal Services','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.9,80,53.4724139,-113.4914445,'{"name":"Star Legal Services","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.4724139,"lng":-113.4914445,"address":"3725 Gateway Blvd NW, Edmonton, AB T6J 5V5","phone":"+18253438005","rating":4.9,"count":80,"slug":"star-legal-services-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Star+Legal+Services+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=3725+Gateway+Blvd+NW%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T6J+5V5","website":"https://www.starlegalservices.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Edmonton. Rated 4.9 from 80 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/star-legal-services-edmonton.png","details":{"languages":["English","Punjabi","Hindi","Urdu"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Gurkirtan Lali","title":"Founding Lawyer"}],"areas":["Business transactions","Separation and cohabitation agreements","Divorce","Motor vehicle accident injury"],"serving":["Edmonton"]}}',NULL,'Star Legal Services is an Edmonton firm handling residential and commercial real estate, family law, motor vehicle injury and wills and estates matters.

Founding lawyer Gurkirtan Lali, born in Edmonton, earned her LLB at the University of Leicester in 2017 and was admitted to the Alberta bar in 2020; her practice centres on real estate, commercial and family law. The office also provides notary and commissioner for oaths services, and its team assists clients in English, Punjabi, Hindi and Urdu from its Gateway Boulevard location.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('salloum-and-company-edmonton','Salloum & Company','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.7,83,53.5450227,-113.4945576,'{"name":"Salloum & Company","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Immigration","Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["family","immigration","criminal"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5450227,"lng":-113.4945576,"address":"Bell Tower, 1203, 10104 103 Ave NW, Edmonton, AB T5J 0H8","phone":"+18259012000","rating":4.7,"count":83,"slug":"salloum-and-company-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Salloum+%26+Company+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Bell+Tower%2C+1203%2C+10104+103+Ave+NW%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5J+0H8","website":"https://www.salloumlaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law / Immigration in Edmonton. Rated 4.7 from 83 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/salloum-and-company-edmonton.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Tariq Salloum"}],"areas":["Criminal law","Family law","Real estate law","Civil law","Immigration law","Wills and estates"],"serving":["Edmonton","St. Albert","Sherwood Park","Spruce Grove","Leduc","Beaumont","Fort Saskatchewan"]}}',NULL,'Salloum & Company is an Edmonton firm acting in criminal defence, immigration, family law, real estate and civil litigation. The office is in the Bell Tower on 103 Avenue NW.

The lawyers act for individuals and businesses facing criminal charges, civil disputes, family matters and property issues, and handle residential real estate from purchases and sales to refinancing. The team brings experience across real estate, civil litigation, family law and criminal defence, and works closely with each client to protect their rights.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('robertson-llp-calgary','Robertson LLP','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.7,80,51.0440415,-114.0817568,'{"name":"Robertson LLP","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0440415,"lng":-114.0817568,"address":"999 8 Street SW #520, Calgary, AB T2R 1J5","phone":"+14034072605","rating":4.7,"count":80,"slug":"robertson-llp-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Robertson+LLP+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=999+8+Street+SW+%23520%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2R+1J5","website":"https://robertsonllp.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Calgary. Rated 4.7 from 80 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/robertson-llp-calgary.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Ryan Robertson"},{"name":"Madison Steenson"},{"name":"Richard Prepolec"},{"name":"Chloe Hornett"},{"name":"Krista Harrison"}],"areas":["Commercial real estate","Franchise law","Residential real estate","Litigation","Corporate and business law","Wills and estates"],"serving":["Calgary","Okotoks"]}}',NULL,'Robertson LLP is a Calgary firm, founded in 2012, practising commercial and residential real estate, business law, wills and estates, and litigation. Ryan Robertson started the firm with national firm and in-house experience, aiming to give clients predictable pricing.

Offices are in Calgary and Okotoks, and clients include home buyers and sellers, small and medium-sized businesses, lenders, home builders, developers, REITs, investors and condominium corporations. Commercial work covers purchases and sales, financing, leasing, construction law, builders'' liens and franchise law. Madison Steenson is among the firm''s lawyers.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('verdicta-llp-edmonton','Verdicta LLP','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,5,74,53.4793414,-113.4784967,'{"name":"Verdicta LLP","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["criminal","realestate"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.4793414,"lng":-113.4784967,"address":"Whitemud Business Park, 200, 9618 42 Ave NW Bldg 3, Edmonton, AB T6E 5Y4","phone":"+17802294559","rating":5,"count":74,"slug":"verdicta-llp-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Verdicta+LLP+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Whitemud+Business+Park%2C+200%2C+9618+42+Ave+NW+Bldg+3%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T6E+5Y4","website":"https://www.verdictallp.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Real Estate in Edmonton. Rated 5.0 from 74 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/verdicta-llp-edmonton.png","details":{"languages":["English","Punjabi","Hindi","Urdu"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Jatin J. Sahni"},{"name":"Milan M. Sahni"},{"name":"Tajvir S. Dhillon"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","Real estate","Corporate and commercial","DUI and IRS sanctions","Traffic tickets","Family law","Emergency protection orders","Civil litigation","Wills and estates"],"serving":["Edmonton"]}}','{"1":[["09:30","16:30"]],"2":[["09:30","16:30"]],"3":[["09:30","16:30"]],"4":[["09:30","16:30"]],"5":[["09:30","16:30"]]}','Verdicta LLP is an Edmonton firm handling criminal defence, DUI and SafeRoads sanctions, real estate, family law and civil litigation. It is based in Whitemud Business Park and offers services in English, Punjabi, Hindi and Urdu.

The practice also covers corporate and commercial law, traffic tickets, emergency protection orders, and wills and estates, with fixed fees for real estate work. Lawyers Jatin J. Sahni, Milan M. Sahni and Tajvir S. Dhillon serve Edmonton, St. Albert, Sherwood Park, Spruce Grove, Stony Plain and Leduc.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('outsiders-law-calgary','Outsiders Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,5,72,51.0471393,-114.069918,'{"name":"Outsiders Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Business Law"],"caseTypes":["business"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0471393,"lng":-114.069918,"address":"350 7 Ave SW Ste 1900, Calgary, AB T2P 3N9","phone":"+15873333352","rating":5,"count":72,"slug":"outsiders-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Outsiders+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=350+7+Ave+SW+Ste+1900%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2P+3N9","website":"https://www.outsiders.law","blurb":"Business Law in Calgary. Rated 5.0 from 72 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/outsiders-law-calgary.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Sebastian Elawny"},{"name":"Chace Stokowski"},{"name":"Lex Klombies"}],"areas":["Corporate and commercial law","Tax planning","Bitcoin and digital assets","Corporate structuring","Buying and selling a business"],"serving":["Calgary","Alberta"]}}',NULL,'Outsiders Law is a Calgary corporate and M&A firm that also advises Alberta charities and not-for-profits on incorporation and governance. Its lawyers combine legal, tax and accounting backgrounds.

Business work covers buying and selling Alberta businesses, corporate structuring, commercial agreements, corporate tax, digital assets, incorporations, annual filings and director changes. Sebastian Elawny is a tax lawyer with more than 14 years of experience at a multinational law firm and as a founding partner of a Big-4 law firm, and Chace Stokowski is a lawyer who is also a CPA and Certified Fraud Examiner. The office is on 7 Avenue SW.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('alloy-llp-calgary','Alloy LLP','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,5,72,51.0482444,-114.0658692,'{"name":"Alloy LLP","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0482444,"lng":-114.0658692,"address":"Bow Valley Square II, 800, 205 5 Ave SW, Calgary, AB T2P 2V7","phone":"+14035384710","rating":5,"count":72,"slug":"alloy-llp-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Alloy+LLP+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Bow+Valley+Square+II%2C+800%2C+205+5+Ave+SW%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2P+2V7","website":"https://alloy.law","blurb":"Real Estate in Calgary. Rated 5.0 from 72 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/alloy-llp-calgary.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Joseph Iwanicki"}],"areas":["Corporate litigation","Real estate","Personal injury"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Alloy LLP is a Calgary firm practising corporate litigation, real estate and personal injury law for individuals and businesses. Partners Joseph Iwanicki and Greg von Euw became friends in law school and formed the firm after more than 10 years of experience in the industry.

Each file stays with one lawyer rather than passing between several, so clients deal with the same person throughout. The firm helps business owners with legal problems, home buyers and sellers, and people hurt in accidents. The office is in Bow Valley Square II on 5 Avenue SW and serves the Calgary area and beyond.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('camino-law-group-calgary','Camino Law Group','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,5,71,51.0472318,-114.0783439,'{"name":"Camino Law Group","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0472318,"lng":-114.0783439,"address":"734 7 Ave SW #805, Calgary, AB T2P 3P8","phone":"+15877025001","rating":5,"count":71,"slug":"camino-law-group-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Camino+Law+Group+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=734+7+Ave+SW+%23805%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2P+3P8","website":"https://www.camino-lawgroup.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Calgary. Rated 5.0 from 71 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/camino-law-group-calgary.png"}',NULL,'Camino Law Group is a Calgary firm offering immigration and litigation services to individuals and small businesses. Its areas of practice are immigration, employment law for small businesses and individuals, personal injury and civil litigation.

Founder Cesar is a litigation lawyer who spent nearly ten years advocating for immigrants, workers and vulnerable populations, and founder Rick is a Regulated Canadian Immigration Consultant with more than seven years of immigration experience after a decade in Calgary engineering and energy firms. The firm also gives information sessions to non-profits and community groups.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('fp-legal-calgary','FP Legal','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.8,72,51.0681219,-114.0645699,'{"name":"FP Legal","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Family Law","Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["injury","family","realestate"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0681219,"lng":-114.0645699,"address":"134 17 Ave NW, Calgary, AB T2M 0M6","phone":"+15873912222","rating":4.8,"count":72,"slug":"fp-legal-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/FP+Legal+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=134+17+Ave+NW%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2M+0M6","website":"https://www.fplegal.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury / Family Law in Calgary. Rated 4.8 from 72 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/fp-legal-calgary.jpg","details":{"areas":["Real estate","Personal injury","Civil litigation","Corporate law","Family law"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}',NULL,'FP Legal is a full-service Calgary firm handling real estate, personal injury, civil litigation, corporate and family law. Its office is on 17 Avenue NW.

Founder Nelson Osamudiamen earned his Juris Doctor at the University of Calgary in 2013, articled at Dentons and was licensed by the Law Society of Alberta in July 2014; he has appeared before all levels of court in Alberta. Real estate work covers residential and commercial transactions, corporate clients receive contract drafting and negotiation support, and family law includes agreements for couples entering, living in or ending a relationship.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('williamson-law-calgary','Williamson Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,5,69,51.0428946,-114.0759244,'{"name":"Williamson Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Real Estate","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["injury","realestate","litigation"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0428946,"lng":-114.0759244,"address":"638 11 Ave SW #200, Calgary, AB T2R 0E2","phone":"+15873553321","rating":5,"count":69,"slug":"williamson-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Williamson+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=638+11+Ave+SW+%23200%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2R+0E2","website":"https://www.williamson.law","blurb":"Personal Injury / Real Estate in Calgary. Rated 5.0 from 69 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/williamson-law-calgary.jpg","bioImage":"images/bio/williamson-law-calgary.webp","details":{"areas":["General civil litigation","Debt collection","Motor vehicle accidents","Insurance claims","Estate planning and trust law","Builders'' liens","Intellectual property","Incorporations","Defamation","Constitutional law"]}}',NULL,'Williamson Law is a Calgary litigation practice handling civil disputes, personal injury, estate litigation, construction and real estate disputes. The practice operates as Chad Williamson Professional Corporation.

Civil work includes debt collection, judgment enforcement, insurance denials and professional negligence, while injury matters cover motor vehicle, motorcycle, pedestrian, bicycle and public transit accidents. It also handles probate, trusts, guardianship and trusteeship, builders'' liens, and shareholder and joint venture disputes. The firm does not offer simple will drafting or real estate purchase and sale services.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('kahane-law-office-edmonton','Kahane Law Office','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.8,71,53.4887272,-113.4574705,'{"name":"Kahane Law Office","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.4887272,"lng":-113.4574705,"address":"8704 51 Ave NW suite 205, Edmonton, AB T6E 5E8","phone":"+17805718463","rating":4.8,"count":71,"slug":"kahane-law-office-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kahane+Law+Office+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=8704+51+Ave+NW+suite+205%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T6E+5E8","website":"https://kahanelaw.com","blurb":"General practice law firm in Edmonton. Rated 4.8 from 71 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/kahane-law-office-edmonton.png","details":{"areas":["Family law","Real estate","Wills and testaments","Labour and employment law","Corporate and commercial law","Immigration","Personal injury","Litigation","Criminal law"],"serving":["Calgary"]}}','{"1":[["08:30","16:30"]],"2":[["08:30","16:30"]],"3":[["08:30","16:30"]],"4":[["08:30","16:30"]],"5":[["08:30","16:30"]]}','Kahane Law Office is an Edmonton firm handling family, real estate, wills, employment, corporate and commercial, immigration and personal injury matters. The practice was founded in 2004.

Commercial real estate transactions range from small-town buildings valued around $50,000 to a $320 million refinancing, and personal injury work is on the plaintiff side. Immigration services are offered across Canada to clients from around the world. Signing agents in Calgary, Okotoks, Canmore, Edmonton, Red Deer and Fort McMurray allow purchases and sales to be completed in those areas.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('galbraith-law-edmonton','Galbraith Law','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.8,68,53.5517626,-113.6279617,'{"name":"Galbraith Law","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5517626,"lng":-113.6279617,"address":"10630 178 St NW, Edmonton, AB T5S 1H4","phone":"+17804836111","rating":4.8,"count":68,"slug":"galbraith-law-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Galbraith+Law+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10630+178+St+NW%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5S+1H4","website":"https://www.galbraith.ab.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Edmonton. Rated 4.8 from 68 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/galbraith-law-edmonton.png","details":{"areas":["Residential real estate","Small business and corporate law","Wills and estates","Commercial real estate"],"serving":["Edmonton"]}}',NULL,'Galbraith Law is a northwest Edmonton firm handling real estate, small business, and wills and estates law, and has served clients since December 1987.

It began as a single-lawyer operation in Westmount Shopping Centre and is now a team of lawyers. Real estate work covers residential and commercial purchases, sales and closings, business work includes incorporation, employment, subcontractor and financing agreements and the purchase or sale of businesses, and estate work covers enduring powers of attorney, personal care directives and estate administration. The ground-level office on 178 Street NW is accessible.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('birdsell-grant-llp-edmonton','Birdsell Grant LLP','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,5,64,53.5861153,-113.5621471,'{"name":"Birdsell Grant LLP","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5861153,"lng":-113.5621471,"address":"12840 St Albert Trail NW, Edmonton, AB T5L 4H6","phone":"+17808188190","rating":5,"count":64,"slug":"birdsell-grant-llp-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Birdsell+Grant+LLP+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=12840+St+Albert+Trail+NW%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5L+4H6","website":"https://birdsell.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Edmonton. Rated 5.0 from 64 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/birdsell-grant-llp-edmonton.png","bioImage":"images/bio/birdsell-grant-llp-edmonton.webp","details":{"founded":1984,"lawyers":[{"name":"Alastair Grant","title":"Founder"},{"name":"Mike Birdsell","title":"Founder"}],"serving":["Alberta"]}}',NULL,'Birdsell Grant LLP is a full-service Edmonton firm with roots in Stony Plain, handling real estate, business, litigation, family and estate law. Alastair Grant and Mike Birdsell began practising together in Stony Plain, Spruce Grove and Parkland County, and the firm has served Alberta since 1984.

It has grown to 11 lawyers and more than 30 support staff and students, with offices in Edmonton and Whitecourt. Practice areas also include employment, agricultural, municipal and First Nations matters and adult guardianship and trusteeship. Clients are farmers, parents, entrepreneurs, professionals and small business owners.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('accord-family-law-edmonton','Accord Family Law','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.9,64,53.5975143,-113.4933595,'{"name":"Accord Family Law","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5975143,"lng":-113.4933595,"address":"13548 97 St NW #333, Edmonton, AB T5E 4E2","phone":"+17809006722","rating":4.9,"count":64,"slug":"accord-family-law-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Accord+Family+Law+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=13548+97+St+NW+%23333%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5E+4E2","website":"https://www.accordfamilylaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Edmonton. Rated 4.9 from 64 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/accord-family-law-edmonton.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Reena Herian"}],"areas":["Family law","Prenuptial, postnuptial and cohabitation agreements","Uncontested divorces","Residential real estate","Estate planning"]}}',NULL,'Accord Family Law is an Edmonton firm drafting separation agreements, uncontested divorces and prenuptial and cohabitation agreements at a flat fee.

Founded by Reena Herian, a family lawyer with more than 15 years of legal experience, the practice aims to keep low-conflict families out of court and meets clients remotely. Work includes parenting arrangements, child and spousal support, property division, and independent legal advice where the other side''s lawyer drafted the agreement. Wills, powers of attorney, personal directives and residential real estate purchases and sales are also offered.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('centre-pointe-law-calgary','Centre Pointe Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,62,51.0700932,-114.0628198,'{"name":"Centre Pointe Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Family Law","Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["injury","family","criminal"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0700932,"lng":-114.0628198,"address":"2009 Centre St N, Calgary, AB T2E 2S9","phone":"+14039301070","rating":4.9,"count":62,"slug":"centre-pointe-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Centre+Pointe+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2009+Centre+St+N%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2E+2S9","website":"https://cplawfirm.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury / Family Law in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 62 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/centre-pointe-law-calgary.webp","bioImage":"images/bio/centre-pointe-law-calgary.webp"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Centre Pointe Law practises in Calgary, Alberta, in the areas of personal injury, family law and criminal defence. The firm''s office is located at 2009 Centre Street N in Calgary, Alberta. Its three recorded practice areas cover injury matters, family law matters and criminal charges. Names of its lawyers and further details of its services are not recorded in this directory.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('highfield-law-office-edmonton','Highfield Law Office','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.6,62,53.5162905,-113.4927178,'{"name":"Highfield Law Office","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills","business"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5162905,"lng":-113.4927178,"address":"10132 80 Ave NW, Edmonton, AB T6E 1T7","phone":"+17804233188","rating":4.6,"count":62,"slug":"highfield-law-office-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Highfield+Law+Office+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10132+80+Ave+NW%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T6E+1T7","website":"https://www.highfieldlaw.com","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Edmonton. Rated 4.6 from 62 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/highfield-law-office-edmonton.png","details":{"founded":2001,"areas":["Real estate","Wills and estate planning","Residential and commercial real estate"],"serving":["Edmonton"]}}',NULL,'Highfield Law Office is an Edmonton real estate practice, established in 2001, handling residential and commercial purchases, sales and refinancing.

More than 90 percent of the practice is real estate, including purchases with a mortgage or in cash, sales and construction draw mortgages. The office also prepares wills, powers of attorney and personal directives, either as a will alone or as a full package, and provides notarization. Estate documents are prepared from instructions given in advance rather than on the spot.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('block-law-edmonton','Block Law','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.9,55,53.4548597,-113.5634017,'{"name":"Block Law","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.4548597,"lng":-113.5634017,"address":"14032 23 Ave NW #216, Edmonton, AB T6R 3L6","phone":"+17806280638","rating":4.9,"count":55,"slug":"block-law-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Block+Law+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=14032+23+Ave+NW+%23216%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T6R+3L6","website":"https://www.edmontonlawyer.net","blurb":"General practice law firm in Edmonton. Rated 4.9 from 55 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/block-law-edmonton.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Benjamin J. Block","title":"Founding Lawyer"}],"areas":["Business law","Real estate"]}}',NULL,'Block Law is an Edmonton business and real estate practice led by founding lawyer Benjamin Block. It works with entrepreneurs and builders and sets out fees and legal points in plain English.

Services include residential and commercial property purchases and sales, business sales, commercial leases for landlords and tenants, business formation and business agreements, and real estate development approvals, permits and construction matters. The practice has no traditional downtown office, so clients are not required to travel downtown to meet their lawyer.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('gosal-and-company-surrey','Gosal & Company','Surrey','BC','bc-fraser',0,4.7,284,49.1779767,-122.8427281,'{"name":"Gosal & Company","city":"Surrey","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"bc-fraser","province":"BC","lat":49.1779767,"lng":-122.8427281,"address":"9639 137 A St #304, Surrey, BC V3T 0M1","phone":"+16045918187","rating":4.7,"count":284,"slug":"gosal-and-company-surrey","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Gosal+%26+Company+Surrey+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=9639+137+A+St+%23304%2C+Surrey%2C+BC+V3T+0M1","website":"https://www.wcblawyers.com","blurb":"Personal Injury in Surrey. Rated 4.7 from 284 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/gosal-and-company-surrey.png","details":{"founded":1993,"lawyers":[{"name":"Sarj Gosal","title":"WorkSafeBC Lawyer"},{"name":"Kali Larsen","title":"WorkSafeBC Lawyer"},{"name":"Kate Elperin","title":"WorkSafeBC Lawyer"},{"name":"Pavin Bura","title":"WorkSafeBC Lawyer"}],"areas":["WorkSafeBC claims and appeals","WorkSafeBC and WCB law"],"serving":["British Columbia"]}}',NULL,'Gosal & Company is a Surrey firm that acts for injured workers in WorkSafeBC cases and appeals across British Columbia. Its lawyers handle appeals of WorkSafeBC decisions, including appeals to the Workers'' Compensation Appeal Tribunal, as well as case management and the reopening of closed files. Sarj Gosal has represented more than 5,800 injured workers since 1993, and the lawyers have over 50 years of combined experience with WorkSafeBC matters.

Clients come from construction, transportation, healthcare, retail, hospitality, manufacturing, forestry, education, aviation and government, and include tradespeople, drivers, nurses, care aides and first responders. The firm has locations in Vancouver, Victoria and Surrey and also assists injured workers remotely across the province.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ascent-employment-law-vancouver','Ascent Employment Law','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.7,190,49.2837218,-123.1121316,'{"name":"Ascent Employment Law","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2837218,"lng":-123.1121316,"address":"422 Richards St #170, Vancouver, BC V6B 2Z4","phone":"+16048005722","rating":4.7,"count":190,"slug":"ascent-employment-law-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Ascent+Employment+Law+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=422+Richards+St+%23170%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6B+2Z4","website":"https://www.ascentemploymentlaw.ca","blurb":"Employment Law in Vancouver. Rated 4.7 from 190 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ascent-employment-law-vancouver.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"David Brown","title":"Partner"},{"name":"Richard Johnson","title":"Partner"},{"name":"Trevor Thomas","title":"Partner"}],"areas":["Employment law","Human rights","Contractor engagements"],"serving":["Pacific Northwest"]}}',NULL,'Ascent Employment Law is a Vancouver firm acting for employers, employees and contractors in employment, labour and human rights matters. Richard Johnson, David Brown and Trevor Thomas formed the practice, and its work is limited to employment, human rights, contractor engagements, labour and workers'' compensation law.

Typical assignments include negotiating new employment terms, handling workplace conflict and grievances, ending difficult employment relationships and appearing in court. The wider team includes Veronica Ukrainetz, Ian Jung, Brynna Hambly, Glen Stratton and Sean Marzinzik.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('gurna-law-corporation-surrey','Gurna Law Corporation','Surrey','BC','bc-fraser',0,4.8,108,49.148597,-122.8676748,'{"name":"Gurna Law Corporation","city":"Surrey","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"bc-fraser","province":"BC","lat":49.148597,"lng":-122.8676748,"address":"8028 128 St #208, Surrey, BC V3W 4E9","phone":"+16042613171","rating":4.8,"count":108,"slug":"gurna-law-corporation-surrey","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Gurna+Law+Corporation+Surrey+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=8028+128+St+%23208%2C+Surrey%2C+BC+V3W+4E9","website":"https://www.gurnalaw.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Surrey. Rated 4.8 from 108 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/gurna-law-corporation-surrey.webp","details":{"areas":["Canadian citizenship","Canadian permanent residence","Provincial Nominee Programs","Labour Market Impact Assessment","Inadmissibility, refusals and appeals","Leave and judicial review","Record suspension","Pre-removal risk assessment"]}}',NULL,'Gurna Law Corporation is a Surrey immigration firm handling permanent residence, family sponsorship, business immigration and citizenship. Its lawyers prepare applications, respond to concerns raised by immigration authorities and represent clients in more complex matters, with advice given in plain language around each person''s family, career and business plans in Canada.

A particular focus is applications held up by government processing delays, which the firm pursues through methods such as a mandamus order. It also assists clients whose applications have been refused, and with the citizenship process from eligibility requirements through documentation to responses to immigration authorities.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('stern-shapray-criminal-lawyers-surrey','Stern Shapray Criminal Lawyers','Surrey','BC','bc-fraser',0,4.6,105,49.1381631,-122.858186,'{"name":"Stern Shapray Criminal Lawyers","city":"Surrey","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"bc-fraser","province":"BC","lat":49.1381631,"lng":-122.858186,"address":"7445 132 St Unit 1012, Surrey, BC V3W 1J8","phone":"+16045905600","rating":4.6,"count":105,"slug":"stern-shapray-criminal-lawyers-surrey","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Stern+Shapray+Criminal+Lawyers+Surrey+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=7445+132+St+Unit+1012%2C+Surrey%2C+BC+V3W+1J8","website":"https://www.sternshapraylaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Surrey. Rated 4.6 from 105 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/stern-shapray-criminal-lawyers-surrey.webp","heroImage":"images/hero/stern-shapray-criminal-lawyers-surrey.webp","details":{"founded":1997,"languages":["Punjabi"],"areas":["Criminal defence","Drug crimes and organized crime","Domestic assault","Sexual assault","Impaired and criminal driving","Youth criminal defence","Traffic ticket defence","Criminal appeals"],"serving":["Surrey","Vancouver","British Columbia","New Westminster"]}}',NULL,'Stern Shapray Criminal Lawyers is a Surrey criminal defence firm acting in criminal, quasi-criminal and regulatory matters across British Columbia. Established in British Columbia in 1997, it is a multi-lawyer practice, so each file draws on the views of several lawyers rather than one.

Its lawyers defend people at every stage of the justice process, from investigation and arrest through trial, sentencing and appeal. The work ranges from serious criminal charges to regulatory offences under the Motor Vehicle Act and the Customs Act, as well as traffic tickets.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('binhimyar-law-group-vancouver','BinHimyar Law Group','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,5,93,49.2845909,-123.1174221,'{"name":"BinHimyar Law Group","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2845909,"lng":-123.1174221,"address":"595 Howe St #308, Vancouver, BC V6C 2T5","phone":"+16042888622","rating":5,"count":93,"slug":"binhimyar-law-group-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/BinHimyar+Law+Group+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=595+Howe+St+%23308%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6C+2T5","website":"https://www.himyarlaw.com","blurb":"Immigration in Vancouver. Rated 5.0 from 93 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/binhimyar-law-group-vancouver.png","details":{"languages":["English","Arabic","Spanish"],"areas":["Business immigration","Labour Market Impact Assessments","Family immigration","Temporary resident visas and permits","Refugees and asylum","Citizenship services"]}}',NULL,'BinHimyar Law Group is a Vancouver immigration firm covering business and family immigration, temporary visas, refugee matters and citizenship. Its lawyers have more than 15 years of experience working only in Canadian immigration and citizenship law, and the team can serve clients in English, Arabic and some Spanish.

The firm assists with work permits, study permits, visitor visas, labour market impact assessments and the sponsorship of spouses, children, parents and grandparents. It represents clients in all divisions of the Immigration and Refugee Board of Canada, including removal orders, application refusals, admissibility hearings and loss of permanent resident status. Appointments are held in person in Vancouver or by Zoom, Skype or WhatsApp.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('sodagar-and-company-law-corporation-vancouver','Sodagar & Company Law Corporation','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.7,89,49.2812793,-123.1157738,'{"name":"Sodagar & Company Law Corporation","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["realestate","litigation"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2812793,"lng":-123.1157738,"address":"475 W Georgia St #650, Vancouver, BC V6B 4M9","phone":"+16046021626","rating":4.7,"count":89,"slug":"sodagar-and-company-law-corporation-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sodagar+%26+Company+Law+Corporation+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=475+W+Georgia+St+%23650%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6B+4M9","website":"https://sodagar.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Civil Litigation in Vancouver. Rated 4.7 from 89 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/sodagar-and-company-law-corporation-vancouver.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Ali Sodagar","title":"Lawyer and Trade-Mark Agent"},{"name":"Jatinder Sharma","title":"Associate"},{"name":"Alireza Fazeli","title":"Associate"},{"name":"Kriti Chopra","title":"Associate"},{"name":"George Gregory","title":"Senior Litigator"}],"areas":["Litigation","Business law","Commercial leases","Corporate law","Wills and estate law","Estate litigation and probate"]}}',NULL,'Sodagar & Company Law Corporation is a Vancouver firm handling business, real estate, estate, litigation and intellectual property matters. For more than two decades it has acted for domestic and international businesses and entrepreneurs, led by principal Ali Sodagar, who is both a lawyer and a Trade-Mark Agent.

Business services include commercial leases, business formations, non-disclosure and non-competition agreements, business transactions and the purchase and sale of intellectual property rights. Associates Jatinder Sharma, Alireza Fazeli and Kriti Chopra and senior litigator George Gregory complete the legal team, which has appeared at all levels of court in British Columbia.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('tevlin-gleadle-curtis-vancouver','Tevlin Gleadle Curtis','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.6,85,49.2843723,-123.1158967,'{"name":"Tevlin Gleadle Curtis","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2843723,"lng":-123.1158967,"address":"543 Granville St #1050, Vancouver, BC V6C 1X8","phone":"+16046482966","rating":4.6,"count":85,"slug":"tevlin-gleadle-curtis-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Tevlin+Gleadle+Curtis+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=543+Granville+St+%231050%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6C+1X8","website":"https://www.tevlingleadle.com","blurb":"Employment Law in Vancouver. Rated 4.6 from 85 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/tevlin-gleadle-curtis-vancouver.jpg","bioImage":"images/bio/tevlin-gleadle-curtis-vancouver.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Blair Curtis"}],"areas":["Employment law","Wrongful dismissal","Constructive dismissal","Human rights","Workplace harassment","Class actions","Workplace investigations","Physician workplace law"],"serving":["Vancouver"]}}',NULL,'Tevlin Gleadle Curtis is a Vancouver employment law firm handling wrongful dismissal, constructive dismissal and human rights matters. Murray Tevlin and Dan Gleadle founded it in 2000, and it acts for employees, groups of employees, employers and contractors across Canada.

Its lawyers have worked in trial and appeal courts in British Columbia, Alberta, Saskatchewan and Ontario and appeared at the Supreme Court of Canada in Matthews and Ocean Nutrition, and they also act in mediation, arbitration and before administrative tribunals. The practice covers workplace harassment, class actions, workplace investigations and compensation issues for physicians in publicly funded health care.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('go-law-vancouver','Go Law','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.9,73,49.2637618,-123.1180386,'{"name":"Go Law","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2637618,"lng":-123.1180386,"address":"601 W Broadway #300, Vancouver, BC V5Z 4C2","phone":"+16043733800","rating":4.9,"count":73,"slug":"go-law-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Go+Law+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=601+W+Broadway+%23300%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V5Z+4C2","website":"https://golawgroup.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Vancouver. Rated 4.9 from 73 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/go-law-vancouver.png","details":{"languages":["Cantonese","Mandarin"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Nick Go","title":"Lawyer"}],"areas":["Real estate","Business law","Estate planning"],"serving":["Vancouver"]}}',NULL,'Go Law is a Vancouver firm handling real estate, business and estate planning matters, including probate. Nick Go founded the firm after completing his Juris Doctor at the University of British Columbia in 2015 and practising with senior lawyer Dick W. Eng and at Bell Alliance LLP.

Real estate work covers residential and commercial purchases and sales, private lending, refinancing, commercial leases and Land Title Office filings such as subdivisions, stratifications and easements. Designated paralegal Teng Fong has more than 15 years of experience with conveyancing, corporate and estate files and serves clients in Cantonese and Mandarin.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('dosanjh-ladner-arora-vancouver','Dosanjh Ladner Arora','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.9,71,49.2642652,-123.1375339,'{"name":"Dosanjh Ladner Arora","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2642652,"lng":-123.1375339,"address":"1462 W 8th Ave #200, Vancouver, BC V6H 1E1","phone":"+16043276381","rating":4.9,"count":71,"slug":"dosanjh-ladner-arora-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Dosanjh+Ladner+Arora+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1462+W+8th+Ave+%23200%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6H+1E1","website":"https://dlalaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Vancouver. Rated 4.9 from 71 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/dosanjh-ladner-arora-vancouver.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Aseem Dosanjh"},{"name":"Paul Ladner","title":"Partner"},{"name":"Pavel Dosanjh"},{"name":"Asheesh R. Arora"}],"areas":["Family law","Civil litigation and dispute resolution","Personal injury","Insurance","Professional misconduct","Police misconduct"],"serving":["Vancouver"]}}',NULL,'Dosanjh Ladner Arora is a Vancouver trial law firm handling family law, civil litigation, personal injury and insurance disputes. The firm, formerly Dosanjh Law Group, traces its practice to 1979, when Ujjal Dosanjh opened it in Vancouver; he later served as Attorney General of British Columbia and as federal Minister of Health.

His sons Aseem and Pavel Dosanjh became partners after being called to the bar in 2001 and 2002, and Aseem has served as president of the Trial Lawyers Association of British Columbia. Paul Ladner joined as an articling student in 2014 and became a partner in 2018. The practice also takes on professional misconduct and police misconduct matters.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('wilson-rasmussen-llp-surrey','Wilson Rasmussen LLP','Surrey','BC','bc-fraser',0,4.7,71,49.1852945,-122.802969,'{"name":"Wilson Rasmussen LLP","city":"Surrey","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"bc-fraser","province":"BC","lat":49.1852945,"lng":-122.802969,"address":"Guildford Landmark, 15127 100 Ave Suite 300, Surrey, BC V3R 0N9","phone":"+16045837917","rating":4.7,"count":71,"slug":"wilson-rasmussen-llp-surrey","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Wilson+Rasmussen+LLP+Surrey+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Guildford+Landmark%2C+15127+100+Ave+Suite+300%2C+Surrey%2C+BC+V3R+0N9","website":"https://wilsonrasmussen.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Surrey. Rated 4.7 from 71 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/wilson-rasmussen-llp-surrey.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Dharam Dhillon"},{"name":"Robin Jawanda"},{"name":"Douglas Zorrilla"}],"areas":["Real estate","Wills and estates","Property development","Business and commercial law","Immigration","Family law","Mediation","Civil litigation"],"serving":["Surrey","Delta","South Surrey"]}}','{"1":[["08:30","17:00"]],"2":[["08:30","17:00"]],"3":[["08:30","17:00"]],"4":[["08:30","17:00"]],"5":[["08:30","17:00"]]}','Wilson Rasmussen LLP is a Surrey and Delta law firm handling real estate, wills and estates, property development, business and family law. It also acts in immigration, mediation and civil litigation, with offices in Surrey''s Guildford Landmark building and in Delta.

Services include preparing wills, powers of attorney and representation agreements, advising companies on contracts and guiding developers through zoning, permits and development projects. The firm serves Surrey, Delta, Ladner, Tsawwassen, Langley, White Rock and Richmond and works in English and Spanish. Its lawyers include Dharam Dhillon, Robin Jawanda and Douglas Zorrilla.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('elegant-law-corporation-surrey','Elegant Law Corporation','Surrey','BC','bc-fraser',0,5,62,49.1338412,-122.8417063,'{"name":"Elegant Law Corporation","city":"Surrey","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration","Civil Litigation","Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["immigration","litigation","realestate"],"region":"bc-fraser","province":"BC","lat":49.1338412,"lng":-122.8417063,"address":"13737 72 Ave #205, Surrey, BC V3W 2P2","phone":"+17789060836","rating":5,"count":62,"slug":"elegant-law-corporation-surrey","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Elegant+Law+Corporation+Surrey+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=13737+72+Ave+%23205%2C+Surrey%2C+BC+V3W+2P2","website":"https://www.elegantlaw.ca","blurb":"Immigration / Civil Litigation in Surrey. Rated 5.0 from 62 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/elegant-law-corporation-surrey.webp","details":{"areas":["Immigration & refugee law","Federal Court & immigration litigation","Civil litigation","Corporate & commercial law","Wills & estates","Real estate conveyancing"]}}',NULL,'Elegant Law Corporation is a Surrey law firm working in immigration, civil litigation and real estate. Its office is at 13737 72 Avenue, Suite 205, Surrey, British Columbia.

The firm also acts in business formation, contracts and dispute resolution, and gives industry-specific advice on compliance and risk management to sectors such as construction, healthcare and manufacturing. Family work includes divorce, child custody, spousal support and adoption, and the firm also deals with cross-border disputes, international trade and foreign investment.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('magnolia-law-corporation-vancouver','Magnolia Law Corporation','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,5,61,49.2805971,-123.1174468,'{"name":"Magnolia Law Corporation","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2805971,"lng":-123.1174468,"address":"777 Richards St Suite 602, Vancouver, BC V6B 0M6","phone":"+16047150110","rating":5,"count":61,"slug":"magnolia-law-corporation-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Magnolia+Law+Corporation+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=777+Richards+St+Suite+602%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6B+0M6","website":"https://www.magnolialaw.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Vancouver. Rated 5.0 from 61 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/magnolia-law-corporation-vancouver.png"}',NULL,'Magnolia Law Corporation is a Vancouver law firm recorded under general practice. Its office is at 777 Richards Street, Suite 602, Vancouver, British Columbia, V6B 0M6. No individual practice areas, lawyers or services have been published for the firm, so its work is known only by that general practice category.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('tuscano-law-surrey','Tuscano Law','Surrey','BC','bc-fraser',0,5,60,49.1857462,-122.8004847,'{"name":"Tuscano Law","city":"Surrey","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"bc-fraser","province":"BC","lat":49.1857462,"lng":-122.8004847,"address":"10090 152 St Suite#556 151, Surrey, BC V3R 8X8","phone":"+16723804349","rating":5,"count":60,"slug":"tuscano-law-surrey","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Tuscano+Law+Surrey+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10090+152+St+Suite%23556+151%2C+Surrey%2C+BC+V3R+8X8","website":"https://tuscanolaw.com","blurb":"General practice law firm in Surrey. Rated 5.0 from 60 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/tuscano-law-surrey.webp"}',NULL,'Tuscano Law is a Surrey firm handling immigration, family, criminal, wills and estates, personal injury and civil litigation matters. Founder Arica began her legal career in Mumbai in 2014, worked in firms in Mumbai and Vancouver, and was called to the Law Society of British Columbia in 2021.

The firm accepts Legal Aid clients and offers unbundled services, in which the lawyer handles only part of a matter and the client carries out the remaining tasks, which can make legal help more accessible. Arica holds an LLM in Business Law and belongs to the Law Society of British Columbia, the Trial Lawyers Association of BC and the South Asian Bar Association of British Columbia.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('smukowich-law-corporation-vancouver','Smukowich Law Corporation','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.9,55,49.28752,-123.1138675,'{"name":"Smukowich Law Corporation","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.28752,"lng":-123.1138675,"address":"999 Canada Pl #404, Vancouver, BC V6C 3E2","phone":"+16043163456","rating":4.9,"count":55,"slug":"smukowich-law-corporation-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Smukowich+Law+Corporation+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=999+Canada+Pl+%23404%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6C+3E2","website":"https://www.smuklaw.com","blurb":"Wills & Estates in Vancouver. Rated 4.9 from 55 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/smukowich-law-corporation-vancouver.jpg","details":{"founded":2020,"lawyers":[{"name":"Andrew Smukowich"}],"areas":["Litigation and dispute resolution","Corporate law","Wills & estates","Aboriginal law"],"serving":["British Columbia"]}}',NULL,'Smukowich Law Corporation is a Vancouver firm handling wills and estates, corporate law and litigation for clients across British Columbia. Andrew Smukowich, a Métis lawyer, founded the practice in 2020 as a virtual firm with predictable pricing, and it is Indigenous owned.

Litigation work includes small claims, Supreme Court civil matters, residential tenancy disputes and arbitration. Corporate services cover incorporation, records management, governance and contract drafting, and estate work covers advance directives, powers of attorney, letters of wishes and representation agreements. The firm has experience in Aboriginal corporate governance and economic development initiatives in BC, and Andrew holds an MBA and a Bachelor of Commerce.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('dumoulin-boskovich-llp-vancouver','DuMoulin Boskovich LLP','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.7,54,49.2798452,-123.1246517,'{"name":"DuMoulin Boskovich LLP","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2798452,"lng":-123.1246517,"address":"808 Nelson St Unit 1301, Vancouver, BC V6Z 2H2","phone":"+16046695500","rating":4.7,"count":54,"slug":"dumoulin-boskovich-llp-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/DuMoulin+Boskovich+LLP+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=808+Nelson+St+Unit+1301%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6Z+2H2","website":"https://www.dubo.com","blurb":"Personal Injury in Vancouver. Rated 4.7 from 54 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/dumoulin-boskovich-llp-vancouver.png","details":{"founded":1972,"languages":["Cantonese","Farsi","French","Hindi","Italian","Mandarin","Polish","Portuguese"],"areas":["Business law","Wills, trusts and estates","Estate litigation","Family law","Real estate","Litigation","Employment law","Insurance law","Strata law","Bankruptcy & insolvency"],"serving":["Vancouver","Kelowna","Vernon"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','DuMoulin Boskovich LLP is a Vancouver law firm, also in Kelowna and Vernon, handling personal injury, family, corporate and real estate matters. Founded in 1972 by Joe Boskovich and Tony DuMoulin, it acts for local, provincial, national and international clients.

Joe Boskovich built a clientele of fishermen, boat owners and fish processors and became a qualified mediator in 1985, while Tony DuMoulin brought strength in real estate, commercial transactions and wills and estates. Today the firm also handles estate litigation, employment law, catastrophic injury, debt collection, strata fee collection and proceedings under the Bankruptcy and Insolvency Act.','dynamic','live',NULL);
