Real estate work covers commercial and residential purchases, sales and refinancing, leasing and real estate litigation, while other services include contract disputes, small claims and estate planning. The firm also offers board secretarial and on-demand corporate legal services to companies, with fixed fees where possible.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('khaki-law-corporation-vancouver','Khaki Law Corporation','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.8,34,49.2853363,-123.1215713,'{"name":"Khaki Law Corporation","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2853363,"lng":-123.1215713,"address":"1055 W Georgia St #2113, Vancouver, BC V6E 3P3","phone":"+17786531725","rating":4.8,"count":34,"slug":"khaki-law-corporation-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Khaki+Law+Corporation+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1055+W+Georgia+St+%232113%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6E+3P3","website":"https://khakilaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Vancouver. Rated 4.8 from 34 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/khaki-law-corporation-vancouver.png","details":{"areas":["Family law","Estate planning","Divorce and separation","Parenting arrangements","Child and spousal support","Property and debt division","Alternative dispute resolution"],"serving":["Vancouver","Langley","British Columbia"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Khaki Law Corporation is a Vancouver family law firm handling separation, divorce, parenting arrangements, support and estate planning. It has offices in Vancouver and Langley and acts for clients throughout British Columbia.

Family work includes child and spousal support, the division of property and debt, agreements such as separation, cohabitation and marriage agreements, and international child abduction and Hague Convention proceedings, with mediation and negotiation encouraged where appropriate. Estate planning covers wills, powers of attorney and representation agreements, and lawyer Altamish Khaki''s work also includes trusts, business law and immigration.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('jk-law-corporation-surrey','JK Law Corporation','Surrey','BC','bc-fraser',0,4.9,30,49.1786371,-122.8429724,'{"name":"JK Law Corporation","city":"Surrey","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"bc-fraser","province":"BC","lat":49.1786371,"lng":-122.8429724,"address":"9686 137 St Unit 809, Surrey, BC V3T 4G8","phone":"+16042291910","rating":4.9,"count":30,"slug":"jk-law-corporation-surrey","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/JK+Law+Corporation+Surrey+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=9686+137+St+Unit+809%2C+Surrey%2C+BC+V3T+4G8","website":"https://jklawcorp.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Surrey. Rated 4.9 from 30 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/jk-law-corporation-surrey.webp","details":{"languages":["English","Punjabi","Hindi"],"lawyers":[{"name":"Jasdeep Kaur"}],"areas":["Immigration & refugee law","Family law"],"serving":["Surrey"]}}',NULL,'JK Law Corporation is a Surrey firm handling family law, immigration and refugee law, real estate and business matters. Founder Jasdeep Kaur earned her Juris Doctor at Queen''s University in 2018 and was called to the Ontario bar in 2019 and the British Columbia bar in 2020.

Family services include guardianship and parenting arrangements, child support, separation agreements, cohabitation and marriage agreements and desk order divorces. Immigration work covers temporary resident permits, restoration of status and permanent resident applications, including the economic class. Before opening the firm she worked in Ontario and British Columbia on family, criminal, conveyancing and estate files and has appeared in the Provincial Court and Supreme Court of British Columbia.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('mahogany-law-group-llp-abbotsford','Mahogany Law Group LLP','Abbotsford','BC','bc-fraser',0,4.7,31,49.0416021,-122.3150862,'{"name":"Mahogany Law Group LLP","city":"Abbotsford","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["family","wills"],"region":"bc-fraser","province":"BC","lat":49.0416021,"lng":-122.3150862,"address":"2180 Gladwin Rd Unit 205, Abbotsford, BC V2S 0H4","phone":"+16042767855","rating":4.7,"count":31,"slug":"mahogany-law-group-llp-abbotsford","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mahogany+Law+Group+LLP+Abbotsford+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2180+Gladwin+Rd+Unit+205%2C+Abbotsford%2C+BC+V2S+0H4","website":"https://www.mahoganylaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law / Wills & Estates in Abbotsford. Rated 4.7 from 31 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/mahogany-law-group-llp-abbotsford.webp","details":{"areas":["Family law","Estate law"]}}',NULL,'Mahogany Law Group LLP is an Abbotsford family and estate law firm handling divorce, wills and estates. Its approach is to match each client with a lawyer suited to the case rather than assigning the next available lawyer, through a five-step process.

The team includes Alexandra M. Ghihor, Puneet K. Mann, Francis Lepp and Joshua Vissia. The firm emphasizes clear and transparent communication, strong client relationships and insight into the local community, and aims to resolve matters as quickly and efficiently as possible.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('stirling-llp-vancouver','Stirling LLP','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,5,28,49.2833332,-123.117736,'{"name":"Stirling LLP","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2833332,"lng":-123.117736,"address":"701 W Georgia St #1460, Vancouver, BC V7Y 1E4","phone":"+16046743818","rating":5,"count":28,"slug":"stirling-llp-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Stirling+LLP+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=701+W+Georgia+St+%231460%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V7Y+1E4","website":"https://www.stirlingllp.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Vancouver. Rated 5.0 from 28 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/stirling-llp-vancouver.png","details":{"areas":["Corporate","Commercial lending","Real estate","Estate planning","Conveyancing","Natural resources & energy"],"serving":["Vancouver"]}}',NULL,'Stirling LLP is a Vancouver business law firm handling corporate, commercial lending, real estate and conveyancing work. It also advises on estate planning and on natural resources and energy matters, and it shares office space with Langford Law while operating independently of it.

Corporate services include the purchase and sale of a business, incorporating BC and federal companies, limited partnerships, societies and not-for-profits, confidentiality and non-compete agreements, and settlement agreements, waivers, releases and indemnities. Commercial lending work covers collateral mortgages, secured lines of credit, security over Crown lands and First Nations lands, and Personal Property Security Act registrations.','dynamic','live',NULL);
