Its clients are mainly companies, business owners, self-employed workers, managers and professionals in the greater Montreal area. Work includes debt recovery, loyalty, non-competition and non-solicitation obligations, and union, collective agreement and grievance arbitration matters, alongside family and estate law. Sector work covers commercial and industrial real estate, health clinics and professionals, information technology, daycare services and vocational schools, franchising, retail and e-commerce, accounting and financial services, and retirement residences.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('siddiky-law-montreal','Siddiky Law','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.9,43,45.5028862,-73.5669333,'{"name":"Siddiky Law","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.5028862,"lng":-73.5669333,"address":"615 Boul. René-Lévesque Ouest #1210, Montreal, Quebec H3B 1P5","phone":"+15145568932","rating":4.9,"count":43,"slug":"siddiky-law-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Siddiky+Law+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=615+Boul.+Ren%C3%A9-L%C3%A9vesque+Ouest+%231210%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H3B+1P5","website":"https://siddikylaw.com","blurb":"Immigration in Montreal. Rated 4.9 from 43 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/siddiky-law-montreal.png","bioImage":"images/bio/siddiky-law-montreal.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Sohana Sara Siddiky","title":"Lawyer"},{"name":"Shadman Siddiky","title":"Lawyer"}],"areas":["Immigration law","Permanent residence","Visitor visa","Work permits","Family reunification","Citizenship"]}}',NULL,'Siddiky Law is a Montreal immigration firm handling permanent residence, visitor visas, work permits, family reunification and citizenship applications.

Its lawyers are Sohana Sara Siddiky and Shadman Siddiky, working from an office on René-Lévesque Boulevard West. Permanent residence applications, visitor visas for temporary stays and work permits for employment in Canada make up the core of the practice. Clients are kept informed of progress at each stage of their file, and the firm''s values are justice, equality and resilience.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('chalati-lawyer-inc-chalati-avocat-inc-montreal','Chalati Lawyer Inc./Chalati Avocat Inc.','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.9,40,45.506755,-73.6925565,'{"name":"Chalati Lawyer Inc./Chalati Avocat Inc.","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Business Law"],"caseTypes":["business"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.506755,"lng":-73.6925565,"address":"2205 Boulevard Cote Vertu Ouest #200, Saint-Laurent, Quebec H4R 1N8","phone":"+15144182587","rating":4.9,"count":40,"slug":"chalati-lawyer-inc-chalati-avocat-inc-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Chalati+Lawyer+Inc.%2FChalati+Avocat+Inc.+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2205+Boulevard+Cote+Vertu+Ouest+%23200%2C+Saint-Laurent%2C+Quebec+H4R+1N8","website":"https://www.chalatilegal.ca","blurb":"Business Law in Montreal. Rated 4.9 from 40 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/chalati-lawyer-inc-chalati-avocat-inc-montreal.png","details":{"areas":["Incorporation for professionals","Not-for-profit incorporation","Partnership agreement","Business registration","Corporate resolutions and minutes","Buying or selling a business","Independent contractor agreement"],"serving":["Montreal"]}}',NULL,'Start-ups, businesses and not-for-profits are advised on incorporation, contracts and transactions by Chalati Lawyer, a Montreal business law firm.

The firm acts as outside counsel for companies signing leases, hiring employees, drafting contracts, reorganizing, or buying and selling a business. Services include incorporation, converting a sole proprietorship into a corporation, and municipal tax exemptions for not-for-profit organizations. Nadine Chalati is the owner and a corporate lawyer, joined by corporate lawyer Kimberly Dayan Vesco Vasquez and corporate paralegals Alexis Silva and Selina Romanelli. The office is on boulevard Côte-Vertu in Saint-Laurent.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lazarus-legal-montreal','Lazarus Legal','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.6,41,45.5019428,-73.560962,'{"name":"Lazarus Legal","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.5019428,"lng":-73.560962,"address":"759 Rue du Square-Victoria #100, Montreal, Quebec H2Y 2H7","phone":"+15142898600","rating":4.6,"count":41,"slug":"lazarus-legal-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lazarus+Legal+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=759+Rue+du+Square-Victoria+%23100%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H2Y+2H7","website":"https://www.lazaruslegal.com","blurb":"General practice law firm in Montreal. Rated 4.6 from 41 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lazarus-legal-montreal.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Edwin Monzon","title":"Managing partner"},{"name":"Patrick Baghdisar"},{"name":"Audrey Baillairgé"},{"name":"Marc Charbonneau"}],"areas":["Commercial litigation","Civil litigation","Corporate matters","Banking and financial matters","Bankruptcy law"]}}',NULL,'Established in 1967, Lazarus Legal is a Montreal law firm that advises clients in emerging industries.

Edwin D. Monzon, called to the Quebec Bar in 2004, is managing partner and works in the gaming and corporate industry. The firm''s people include Patrick Baghdisar, Audrey Baillairgé, Tim Buckingham, Marc Charbonneau, David Chislaru, Ian Cook, Alexander Di Giovanni, Vanessa Di Tullio, René R. Gauthier and John Giammarella. A notarial division handles real estate acquisitions, refinancing and condominium projects, along with non-contentious family law procedures, in English, French and Italian. The firm''s core values are kindness and respect, trust, teamwork, success, growth and innovation, and courage and optimism.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('mathieu-di-lullo-montreal','Mathieu Di Lullo','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.9,35,45.4768165,-73.6219234,'{"name":"Mathieu Di Lullo","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.4768165,"lng":-73.6219234,"address":"5505 Monkland Ave, Montreal, Quebec H4A 1C8","phone":"+15142613337","rating":4.9,"count":35,"slug":"mathieu-di-lullo-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mathieu+Di+Lullo+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=5505+Monkland+Ave%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H4A+1C8","website":"https://mdlimmigration.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Montreal. Rated 4.9 from 35 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/mathieu-di-lullo-montreal.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Mathieu Di Lullo"}],"areas":["Immigration","Citoyenneté","Entrée express","Réunification de la famille"]}}',NULL,'Express Entry, work and study applications, citizenship, family reunification and litigation are the focus of Mathieu Di Lullo, a Montreal immigration lawyer.

He has practised immigration law since 2012 and has handled hundreds of routine and complex files for temporary and permanent immigration to Canada, for workers, employers and students. He works in English and French and has a working knowledge of Italian. He is a member of the Barreau du Québec, the Association québécoise des avocats en droit de l''immigration (AQAADI) and the immigration section of the Canadian Bar Association, where he sits on the Quebec executive. The practice operates as MDL Immigration from an office on Monkland Avenue.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('gauthier-avocats-brossard','GAUTHIER AVOCATS','Brossard','QC','qc-monteregie',0,4.9,35,45.4508888,-73.4373978,'{"name":"GAUTHIER AVOCATS","city":"Brossard","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"qc-monteregie","province":"QC","lat":45.4508888,"lng":-73.4373978,"address":"4605 Boul. Lapinière Ste 350, Brossard, QC J4Z 3T5","phone":"+14509943434","rating":4.9,"count":35,"slug":"gauthier-avocats-brossard","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/GAUTHIER+AVOCATS+Brossard+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4605+Boul.+Lapini%C3%A8re+Ste+350%2C+Brossard%2C+QC+J4Z+3T5","website":"https://avocatsgauthier.com","blurb":"Family Law in Brossard. Rated 4.9 from 35 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/gauthier-avocats-brossard.png","details":{"founded":2009,"areas":["Conjoints de fait","Conjoints mariés"],"serving":["Brossard","Longueuil","Montréal","Saint-Jean-sur-Richelieu","St-Hyacinthe"]}}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Gauthier Avocats is a Brossard family law firm handling divorce, separation and child custody matters for spouses and parents in the Montreal area.

The firm has practised family law since 2009 and serves clients in Brossard, Longueuil, Montreal, Saint-Jean-sur-Richelieu and Saint-Hyacinthe. Its approach rests on long experience in family matters and close attention to each client. The office is on Boulevard Lapinière in Brossard, and legal aid mandates are not accepted.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('tcj-brossard','TCJ','Brossard','QC','qc-monteregie',0,4.9,29,45.4472429,-73.4321846,'{"name":"TCJ","city":"Brossard","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"qc-monteregie","province":"QC","lat":45.4472429,"lng":-73.4321846,"address":"2000 R. de l''Éclipse #1400, Brossard, QC J4Z 0S2","phone":"+14504628555","rating":4.9,"count":29,"slug":"tcj-brossard","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/TCJ+Brossard+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2000+R.+de+l%27%C3%89clipse+%231400%2C+Brossard%2C+QC+J4Z+0S2","website":"https://www.groupetcj.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Brossard. Rated 4.9 from 29 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/tcj-brossard.png","details":{"areas":["Affaires, commercial et corporatif"]}}',NULL,'TCJ (Therrien Couture Joli-Coeur) is a Brossard firm of lawyers, notaries and financial analysts serving businesses, professionals and public bodies.

Its work includes advising private and public health and social services institutions, as well as doctors, dentists, pharmacists and veterinarians on their legal needs and business projects, and representing public health bodies in tenders, contracts and public procurement. Other areas are financial services, business, commercial and corporate law, administrative law, and labour and employment law. The team includes Nathalie Lamontagne, Yves Lacasse, Normand Therrien, Guillaume Lapierre and Véronique Jobin, working from rue de l''Éclipse in Brossard.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lacombe-avocats-montreal','Lacombe Avocats','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.8,29,45.5022354,-73.5632279,'{"name":"Lacombe Avocats","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.5022354,"lng":-73.5632279,"address":"495 Av. Viger O #3105, Montréal, QC H2Z 1B1","phone":"+15148984029","rating":4.8,"count":29,"slug":"lacombe-avocats-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lacombe+Avocats+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=495+Av.+Viger+O+%233105%2C+Montr%C3%A9al%2C+QC+H2Z+1B1","website":"https://www.lacombeavocats.ca","blurb":"General practice law firm in Montreal. Rated 4.8 from 29 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lacombe-avocats-montreal.png","details":{"areas":["Création de société","Convention d''actionnaires","Testament","Fiscalité internationale","Liquidation de succession","Achat et vente d''immeuble","Copropriété","Congédiement","Citoyenneté","Médiation familiale"],"serving":["Montréal"]}}',NULL,'From downtown Montreal, Lacombe Avocats handles litigation, real estate, condominium, estate, business and tax matters.

The firm is led by Me Marc-André Lacombe, who holds a master''s degree in taxation, a master''s degree in international trade law from the Université de Montpellier, a common law Juris Doctor and a graduate diploma in business law. It operates from Avenue Viger Ouest and offers prepaid blocks of hours for clients. Its approach is transparent and personal, tailored to the needs of each client and to their budget.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('fdg-avocats-montreal','FDG Avocats','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,5,27,45.4952254,-73.690779,'{"name":"FDG Avocats","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["litigation"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.4952254,"lng":-73.690779,"address":"404, 6505 Rte Transcanadienne O, Saint-Laurent, QC H3C 1T4","phone":"+15145449999","rating":5,"count":27,"slug":"fdg-avocats-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/FDG+Avocats+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=404%2C+6505+Rte+Transcanadienne+O%2C+Saint-Laurent%2C+QC+H3C+1T4","website":"https://fdgavocats.com","blurb":"Civil Litigation in Montreal. Rated 5.0 from 27 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/fdg-avocats-montreal.jpg","details":{"areas":["Droit des affaires","Droit fiscal","Litige"]}}',NULL,'Business law, tax law and litigation for start-ups and established companies are the focus of FDG Avocats in Montreal.

Services include representation in audits, objections and court proceedings against tax authorities, tax strategies for individuals and businesses, and legal structuring that isolates business assets from personal wealth and guards against seizure. The firm also advises on business management and growth and helps resolve disputes between individuals or companies, whether by agreement or before the courts. Me Félix-Desbiens-Gravel is a former counsel for the Canada Revenue Agency. The office is on Route Transcanadienne Ouest in Saint-Laurent.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('le-groupe-campeau-raymond-inc-montreal','Le Groupe Campeau Raymond Inc.','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.9,27,45.505018,-73.554706,'{"name":"Le Groupe Campeau Raymond Inc.","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.505018,"lng":-73.554706,"address":"54 Le Royer St W, Montreal, Quebec H2Y 3S5","phone":"+15145070527","rating":4.9,"count":27,"slug":"le-groupe-campeau-raymond-inc-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Le+Groupe+Campeau+Raymond+Inc.+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=54+Le+Royer+St+W%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H2Y+3S5","website":"https://www.legroupecr.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Montreal. Rated 4.9 from 27 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/le-groupe-campeau-raymond-inc-montreal.png","details":{"areas":["Droit criminel","Droit pénal","Enquête sur remise en liberté","Représentations sur sentence"],"serving":["Montreal"]}}',NULL,'Criminal and penal defence at trial and on appeal, up to the Supreme Court of Canada, is the work of Le Groupe Campeau Raymond in Montreal.

Lawyers Campeau and Raymond have acted in matters including a stay of proceedings in a large drug investigation, a stay for unreasonable delay on securities-law fines above 240,000 dollars confirmed by the Quebec Court of Appeal, an acquittal on unstamped tobacco fines above 200,000 dollars, and a Court of Appeal order for a new trial in a first-degree murder case. Me Raymond appeared for the AQAAD, the Quebec defence lawyers'' association, before the Supreme Court of Canada in Sharma, on conditional sentences.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('dionne-avocats-boucherville-brossard','Dionne Avocats Boucherville','Brossard','QC','qc-monteregie',0,4.8,26,45.4508888,-73.4373978,'{"name":"Dionne Avocats Boucherville","city":"Brossard","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"qc-monteregie","province":"QC","lat":45.4508888,"lng":-73.4373978,"address":"4605 Boul. Lapinière Ste 350, Brossard, QC J4Z 3T5","phone":"+14504490100","rating":4.8,"count":26,"slug":"dionne-avocats-boucherville-brossard","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Dionne+Avocats+Boucherville+Brossard+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4605+Boul.+Lapini%C3%A8re+Ste+350%2C+Brossard%2C+QC+J4Z+3T5","website":"https://www.dionneavocats.com","blurb":"Family Law in Brossard. Rated 4.8 from 26 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/dionne-avocats-boucherville-brossard.png","bioImage":"images/bio/dionne-avocats-boucherville-brossard.webp","details":{"areas":["Droit familial","Droit de la famille","Séparation","Divorce","Garde d''enfants","Pension alimentaire"],"serving":["Québec"]}}',NULL,'Based in Brossard, Dionne Avocats Boucherville is a family law practice handling divorce, separation, child custody and child support.

The practice also covers access rights, whether through negotiation, amicable agreements or before the courts, and handles criminal and penal matters. Services are offered remotely to clients across Quebec, and the lawyers travel throughout the greater Montreal area. Topics addressed include how a custody application proceeds in Quebec and whether a support payment or an existing judgment can be changed.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('patrick-jacques-avocat-droit-criminel-quebec-city','Patrick Jacques Avocat Droit Criminel','Quebec City','QC','qc-quebec',0,4.8,24,46.8008507,-71.2318623,'{"name":"Patrick Jacques Avocat Droit Criminel","city":"Quebec City","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["criminal","litigation"],"region":"qc-quebec","province":"QC","lat":46.8008507,"lng":-71.2318623,"address":"425 Boulevard René-Lévesque O, Québec, QC G1S 1S2","phone":"+14182631333","rating":4.8,"count":24,"slug":"patrick-jacques-avocat-droit-criminel-quebec-city","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Patrick+Jacques+Avocat+Droit+Criminel+Quebec+City+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=425+Boulevard+Ren%C3%A9-L%C3%A9vesque+O%2C+Qu%C3%A9bec%2C+QC+G1S+1S2","website":"https://pjavocatcriminel.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Civil Litigation in Quebec City. Rated 4.8 from 24 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/patrick-jacques-avocat-droit-criminel-quebec-city.png","heroImage":"images/hero/patrick-jacques-avocat-droit-criminel-quebec-city.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Patrick Jacques"}],"areas":["Droit criminel","Conduite avec facultés affaiblies","Voies de fait","Agressions sexuelles","Vol et cambriolage","Infractions relatives aux drogues","Infractions relatives aux armes à feu","Meurtre et homicide involontaire","Représentation en appel","Violence conjugale"]}}','{"1":[["08:00","17:00"]],"2":[["08:00","17:00"]],"3":[["08:00","17:00"]],"4":[["08:00","17:00"]],"5":[["08:00","17:00"]]}','Patrick Jacques is a Quebec City criminal defence lawyer with more than 20 years of experience and a background as a Crown prosecutor.

As a former Crown prosecutor, he knows how the prosecution builds a case. His practice covers criminal charges of every kind, including impaired driving arrests and assault charges. Each case is analysed on its own facts, witnesses and context, and the office acts quickly in urgent or complex situations. The practice also publishes a blog on criminal law topics, and its office is on Boulevard René-Lévesque Ouest in Quebec City.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('juri-plus-montreal','Juri-Plus','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.7,23,45.51603,-73.7201,'{"name":"Juri-Plus","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["family","litigation"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.51603,"lng":-73.7201,"address":"2701 Rue Jasmin, Montréal, QC H4R 1H8","phone":"+15148023518","rating":4.7,"count":23,"slug":"juri-plus-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Juri-Plus+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2701+Rue+Jasmin%2C+Montr%C3%A9al%2C+QC+H4R+1H8","website":"https://www.juri-plus.ca","blurb":"Family Law / Civil Litigation in Montreal. Rated 4.7 from 23 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/juri-plus-montreal.jpg"}',NULL,'Juri-Plus is the Montreal practice of family lawyer Kadiatou Desautels, handling divorce, separation, child custody and child support.

Beyond family law, the practice covers the law of persons, including successions and adoption, as well as youth court matters, negotiation, and the drafting of formal demand letters. It also serves clients in Laval, the Laurentides and the South Shore, and its office is on Rue Jasmin in Montreal.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lcg-avocats-inc-quebec-city','LCG Avocats Inc.','Quebec City','QC','qc-quebec',0,4.5,68,46.786589,-71.280307,'{"name":"LCG Avocats Inc.","city":"Quebec City","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"qc-quebec","province":"QC","lat":46.786589,"lng":-71.280307,"address":"2336 Ch Ste-Foy, Québec, QC G1V 1S5","phone":"+14186502285","rating":4.5,"count":68,"slug":"lcg-avocats-inc-quebec-city","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/LCG+Avocats+Inc.+Quebec+City+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2336+Ch+Ste-Foy%2C+Qu%C3%A9bec%2C+QC+G1V+1S5","website":"https://www.lcgavocats.com","blurb":"General practice law firm in Quebec City. Rated 4.5 from 68 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lcg-avocats-inc-quebec-city.png","details":{"founded":2022,"areas":["Droit civil","Droit familial et de la jeunesse","Droit des affaires","Droit criminel et pénal","Immigration et citoyenneté","Droit du travail","Droit public et administratif","Droit professionnel et déontologie"],"serving":["Québec","Sainte-Foy","Charlevoix","Mauricie"]}}',NULL,'Formed by a 2022 merger, LCG Avocats is a Quebec City firm covering civil, family, business, criminal, immigration and labour law.

The name stands for Labadie Carrier Guay, created from the merger of Côté Carrier avocats and L2 avocats. Civil litigation work includes commercial disputes, personal injury and medical liability, professional liability, wrongful dismissal, psychological harassment, construction law, latent defects, consumer protection, defamation and class actions. Other practice areas are public and administrative law and professional law and ethics, with an office on Chemin Sainte-Foy.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('cantin-myre-leroux-avocats-saint-jerome','Cantin Myre Leroux Avocats','Saint-Jerome','QC','qc-laval-laurentides',0,4.5,62,45.7794647,-74.0066724,'{"name":"Cantin Myre Leroux Avocats","city":"Saint-Jerome","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"qc-laval-laurentides","province":"QC","lat":45.7794647,"lng":-74.0066724,"address":"391 Rue Laviolette, Saint-Jérôme, QC J7Y 2T2","phone":"+14505650440","rating":4.5,"count":62,"slug":"cantin-myre-leroux-avocats-saint-jerome","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Cantin+Myre+Leroux+Avocats+Saint-Jerome+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=391+Rue+Laviolette%2C+Saint-J%C3%A9r%C3%B4me%2C+QC+J7Y+2T2","website":"https://www.cmlavocats.com","blurb":"Family Law in Saint-Jerome. Rated 4.5 from 62 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/cantin-myre-leroux-avocats-saint-jerome.png","details":{"areas":["Droit familial"],"serving":["Saint-Jérôme"]}}',NULL,'In Saint-Jerome, Cantin Myre Leroux Avocats handles divorce, separation, child custody, child support and family mediation.

The office is a short walk from the Saint-Jerome courthouse. The team includes lawyers and accredited mediators, and the firm assists with applications to obtain or change family judgments, paternity matters and mediation sessions. Civil law is a further practice area. The firm has served clients for more than 25 years and offers meetings by videoconference.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('non-coupable-longueuil','Non Coupable','Longueuil','QC','qc-monteregie',0,4.5,43,45.5365236,-73.4981022,'{"name":"Non Coupable","city":"Longueuil","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"qc-monteregie","province":"QC","lat":45.5365236,"lng":-73.4981022,"address":"785 Ch. de Chambly #201, Longueuil, Quebec J4H 1V1","phone":"+14504633336","rating":4.5,"count":43,"slug":"non-coupable-longueuil","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Non+Coupable+Longueuil+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=785+Ch.+de+Chambly+%23201%2C+Longueuil%2C+Quebec+J4H+1V1","website":"https://www.noncoupable.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Longueuil. Rated 4.5 from 43 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/non-coupable-longueuil.png","details":{"areas":["Droit criminel","Droit pénal","Alcool et drogue au volant","Crime contre la personne","Crime sexuel","Crime économique","Constat d''infraction","Jeunesse","Appels"]}}',NULL,'In Longueuil, Non Coupable defends criminal and penal charges at trial and on appeal, from statements of offence to murder cases.

Operating as Elayoubi Raymond, the firm has been in practice since 2002 and takes only criminal and penal files. Its lawyers appear before the municipal court, the Court of Quebec, the Superior Court, the Court of Appeal and the Supreme Court. Areas include impaired driving by alcohol or drugs, crimes against the person, sexual offences, economic crime, drug offences, youth cases and appeals. Lawyers are available around the clock in an arrest or emergency, and the firm covers greater Montreal and most judicial districts of the North Shore and South Shore.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('dtb-avocats-inc-montreal','DTB AVOCATS INC','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.5,36,45.5002192,-73.6296549,'{"name":"DTB AVOCATS INC","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.5002192,"lng":-73.6296549,"address":"5845 Chem. de la Côte-des-Neiges #515, Montreal, Quebec H3S 1Z4","phone":"+15143793666","rating":4.5,"count":36,"slug":"dtb-avocats-inc-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/DTB+AVOCATS+INC+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=5845+Chem.+de+la+C%C3%B4te-des-Neiges+%23515%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H3S+1Z4","website":"https://dtbavocats.com","blurb":"Immigration in Montreal. Rated 4.5 from 36 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/dtb-avocats-inc-montreal.png","details":{"founded":2019,"areas":["Immigration","Litige civil et commercial","Droit des contrats","Droit des affaires","Médiation"]}}',NULL,'Founded in January 2019, DTB Avocats is a Montreal firm working in immigration, business law, civil and commercial litigation and mediation.

Clients are national and international, and the firm favours out-of-court dispute resolution, appearing when needed before the civil and commercial divisions of the Superior Court and the Court of Quebec, the Immigration and Refugee Board and the Federal Court of Canada. Contract law is also part of the practice. The team works in French, English, Poular and Wolof from an office on Chemin de la Côte-des-Neiges.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('justice-famille-quebec-city','Justice Famille','Quebec City','QC','qc-quebec',0,4.5,31,46.8364579,-71.2927556,'{"name":"Justice Famille","city":"Quebec City","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"qc-quebec","province":"QC","lat":46.8364579,"lng":-71.2927556,"address":"1170 Bd Lebourgneuf #400, Québec City, Quebec G2K 2E3","phone":"+15817424757","rating":4.5,"count":31,"slug":"justice-famille-quebec-city","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Justice+Famille+Quebec+City+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1170+Bd+Lebourgneuf+%23400%2C+Qu%C3%A9bec+City%2C+Quebec+G2K+2E3","website":"https://www.justicefamille.com","blurb":"Family Law in Quebec City. Rated 4.5 from 31 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/justice-famille-quebec-city.png","details":{"areas":["Droit de la famille","Divorce et séparation de corps","Garde d''enfants","Violence conjugale et post-séparation","Protection de la jeunesse et DPJ","Médiation familiale"],"serving":["Québec"]}}',NULL,'Justice Famille handles divorce, legal separation, child custody, youth protection and mediation as a family law firm in Quebec City.

Related matters include spousal support, compensatory allowance, partition of the family patrimony and acquests, annulment of marriage, and domestic and post-separation violence. In youth protection files it assists with agreements on voluntary measures involving the DPJ. The firm acts in amicable and contested divorces, deals with access and custody arrangements, and represents clients in court. Its values are integrity, rigour and empathy, with the interests of the child at the centre of the practice. The office is on Boulevard Lebourgneuf.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lalonde-geraghty-riendeau-saint-jerome','Lalonde Geraghty Riendeau','Saint-Jerome','QC','qc-laval-laurentides',0,4.5,26,45.7802307,-74.0086657,'{"name":"Lalonde Geraghty Riendeau","city":"Saint-Jerome","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Employment Law","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["realestate","employment","litigation"],"region":"qc-laval-laurentides","province":"QC","lat":45.7802307,"lng":-74.0086657,"address":"44 Rue de Martigny W, Saint-Jérôme, Quebec J7Y 2E9","phone":"+14504368022","rating":4.5,"count":26,"slug":"lalonde-geraghty-riendeau-saint-jerome","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lalonde+Geraghty+Riendeau+Saint-Jerome+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=44+Rue+de+Martigny+W%2C+Saint-J%C3%A9r%C3%B4me%2C+Quebec+J7Y+2E9","website":"https://www.lgra.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Employment Law in Saint-Jerome. Rated 4.5 from 26 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lalonde-geraghty-riendeau-saint-jerome.png","details":{"founded":1978,"serving":["Laurentides"]}}',NULL,'Since 1978, Lalonde Geraghty Riendeau has practised in Saint-Jerome, covering civil and commercial litigation, business, real estate and family law.

Known as LGRA, the firm''s lawyers also cover construction, tax, labour and employment, insurance, hypothecary recourses, municipal law, bankruptcy and insolvency, and estates. Litigation work includes appearances before the Court of Québec, Superior Court, Court of Appeal, Supreme Court, Federal Court, Tax Court of Canada and the Administrative Tribunal of Quebec, as well as arbitration and negotiated settlements. Business law services extend to self-employed workers and small and medium-sized businesses, including sales of businesses, shareholder agreements and disputes, and directors'' liability.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('me-jonathan-boivin-saint-jerome','Me Jonathan Boivin','Saint-Jerome','QC','qc-laval-laurentides',0,5,19,45.7808937,-74.0070609,'{"name":"Me Jonathan Boivin","city":"Saint-Jerome","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"qc-laval-laurentides","province":"QC","lat":45.7808937,"lng":-74.0070609,"address":"474 Rue Laviolette, Saint-Jérôme, QC J7Y 2T7","phone":"+15148021211","rating":5,"count":19,"slug":"me-jonathan-boivin-saint-jerome","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Me+Jonathan+Boivin+Saint-Jerome+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=474+Rue+Laviolette%2C+Saint-J%C3%A9r%C3%B4me%2C+QC+J7Y+2T7","website":"https://jboivinavocat.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Saint-Jerome. Rated 5.0 from 19 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/me-jonathan-boivin-saint-jerome.png","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Jonathan Boivin","title":"Avocat Criminaliste"}],"areas":["Droit criminel","Droit pénal","Droit administratif"],"serving":["Saint-Jérôme","Joliette","Laurentides"]}}',NULL,'Criminal defence in Saint-Jerome, Joliette and the Laurentides is the work of Jonathan Boivin, a partner at OMB Avocats.

A member of the Barreau du Québec since 2007, he began his career with the criminal and penal prosecution service (DPCP), including appeal files, before entering private practice in 2012. His work covers criminal, penal and administrative law: impaired driving, restricted licences, vehicle seizures, setting aside judgments rendered in a client''s absence, hit and run, licence suspensions and contested tickets. Emergency representation is available around the clock, from an office on Rue Laviolette.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('aeh-legal-laval','AEH Legal','Laval','QC','qc-laval-laurentides',0,5,18,45.5446708,-73.7406037,'{"name":"AEH Legal","city":"Laval","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"qc-laval-laurentides","province":"QC","lat":45.5446708,"lng":-73.7406037,"address":"430, 800 Bd Chomedey Tower C, Floor 4, Laval, Quebec H7V 3X1","phone":"+15142282703","rating":5,"count":18,"slug":"aeh-legal-laval","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/AEH+Legal+Laval+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=430%2C+800+Bd+Chomedey+Tower+C%2C+Floor+4%2C+Laval%2C+Quebec+H7V+3X1","website":"https://aehlegal.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Laval. Rated 5.0 from 18 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/aeh-legal-laval.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Alicia Haziza"}],"areas":["Criminal defence","Penal law defence","DUI and impaired driving","Domestic assault","Drug offences","Fraud","Firearms and weapons","Sexual assault","Breach of conditions","Assault"],"serving":["Montreal","Quebec"]}}',NULL,'Former Crown prosecutor Alicia Haziza founded AEH Legal, a Laval firm defending criminal and penal charges in Montreal and across Quebec.

Me Haziza worked for ten years as a Crown prosecutor before moving to defence, and the firm approaches each case through how prosecutions are built and where they can be challenged. It handles impaired driving, assault, drug, fraud and weapons charges, as well as penal statements of offence, and represents clients in English and in French. Representation is available around the clock. The office is on Boulevard Chomedey.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('beaudry-roussin-avocats-quebec-city','Beaudry Roussin Avocats','Quebec City','QC','qc-quebec',0,5,17,46.817106,-71.2239552,'{"name":"Beaudry Roussin Avocats","city":"Quebec City","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"qc-quebec","province":"QC","lat":46.817106,"lng":-71.2239552,"address":"555 Rue du Prince-Édouard, Québec, QC G1K 2M9","phone":"+14187471320","rating":5,"count":17,"slug":"beaudry-roussin-avocats-quebec-city","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Beaudry+Roussin+Avocats+Quebec+City+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=555+Rue+du+Prince-%C3%89douard%2C+Qu%C3%A9bec%2C+QC+G1K+2M9","website":"https://rlavocats.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Quebec City. Rated 5.0 from 17 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/beaudry-roussin-avocats-quebec-city.webp","details":{"lawyers":[{"name":"Myralie Roussin"},{"name":"Alexandre Langlois"},{"name":"Éloïse Marceau"}],"areas":["Droit criminel et pénal","Protection de la jeunesse"]}}',NULL,'Beaudry Roussin Avocats, which also uses the name Roussin Langlois, defends criminal, penal and youth protection cases in Quebec City.

Lawyers Myralie Roussin, Alexandre Langlois and Éloïse Marceau act in all judicial districts of Quebec, and Me Roussin and Me Langlois work in French and English. Me Roussin has pleaded defence files since 2011 and was appointed in 2019 as an independent external decision-maker under Bill C-83 on solitary confinement in federal penitentiaries. Me Langlois regularly acts in sexual offence cases involving digital evidence and consent, and in motions to exclude evidence. Fees can be adapted to each client and file, and fixed-fee packages are often used.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lebrun-provencher-trois-rivieres','LeBrun Provencher','Trois-Rivieres','QC','qc-mauricie',0,4.7,18,46.3433973,-72.5415172,'{"name":"LeBrun Provencher","city":"Trois-Rivieres","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"qc-mauricie","province":"QC","lat":46.3433973,"lng":-72.5415172,"address":"1243 Rue Hart, Trois-Rivières, QC G9A 4S4","phone":"+18193746239","rating":4.7,"count":18,"slug":"lebrun-provencher-trois-rivieres","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/LeBrun+Provencher+Trois-Rivieres+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1243+Rue+Hart%2C+Trois-Rivi%C3%A8res%2C+QC+G9A+4S4","website":"https://lebrunprovencher.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Trois-Rivieres. Rated 4.7 from 18 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lebrun-provencher-trois-rivieres.png","details":{"founded":1947,"areas":["Droit criminel","Droit pénal"],"serving":["Trois-Rivières"]}}',NULL,'Founded in 1947, LeBrun Provencher is a Trois-Rivieres firm whose lawyers practise criminal and penal law.

Its office is on rue Hart in Trois-Rivieres. The team has built up experience in criminal and penal matters over the years, and its lawyers are attentive to the concerns that a court process can raise and to the individual needs of each client. The firm''s approach is based on discretion, efficiency and competence, delivered with professionalism and respect.','dynamic','live',NULL);
