Immigration work covers refugee protection and asylum applications, the Quebec Selection Certificate (CSQ) and federal economic immigration through Express Entry, including its points system and category-based draws, as well as Quebec''s separate selection system. Files are handled in steps: listening to the client''s situation, assessing the file, setting out next steps and following developments through to the objective, with adjustments when circumstances change. The office is on Rue de Salaberry.','dynamic','live',NULL);
