The team represents clients at each stage of the court process so they need not attend every appearance, and fees are set on a flat basis rather than by the hour, explained at the first meeting. It has handled more than 3,000 files, including impaired driving cases, and its team includes a member of the Barreau du Québec since 2009. The firm serves the judicial districts of Montreal, Longueuil and Saint-Hyacinthe, among others, in French and English, from an office on Rue Sherbrooke Est.','dynamic','live',NULL);
